window.AKK_FUTURE_GOSSIP_DEATH_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_FUTURE_GOSSIP_DEATH_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":101,"title":"Chapter 101","paragraphs":["Tong Yang looked around the room for a moment, then turned and left.","Out in the hallway of the building, all the other doors were closed.","Tong Yang tried turning a doorknob. Dust cascaded down, and the door opened easily.","The room showed no signs of recent habitation. A thick layer of dust covered the floor. Tong Yang walked in and looked around, making sure there were no traces of anyone else living there.","With a bang, she opened the window. A fine drizzle pattered against the windowsill.","\"Not bad,\" Tong Yang remarked with appreciation. \"Much better than the Dongyang neighborhood.\"","Since she was going to stay in the First World, she naturally needed a place to live. This area was called the slums, and it didn't seem like there were many laws to speak of. She'd just find a random spot to settle down.","As for that little girl...","Tong Yang returned to the little girl's room. The house had been blown up and was no longer habitable.","The little girl was still lying over the corpse, taking small bites of mold-covered bread, her dry lips cracked.","\"Are you hungry?\" Tong Yang asked.","The girl stared at her blankly, showing no reaction, eating the bread without tasting it.","Tong Yang walked up to her and lifted the little girl off the corpse.","The girl didn't resist, just clutched the moldy bread tightly, letting herself be moved with numb indifference.","After setting her aside, Tong Yang went to deal with the body on the bed. The previously unresponsive little girl suddenly grabbed her clothes.","\"Don't touch my mom...\"","Tong Yang looked down at her and said, \"Your mother has passed away.\"","The little girl shook her head. \"It's okay. As long as Mom is here, I'll be okay no matter what.\"","Tong Yang said, \"I want to make a deal with you.\"","The girl looked confused, slowly raising her head. \"What...?\"","\"For now, you'll live with me temporarily. No matter who asks about our relationship, you just tell them I'm your older sister.\"","The little girl lifted her dirty face. \"Why?\"","\"No reason.\"","The slums of the First World were a chaotic place. Living with a native of the First World shouldn't arouse suspicion.","Tong Yang continued, \"In return, I'll be responsible for your food, clothing, and shelter. Try not to cause me any trouble. Before I leave, I'll give you all the money I have.\"","It was unclear if the girl understood. She stared dumbly at Tong Yang for a long moment before finally whispering, \"C-can I... eat my fill from now on?\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"Of course.\"","She had managed to support Tong Le before; naturally, she could support this little girl now.","Besides using her as a cover, there was another reason to live with her: the destruction of her house was somewhat related to Tong Yang.","\"Mom...\" The little girl suddenly threw herself forward, wrapping her arms around Tong Yang's arm. \"Mom.\"","Tong Yang's face darkened. \"Say 'sister.'\"","\"Only Mom gives me food.\"","Tong Yang pushed her away. \"From now on, your sister will give you food too.\"","\"Oh.\" The girl nodded vaguely.","\"Be smart. Don't cause me trouble, or you won't get any food.\"","The girl said nervously, \"I-I understand.\"","Her stomach growled loudly. Instinctively, she tried to stuff the moldy bread into her mouth.","Tong Yang snatched the bread away. \"I'll take you to get something to eat in a bit.\"","\"But...\"","Tong Yang said, \"I have only one requirement for you—obedience. Understand?\"","The girl nodded dazedly. \"I understand.\"","\"Now, I need to deal with your mother's body.\"","The girl looked at her timidly, moved out of the way, and said softly, \"She's not my mom.\"","Tong Yang was surprised. \"Is that so?\"","\"She gave me bread, so...\"","Tong Yang understood. In the little girl's eyes, this corpse was her provider.","\"How old are you?\" Tong Yang asked while looking for something to wrap the body in.","\"Eleven...\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang couldn't help but look at her in surprise.","The girl was skin and bones, short and small. Probably due to long-term malnutrition, she looked only eight or nine years old.","\"What's your name?\"","\"Miaomiao.\"","\"My name is Yang Tong,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Yang Tong sister.\"","\"Just 'sister' is fine.\"","\"Sister.\"","\"Mm.\"","Tong Yang put the body in a bag, hoisted it onto her shoulder, and said to Miaomiao, \"Let's go.\"","\"Sister, where are we going?\"","\"To eat.\"","Tong Yang also wanted to get a sense of the situation in the First World's slums.","After burying the body in a random pit, Tong Yang led Miaomiao towards more populated areas.","Bombings in the slums weren't considered strange occurrences, and life went on as usual.","They arrived at a place resembling a market in the real world, with second-hand shops lining both sides of the street.","\"Don't miss out, don't pass by! Fresh goods for cheap!\"","The two of them stopped outside a noodle shop. A waiter with dark skin beckoned them inside.","\"Two bowls of beef noodles,\" Tong Yang said.","The waiter looked at her in astonishment. \"Are you kidding? Beef? That's not something people like us eat.\"","Tong Yang raised an eyebrow. \"What do you have here?\"","\"Vegetable noodles.\"","Each ordered a bowl of green vegetable noodles, and they sat down at a rickety table to wait.","Miaomiao seemed to be eating in such a place for the first time; she appeared extremely awkward and nervous.","Tong Yang didn't pay it much mind. She took out her phone and checked for a signal.","No signal.","She didn't know if it was because they were in the slums or if Wu Pingxue had lied to her, but Tong Yang couldn't connect to any satellite signal here.","Suddenly, Tong Yang sensed something was off and paused her movements.","During the year of conflict with the parallel world, her instincts had become razor-sharp.","She clearly felt that after she took out her phone, the people around her deliberately softened their breathing and kept glancing her way—or more accurately, at her phone.","It was a gift from Chu Shiyu, a domestic brand touted as far ahead of its time. Ye Huai had even taken it to tweak some data to ensure it could connect to the parallel world's satellite signals.","Tong Yang looked up and calmly put the device back into her backpack.","Immediately, the attention of those nearby shifted entirely to her backpack.","Tong Yang let out an almost inaudible sigh. It seemed the valuables on her person had attracted unwanted attention.","She had been careless. Such electronic devices were probably rare in the slums.","\"Here you go, customers. Enjoy your meal slowly.\"","\"Eat,\" Tong Yang said flatly.","Miaomiao nodded, grabbed her chopsticks, and began devouring the food.","Tong Yang took a bite. The broth was bland and watery, utterly tasteless, not even as good as the noodles Tong Le used to make.","Thinking there might be a tough fight ahead and needing to replenish her energy, Tong Yang forced herself to eat it.","\"Hey, I heard a young master from the affluent district got robbed here in the slums!\"","\"Who?\"","\"Who got robbed?\"","\"My brother works in the commoners' district. It's all over the news there. That young master had all his money stolen, even his coat was taken!\"","\"Heavens! Who has the nerve? They must be insane!\"","\"That's practically asking for death!\"","\"Will this affect us, do you think?\"","\"I'm not sure either. Everyone should lay low these next couple of days, try not to draw attention from the higher-ups.\"","At this, one of them sighed. \"If only we could get into the Commoner District.\"","\"Yeah, there... at least you wouldn't have to worry about your life.\"","\"Don't even think about it. For slum dwellers to enter the Commoner District, it's harder than climbing to the sky.\"","\"Ah...\"","Tong Yang listened to their discussion without changing her expression.","She robbed him? That was clearly compensation for the young master treating human life as worthless.","And wasn't it he who threw the jacket over himself?","But... the Commoner District? What's the difference from the slums?","It sounded like life in the Commoner District was somewhat better than in the slums; at the very least, you wouldn't have to fear for your life. Perhaps satellite signals could be accessed there, and there would be more channels for obtaining information.","She needed to think of a way to get into the Commoner District.","Miaomiao finished the last sip of her noodle soup, looked up contentedly, and said to Tong Yang, \"Sister, it was delicious.\"","\"Full?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"Full,\" Miaomiao said.","\"Then let's go.\"","Tong Yang had no small change on her, only a card and the hundred-dollar bill she had taken from the young master.","When she handed the hundred-dollar bill to the server, his eyes went wide. \"Please wait a moment.\"","The server went behind the counter and opened the cash box, which was filled with nothing but small bills of a few or tens of dollars.","\"Your change, ninety dollars.\" The server handed Tong Yang a bunch of crumpled small bills.","\"Thank you,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Wait...\" the server suddenly called out to them.","\"What is it?\" Tong Yang frowned.","The server pursed his lips, glanced at the other customers in the noodle shop, and warned in a low voice, \"Young lady, you don't seem to be from the slums. They've already got their eyes on you. You should leave quickly.\"","Tong Yang glanced towards the main hall. The others appeared to be eating, but their attention had been fixed on Tong Yang and the other girl the whole time.","In the impoverished and chaotic slums, two girls who looked utterly defenseless, carrying electronic devices and paying with a hundred-dollar bill, would naturally become a tempting target in others' eyes.","Tong Yang looked away and said, \"Thank you. We'll be going now.\"","\"Take care, you two!\"","After leaving the noodle shop, Tong Yang led Miaomiao forward, wandering aimlessly through the streets, planning to buy some instant food to take back for emergencies.","She could sense that two or three people had been following them furtively. Probably because there were too many eyes around, they hadn't made a direct move against Tong Yang and the girl.","Tong Yang bought some things, and Miaomiao dutifully carried them.","\"No matter what happens in a moment, don't be afraid. Just wait for me obediently to the side.\"","Miaomiao nodded. \"I understand.\"","Having bought what they needed, Tong Yang and the girl headed towards a more deserted area.","As the surrounding crowd thinned, the movements of the few people following behind became even more obvious.","\"Sister, it seems like someone...\"","\"It's fine. Don't look back.\"","\"Oh...\"","Tong Yang continued walking forward nonchalantly.","They entered a deserted street. Raindrops fell from the wet eaves, hitting the stone slabs with a crisp sound.","Tong Yang heard the footsteps behind them suddenly become chaotic and rapidly approach.","Tong Yang pressed her lips together, subtly moving her hand towards the side pocket of her backpack, where a sharp dagger was hidden.","\"Go wait over there,\" Tong Yang said.","\"I know...\"","Before she could finish her words, a man suddenly appeared behind her, his hands reaching to choke her neck.","Tong Yang swiftly pulled the dagger from the backpack's side pocket and slashed at the thin arm.","\"Ah!\"","The dagger cut a long gash in the arm, blood gushing out. The man clutched his arm, letting out a scream.","Miaomiao was stunned for a moment. Coming to her senses, she immediately grabbed the bags and ran farther away. Whether the bags were too heavy or she ran too hastily, she nearly took a bad fall.","There was more than one person who had come. Tong Yang kicked the man down and, gripping the dagger in a reverse hold, lunged at the other two.","Probably thinking it wouldn't take much effort to deal with two girls, none of the men carried any weapons; they were bare-handed.","Tong Yang, holding a bloodied dagger, was remarkably agile. The men couldn't even touch her shadow. In a few quick moves, they were all knocked to the ground, groaning in pain.","\"Stop pretending. I used the flat of the blade.\" Tong Yang nudged the man at her feet impatiently.","These malnourished guys were all brawn and no substance, completely no match for Tong Yang.","\"Spare us! Have mercy!\"","\"Miss, have mercy!\"","\"We were blinded by greed, we won't dare, we really won't dare again!\"","Tong Yang hadn't planned to kill them in the first place.","\"Answer a few questions for me honestly,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Ask, ask! We'll tell you everything we know!\"","\"First, what's the difference between the slums and the Commoner District?\"","One of the less injured men answered, \"The slums are a garbage dump. People who contribute nothing to society get thrown here. No electricity, no signal.\"","\"No one cares whether people in the slums live or die. We... we have no money, can't afford to buy things, so we can only...\" The man choked up.","\"Miss, please, you must forgive us! I have an eighty-year-old mother above and a two-year-old child below! I was truly forced into a corner to attack you, I'm sorry!\" Another man cried out dramatically, though his acting was poor—no tears came out.","They thought Tong Yang was an ordinary, kind-hearted girl who would be overwhelmed with sympathy upon hearing their plight and give them some money.","However, that tactic was clearly not suitable for Tong Yang.","\"None of my business,\" Tong Yang said coolly. \"Don't interrupt. Just answer my questions.\"","The man: \"...\"","He and his companions exchanged looks, gradually dropping their hypocritical facade.","They'd really kicked an iron plate today—she was impervious to both soft and hard approaches.","\"What about the Commoner District?\"","The man sat up, scrutinizing Tong Yang. \"You don't know anything... how did you end up here...\"","\"I told you to answer, not to ask questions,\" Tong Yang said with a cold face.","The man looked at the blood-stained dagger in her hand, swallowed nervously in hindsight, and said, \"The Commoner District is where commoners live. They can earn wages through labor.\"","Tong Yang nodded. The Commoner District was where ordinary people lived.","\"How do you get into the Commoner District?\" Tong Yang asked.","As soon as the words left her mouth, the men sprawled on the ground shook their heads in unison.","\"Impossible.\"","\"Slum dwellers can't enter the Commoner District. Absolutely impossible. And they'd never be accepted.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"Why?\"","\"People in the Commoner District all have their own identity papers. To live there, you must have identity papers. But people in the slums don't have them, so we can't go to the Commoner District.\"","\"It's true! I'm not lying to you!\"","\"If you were originally from the slums, give up. You can't enter the Commoner District.\"","Tong Yang looked at their expressions. They didn't seem to be lying.","The slums were not a place she could go just because she wanted to. After all, like the people of the slums, she had no identification in the First World.","After a long silence, Tong Yang said, \"Don't worry about whether I can go or not. Just tell me directly what I need to do to get there.\"","The man gritted his teeth. \"There's only one chance a month, but no one from the slums has managed to leave through here for ten years.\"","\"What chance?\" Tong Yang asked.","...","After getting the information she wanted, Tong Yang took Miaomiao back to their temporary lodging.","Once there, Tong Yang boiled a pot of water using a rust-covered pot, told Miaomiao to go wash herself, rummaged through the room to find a few clean clothes belonging to the previous occupant, and handed them to her.","\"Conserve water, but get clean.\"","\"I know...\"","The room had no electricity or lights. As night fell, everything was plunged into darkness. The neon lights over the distant city lit up the skyline, forming a stark contrast with the slum environment.","Even Tong Yang hadn't lived in conditions like this for a long time.","The buildings were packed closely together. Occasionally, a faint, pearly light would glow from a window. The night wind howled, whistling through cracks in the walls, producing hollow, eerie sounds.","On the other side of the wall, the sound of water trickled from the bathroom. Tong Yang lit a candle, sat by the table, and pondered what the man had said.","To go from the slums to the commoner district, one must be recommended by someone from the commoner district and pass a test to prove one has value to exist.","However, the commoner district, though also part of society's lower strata, looked down on slum dwellers with utter contempt. The idea of recommending one to enter the commoner district was unthinkable; they'd probably spit at the sight of them, cursing them for bringing bad luck.","What was even more difficult was the test to enter the commoner district.","Although the commoner district looked down on slum dwellers from the bottom of their hearts, considering them garbage, even less valuable to humanity than livestock, there were, for various reasons, still some who gave recommendations. Yet, those who passed the commoner district test were exceedingly few, most slinking back to the slums in defeat.","Unclear of the test's exact contents, Tong Yang believed it must be extremely difficult.","Moreover, she didn't know anyone from the commoner district, making a recommendation impossible.","The \"once-a-month\" chance the man spoke of was merely this: on the first of every month, people from the commoner district would sell some useless garbage to the slums at extremely low prices to maintain the slums' survival order.","Compared to the bottom rung of the parallel world, this place seemed slightly more tolerant, but in Tong Yang's view, it was just the difference between penned livestock and free-range livestock.","If the First World was a capitalist society with clear-cut class divisions, the parallel world it had invaded was a capitalist society drenched in blood.","The parallel world was like a bloody maw, ready to devour those at the bottom at any moment; the First World was like a monster clad in a glamorous skin, devouring people without spitting out the bones.","The difference between the two seemed vast, but in essence, it wasn't.","\"July first...\"","There were still over half a month until July first. She could only watch and wait, biding her time.","Time raced by like a galloping river, and in the blink of an eye, it was the end of June.","During her time in the First World, Tong Yang hadn't been idle; she simply couldn't do anything.","The slums had no signal, and only a very few shops had access to electricity. She originally had her phone to pass the time, to read some cached professional books. But with nowhere to charge it, it became a useless brick after a couple of days.","Tong Yang sometimes wandered the bustling streets to learn about the First World. Unfortunately, information in the slums was severely blocked. The few people who could keep up with outside news mostly only knew trivial matters, which were no help to Tong Yang.","Left with no other options and unable to stay idle, Tong Yang had Miaomiao to keep her company.","She hadn't gone easy on Miaomiao these past two weeks. Besides providing food and clothing, she taught her combat stances, forced her to memorize texts, vocabulary, and solve math problems. The little girl, already weathered by life's hardships, finally went on a hunger strike, declaring she'd rather skip a meal than do another math problem.","Furthermore, every time she saw Tong Yang approaching with a notebook full of math problems, she would immediately hide far away, utterly unmoved by any threats or bribes.","Tong Yang could only remark, \"You simply don't understand the joy of learning.\"","Having been by Tong Yang's side these days and witnessing her behavior, Miaomiao's courage had grown. She retorted weakly, \"I... I just don't get it...\"","Tong Yang had no other recourse. Fortunately, while Miaomiao showed little interest in academics, she was very keen on combat techniques, so Tong Yang had something to occupy her days.","On July first, Tong Yang and Miaomiao went early to Gate No. 2, which led from the slums to the commoner district.","At ten in the morning, the gate would open precisely. Countless people, like them, had gathered behind it.","Among them were those like Tong Yang, desperate to enter the commoner district, but the majority were there to purchase the supplies delivered from there.","\"Sister, the gate seems like it's about to open,\" Miaomiao whispered, grabbing her arm.","\"Yeah.\"","Tong Yang stared intently at the gate. As the clock struck ten, movement gradually came from outside. The heavy iron gates slowly swung open to either side, scraping against the ground with a piercing shriek.","Yet the crowd only watched the widening gap intently. As the gates fully opened, an old cart piled high with goods rolled into view.","\"It's here! It's here!\"","\"Finally!\"","\"What is it this time?\"","\"Apples! And meat! My god! There's even pork!\"","...","Exclamations rippled through the crowd as if they were witnessing rare treasures.","However, the goods on the cart were less \"supplies\" and more like garbage.","Apples half-rotten, pork emitting a foul odor, a jumble of various food items and daily necessities, along with some knick-knacks of completely unknown use.","There were five such carts in total, each piled high with \"junk.\"","The slums had twelve gates leading to the outside world, and the scene before each was the same.","This was the sustenance on which the slums relied for survival.","And it wasn't free; it had to be purchased at an \"extremely low price.\"","Two burly men sat on each cart, distributing the goods to the slum purchasers.","Their faces were filled with disgust and disdain, as if the slums were a mass of maggots living in a sewer. They wore protective suits, gloves, were bundled up tightly, and were fully armed.","Once class solidifies, people from any class will look down upon those beneath them.","Since this wasn't the real world, Tong Yang didn't care about any of that.","She was thinking: what could she do to attract their attention, to make them willing to recommend her for entry into the commoner district?","Coercion and bribery? A humble, pleading request?","Tong Yang decisively chose the former. Only...","Only there were too many eyes and ears here; she couldn't act recklessly.","If only someone would, for some inexplicable reason, want to be alone with her.","But, such good fortune didn't just fall from the sky. She'd have to find another way...","Just then, following behind the five carts, a silver-white convertible car appeared.","This vehicle must have been exorbitantly, glaringly out of place with its surroundings.","Tong Yang looked up and locked eyes with the boy in the passenger seat.","Instantly, a fierce glare flashed in the boy's eyes.","\"You!\" The boy pointed at Tong Yang, \"Get over here!\"","Tong Yang was taken aback for a moment, thinking the boy looked somewhat familiar.","\"Did you hear me! I said get over here!\"","Seeing her frozen in place, the boy spat out the words, furious.","Then it clicked for Tong Yang.","Wasn't this the young master she had relieved of eight thousand bucks not long ago?","Seeing him, Tong Yang broke into a smile.","What was this?","A gift from heaven, practically forcing itself into her mouth—how could she possibly refuse?"]},{"number":102,"title":"Chapter 102","paragraphs":["Tong Yang signaled for Miaomiao to wait where she was, and made her way through the crowd to the convertible.","Looking at the boy in the passenger seat, she raised an eyebrow and asked, \"Something the matter?\"","The boy's eyes were fierce. \"You dare show your face in front of me?\"","Tong Yang scoffed. \"This is the slums. If I don't appear here, where should I appear? If anything, shouldn't it be you who shouldn't be appearing before me?\"","\"Are you doing tongue twisters here?\" The boy held out his palm towards her. \"My jacket. Where is it?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Didn't you generously give it to me?\"","\"I changed my mind, so what?\" He glared at her.","Tong Yang looked him up and down, an expression of disdain on her face. \"I could tell at a glance you weren't some generous, upright person.\"","\"You!\" The boy's eyes bulged. \"How am I not generous? People in the slums might never see that much money in their lifetime!\"","Tong Yang didn't respond directly, instead smiling faintly. \"So, you plan to go back on your word and take back a gift?\"","The phrase \"go back on your word\" made the boy's face turn ashen with anger.","\"I can give you money,\" the boy said.","Tong Yang crossed her arms. \"How much can you give?\"","\"I have ten thousand on me.\"","Their voices weren't exactly soft, and coupled with the unprecedented sight of a convertible in the slums, most of the onlookers had their attention fixed on them. Hearing the boy mention ten thousand, a collective gasp rippled through the crowd.","Tong Yang said nonchalantly, \"If that jacket of yours were sold, it should fetch more than that, shouldn't it?\"","The boy stared at her angrily. \"You didn't already sell it, did you?\"","\"Idiot, who in the slums could afford it?\" Tong Yang mocked.","\"That's good then.\" The boy immediately relaxed. \"Where's my jacket?\"","Tong Yang looked at him meaningfully and countered with a question instead of answering. \"You don't seem like a stingy person to me. Why do you want the jacket back?\"","The boy snorted coldly. \"I wouldn't come to a place like this just for a jacket.\"","\"So, the reason?\"","\"Why should I tell you?\"","\"Then why should I give it back to you?\"","The boy gritted his teeth. \"It's my jacket!\"","\"You gave it to me, so it's mine now.\"","\"Anyway, you can't sell it even if you keep it. I'll give you ten thousand, how about it?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Ten thousand is too little. If I can't sell it, I'll just keep it. Could use it as a rag.\"","The boy was fuming, his teeth practically itching. \"Aren't you afraid I'll retaliate?\"","Tong Yang glanced at him. \"In your eyes, aren't slum dwellers just livestock you can kill at will?\"","The boy pressed his lips together and looked at her. \"I already apologized to you. What more do you want?\"","\"Did those people you blew up ever get an apology from you?\"","\"I...\" The boy's expression clearly faltered. Looking into Tong Yang's deep pupils, he inexplicably felt a pang of guilt and averted his gaze. \"Hunting slum dwellers isn't against the law.\"","Noticing the obvious guilt on his face, Tong Yang suddenly leaned forward, bracing her hands on the car door, and stared straight at him. \"Have you ever considered that this might be wrong?\"","The boy looked stunned, his eyes wide.","\"Y-you... what nonsense are you spouting? This is the law enacted by the United Government!\"","Tong Yang glanced at the others around them and scolded, \"Keep your voice down.\"","The boy covered his mouth and nose, looking at Tong Yang as if she were insane. \"Are you crazy? Are you saying the laws enacted by the United Government are wrong?\"","Tong Yang asked him, \"Why were the slums established?\"","The boy said, \"It's like a garbage dump.\"","\"My father told me, the human world is like a bunch of grapes, divided into sweet and delicious ones, ones that are bland and not worth keeping, and rotten ones. Those rotten ones contribute nothing to the human world and even affect others, so they're just like trash.\"","\"We throw trash into bins. People like trash, the slum dwellers, naturally have to live in the slums. And my father says trash should be disposed of to avoid polluting the environment. The United Government was kind enough to let them keep their lives.\"","The further he spoke, the more self-righteous the boy became, declaring solemnly, \"So, what's wrong with me disposing of trash?\"","Unnoticed, the surroundings had grown very quiet, with everyone's gaze fixed on the boy.","Tong Yang cursed, \"Idiot, I told you to keep it down.\"","Facing those hostile stares, the boy showed no fear, sneering contemptuously. \"They wouldn't dare lay a hand on me anyway.\"","\"As the saying goes, 'the barefooted aren't afraid of those wearing shoes.' On someone else's turf, you'd better rein it in.\"","\"Hmph, whatever. It's not like I come to places like this normally anyway.\"","Tong Yang didn't argue the point and returned to the previous topic. \"So, you believe everyone in the slums is useless trash that contributes nothing to society?\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the gazes of the people around them burned against Tong Yang's skin.","The boy looked at her like she was a lunatic. \"You live in the slums. Aren't you afraid they'll retaliate against you?\"","\"Answer my question.\"","The boy pursed his lips, finding the woman before him utterly strange—a slum dweller actually daring to use a commanding tone with him, someone from the affluent district!","He originally didn't want to give her the satisfaction, but when he lifted his eyes and met her calm gaze, it felt like it possessed some kind of frightening magic.","The boy muttered, \"Isn't that obvious?\"","\"Obvious?\" Tong Yang's tone was indescribable. \"How do you prove they're useless?\"","\"They've always lived here...\"","\"They've always lived here. What opportunities have they ever had to make a contribution?\"","The boy's expression faltered. \"But... but...\"","\"But what? There are no buts.\" Tong Yang stated firmly. \"Have you ever interacted with them? Do you understand them? Have you ever given them a chance?\"","Tong Yang answered her own question. \"No.\"","Tong Yang patted his shoulder. \"No one is born as tall as you. The only difference between them and you is that they weren't born into a wealthy family.\"","Hearing her words, the boy looked bewildered.","If he thought about it carefully, he found nothing wrong with her words; they even made a lot of sense.","These high-sounding words, Tong Yang learned them from Ye Huai. The rousing speeches on Harker's Island, she still remembered them.","Tong Yang had always believed the greatest watershed in life was the family one was born into.","It wasn't necessarily true that children from wealthy families were smarter or more useful than children from ordinary families.","But most children from ordinary families would live their whole lives in mediocrity, never even reaching the point where they needed to compete on talent alone.","So, Tong Yang felt she was just spouting grand rhetoric, but it should be enough to intimidate the boy.","Once Tong Yang finished speaking, the way the others looked at her instantly changed.","\"Sis!\"","Just then, a shout came from the crowd.","Tong Yang looked back. A woman stood behind Miaomiao, trying to snatch the backpack Tong Yang had entrusted to her.","Tong Yang said calmly, \"Fight back.\"","The boy, who had been pondering Tong Yang's words, instinctively looked towards the crowd at the sound.","The little girl, who was desperately clutching the backpack, heard Tong Yang's words and almost immediately sprang into action. She seized the woman's wrist with one hand, took half a step back, and with a clever twist of force, flipped the woman onto the ground.","With a \"thud,\" the woman lay dazed on the ground.","Miaomiao, unable to contain her anger, straddled the woman and unleashed a flurry of punches and kicks.","\"Take that for stealing my stuff!\"","\"Take that for stealing my stuff!\"","Tong Yang nodded in satisfaction. The training results lately were decent, but more importantly, the woman was petite and malnourished—a little technique was all it took to throw her over the shoulder.","\"Alright, that's enough,\" Tong Yang spoke up to stop it. Miaomiao immediately halted her actions, trotted over to her side, and glared fiercely at the others like a little wolf cub who had just tasted blood.","Turning back and seeing the boy standing there dumbfounded, Miaomiao bared her teeth at him. \"What are you looking at... Ouch!\"","Tong Yang tapped the back of her head. \"Are you a dog? What's with the bared teeth?\"","Miaomiao snorted, clutching her backpack tightly as she warily eyed the others.","There had been quite a few rumors lately about Tong Yang and Miaomiao. Anyone who coveted their money or thought two weak women would be easy targets had been thoroughly dealt with.","Tong Yang lowered her gaze and asked, \"Do you think you could beat her?\"","—Of course.","Anyone with just a bit more strength could definitely beat Miaomiao.","But this young master clearly had never been in a fight before.","Miaomiao cooperatively shot the boy a glare.","The boy looked dazed, stammering, \"N-not necessarily.\"","Tong Yang leaned forward slightly, breaking into a radiant smile. \"Since there's no way to prove everyone here is trash, how about I prove to you that not everyone here is necessarily trash?\"","Tong Yang was someone who had clawed her way up from the bottom using every means possible. Back then, living in Dongyang District with Tong Le, what difference was there between them and the people in the slums?","The boy, half-convinced and half-doubting, asked, \"How do you plan to prove it?\"","Tong Yang looked up in the direction the vehicle had come from, pretending to ponder for a moment before saying, \"I've heard it's almost impossible for people living in the slums to pass the test to enter the Common District. How about we use whether I can pass the test and enter the Common District as the proof?\"","The boy showed a surprised expression. \"Are you crazy?\"","\"I'm not crazy.\"","\"You want to enter the Common District? You can't do it. I'm not lying to you. The last person who passed the Common District test was...\"","Tong Yang shrugged. \"I don't know if I can pass either. I just want to prove to you that the people in the slums aren't worthless trash.\"","—That's a lie.","No matter how noble it sounded, Tong Yang's real goal was to enter the Common District.","The boy seemed to have never met anyone like Tong Yang before. He stared at her for a long time before saying, \"Fine, I agree. If you can pass the test and enter the Common District, from now on I'll never think of the people here as trash again.\"","The corner of Tong Yang's mouth lifted. \"Deal?\"","\"Deal!\"","\"But you need a recommendation to take the test.\"","\"With me here, what are you worried about?\"","Tong Yang nodded, satisfied. \"Then I'll leave it to you.\"","\"Don't mention it. You're an ambitious person. I admire that.\"","\"Thank you.\"","The boy suddenly remembered something. \"What about my jacket...\"","Tong Yang opened the backpack Miaomiao was carrying and took out the jacket.","The boy immediately sighed in relief, reaching out to take it. \"Good, you haven't sold it yet...\"","Tong Yang raised her arm higher. \"I never said I'd just give it back. It's my property now.\"","The boy's mouth turned down at the corners. He took out a thick stack of cash from his bag and handed it to her.","Tong Yang exchanged the money for the goods. \"Thank you.\"","The boy: \"...\"","\"Heh, you're welcome.\"","Tong Yang held the money in her hand, asking curiously, \"You mentioned earlier, who was the last person to leave the slums?\"","Speaking of this person, a look of fear appeared on the boy's face. \"I've never seen him, but I heard he became an officer at a very young age. His methods are especially terrifying.\"","\"An officer...\" Tong Yang narrowed her eyes, murmuring to herself.","It couldn't be the person she was imagining, could it?","\"I'm leaving. See you in the Common District.\" Tong Yang waved the stack of bills in her hand.","Although it's unwise to flaunt wealth, since the money had been handed to her in front of everyone, there was no point in trying to hide it.","The boy glared, his frustration evident. \"Nothing's even started yet!\"","Tong Yang shot him a sidelong glance, then turned and walked back.","\"What's your name?\" the boy called out.","Tong Yang paused slightly. \"Yang Tong.\"","\"My name is—\"","\"I don't want to know.\"","The boy's face darkened. He grabbed the car door, leaning his upper body out, and shouted, \"My name is Zhan Zicheng!\"","Tong Yang ignored him and returned to the crowd, handing the money to Miaomiao. \"Put it away.\"","\"Okay.\" Miaomiao obediently took it.","Tong Yang raised her head, looking at the people around her, and said calmly, \"What? Thinking of trying to take it?\"","Everyone shook their heads in unison.","\"No, we won't.\"","\"Yang Tong, go for it! Get into the Common District! Prove we're not trash!\"","\"We're not trash! We just never had a chance!\"","\"You have to prove that to them!\"","\"We just started from a different place! How many people are born in the slums!\"","\"It's not that we don't contribute to society, it's that we have no way to contribute to society!\"","\"You have to succeed!\"","...","Tong Yang looked surprised, then turned back to Zhan Zicheng, who was just like the others, and shrugged. \"You see?\"","Zhan Zicheng stared, nodding blankly. \"I see...\"","\"Let's go.\"","Tong Yang turned her head back, putting an arm around Miaomiao's shoulders.","Miaomiao said, \"Sister, if you enter the Common District, does that mean all this money is left for me?\"","As she spoke, a hint of excitement flickered in the little girl's expression.","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes. She had almost forgotten her promise to Miaomiao. But she would definitely need money to enter the Common District; she couldn't leave it all for her.","Tong Yang patted her head. \"Don't worry, I'll take you with me.\"","Hearing this, Miaomiao subtly let out a sigh of relief, a look of joy appearing on her face.","\"Oh, I see.\"","The two returned to their dwelling. The next day, a messenger responsible for communication between the slums and the Common District found Tong Yang.","He notified her to go to Gate Two on July 15th to enter the Common District from there and participate in the test. He also issued her an identity card with no rank.","Since she didn't know what the test involved, Tong Yang had no leads. She could only go to one of the few places in the slums with electricity. Usually, this place was crowded, so she might be able to gather some information.","Arriving at a general store with Miaomiao, a news report was playing on the TV behind the counter. The shop was almost packed.","This was the only store in the slums with a TV, usually requiring payment for specific broadcasts.","\"What's going on?\"","As Tong Yang entered the store, hearing her voice, everyone turned around and, as if by prior agreement, stepped back to both sides, clearing a path down the middle.","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes, walked up to the counter, and looked at the TV screen.","\"On July 1st, the sole heir of the Zhan family visited the slums. A woman, dissatisfied with the supplies delivered to her district, got into a dispute with him. She claimed the people of the slums are not trash, nor are they without value to society—they simply lack the opportunity to contribute. She demanded a chance to prove it from the Zhan heir...\"","\"Afterwards, our district reporter was honored to interview Mr. Zhan...\"","Zhan Zicheng appeared on screen. Judging by his attire, the interview had likely taken place around July 1st.","\"After hearing her words, I found there was some truth to them. People in the slums spend their whole lives there, with little chance to contact the outside world. They simply have no way to demonstrate their value to society. Therefore, I've decided to give her a chance. If she can successfully pass the test for the commoner district and become an ordinary citizen, I will petition my father to fund aid for the slums, appropriately providing them with some opportunities.\"","Zhan Zicheng's tone of voice was different from when Tong Yang had interacted with him; it was noticeably more mature and steady, as if he had rehearsed this speech several times beforehand.","\"What does the Zhan Group do?\"","\"They research combat aircraft, and seem to dabble in some entertainment ventures too. They even invested in a TV drama before.\"","Tong Yang exclaimed in surprise, \"They have TV dramas here?\"","\"Of course we do.\"","\"Really?\"","The voice from the news report continued: \"Once released, the news interview immediately drew widespread attention. The test on July 15th may become the slums' only chance to receive aid.\"","\"It is reported that our district is already making preparations for the test on July 15th.\"","Tong Yang frowned. That guy Zhan Zicheng, why did he have to make such a big deal out of this?","She originally had no idea what the test would entail or which direction to prepare for. Now, the entire commoner district knew about it. The test was probably going to be even harder than before.","\"Don't worry, don't worry! There's more!\"","The shopkeeper immediately switched to the next news item. A foreign man in a suit, with red hair and blue eyes, appeared on the screen.","\"Regarding the Zhan Group's proposal to provide financial aid to the slums contingent on passing our district's test, what is your stance?\"","The foreign man's gaze was cold as he looked at the camera. \"Young Master Zhan is not wrong. Not everyone in the slums is trash. If that woman can prove this point, I will follow the Zhan Group's example and provide the slums with funds and other forms of assistance.\"","Immediately after, the shopkeeper switched to the next interview video.","Several consecutive interview videos featured exquisitely dressed, expensively clad wealthy individuals. Their statements were almost identical, as if pre-arranged.","After the interview videos ended, excitement ran high in the shop.","\"Tong Yang, if you pass the test, the slums will receive aid from the affluent district! We won't have to eat this garbage anymore!\"","\"Maybe they'll even get electricity for every household!\"","\"I thought the affluent district never gave us a second glance. I never imagined they'd be willing to help us!\"","\"This is wonderful! Tong Yang, you absolutely must pass the test!\"","\"That gentleman even said he's willing to donate a school for us. The children of the slums could go to school!\"","\"Tong Yang, I'm sorry for laying hands on you the other day... even though you gave me a good beating...\"","\"Tong Yang, you are the hope of our slums!\"","\"We definitely won't help you!\"","...","Looking at their flushed, excited faces, Tong Yang's expression remained anything but relaxed.","She had to pour cold water on their enthusiasm.","\"Don't celebrate too soon.\"","\"This is the first time people from the affluent district have ever offered to aid us!\"","\"Tong Yang, you should be a little happier too!\"","\"Even though passing the test is difficult, it's not without hope!\"","\"If you can pass, life in our slums will get better!\"","\"That's right! That's right!\"","Tong Yang frowned deeply, her expression solemn. \"Have the slums only existed since today?\"","\"Am I the only one who ever decided to try and leave the slums?\"","Tong Yang disliked having baseless expectations placed upon her, but she was the one who had first brought this up.","More than that, she hated being manipulated by others.","\"No...\"","\"But...\"","Tong Yang said, \"Use your brains. The slums haven't just appeared today. The fact that not everyone in the slums is trash is something the affluent district knows better than you. Only an idiot like Zhan Zicheng and you all would believe such talk.\"","Hearing Tong Yang's words, the crowd's expressions grew confused.","\"Isn't that how it is?\"","\"Are you saying they don't actually intend to help us?\"","\"But why would they say that in the interviews?\"","\"We never expected to receive their aid before either?\"","\"Why...\"","Tong Yang said, \"Simple. Because they care about their image, their shiny public facade. Zhan Zicheng made this a big public spectacle. The Zhan Group stated their position, so naturally everyone else has to put on a good show for appearances too.\"","\"So you mean, they have no intention of actually aiding us?\"","\"I actually believed them? They sounded so sincere...\"","\"Give up hope! They treat the slums as a dumping ground. Whether testing combat robots or combat aircraft, they do it all in the slums, recklessly, without ever caring if we live or die. We're not even considered worthy of living!\"","\"Yeah, the United Government's laws don't even recognize our existence. The slums are like livestock to them, to be slaughtered as they please.\"","\"We even live worse than livestock. At least they get a full meal sometimes!\"","...","\"Tong Yang, since they've already said it publicly, but don't actually plan to aid the slums, what will happen?\"","Tong Yang said gravely, \"Those rich people are obsessed with saving face. They won't go back on something they've publicly stated.\"","\"Really? So does that mean as long as you pass the test...\"","\"It's not that simple.\" Tong Yang shook her head. \"They won't let me pass the test.\"","The interview videos were widely broadcast. Those wealthy people couldn't simply renege directly.","\"They've made a promise but don't want to fulfill it. The best way is to ensure the prerequisite can never be met,\" Tong Yang said.","A collective gasp rose in the shop, followed by dead silence.","\"Will they kill you?\" one person asked, voice trembling.","\"Oh heavens! And it's all for our sake...\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together. \"Killing me would probably be a last resort. The first thing they'll likely do is increase the test's difficulty, ensuring I absolutely cannot pass.\"","Hearing this, the crowd breathed a sigh of relief.","\"That's good, that's good then.\"","\"After all, over all these years, almost no one has passed the commoner district test. Even if they didn't increase the difficulty, the chances of you passing were extremely slim anyway.\"","\"Right, failing is failing. Your life is more important than anything.\"","...","Tong Yang didn't see it that way. Staying in the slums meant she could do nothing. Moreover, if she failed this test, it was likely no one would ever recommend her to participate again.","What's more, even if she failed the test, she might still end up dead in some \"accident\" not long after. Those people would never allow anyone to challenge their authority.","That Zhan Zicheng, more trouble than he's worth!","\"Big sister, what will happen if you do pass the test?\" Miaomiao asked curiously.","Tong Yang replied expressionlessly, \"I'll die.\"","Whether she passes or fails, she'll probably die.!"]},{"number":103,"title":"Chapter 103","paragraphs":["No matter what, when something goes against the norm, there must be a reason behind it.","Tong Yang had gathered some information. In recent years, people from the slums had participated in the tests, but the content was different each time and completely outside their understanding, so no one had ever passed.","Having gained nothing, the two returned to their residence.","Tong Yang thought it over and felt things weren't that simple.","Her bet with Zhan Zicheng wasn't some grand affair. Even if Zhan Zicheng had told his father about it, it generally shouldn't have caused such a big stir. After all, what happened in the slums couldn't easily leak to the outside world; they had very few channels to communicate with it.","\"Sister, are you going to wash up?\" Miaomiao asked.","\"Mhm,\" Tong Yang replied absentmindedly and walked into the bathroom.","The weather had been hot lately. Tong Yang had installed a large water barrel outside the window. A few hours of sun each day meant she didn't need to boil water for a bath.","Come to think of it, could it be that her identity had already been exposed?","It shouldn't be that fast.","Wu Pingxue had broadly shielded her coordinates. The First World couldn't find her, and the slums were a place of mixed characters, reportedly housing fifty percent of Earth's population. Finding her wouldn't be easy.","Furthermore, according to the information Wu Pingxue had, neither the parallel worlds nor the First World possessed much intelligence regarding Tong Yang. Or perhaps they could obtain it but had always disdained to do so.","To them, there was no \"Tong Yang,\" only the \"Temporal Anchor.\" They didn't care who the Temporal Anchor was.","Even if she looked identical to the Tong Yang from the First World, the people who knew this were certainly an extreme minority and wouldn't publicize it widely. They were utterly arrogant, just as Meng Xiao had once said—they didn't need to know who the Temporal Anchor was.","Taking a step back, in the densely populated, information-isolated slums, how could she be easily discovered?","Those outsiders wouldn't waste their energy on people from the slums.","If she hadn't been discovered, what reason would the Zhan family have for blowing things up so dramatically?","Tong Yang couldn't figure it out for the moment.","July 15, 2025. Tong Yang headed to Gate Two, preparing to go to the commoner district for the test.","She wore a hat and stood behind Gate Two, surrounded by a large crowd of onlookers.","As the clock struck ten in the morning, the heavy iron gates slowly swung open.","\"Yang Tong?\" A man by the gate looked her up and down and asked.","Tong Yang nodded and handed him her ID card.","The man glanced at it and nodded. \"Come in.\"","\"Alright.\"","Tong Yang looked back at Miaomiao in the crowd, who gave her a slight smile.","\"Go for it, Yang Tong!\"","\"Be careful!\"","\"It's okay if you don't pass the test!\"","\"Did you hear? The test is too difficult.\"","...","The chattering crowd behind her faded as Tong Yang followed the man in without looking back.","Behind the iron gate was a passageway with high walls on both sides. As the gate closed again, the footsteps of the two echoed in the corridor.","After walking in silence for nearly ten minutes, Tong Yang saw a large door at the end of the passage.","This door was strange. It had deep and shallow patterns, emitting a faint blue glow. Dozens of meters high, it fit seamlessly with the ground, showing no gaps—like something out of a sci-fi movie.","Standing before it, its grandeur was even more palpable.","\"This way.\" The man walked to the right side of the door, faced the wall, and called out.","Tong Yang went to his side. The man raised his arm and pressed a few spots on the wall. Suddenly, the concrete wall stirred. Its outer surface flowed like liquid, with bricks churning within.","Gradually, the churning wall settled, transforming into an ordinary door.","The man pushed the door open, revealing a dark passage that led to who-knows-where.","\"Go straight ahead. Stop when you reach a place with people,\" the man said.","Tong Yang pressed her lips together, frowning slightly. This passage didn't look like a good place.","But things had come to this; there was no other way.","She couldn't just turn back and stay in the slums forever, could she?","What would be the point of her entering the First World early then?","Tong Yang stepped into the passage. Just as she was about to ask something, the door behind her closed.","The only light source in the passage vanished. Everything was plunged into pitch-black darkness, so thick she couldn't see her own hand.","Tong Yang stretched her arms out to feel her surroundings. Before they were fully extended, her hands touched cold walls.","This passage was extremely narrow.","\"What a wretched place...\" Tong Yang muttered under her breath.","Before her eyes was nothing but an endless expanse of darkness.","Remembering the man's words—to stop only when she reached a place with people—she had no choice but to feel her way forward in the dark.","The passage was so quiet that Tong Yang could clearly hear her own breathing and footsteps.","Darkness amplifies the senses infinitely. Sweat gradually soaked her back, making Tong Yang feel intensely uncomfortable.","If her phone hadn't long since run out of battery and shut down, she would have loved to turn on the flashlight and see what this wretched place looked like.","But it was just a thought. Even if the phone had power, she couldn't take it out.","\"Hah...\"","Time ticked by, but Tong Yang never reached the end.","Although Tong Yang wasn't afraid of the dark and had been in countless dark environments before, the feeling this situation gave her was completely different.","It was as if she were submerged in ink. Apart from the all-encompassing darkness, there was no other color.","\"Six hundred and one...\"","Tong Yang counted the seconds silently and realized that even after ten minutes, no light appeared ahead.","She could hardly believe only ten minutes had passed, experiencing for the first time the feeling of time dragging on like years.","Sweat dripped from her forehead, wetting her eyelashes and seeping into her eyes, stinging so much she had to close them.","Whether her eyes were open or closed, she couldn't see anything anyway, so she might as well keep them shut.","Tong Yang squeezed her eyes shut tightly and reached forward, suddenly touching a wall.","\"A dead end?\" Tong Yang moistened her dry lips and whispered.","But there was no one else around her.","Would those damned people really intend to trap her here forever?","Tong Yang's breathing grew rapid. This wouldn't do. She had to stay calm. In an environment like this, losing composure and succumbing to anxiety would drive anyone normal mad.","Even if those people didn't want her to pass the test, they wouldn't kill her this way.","If her identity was already exposed, the First World certainly wouldn't kill her. After all, they had harmed the people around Tong Yang to force her to enter the First World early.","Suddenly, an idea flashed in Tong Yang's mind.","Could the First World forcing her to come here be related to this incident?","Since the way forward was blocked, Tong Yang continued feeling around and finally discovered a passage continuing to the right.","This path wasn't straight.","Gritting her teeth, Tong Yang had no choice but to press on. Turning back now was impossible.","This passage seemed to have no end. Tong Yang was like a headless fly, walking in the dark, unable to find her direction.","To avoid descending into confusion, Tong Yang silently counted numbers, hoping to keep track of how long she had been in the passage.","But as her breathing grew more and more ragged, her counting speed became erratic, fast then slow, until it lost all usefulness as a reference.","Tong Yang's palms were burning hot as she braced against the icy wall, gasping for breath. At least an hour had passed since she entered the passageway.","For this entire hour, Tong Yang had been enveloped in boundless darkness. Although she tried to constantly regulate her breathing, her brain was exhausted to the extreme, and her limbs felt incredibly heavy, as if every step drained the last of her strength.","The worst part was, Tong Yang had no idea how much longer this state would last.","She wasn't afraid of any unknown entities that might lurk in the dark; it was the utter uncertainty of what lay ahead that was giving rise to some grim thoughts.","— Did those bastards really plan to trap her here for a lifetime?","Tong Yang was utterly spent, her nerves stretched taut every moment. Anyone else wandering aimlessly in a place like this for over an hour would likely have had a mental breakdown long ago.","Leaning her back against the wall, Tong Yang sat down on the ground, intending to rest for a moment.","\"Psychopaths...\"","Tong Yang lifted her head, panting as she cursed.","If those guys weren't planning to trap her here forever, then she had probably already entered the test for the civilian district.","A bunch of sickos!","Was it really necessary to devise such a twisted test just for wanting to live among ordinary people?","Tong Yang hung her hat on her backpack, wiping the sweat from her forehead. Her whole body felt sticky and unbearably uncomfortable.","After a brief rest, Tong Yang continued forward.","She took a deep breath, propped herself up with one hand against the wall, adjusted her pace, and pressed on.","Time crawled by with each labored breath. Tong Yang still hadn't reached the end, nor did she know where the end might be.","Even though Tong Yang considered herself mentally resilient, the prolonged torment and consumption by the darkness gradually bred feelings of unease and anxiety.","Just how much longer did she have to walk? When would this path finally end?","Even if Tong Yang died and entered a cycle, she would remain trapped in this passageway until the time dislocation completely vanished.","Tong Yang's breathing grew increasingly heavy, the pressure on her lungs immense.","In any other place, walking for a full day and night wouldn't have left her this exhausted. Compared to physical fatigue, the psychological torment was far more deadly.","One hour, two hours, three hours, four hours...","Tong Yang's body was severely dehydrated, her mental state deteriorating rapidly. Lost in the darkness, she couldn't even tell if she was standing or lying down, or if everything happening was just a dream.","Maybe this was just a nightmare born from the immense pressure before her college entrance exams. There was no group chat created in the future, no home invasion robbery on May 28th, no bastard mother who came back from the dead... no parallel worlds, no First World. Everything was just a dream woven from nervous tension...","A dream...","If it's a dream, she would definitely wake up eventually.","Perhaps all she needed now was a good sleep... just to sleep...","\"Haha...\"","Two suppressed laughs echoed through the deathly silent passageway.","Tong Yang covered her eyes. The laughter, initially stifled, gradually rose in pitch before finally settling into calm.","\"Hahaha...\"","\"I've really gone mad...\"","Tong Yang bent over, muttering to herself.","She never thought she'd see the day she'd resort to self-deception.","\"A dream? How could it be?\" Tong Yang scoffed.","She raised her left arm and bit down hard. A sharp pain shot through her, and her numb heartbeat finally resumed its rhythm.","Tong Yang had bitten too hard; a strong metallic taste of blood spread in her mouth.","Releasing her teeth, blood trickled from the corner of her lips, wetting her parched mouth.","She was truly so thirsty that she instinctively licked it in.","Trembling, Tong Yang lowered her arm and continued forward.","For some reason, after that mad outburst, memories of her childhood inexplicably surfaced.","Her bastard parents, Tong Le... it all played out vividly before her eyes.","Unnecessary.","There was no need to dwell on the past. It was all over anyway.","Nothing was more important than the present.","Keep moving forward. Just keep moving forward.","She would definitely reach the end.","She had to.","Meanwhile, in a bright, spacious room.","Two people sat before an electronic display, watching the girl's every move on the monitor.","Zhan Zicheng walked in, yawning, tears hanging at the corners of his eyes as if he'd just woken up.","\"How's it going?\" Zhan Zicheng asked as he approached.","Before he could get close, he saw the image on the screen and froze for a moment, his eyes widening in disbelief. \"She... she's still not out?\"","The two seated men looked serious, shaking their heads. \"No.\"","Zhan Zicheng's face showed urgency as he cursed, \"Are you insane? People can go mad under those conditions!\"","One of them replied, \"We've conducted experiments...\"","\"Experiments my ass! Is the situation the same? Eight hours! She's been walking non-stop in that environment for eight hours! How the hell is that the same as locking someone in a dark room with water and bread?\"","\"Mr. Zhan, please calm down,\" the man said composedly. \"We have our own judgment. Please do not interfere with our test.\"","\"Test my head! Your test will be over, and she'll be insane! Wasn't it agreed to be three hours?\"","The man glanced at him. \"Relax. In my opinion, she can last at least twenty-four hours in there.\"","Zhan Zicheng stared in disbelief, muttering, \"Mad... you're all mad...\"","\"This could kill someone!\"","\"She's not taking the test anymore!\"","The man said dismissively, \"Don't worry, she won't die.\"","A moment later, the man chuckled. \"Mr. Zhan, you have good luck. You've picked up a piece of jade. My long journey here wasn't in vain.\"","Zhan Zicheng asked in astonishment, \"What do you mean? You don't intend for her to...\"","\"Hmm, that is indeed my intention.\"","\"You're a real lunatic,\" Zhan Zicheng gritted his teeth and cursed.","The man said, \"Anyway, whether she passes the test or not doesn't affect other matters. The higher-ups' target isn't this. Whether she lives or dies depends on whether she herself has value.\"","\"Aren't you here to find the Time Anchor?\"","The man nodded noncommittally and asked, \"Where is the Time Anchor?\"","Zhan Zicheng shook his head. \"I don't know.\"","\"Who is the Time Anchor?\"","Zhan Zicheng shook his head again. \"I don't know.\"","\"What does the Time Anchor look like?\"","Zhan Zicheng said, \"I don't know.\"","\"If I don't know where she is, who she is, or what she looks like, how am I supposed to find her?\"","Zhan Zicheng pursed his lips. \"You don't have any information related to the Time Anchor at all?\"","The man said, \"You might not believe it, but aside from her gender, I have nothing.\"","\"Why? The Menard family incident caused such a huge stir. How is it possible you have zero information?\"","The man thought for a moment and said, \"That's the entanglement between the parallel world and her. In any case, I have no information about her.\"","\"Damn it! It's all because of the Time Anchor, causing the Maynard family to be wiped out overnight. I still wanted to meet Mr. Maynard.\"","The man said with a half-smile, \"You might still get to see him in the future. After all, that person deliberately let them go.\"","\"Who is that person?\" Zhan Zicheng asked curiously.","\"Who else could it be?\"","Zhan Zicheng suddenly understood, \"You mean the last person who passed the test and left the slums? What was her name, something, something...\"","The man said, \"Aside from those close to her, probably no one knows her name.\"","Hearing this, Zhan Zicheng asked curiously, \"Have you ever seen her?\"","The man scoffed, \"Only two kinds of people have seen her: those at the very top, and the dead.\"","\"Tch! Sounds like a monster.\"","The man looked up again at the electronic screen, at the girl still walking forward, and said, \"Speaking of monsters, this one seems to be no less formidable.\"","\"Really?\" Zhan Zicheng looked left and right at the screen. \"I think she's quite good-looking.\"","The man glanced at him sideways and said, \"Few people her age can remain this calm under such circumstances.\"","As if remembering something, the man stroked his chin and said, \"If properly nurtured, she might become an excellent 'Pathfinder'.\"","Zhan Zicheng widened his eyes, \"So, you plan to completely ignore the Time Anchor matter now?\"","The man replied, \"Can't manage it, and if I don't, others will. Besides, her entering the First World was the higher-ups' goal from the start.\"","\"Huh? Didn't the United Government want her dead?\"","\"Nonsense, she can't die yet.\"","The man said mockingly, \"If the United Government just wanted her dead, why force her into the First World?\"","He looked at the girl on the screen, his eyes growing fervent. \"She might become an excellent weapon. She just needs proper polishing for now...\"","Perhaps his gaze was too intense. The girl in the passage seemed to sense something; she actually raised her head and looked directly at the camera.","\"Whoa!\" Zhan Zicheng exclaimed. \"Isn't it made of stealth material? How did she see it?\"","The man fell silent for a moment. During their conversation earlier, his elbow had accidentally bumped the mouse, which allowed the camera to pan left and right.","The camera used stealth material, so a slight movement wouldn't leave much trace.","Tong Yang was exhausted. She couldn't tell if this was a test or if they had already discovered her identity.","Wu Pingxue had said they didn't know what Tong Yang looked like, so the former possibility was more likely.","But regardless, Tong Yang had had enough.","In the room, three pairs of eyes were fixed on the screen.","On the screen, the girl looked in the direction of the camera, suddenly raised her right hand, and made an internationally friendly gesture.","\"Pfft—\" Zhan Zicheng burst out laughing.","Another person showed a helpless expression. \"Is she provoking us?\"","The man smiled, \"Who knows.\"","Zhan Zicheng joked, \"Do you think there's a chance she actually is the Time Anchor?\"","\"It's not impossible, but it doesn't matter,\" the man said with a meaningful smile.","Zhan Zicheng shook his head. \"I don't think so. The Time Anchor killed so many people across parallel worlds; she must be big and burly. This girl clearly doesn't fit that.\"","\"Who knows.\"","The man smiled indifferently and said to the person beside him, \"Let her out in two hours. Proceed to the next round of testing.\"","\"Yes.\"","Knowing someone was watching her in the dark, she could pretty much confirm this was a test to enter the civilian district.","Tong Yang was long accustomed to her surroundings; she could detect any slight movement immediately.","But this test seemed rather unnecessary. She wasn't trying to become a special forces soldier. According to Xu Junyue, special forces selection had similar tests.","Time ticked by second by second. Tong Yang didn't know exactly how long had passed when she finally saw a bright light in the distance.","For eyes adapted to darkness, the sudden light was somewhat blinding. Tong Yang forced herself not to look away.","Even though she knew the exit was ahead, Tong Yang didn't quicken her pace.","While her spirit could barely hold on, her body was likely on the verge of collapse. Not knowing what she might face next, it was better to conserve some strength.","Tong Yang walked unhurriedly to the source of the light and found it was a bedroom.","She entered the bedroom, the light making her squint.","\"Ta-da! Congratulations on passing the first test!\"","Zhan Zicheng jumped out from behind the door, saying cheerfully.","Tong Yang gave him an icy look. \"Go get some water.\"","Zhan Zicheng widened his eyes. \"Are you ordering me?\"","\"Hurry up!\"","Tong Yang's limbs felt weak. She pulled over a chair and sat down, her throat so dry it felt like it was smoking.","Zhan Zicheng glared at her, but seeing her parched lips, he still poured a glass of water for her.","\"Here.\"","\"Put it on the table.\"","\"Oh.\"","Tong Yang tried to lift her arm. Her relaxed mind could no longer control her body properly.","Tong Yang closed her eyes and asked, \"Is it over?\"","Zhan Zicheng shook his head. \"No.\"","Tong Yang sneered. \"Figured.\"","Zhan Zicheng looked at her physical state and said hesitantly, \"I agree with your point now. Not everyone from the slums is trash. What you just did, I definitely couldn't do.\"","\"How many hours did I walk?\"","\"Almost eleven hours.\"","Tong Yang gritted her teeth, cursing inwardly.","\"S-so, you don't have to take the next tests. I'll have my father provide aid to the slums...\"","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes and said, \"I don't do things halfway.\"","\"The next tests are extremely difficult. You absolutely cannot pass!\"","Tong Yang said, \"Whether I can pass or not, I'll only know after trying. But I need some time to rest.\"","Zhan Zicheng frowned, seeming to hold back his words.","\"You don't understand. The United Government has sent people to various districts to search for the Time Anchor. They work directly for the United Government, and their methods are terrifying. The test just now was decided by one of them. The upcoming tests will only be harder.\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang's expression changed slightly as she caught an important piece of information.","\"Searching for the Time Anchor?\" Tong Yang asked casually, as if it were nothing. \"Is she here?\"","Zhan Zicheng, lacking caution, shook his head. \"Don't know. I don't think they ever planned to find her.\"","\"Why? If they find her, killing her would be good, right?\"","Zhan Zicheng said, \"They say the Time Anchor can't die yet. And her entering the First World means the United Government's goal has been achieved.\"","\"Really? What goal?\"","\"I don't know.\"","At this point, Zhan Zicheng looked at her warily. \"Why are you asking so much? You're not the Time Anchor, are you?\"","Tong Yang smiled ambiguously. \"What do you think?\"","Zhan Zicheng snorted. \"If you are, I'd kill you right now.\"","\"Don't they have her coordinates?\" Tong Yang changed the subject.","\"Gone. We only know she's in the First World.\"","\"Is that so.\"","Tong Yang's gaze grew profound. The situation was roughly as she had guessed, no wonder Wu Pingxue had agreed to let her enter the First World early.","Not wanting to arouse suspicion, Tong Yang changed the subject. \"What is the second round of testing?\"","At this, Zhan Zicheng's face scrunched up. \"You won't pass. You absolutely won't pass.\"","\"So, what is it?\"","\"An exam.\"","Tong Yang paused. \"What?\"","Zhan Zicheng said, \"See! I told you you wouldn't pass. You don't even know what an exam is! Exams are really hard! And you need to get a passing grade.\"","\"What kind of exam?\"","\"Math, physics, stuff like that. I hate exams the most!\"","Zhan Zicheng sighed. \"How could you have been exposed to that kind of knowledge in the slums? They never intended for you to pass the test.\"","\"Oh... is that so.\"","\"Definitely!\"","\"Oh...\"","Zhan Zicheng looked at her. \"So? Have you decided to give up?\"","\"Besides math and physics, are there any other tests?\"","\"I don't think so.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"What's the passing score?\"","\"Sixty.\"","Tong Yang sighed. \"That is indeed difficult.\"","The difficulty wasn't the exam itself!"]},{"number":104,"title":"Chapter 104","paragraphs":["The second round of testing did not begin immediately, giving Tong Yang a day to rest and prepare.","Tong Yang was sweaty and sticky, so she had Zhan Zicheng find her a change of clothes. After taking a shower, she slept for a while.","Less than seven hours later, Tong Yang woke from her sleep. Zhan Zicheng brought her some relevant books. Tong Yang skimmed through them; the mathematics differed slightly from that of the real world, but was largely the same.","Moreover, most of this knowledge could be mastered by middle school level and wasn't difficult.","However, for people from the slums, very few ever got the chance to study, so passing was an extremely difficult feat.","\"How's the preparation going? The test starts in another two hours,\" Zhan Zicheng entered the room and looked at her.","Tong Yang sat on the bed, holding a physics book, and said, \"Are you sure the exam content is within these few books?\"","Zhan Zicheng nodded, \"That's what the examiner said, anyway.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Then there's no problem.\"","\"Wow! You're so confident. Do you know how hard math and physics are?\"","\"But isn't it explained quite clearly in the books?\"","\"Don't you think those numbers look like a foreign language?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I think it's okay.\"","\"Tsk! Talk after you pass.\"","\"Mm.\"","A few hours later, someone notified her that the test was about to begin and told Tong Yang to pack her things and get ready to leave the room.","Tong Yang took her belongings and followed the person down a corridor to a bright, spacious room.","In the middle was a table with paper, pens, and a thick stack of test papers.","Directly opposite the table were three chairs, all empty.","\"Go on in.\"","\"Okay.\"","Tong Yang pulled down the brim of her cap, hung her backpack on the chair, and sat down.","Looking around, the room was unusually empty.","Shortly after Tong Yang took her seat, a broadcast sounded from the front, announcing that the test would begin in approximately ten minutes.","After the broadcast ended, footsteps gradually echoed from the corridor.","Not long after, three examiners entered the room, one of whom was Zhan Zicheng.","He winked at Tong Yang, looking rather pleased with himself.","Tong Yang's attention, however, wasn't on him; she was watching the two people walking in front.","Their footsteps were light, almost soundless.","The leading man had a crew cut, a black stud on his brow bone. Despite his fierce and intimidating features, he wore a smile. When his eyes met Tong Yang's, he gave a slight nod in greeting.","The one in the middle was a woman wearing glasses, her expression quite stern. She walked into the room without glancing sideways, not paying Tong Yang the slightest attention.","\"The test duration is six hours. You may choose to submit your paper early. You cannot leave the room during this period,\" the woman said.","She checked her watch and said, \"There are nine minutes until the test begins. You may choose to look over the test papers.\"","Tong Yang nodded, \"I understand.\"","\"Please note, maintain silence during the exam.\"","\"Mhm.\"","Tong Yang wasn't worried about them seeing her face, as there were now three worlds, and it was possible for three identical people to exist.","Furthermore, the First World didn't intend to kill her. Even if they knew what she looked like, they wouldn't make it public. After all, the fact that the United Government didn't want her dead didn't mean others didn't. So, they couldn't possibly reveal Tong Yang's identity.","For either reason, it conveniently gave Tong Yang an opportunity.","Nine minutes later, the test officially began.","The room was exceptionally quiet, with only the sounds of turning pages and pen tips scratching against paper.","Tong Yang chose not to use her usual method. She didn't force herself to be flawless or to calculate everything mentally. Instead, she wrote long strings of formulas on the scratch paper, even making some deliberate mistakes.","No matter what, her current identity was still that of a slum dweller. She had to keep up appearances and avoid raising suspicion as much as possible.","Tong Yang didn't think her desire to enter the civilian district was rash. After all, she wasn't the first person to take this test, nor the first to leave this place.","Tong Yang wrote diligently, trying to keep her scores right around the passing line. She intentionally omitted some questions that required more thought or wrote wrong answers, even having to think about how to make the mistakes seem plausible. It felt more meticulous than her own middle school entrance exams.","Time passed slowly in the quietness, until suddenly, snoring came from the front.","Interrupted in her thoughts, Tong Yang looked up and saw Zhan Zicheng, sound asleep, slumped in his chair.","The woman in the middle backhanded Zhan Zicheng on the back of his head.","\"Who, who hit me?\" Zhan Zicheng jolted awake, looking around angrily.","\"Maintain silence. Do not disturb the test,\" the woman said.","Zhan Zicheng grumbled, \"I wasn't disturbing the test.\"","\"No sleeping.\"","\"Hmph.\"","Tong Yang's gaze shifted to the woman. Since the exam started, the woman's eyes hadn't left Tong Yang, staring at her fixedly like a surveillance camera.","Fortunately, Tong Yang had strong mental fortitude. She acted as if the woman didn't exist the entire time, burying her head in her work.","The crew-cut man kept his head down, playing on his phone, not making a sound.","Tong Yang lowered her head again, turned the test paper over, and continued answering.","Zhan Zicheng, probably bored from sitting, got up and paced over to her. He stood by the table and glanced at her paper.","Tong Yang was working on a problem-solving question.","Zhan Zicheng read the question stem along with her. Before he could even process it, Tong Yang swiftly wrote out a formula on the scratch paper with two strokes.","Zhan Zicheng followed her train of thought, perhaps too engrossed. When Tong Le deliberately miscalculated a step, he reminded her, \"You wrote that wrong.\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, the three people in the room simultaneously looked at him.","\"Go away.\"","\"Get back here!\"","Tong Yang and the woman spoke in unison.","Zhan Zicheng slunk back to his seat and continued dozing off. He should have known better than to come watch; he might as well have slept soundly in his room.","Four hours later, Tong Yang finally finished the last test paper. By then, she felt it was even more exhausting than the college entrance exam.","She didn't choose to submit the paper immediately. Instead, she checked the papers inside and out, while also estimating her scores along the way. Math and physics were around sixty-seven and sixty-four respectively, just over the passing line and unlikely to raise suspicion, as all this knowledge was in the textbooks Zhan Zicheng had given her.","\"I'm finished,\" Tong Yang said.","Zhan Zicheng said in surprise, \"You're not going to check again? There's still time.\"","Tong Yang said:","\"I've written all I know. Give me ten more days and I still wouldn't be able to write the rest.\"","\"That's true.\"","The crew-cut man said, \"Are you sure?\"","\"Mhm.\"","\"Alright, then proceed to the next test.\"","Tong Yang wasn't surprised there were more tests. She shouldered her backpack and left the room.","The following tests were worlds apart from the first two rounds, consisting entirely of questions about common sense and ideological morality. Although Tong Yang wasn't a particularly moral person, it wasn't hard to answer correctly.","Three days passed, and Tong Yang completed all the tests required to enter the civilian district.","\"All tests are concluded.\"","Tong Yang stood in the room, looking utterly exhausted.","The testing period was too long and too tedious. Apart from the first two rounds, which posed no difficulty for her, there were just too many questions. She also had to pretend to only half-understand, which was very draining.","\"Yang Tong, our investigation shows this is not your first time taking these tests,\" the woman suddenly said to her.","Tong Yang was momentarily taken aback, but replied calmly, \"Yes, it's been a while.\"","\"Last time you fell just short. I hope you can pass this time.\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"Thank you.\"","She didn't ask further questions, but already understood the situation perfectly.","In the parallel world, Tong Yang had once lived with her in the real world under the alias \"Yang Tong,\" with Tong Yang covering all her daily expenses.","At the end of April, she returned to the parallel world. Before parting, she said she would prepare a gift for Tong Yang in the First World. The password to receive the gift was the name \"Yang Tong,\" which was precisely why Tong Yang had chosen \"Yang Tong\" as her alias to stay in the slums.","If \"Yang Tong\" participated in the Commoner District test before she herself entered the First World, her existence would become legitimate, unrelated to the Time Anchor, because at that time the \"Time Anchor\" was still in the real world.","The woman said, \"The test results will be out within a week. We will inform you whether you passed or not.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"If I pass the test, can I bring people close to me into the Commoner District?\"","\"No more than five people.\"","\"I understand,\" Tong Yang nodded.","As she left the testing area, the man with the crew cut was leaning against the door frame watching her.","\"Is there something?\" Tong Yang asked.","The crew-cut man said, \"Yang Tong, I look forward to seeing you again.\"","\"Then let me pass the test,\" Tong Yang replied.","Prior to this, Tong Yang had already managed to get Zhan Zicheng to reveal the crew-cut man's attitude towards her.","Safely passing the exam wasn't an impossible task.","The crew-cut man said, \"If you have the capability.\"","Tong Yang glanced at him and walked straight down the corridor, leaving without another word.","The crew-cut man looked at the woman in the room and asked, \"When was Yang Tong's last test?\"","The woman replied, \"May fifteenth.\"","The crew-cut man narrowed his eyes. \"That means she must have obtained test qualification by at least May first.\"","\"Correct.\"","\"That doesn't align with the time the Time Anchor entered the First World.\"","The woman narrowed her eyes. \"You suspect her?\"","\"I suspect anyone I haven't met before,\" the crew-cut man shrugged. \"Anyone unfamiliar is a potential suspect.\"","The woman said, \"Yang Tong existed before the Time Anchor appeared.\"","\"Indeed.\"","\"How were the first-round test results?\"","\"Just barely passed.\"","The man's pupils contracted slightly, murmuring, \"Just barely passed...\"","Tong Yang was led back to the original corridor by a staff member.","\"You can return from here.\"","\"Mhm.\"","Tong Yang slung her backpack over one shoulder. Having lived for days in a sunless place, it felt like forever since she had seen such brilliant sunlight.","She stretched. She needed to get a good sleep when she got back.","If nothing unexpected happened, she would enter the Commoner District in a week. Then she could contact people from the real world. She wondered how many calls Tong Le had made to her during this time.","Reaching the end of the corridor, she opened the small door on the right side of the large iron gate and returned to the slums.","The area near the exit was almost deserted except on the first and fifteenth of each month. Tong Yang closed the door, raised her eyes, and caught a glimpse of something in the corner behind the door.","Looking closer, she saw a thin, small figure curled up hugging her knees, dressed exactly as she was before Tong Yang left, unsure how long she had been waiting.","Tong Yang walked over and saw Miaomiao had fallen asleep with her head tilted, cookie crumbs still clinging to the corner of her mouth.","\"Miaomiao?\" Tong Yang called softly.","She was sound asleep, showing no sign of stirring.","Tong Yang patted her shoulder and noticed her body temperature was higher than usual. \"Miaomiao?\"","After a couple of gentle shakes, Miaomiao gradually stirred, opening her bleary eyes. Her gaze was empty and numb until she heard Tong Yang's voice. Slowly lifting her eyes, light seemed to flood into them.","\"Big sister... cough... You're back!\" Miaomiao grabbed the hem of her shirt.","Tong Yang frowned, placing her right hand on Miaomiao's forehead. \"You have a fever.\"","Miaomiao brushed her hand away, using the wall to push herself up. \"I'm fine. I just fell asleep accidentally. Let's go back.\"","\"How long have you been waiting?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"I've been here the whole time, so big sister would see me as soon as she came back.\"","Tong Yang's expression was complex. \"Are there any doctors in the slums?\"","Miaomiao shook her head. \"No.\"","\"When people here get sick, they can only wait to die slowly... Big sister, am I going to die?\"","Tong Yang tapped her forehead. \"Don't talk nonsense. It's just a fever. You won't die even if you want to.\"","\"That's good then...\"","Tong Yang sighed helplessly, handing her backpack to Miaomiao, who obediently took it.","\"Get on my back. I'll carry you home.\"","\"Okay...\"","Miaomiao climbed onto her back, wrapping her arms around Tong Yang's neck.","There were no doctors in the slums, but there were some medicines available. Tong Yang bought a few boxes on the way back.","After giving her some fever reducer, she let her sleep.","Miaomiao's cold wasn't severe; it was just that long-term malnutrition had weakened her immune system. After a few days of medicine and rest, she was fine.","After Tong Yang returned from the test, people occasionally came to visit them, inquiring about the test situation.","Now, the entire First World had its eyes fixed on the slums.","On the sixth day after the test ended, the owner of the grocery store rushed to find Tong Yang, breathlessly saying, \"They're here... people from the Commoner District are here...\"","At that moment, Tong Yang was practicing combat techniques with Miaomiao.","\"Where?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"At my shop! You'd better hurry over.\"","\"Mhm.\"","Tong Yang patted Miaomiao's shoulder, signaling her to get ready. \"I'll go check first.\"","\"Got it!\"","Miaomiao scurried into the room, while Tong Yang returned to the grocery store with the owner.","By the time they arrived, a huge crowd had gathered outside the shop.","\"She's here, she's here! Yang Tong is here!\"","\"Move aside! Make way!\"","The crowd automatically parted to both sides, creating a path down the middle.","Tong Yang entered the grocery store and saw several people, led by the crew-cut man, sitting inside.","The TV behind the counter was broadcasting a news report: the Time Anchor had entered the First World. Since both the Commoner and Elite Districts had identity registration, initial judgment indicated the Time Anchor would likely appear in the slums.","Shifting her gaze to the crew-cut man, he smiled at her.","\"Yang Tong, long time no see.\"","Tong Yang gave a slight nod. \"Long time no see.\"","The crew-cut man said, \"How have you been these past couple of days?\"","Tong Yang was puzzled. \"Did you come here to catch up?\"","The crew-cut man smiled. \"Of course not.\"","\"Then let's get to the main point,\" Tong Yang said.","The crew-cut man nodded. \"Alright, let's get to the main point.\"","\"The results of the test you took on July 15th are out. We came here to inform you of your test results.\"","Tong Yang nodded, her expression unreadable. \"Go ahead.\"","The crew-cut man sighed. \"I'm very sorry. You did not pass the test.\"","As these words were spoken, a murmur of disappointment rippled through the crowd.","\"Just as expected.\"","\"The Commoner District tests are never that simple. We already guessed this would happen.\"","\"It's okay. At least you're still alive.\"","\"Right, being alive is what matters.\"","No one seemed particularly surprised, including Tong Yang.","These guys definitely wouldn't let her enter the civilian district easily. Although Zhan Zicheng had told her the Joint Government had ulterior motives and wasn't completely forbidding her from passing the test.","Tong Yang remained unflustered by favor or disgrace, asking, \"I understand.\"","The man with the crew cut said, \"You don't seem surprised at all? If you miss this opportunity, you probably won't get another chance to leave the slums.\"","Tong Yang said helplessly, \"What can I do about it? I participated in two tests and failed them all, proving I'm not qualified to enter the civilian district.\"","Tong Yang spoke lightly, but she didn't truly think that way. She had to find a way to leave this place, otherwise, her connection to the real world would be completely severed.","\"But I have a question, and I hope you all can answer it,\" Tong Yang said.","The crew-cut man lifted his chin. \"Go ahead.\"","Tong Yang said, \"I want to know, in which round did I fail? Or did I fail all of them?\"","The crew-cut man said, \"You performed very well in every round of testing, especially the first round.\"","\"So?\"","\"It's just that, for the first round, the math and physics test papers... you failed them all.\"","Tong Yang's jaw tightened. Failed them all? What a joke?","How much effort had she spent to reasonably control her scores to that specific value?","She might fail at anything else, but she would absolutely not fail the first round of tests!","However, this was clearly just an excuse to keep her out of the First World. Tong Yang couldn't reveal any flaws. Even though she knew they were blatantly lying, she had to accept it and couldn't show that she knew the scores inside out.","\"Is that so.\" Tong Yang lowered her eyelashes. \"It seems I'm not qualified to enter the civilian district.\"","\"I express my deepest regret regarding this,\" the crew-cut man said.","Tong Yang continued, \"However, I still firmly believe that the slums are not a garbage dump. We are just lacking opportunities to contribute to humanity. I simply... am not among those who qualify.\"","The crew-cut man looked at her, his smile thought-provoking.","\"Perhaps you're right. What a pity.\"","Rage surged in Tong Yang's chest. These bastards dared to tamper with her results.","They actually said she failed her science exams? Tong Yang felt there was no greater insult.","\"If there's nothing else, I'm going back,\" Tong Yang said coldly.","\"Wait a moment, my phone is ringing.\" The crew-cut man pulled a phone from his pocket, swiped it casually, and held it to his ear.","Everyone exchanged glances. Wasn't there no signal in the slums? How could he receive a call?","\"Hmm, I've met Yang Tong. What is it?\"","\"What?\" The crew-cut man sat up straight, a look of surprise on his face. \"The first-round scores were miscalculated?\"","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes, watching the man with an inscrutable expression.","\"She passed? She passed them all?\" the crew-cut man said, shocked.","\"What?!\"","\"Passed? Yang Tong passed!\"","\"Yang Tong passed the first round of tests, so doesn't that mean...\"","\"Oh my god! She passed the civilian district test!\"","\"My heavens!\"","Tong Yang's expression was a mix between a smile and a sneer. Was this crew-cut guy deliberately testing her?","A moment later, the crew-cut man put down his phone and said to Tong Yang with a face full of remorse, \"My sincerest apologies. The staff responsible for reviewing the first-round tests missed some answers and miscounted a few points. You just barely passed math and physics. You've passed the first round.\"","Tong Yang's eyes darkened. \"Who reviewed the first-round tests?\"","The crew-cut man stood up, stepped forward, and patted Tong Yang's shoulder. \"I know you're angry, but please understand. People aren't machines; mistakes are inevitable.\"","Tong Yang was silent for a moment, then asked, \"So, I passed the test?\"","\"Yes.\" The crew-cut man proactively took her hand and shook it. \"Congratulations, congratulations.\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together and pulled her hand back.","The crew-cut man said, \"Why aren't you happy even though you passed the test?\"","Tong Yang said, \"If you had told me from the start that I had passed, I probably would be happy. But I almost lost my qualification to enter the civilian district forever because of your mistake.\"","\"I proved my point was correct. The slums are not a garbage dump.\"","The crew-cut man said with great seriousness, \"You are right. We are deeply sorry. It was entirely our negligence. Fortunately, they were able to correct it in time.\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together, thinking this person was insane.","\"Wh-what does this mean...\"","\"Yang Tong really passed the civilian district test?\"","\"Then doesn't that mean... doesn't that mean...\"","\"The slums will receive aid from the affluent district?\"","\"We can go to school too?\"","...","The crew-cut man looked past Tong Yang at the crowd present and said, \"That's correct. Yang Tong has passed the civilian district test. We will fulfill our promise and provide aid to the slums.\"","\"However, processing the identity paperwork will take some time. Yang Tong can bring up to five family members or close friends with her into the civilian district.\"","\"Additionally, apart from this matter, there is one more thing we need to ask of everyone. The Time Anchor might be within the slums. Because the slums are... a sensitive area, the Joint Government cannot conduct direct searches. We hope during this time, everyone can spread the word and look for traces of the Time Anchor.\"","The crowd erupted in an uproar.","\"The Time Anchor is actually in the civilian district?\"","\"Why would the Time Anchor enter the First World?\"","\"If we catch her, kill her, we can go to the Third World! Then there won't be any slums anymore!\"","\"Catch her! We must catch her!\"","\"Sir, who is the Time Anchor?\"","The crew-cut man said, \"The information we have about her is very limited. We only know she is a young woman who often operates alone.\"","\"We understand!\"","\"The Time Anchor... we must capture her!\"","Tong Yang watched them coldly. Thinking about it this way, she herself was somewhat suspicious. After all, when she first arrived, she had acted somewhat unusually. Thankfully, she often kept Miaomiao by her side.","The crew-cut man changed tack, saying, \"She likely carries items not commonly seen in the slums, such as electronic devices.\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang's heart sank.","Except for that day at the noodle shop, she had never taken out any electronic devices. But the few people who had seen it that day and later tried to rob her, only to be thoroughly beaten by Tong Yang, were standing not far away.","She wouldn't be exposed in this way, would she?","Tong Yang curled her fingers into her palms, nails digging into her flesh.","What to do? If they spoke up, suspicion towards Tong Yang would increase.","\"Electronic devices aren't common in the slums, but they aren't unheard of either.\"","\"Right, sometimes there are first-hand goods in the supplies, they're just sold at a higher price.\"","Tong Yang looked at the speakers—they were precisely the ones who had tried to rob her and gotten beaten up.","The several men, meeting Tong Yang's gaze, each gave her a look that seemed to say \"don't worry.\"","Tong Yang: \"?\"","What did that mean?!"]},{"number":105,"title":"Chapter 105","paragraphs":["Not long after, the crew-cut man and his group left the slum. Yang Tong watched thoughtfully as the several men who had helped conceal the electronic devices she was carrying gave her friendly smiles before disappearing into the crowd.","Yang Tong did not pursue them. She turned and went back to her residence.","Miaomiao had already packed everything and was standing by the second-floor window looking down. \"Sister!\" she called out.","\"Hmm,\" Yang Tong responded absentmindedly.","Back in the room, Miaomiao, dragging large and small bags of luggage, asked, \"When are we leaving?\"","\"Tomorrow morning,\" Yang Tong said.","\"Oh,\" Miaomiao immediately put the things down. \"So we're staying one more night.\"","Yang Tong glanced at her. The bags contained everything, including pots, pans, bowls, and dishes.","\"Why didn't you just dismantle the bed and take that too?\"","Miaomiao grinned sheepishly. \"I couldn't carry it.\"","Yang Tong was speechless. \"No need. We'll buy new ones when we get there.\"","\"But that costs a lot of money.\"","\"It's fine.\"","Yang Tong told her to take out all the useless items from the bags and discovered even used disposable chopsticks inside.","At ten o'clock tomorrow morning, she would take her family and friends to Gate No. 2 to register their identities. Once the identity documents were issued, they would be people of the commoners' district.","However, including herself, she could bring at most four people in. Besides Miaomiao, that left three vacant spots.","In the evening, the living room door was knocked.","Yang Tong sent Miaomiao to open it. Standing outside were four men—the same ones who had attempted the robbery that day and who had helped conceal her electronic devices during the day.","Seeing the four appear, Yang Tong's expression remained calm, not at all surprised.","\"Miss Yang.\"","\"Good evening, Miss Yang.\"","Miaomiao frowned. \"What are you doing here?\"","One of them said, \"We're here to see Yang Tong, Miss Yang.\"","Yang Tong said, \"Miaomiao, let them in. You go back to your room.\"","The four men filed into the room. Miaomiao closed the door, crossed her arms, and stood beside Yang Tong, eyeing the four men warily. \"I'm staying right here,\" she said.","Yang Tong glanced at her but didn't insist. She gestured for the men opposite to sit.","\"What did you come to see me about?\" Yang Tong asked.","One of them spoke up, \"Miss Yang, we heard you're entering the commoners' district tomorrow to register your identity, and that you can bring four people with you. We...\"","The four exchanged looks. A man with a sallow, emaciated face said, \"We lost our heads before and offended you. We were wondering if you'd be willing to give us a chance to make up for it.\"","Yang Tong laughed at this. \"And how do you plan to make up for it?\"","The man said, \"The adults from the commoners' district said the time anchor point might be in the slums, and that it involves carrying electronic devices. You see...\"","\"What?\"","\"Although you aren't the time anchor point, you are carrying electronic devices. If the adults from the commoners' district find out, given their style of 'rather kill the innocent than let the guilty go,' you definitely won't be allowed into the commoners' district, and you might even be in mortal danger.\"","Yang Tong propped her chin on one hand. \"So?\"","\"We won't tell anyone about this. We won't hinder your entry into the commoners' district.\"","Yang Tong asked with a smile, \"Besides you four, does anyone else know?\"","\"No one else knows. They only know you got a lot of money from the Zhan family's only son,\" that man said.","Yang Tong said unhappily, \"Who said I robbed him? He almost killed me. It was compensation.\"","The man slapped his own cheek, smiling awkwardly. \"My mistake, my mistake. They only know the Zhan family's only son gave you a lot of money.\"","Yang Tong said, \"What you say makes sense. If I'm not the time anchor point but they discover I'm carrying electronic devices, I probably won't get into the commoners' district and might even be in danger.\"","\"Exactly!\"","\"Don't worry, we absolutely won't breathe a word!\"","Yang Tong nodded. \"Then thank you.\"","Miaomiao stood behind her, glaring at the four men with clear hostility. These guys were obviously up to no good.","\"You're welcome, you're welcome.\"","\"This is our way of making amends, Miss Yang. So, what do you think?\"","Yang Tong said, \"I think it's quite good.\"","\"That's great, that's great.\"","Yang Tong said meaningfully, \"You're helping me so much. I wonder how I should repay you.\"","Hearing this, the four men's eyes lit up, gleaming.","\"Miss Yang, you're too kind. We don't need any repayment.\"","\"Right, no need to stand on ceremony with us.\"","The four exchanged a look, then continued, \"It's just...\"","Yang Tong asked leisurely, \"Just what?\"","\"It's just that the commoners' district is different from the slums. You have to find work to support yourself. A young girl like you might have a hard time adapting, so...\"","\"So?\"","\"So, if you don't mind, you could let the four of us accompany you inside. From then on, we could address each other as siblings, and we would earn money to support and take care of you.\"","These guys, the fox's tail was finally showing.","Yang Tong hadn't gone to question them immediately back then precisely because she guessed this was their goal.","Did they think she was a three-year-old child? Address each other as siblings? They would earn money to take care of her? She'd probably die in the commoners' district without knowing how.","Yang Tong said, \"Thank you for your kindness, but no need. I'll be taking Miaomiao into the commoners' district.\"","That man said, \"Think it over carefully. If you take her, you'll have to support not only yourself but also her.\"","\"It's fine. Barring any accidents, I should be able to afford it.\"","Seeing Yang Tong's firm attitude, the four men's expressions changed slightly.","\"Miss Yang, I think you should consider this carefully...\"","Yang Tong changed tack, saying, \"How about this: I can't leave Miaomiao here alone, but there are three vacant spots. Discuss among yourselves who stays in the slums, and the remaining three can enter the commoners' district with me.\"","The four men looked at each other, seemingly pondering the feasibility of Yang Tong's words.","However, before they could reach any conclusion, one of them spoke up. \"Miss Yang.\"","His voice was low, his face displeased.","\"We've been discussing this with you politely. You should at least show us the most basic respect.\"","Yang Tong chuckled. \"How am I not respecting you? Didn't I give you a choice?\"","The man's lips tightened. \"Then let me be blunt. If you don't want to arouse the suspicion of the commoners' district, take all four of us in.\"","The other three chimed in, \"That's right, Miss Yang. You're a smart person. It's better to be sensible.\"","Yang Tong narrowed her eyes slightly. \"And if I refuse?\"","The man sneered. \"Tomorrow we'll tell the people from the commoners' district that you are the time anchor point.\"","Yang Tong said, \"Do you have proof?\"","\"No proof. But that way, the people from the commoners' district won't let you off, and they'll never let you enter the district.\"","Yang Tong rested her chin on her hand, her expression indifferent. \"What if I simply refuse to cooperate?\"","The man slammed a dagger onto the table and said coldly, \"We underestimated you last time. This time, we are fully prepared. If you refuse, we will absolutely not let you off after tomorrow.\"","\"Think about it. Two weak women like you will always have moments of carelessness.\"","Tong Yang smiled. \"First the courtesy, then the force?\"","\"Correct.\"","\"We hope you make the right choice.\"","\"You people...\" Miaomiao was about to unleash a torrent of abuse but was stopped by Tong Yang.","Tong Yang said with calm composure, \"So, you're saying I have no choice but to cooperate with you?\"","\"Correct.\"","\"We didn't want to be this rough with you either. If you had cooperated from the start...\"","\"But it's not too late now. As long as you agree, we can address each other as siblings from now on. At the very least, you won't go hungry.\"","Tong Yang almost laughed. She had the ability to pass the test and enter the civilian zone; how could she possibly be unable to feed herself?","Tong Yang waved at Miaomiao and said, \"Go to the kitchen and pour me a cup of hot water.\"","\"Sis...\" Miaomiao was worried and didn't want to leave her side.","\"Go.\" Tong Yang's tone brooked no argument.","Miaomiao had no other choice. She could only glare fiercely at the four men, warning them not to harm Tong Yang.","Miaomiao walked into the kitchen, turned on the gas, and boiled half a pot of water.","In the living room, Tong Yang faced off against the four men and said, \"Actually, besides cooperating with you, there is another solution.\"","\"What?\"","\"Kill you all before you can tell anyone.\" Tong Yang stated.","The four men were momentarily stunned, then frowned deeply.","\"Don't look down on us...\"","\"Pfft!\"","Before the man could finish his sentence, Tong Yang moved like lightning. She grabbed the dagger from the table and plunged it into the man's throat.","It happened almost in the blink of an eye. Before the others could even register her movement, the man had lost his breath and collapsed on the floor.","\"What are you doing...\"","Tong Yang gave them no time to react. She kicked the person next to her, pulled out the dagger, and swiftly appeared before another man, gripping his throat and ending his life with a single stab.","Another man grabbed a chair and swung it at her. Tong Yang blocked it with her arm, delivered a spinning kick that sent him crashing to the floor, then rushed forward in three quick steps and kicked him squarely in the chest, making him cough up blood.","Tong Yang bent down, slit his throat, then turned to look at the remaining man.","Three of the four men were dead within seconds. The last one, seeing the pool of blood on the floor, was utterly dumbfounded, trembling uncontrollably in fear.","\"You... you...\"","Watching Tong Yang approach, the man's face turned deathly pale, his legs gave way, and he could no longer stand.","Tong Yang walked up to him. In no hurry to strike, she half-knelt, using the blood-stained blade to lift his chin. She saw deep-seated fear etched in his eyes, tears welling up.","Tong Yang curled her lips into a smile, leaned close to his ear, and whispered in a low voice, \"Didn't you ever consider what you'd do if I were a temporal anchor point?\"","The man's eyes widened in terror, his dry lips quivering. \"You... you are...\"","Tong Yang raised the dagger and stabbed it into his temple.","Blood splattered all over Tong Yang. She stood up and turned to see Miaomiao standing at the kitchen doorway, staring at her dumbfounded.","\"Sis, you...\"","Tong Yang wiped the blood from her face and walked calmly into the bathroom. \"Stay there. I'm going to take a shower.\"","After washing off the blood and drying her damp hair, Tong Yang returned to the living room. Miaomiao was still standing at the kitchen doorway, motionless, watching her.","\"Is the water not ready yet?\"","Hearing her words, Miaomiao snapped out of her daze.","\"It's... it's ready.\"","\"Pour me a cup.\"","\"Oh...\"","Miaomiao carried a bowl of scalding hot water out of the kitchen and saw Tong Yang sitting in one of the few clean spots in the room.","\"Sis, it's a bit hot.\"","Tong Yang glanced at her and asked, \"Scared?\"","Miaomiao nodded instinctively, then paused for a few seconds and shook her head. \"I'm a little scared of their bodies...\"","Tong Yang said, surprised, \"You're not scared of me?\"","\"I could never be scared of you, sis.\"","Tong Yang blew on the steaming hot water and asked, \"You stayed in the same room with your previous 'mom's' corpse for so long. Why are you scared of bodies now?\"","Miaomiao said, \"Because that mom didn't bleed.\"","\"So, you're scared of blood.\"","\"Mhm...\"","\"Go back to your room. No need to clean up. We're leaving tomorrow morning.\"","\"Oh...\"","Miaomiao acknowledged and started walking towards the room.","Suddenly, in the quiet night, unhurried footsteps echoed from the stairwell.","Tong Yang's body stiffened slightly, her brows furrowing.","Some people lived in this building, but they generally stayed in their rooms and rarely wandered out at night. Moreover, the footsteps of people in the slums were usually weak and shuffling. These footsteps, however, sounded very steady, likely belonging to a healthy adult male.","And they seemed utterly at ease.","Tong Yang was certain she had never seen, nor would there exist, such a person in the No. 2 Gate area of the civilian zone.","Seeing Tong Yang's grave expression, Miaomiao stopped and looked toward the door in confusion.","The footsteps traversed the empty stairwell, entered the second-floor corridor, and gradually approached the room where Tong Yang and Miaomiao were, without deliberately lightening or slowing down.","\"Go back to the room,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Sis, you...\"","Tong Yang raised her voice. \"Go back to the room!\"","Miaomiao flinched, scared by her tone, and didn't dare say more.","She turned back, entered the room, and closed the door.","The footsteps stopped right outside their room.","Tong Yang looked at the corpses littering the floor and took a deep breath. The person outside was likely trouble.","Let her pass the test during the day, then send someone to kill her at night? What kind of tactic was this?","Tong Yang returned to the room, hid a handgun on her person for emergencies, and gripped a dagger in her hand.","\"Thump—\"","\"Thump—\"","Knocking sounds came, still leisurely and unhurried.","Tong Yang found a blind spot out of view from the doorway and regulated her breathing.","\"Thump—\"","After three knocks, silence fell outside the door.","Instinct told Tong Yang the person outside was no ordinary foe. In a direct confrontation, she would likely find it hard to prevail against him.","\"Bang—\"","The door was violently kicked open. The old wooden plank door immediately splintered into pieces, wood fragments scattering across the floor.","Immediately after, a man dressed in black tight-fitting clothes, with a burly build, walked in.","Fortunately, most places in the slums had no electricity. A few candles flickered dimly in the room. Tong Yang concealed herself in the darkness, waiting for an opportunity, ready to strike.","The man stood by the doorway, surveyed the gruesome scene inside the room, glanced around, and his gaze settled on the closed door to Miaomiao's room.","In his right hand, he held the body of a woman, limbs limp, seemingly unconscious.","\"Bang! Bang! Bang!\"","Without warning, he grabbed the woman by the hair and smashed her face repeatedly against the floor until it was a bloody, unrecognizable pulp. Then, he tossed her aside like garbage.","Afterwards, he stepped around the blood and corpses on the floor and approached the closed door to Miaomiao's room.","\"Thump—\"","He raised his arm and knocked gently.","Miaomiao did not respond, much less open the door.","The man's back was turned to Tong Yang—a perfect opportunity.","Tong Yang held her breath, moving through the darkness.","However, the moment she moved, the man at the door immediately looked towards her.","Tong Yang clenched her teeth. His senses were too sharp.","\"Come out.\" The man's voice had a mechanical steadiness.","Knowing there was no point in hiding any longer, Tong Yang stepped out of the shadows and asked, \"May I ask who you are?\"","\"What business brings you to this humble dwelling so late at night?\"","The man turned around, looked at Tong Yang, and instead of answering, asked, \"Yang Tong?\"","\"If I said no, would you believe me?\"","The man's voice changed slightly as he repeated, \"Yang Tong.\"","The candlelight flickered on their faces. Tong Yang did not close the distance between them; the other party was most likely not a friendly sort.","\"Right, I am Yang Tong. So what do you want?\"","The man said, \"I have been sent to protect you.\"","Tong Yang was stunned. \"What did you say?\"","The man repeated patiently, \"I was sent by the United Government to protect you.\"","Tong Yang: \"?\"","She narrowed her eyes. \"Protect me? Why protect me?\"","\"Because you are someone the United Government values.\"","Tong Yang shook her head. \"I mean, protect me from what? Who would want to harm me?\"","The man said, \"Yes.\"","\"Who?\"","Avoiding the question, the man looked at the corpses littering the floor and continued, \"However, it is most unfortunate. By the time I arrived, you were already dead.\"","Tong Yang frowned deeply. \"What do you mean?\"","The man explained, \"When I arrived, Yang Tong was already dead. I only saw the killer.\"","\"Who?\"","The man's gaze shifted to her, then after a moment, moved to the floor, to the corpse he had brought in—its face smashed, casually discarded on the ground.","Tong Yang realized something. \"Is she Yang Tong?\"","\"Correct.\" The man nodded. \"Most regrettable. Yang Tong, who passed the July 15th test and successfully earned entry to the Civilian Zone, was killed on the eve of her departure.\"","Things were becoming more and more perplexing. Tong Yang couldn't understand. What exactly did the United Government want?","\"Yang Tong is dead. Then what about me?\" Tong Yang asked.","The man said, \"You will acquire a new identity and go to live in the Civilian Zone.\"","\"When?\"","\"Now.\"","What on earth was going on?","Did the United Government want to kill her, but someone was unwilling, so they used a scapegoat to die in her place?","Or did they have another purpose?","\"Must we leave now?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Can I bring my sister?\"","\"You can.\"","\"No need to manufacture another corpse.\"","\"Unnecessary.\" The man added, mercifully, \"They only care about whether Yang Tong is dead.\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together, lost in thought. Without understanding the United Government's purpose, she had no other choice at the moment.","\"It's getting late. Come with me,\" the man said.","\"Alright.\"","No matter what, she had to get to the Civilian Zone. She would first see what these people were really after.","\"Miaomiao, come out,\" Tong Yang called.","As soon as the words were spoken, the closed door was pushed open.","Miaomiao stood there, one hand gripping a chair leg, the other a rusty kitchen knife, eyeing the man warily.","The man looked down at her impassively and said, \"I advise you not to try anything. I dislike killing rats.\"","\"You're the rat! Your whole family are rats!\"","\"Miaomiao, pack our things. We're going with him.\"","Miaomiao snorted coldly and quickly ran to Tong Yang's side. \"I understand, sis.\"","Shouldering their respective belongings, they followed the man through the hallway and onto a secluded path.","Along the way, the man deliberately led them to avoid others.","After walking for nearly two hours, they finally reached their destination: Gate Nine of the Slums.","A small door had been left open on the right side of the iron gate.","Once they passed through that small door, their lives would be completely cut off from the slums.","The man led them down a passageway with walls on both sides, arriving at a spot similar to where the Gate Two test had been held that day. He opened a door in the wall.","Seeing the pitch-black tunnel inside instantly reminded Tong Yang of the eight or nine hours she had once spent groping in darkness in a sunless place. Although she hadn't felt fear then, she had no desire to repeat a similar experience.","\"Follow me in,\" the man said.","Despite her reluctance, Tong Yang followed.","Inside the door was another narrow passage where you couldn't see your hand in front of your face. The man walked ahead, while Miaomiao anxiously clutched her clothes.","Fortunately, the passage wasn't long. After less than three minutes, some light appeared ahead.","Entering the lit area, they found themselves in a large hall.","The man led them across the hall and stopped before a door. Pushing it open, he said, \"Rest here tonight. Someone will come tomorrow to register you.\"","\"I understand,\" Tong Yang said.","The man nodded and turned to leave.","\"Wait.\" Tong Yang suddenly called out to him.","The man turned back, looking at her motionlessly.","Tong Yang asked, \"Why are you doing this? Who wants to kill me? Are you really protecting me?\"","The man replied, \"Settle in here peacefully. You'll know tomorrow.\"","With that, the man left without further delay.","Tong Yang and Miaomiao entered the room. Miaomiao asked, \"Sis, what does all this mean? What does he mean by 'you're already dead'?\"","Tong Yang shook her head, indicating she hadn't figured it out yet either.","She looked around. It was an ordinary room with a television and an outlet below it for charging.","However, the room might have surveillance, so they couldn't charge their devices here.","\"Don't think about it. He said we'll know tomorrow.\"","Tong Yang wanted to see for herself what the United Government's goal was.","Having walked so long, she was sweaty and decided to take another shower.","Miaomiao said, \"Sis, aren't you afraid there might be cameras in the bathroom?\"","\"It's a bit gross, but I'm not afraid.\"","Besides, what kind of person installs cameras in a bathroom? Only a pervert.","Even so, Tong Yang carefully checked the bathroom. No cameras.","After showering, Tong Yang fell asleep immediately.","Whatever was going on, she'd deal with it tomorrow.","Early the next morning, Tong Yang habitually woke up around six or seven. After washing up, a staff member brought breakfast, indicating they should stay in the room and someone would come to take them away later.","After breakfast, they waited for several hours. The scheduled time for identity registration had already passed.","Bored, Tong Yang turned on the TV to watch the news. Perhaps the news of \"Yang Tong's\" death had already been discovered.","After flipping through a few channels, she finally found a related report.","\"According to certification by relevant departments, the recent highly publicized Civilian Zone test has yielded a result.\"","\"The slum-dweller who participated in the test passed successfully yesterday, earning the opportunity to go to the Civilian Zone.\"","\"However, it is most unfortunate. When United Government personnel went to receive her, they found her and her friends already dead in her home, the scene extremely gruesome. Here are the photos we captured on-site...\"","On the screen, a shabby room was shown with five corpses lying haphazardly. The floor and walls were covered in dried bloodstains.","\"In order to prevent such an incident, the Unified Government specifically dispatched personnel to the slums to provide protection. Who could have anticipated they would arrive one step too late, only to witness the murderer fleeing the scene after the killing.\"","\"After extensive investigation and verification, it was confirmed that the perpetrator was a time anchor from the Third World...\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang's brows furrowed tightly.","Who was the killer?!"]},{"number":106,"title":"Chapter 106","paragraphs":["\"Time Anchor?\" Miaomiao repeated softly.","\"Sister, are they trying to frame the Third World's Time Anchor?\"","Tong Yang's face was dark, her lips pressed into a tight line.","Announcing yesterday that the Time Anchor might be in the slums, and then having Yang Tong, who passed the test, \"die\" at the hands of the Time Anchor today... it was all too unusual.","But the parallel world, the First World, had always been at odds with her, the Time Anchor. Why kill Yang Tong and shift the hatred onto the Time Anchor?","Could it be related to the First World forcing her to come here?","\"Sister?\"","Hearing no response for a while, Miaomiao called out in confusion.","Tong Yang's eyes were deep and unreadable. She shook her head to indicate she was fine.","The news broadcast continued, showing the current situation in the slums.","The crowd was furious, cursing the Time Anchor for killing Yang Tong, vowing to drag the Time Anchor out and avenge her.","A man with a buzz cut stood on a high platform, raising his hands to urge calm.","The crowd gradually quieted down. The buzz-cut man spoke: \"We are filled with anger and sorrow over Yang Tong's death.\"","\"She was a talent who made us believe that people from the slums could also create value for the world. Yet, at such a time, the Third World's Time Anchor attacked her, cutting her life short so young. How can this not be heartbreaking?\"","\"I don't know if the Time Anchor can see this broadcast. But if you can, remember this: No matter who you are, no matter where you hide, no matter the cost, we will find you and make you pay with your life for the innocent Yang Tong!\"","His speech was met with cheers from the crowd.","After a pause of several seconds, the buzz-cut man said regretfully, \"Through our extensive investigation, we have determined that the Time Anchor's goal is to prevent the slums from receiving aid from the affluent districts, which is why she ruthlessly targeted the innocent Yang Tong. Therefore, we have no choice but to temporarily suspend the previously agreed aid plan until the Time Anchor is found, to prevent her from attacking others.\"","These words stirred even stronger emotions in the slum dwellers. A torrent of vile curses erupted. If the Time Anchor stood before them now, she would be torn to pieces instantly.","Watching this, Tong Yang certainly didn't believe they were merely using the Time Anchor as an excuse to evade promised aid to the slums.","Most likely, forcing Tong Yang into the First World was part of their plan. Even without the \"Yang Tong\" incident, they would have found another reason to frame her. Their objective was probably far from simple.","Sure enough, watching the furious crowd below, the buzz-cut man narrowed his eyes slyly.","\"To capture the Time Anchor as soon as possible and fulfill our promise to the slums, we have made a bold decision.\"","The buzz-cut man placed a hand over his heart and bowed. \"Finding the Time Anchor among the slum population, which constitutes fifty percent of Earth's people, is nearly impossible. We must choose an alternative path. In the near future, we will conduct large-scale bombings of the slums. We will spare no location the Time Anchor might frequent. This action will undoubtedly cause massive casualties among the slum population. Here, on behalf of the United Government, I express our sincere apologies to those who will perish in the bombings.\"","After these words, the crowd fell silent.","\"What...\"","\"Large-scale bombings of the slums?\"","\"Then we would...\"","The buzz-cut man continued, \"We believe the people of the slums are also willing, like Yang Tong, to demonstrate their ability to contribute to the world.\"","\"After all, the people of the slums have never been under the protection of the law.\"","Tong Yang's expression turned grave. Was the United Government's goal to use her to justify the extermination of everyone in the slums?","Why go to such insane lengths?","The buzz-cut man went on, \"In return, after the Third World Time Anchor is captured or killed, those who remain alive will unconditionally receive 'Civilian' status. Furthermore, the United Government will permanently delete the clause stating 'Slum humans are equivalent to garbage and are not protected by any law.'\"","These words left the crowd dumbfounded.","\"Survivors can get civilian status?\"","\"As long as we catch the Time Anchor, survivors won't be garbage anymore, but legally recognized people?\"","\"Oh my god! Finally... finally...\"","The buzz-cut man's words were like a bone tied to a dog's neck.","The living conditions in the slums were already harsh. Anyone could attack them. Before this, they wouldn't even have been notified of the impending bombings, dying under artillery fire completely unaware.","This time, the United Government not only informed them but also offered a condition they absolutely could not refuse.","As long as they captured the Time Anchor, killed the Time Anchor, they would get the chance to become \"human.\"","As long as they survived until then, they could escape the mire.","Lured by the bone of becoming \"Civilians,\" they would not resent the United Government's decision, but keep moving forward.","Even if some died along the way, the one they would hate would only be the Time Anchor who caused it all.","The buzz-cut man watched the crowd's reaction with satisfaction.","Then, someone asked, \"If we catch the Time Anchor today, can we become civilians, protected by the law?\"","The buzz-cut man smiled. \"Of course. Whenever the Time Anchor is caught and killed, that is when we will fulfill our promise.\"","\"So, please also keep a close eye on the people around you. It's for everyone's good.\"","\"Excellent!\"","\"As long as we find the Time Anchor quickly, we can earn the right to live!\"","\"Excellent, excellent!\"","\"Let's all work together, we must find the Time Anchor as soon as possible!\"","\"Yes!\"","The buzz-cut man said, \"I need to correct you on one point. If the Time Anchor hadn't killed Yang Tong, you would have gained the chance to become civilians today.\"","\"Damn that Time Anchor!\"","\"Damn her! She deserves to die!\"","\"Don't let me find her, or I'll make her wish she were dead!\"","\"Why didn't Yang Tong protect herself?\"","\"If she had protected herself, none of this would have happened!\"","...","Truly, madness takes hold. Someone was actually pointing fingers at the victim, Yang Tong.","The buzz-cut man took in this scene, with no intention of stopping it.","In the room, Tong Yang's face could no longer be described as merely dark.","Those damned people from the First World forced her into the First World just to legitimately exterminate the slum population?","The slum dwellers didn't know, but the United Government knew perfectly well that the one who killed Yang Tong wasn't the Time Anchor. They just needed an excuse the slum humans absolutely couldn't resist, and that excuse was the existence of the Time Anchor.","They didn't truly want to catch Tong Yang, to kill Tong Yang. So they would keep bombing the slums until they reached a level satisfactory to the United Government.","Tong Yang gritted her teeth, unable to understand why.","The social systems of the First World and the Parallel World were different.","The First World merely had a large wealth gap; commoners could still excavate resources for them, and the slums were just places to contain the refuse. The Parallel World, however, had been invaded, suffered large-scale warfare, and after its social system collapsed and was restructured, countless people at the bottom died. They could no longer be enslaved, and the First World became overly reliant on existing resources. So, they were constantly hunting people from the lower strata, using them for experiments to develop genetic serums.","The lower strata of the Parallel World society were already beyond saving, leaving no choice but to abandon them and move on to the next world.","Yet the First World was not like this. The existence of the slums had no real impact on the social system. In fact, large-scale bombing of the slums would be an even greater waste of manpower, material, and financial resources than simply allowing them to continue to exist.","Why was the United Government doing this?","If it was simply for the pleasure of killing, wouldn't the Parallel World be the most suitable place for them?","Was there a reason they were forced to do this?","What was it?","Tong Yang frowned deeply, staring at the image on the screen of the man with a buzz cut, who wore a sincere and humble expression. If she tore off his hypocritical mask, what true face would be revealed?","\"Sister, are you okay?\" Miaomiao asked with concern, seeing her complexion was off.","\"I'm fine,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Sister, what should we do?\" Miaomiao pressed her lips together. \"You didn't die, so why are they bombing the slums?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Because the United Government needs a suitable pretext to exterminate the people in the slums.\"","Miaomiao turned pale. \"Then what about us...\"","Tong Yang said, \"We just need to protect ourselves.\"","Tong Yang certainly wasn't foolish enough to expose her identity because of the First World's people or to disrupt the United Government's plans.","Admittedly, she was extremely displeased that the United Government was using her to carry out such an inhuman massacre, but she truly couldn't empathize with or pity the humans in the slums. They and the First World were one entity, the chief culprits who caused the Parallel World to become what it was, and also the chief culprits behind the invasion of the real world.","Apart from doing what she needed to do, Tong Yang had no intention of getting involved in anything related to the First World.","Miaomiao nodded. \"Sister, you're right. It's enough if we can just preserve our own lives.\"","After a few seconds, Miaomiao asked, \"Sister, if one wanted to stop it, how could they stop the bombing of the slums?\"","Tong Yang thought for a moment and said, \"It's absolutely impossible with just a few people's strength. The only thing that could be done is to overthrow the United Government before the people in the slums are all dead.\"","Miaomiao said, \"Couldn't we also capture the Time Anchor?\"","Tong Yang glanced at her. \"The United Government's goal isn't the Time Anchor. Even if they captured her, they would 'accidentally' let her escape and continue the bombing.\"","Miaomiao said, \"What if they killed the Time Anchor?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Setting aside whether the Time Anchor can even be killed, even if she were accidentally killed, they could just create a new Time Anchor.\"","For example, after the war in the Parallel World subsided, they re-established the Time Anchor's coordinates on Yan Qing in the Parallel World.","Miaomiao said dejectedly, \"Why?\"","\"Why must they kill the people in the slums?\"","Tong Yang said gravely, \"That's not something we should concern ourselves with.\"","None of this had anything to do with her anymore.","Entering the commoner district and making contact with Wu Pingxue was the task she had currently set for herself.","As for the First World humans about to die in the bombing, it had nothing to do with her; she wasn't the executioner.","On the contrary, she felt she was a victim too.","In the news, the buzz-cut man continued, \"To create reasonable time for everyone to evacuate, starting tomorrow, the first round of bombing will commence ten days later, with subsequent rounds every ten days thereafter. The locations are undetermined.\"","\"Please protect yourselves. The United Government will be with you.\"","Was it laughable?","The party standing at the top of the food chain, issuing the death order, had the audacity to claim they were with the humans they viewed as trash?","\"Thank you, United Government!\"","\"It's all because of the Time Anchor!\"","\"We must capture the Time Anchor! At any cost!\"","\"Respected Chairman of the United Government, please bless us to survive and kill the Time Anchor as soon as possible, so everything can return to normal.\"","\"Thank you, United Government! Kill the Time Anchor!\"","...","Amidst the loud cries from the slum dwellers, the buzz-cut man left the podium and walked through the gate separating the slums from the commoner district.","The news anchor shared their views on the incident, wishing for the swift capture of the Time Anchor and for the people in the slums to soon escape their suffering.","Turning off the TV, the room fell into silence.","The bombing of the slums would begin in ten days, and then every ten days thereafter.","What on earth were these lunatics trying to do?","Sensing Tong Yang's displeasure, Miaomiao obediently stayed by her side without making a sound to disturb her.","Half an hour later, the same buzz-cut man who had just appeared on the news knocked on the door of Tong Yang and Miaomiao's room.","\"Hi,\" the buzz-cut man stood at the doorway, raising his hand in greeting.","Tong Yang looked at him and said, \"I saw the news.\"","The buzz-cut man wasn't surprised. \"Even if you hadn't, I would have told you.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"Why are you doing this? Do you really want to capture the Time Anchor?\"","The buzz-cut man entered the room and closed the door behind him.","\"No.\"","Tong Yang's face turned somewhat cold. \"Why?\"","The buzz-cut man shrugged. \"To be honest, as of now, even the United Government isn't sure of the Time Anchor's location. She could be mingling in the commoner district or the affluent district. From what I know, there are people willing to help her in both areas.\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang's mind stirred, but she didn't delve deeper into the topic. Maintaining her composure, she said, \"Then why does the news say the Time Anchor is in the slums? And why must I die?\"","The buzz-cut man stretched, sat down at the table, and ordered Miaomiao, \"Pour me a glass of water.\"","Miaomiao ignored him completely. The man pursed his lips and poured himself a glass of water.","\"Because the United Government's original goal was to bomb the slums. You just happened to appear, so they decided to make a big deal out of it and go with the flow.\"","Tong Yang said gravely, \"So all the promises you made to me are worthless? The slums are still just trash in your eyes? Then why not just kill me outright? Why bother letting me enter the commoner district with a new name?\"","The buzz-cut man chuckled. \"No, of course the slums aren't trash in my eyes. After all, one or two highly accomplished people have come from there. But, I don't care about who's in the slums. Do you understand what I mean?\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together tightly. She understood perfectly. Whether the slums held geniuses, mediocrities, or ordinary people, it was all unimportant to them.","The buzz-cut man said, \"Yang Tong, technology has already reached the point where it can replace the labor that ordinary—even exceptional—humans contribute to society. In fact, its impact is even greater.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Then why keep me alive?\"","The buzz-cut man smiled and said, \"In my view, you're not an ordinary or even just an exceptional human. You might bring unexpected gains to the First World.\"","Tong Yang looked at him coldly, remained silent for a long moment, then asked, \"Does the United Government want to kill the people in the slums because they don't want to fulfill their responsibilities?\"","The buzz-cut man said with surprise, \"Why would you think that? The aid they want is utterly insignificant to the affluent districts. There's no need to spend more time and resources over such trivial gains.\"","\"Then why? What reason makes it necessary for us to die?\"","The buzz-cut man narrowed his eyes, refusing to divulge any more information to Tong Yang. He said, \"Yang Tong, starting today, you and the little girl beside you are no longer residents of the slums.\"","This guy, clamming up whenever it gets to the crucial point. Tong Yang had no choice but to change her approach.","\"If the temporal anchor point is really in the slums, what if it gets blown up by you?\"","The buzz-cut man said, \"That possibility isn't zero. However, she probably won't die.\"","\"What if Miaomiao and I step forward and expose the United Government's lies?\"","The buzz-cut man said helplessly, \"Yang Tong, haven't you understood yet? You're just a pretext. Without you, the United Government would naturally find someone else.\"","Tong Yang naturally understood the United Government's intention.","Forcing her into the First World, yet not wanting to kill her, instead using her as an excuse to carry out indiscriminate actions in the slums and pin the blame on her.","She just wanted to fish out some key information from the buzz-cut man's mouth, but this guy was tightly guarded. He said everything he could say and didn't utter a single word about what he couldn't.","\"Oh, by the way, I haven't introduced myself yet. I'm Xue Wei, twenty-six years old, currently unmarried.\"","\"Okay, let's go.\"","Since she couldn't get anything out of him, Tong Yang didn't want to waste any more time.","They would enter the civilian district and try to contact Wu Pingxue to tell him about this.","Xue Wei said helplessly, \"You're so cold to me. Am I not handsome enough?\"","Tong Yang looked him up and down and asked, \"Do you want to hear the truth?\"","Xue Wei first nodded, then shook his head. \"Forget it. I have a feeling that nothing pleasant would come out of that mouth of yours.\"","Tong Yang gave a half-smile, shouldered her belongings, and walked towards the door. Miaomiao, afraid of being left behind, grabbed her things and hurriedly chased after her.","At the doorway, Tong Yang suddenly stopped.","Miaomiao couldn't brake in time and bumped her head into Tong Yang's back.","Tong Yang turned around, looked at Xue Wei, and said, \"To be honest, pretty average.\"","Xue Wei's face darkened. \"Hey! I didn't want to hear the truth!\"","Tong Yang said, \"Sorry, I prefer to call it as I see it. Please understand.\"","Xue Wei gritted his teeth, glaring at her angrily. \"You'd better be saying that because I changed my hairstyle!\"","A flicker of disdain passed through Tong Yang's eyes. \"You...\"","She had just started speaking when Xue Wei suddenly covered his ears. \"I'm not listening! I'm not listening!\"","He said this while walking out, deliberately bumping into her as he passed by.","\"Is he sick?\" Miaomiao watched Xue Wei's retreating figure, her expression cracking.","Tong Yang said flatly, \"Who knows.\"","They followed Xue Wei to a service window. He stood to the side with his arms crossed, his face cold. \"Register your identities. You are not allowed to use your original names.\"","A girl in work clothes sat inside the window. \"Name.\"","Tong Yang simply changed it. \"Yang Le.\"","\"Gender.\"","\"Female.\"","\"Age.\"","\"Twenty.\"","Tong Yang arbitrarily added two years.","\"Alright, next.\"","Miaomiao walked up to the window, nervously standing on tiptoe to look inside.","\"Name.\"","Miaomiao hesitated, glanced back at Tong Yang, and said, \"Yang... Yang Miao.\"","Miaomiao didn't have a surname, only knowing her nickname was Miaomiao.","Anyway, to outsiders, she and her sister were family, so sharing her sister's surname should be fine, right?","After answering, she looked back at Tong Yang again and only relaxed when she saw she had no particular reaction.","\"Gender.\"","\"Female.\"","\"Age.\"","\"Eleven.\"","\"Alright. Your identity cards will be ready within ten minutes. Please wait a moment.\"","\"Thank you.\"","Tong Yang looked at Xue Wei and asked, \"Didn't you say processing identity documents takes a lot of time?\"","Xue Wei blinked and said, \"Oh, I lied to you.\"","Tong Yang curled the corner of her mouth. \"I 'generally' don't lie.\"","She deliberately emphasized the word \"generally.\" Hearing this, Xue Wei widened his eyes and shot her a glare. \"That's enough from you. After all, I am a member of the United Government.\"","Tong Yang was unimpressed but didn't continue further.","A few minutes later, the identity cards were ready. The staff handed two cards to Tong Yang.","Tong Yang took them and looked. The cards had their names, genders, ages, and a string of numbers representing their ID numbers. The last row also had a residential address.","The staff said, \"The address listed is your temporary residence. A monthly rent of three thousand is required. Please go to a designated location to update your identity card if you change your address.\"","Tong Yang frowned. \"Three thousand a month? That's too expensive.\"","Xue Wei said, \"Didn't you swindle quite a bit of money from Zhan Zicheng?\"","Tong Yang said unhappily, \"That was what I deserved.\"","Xue Wei pursed his lips. \"Whatever you say.\"","The staff said, \"After residing for one month, you can choose to change your address. There are also areas with cheaper rent.\"","\"Okay, thank you.\"","Tong Yang thanked her and didn't linger. Xue Wei led the two away from the window.","They entered a bright corridor with polished marble walls reflecting the lights.","After walking for about ten minutes, a pristine white door appeared ahead.","Xue Wei pushed the door open and stood to one side, gesturing for Tong Yang and the other to enter.","Tong Yang stepped through the door first. Before her eyes was a clean, tidy street surrounded by houses.","\"Whoosh—\"","An aircraft flew overhead. Tong Yang looked up; it was slightly different from the combat aircraft Zhan Zicheng piloted.","At the end of the street, several kilometers away, several skyscrapers towered, almost disappearing into the clouds.","\"Pedestrians, please yield—\"","\"Pedestrians, please yield—\"","A mechanical voice came from the roadside. Tong Yang turned to look. A mechanical dog carrying various packages, with wheels on its feet, was moving along the street, accurately and swiftly navigating around all obstacles.","\"Mommy, I want a mechanical puppy too.\"","\"Okay, we'll go browse at the pet shop later.\"","A mother and daughter walked along another path, chatting and laughing.","All sorts of strange and novel things around them made it hard for the two to look away.","Xue Wei stood inside the doorway and said to Tong Yang, \"I have some matters to attend to. See you in a while.\"","Tong Yang glanced at him. \"Mhm.\"","Xue Wei didn't say anything more and closed the door.","\"Let's go,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Oh...\"","With Miaomiao, she crossed the street and approached an ordinary restaurant. The owner sat at the front counter playing on his phone.","Tong Yang asked, \"Boss, can we charge here?\"","\"Yes, there are outlets by the seats.\"","\"Thank you.\"","Tong Yang sat down, pulled out her charger and phone, plugged it in, and ordered some food.","A few minutes later, the phone successfully powered on.","Tong Yang looked at the signal bar on his screen and let out a sigh of relief.","Finally, there was a signal."]},{"number":107,"title":"Chapter 107","paragraphs":["After finishing their meal and charging the phone, the two went to their accommodation.","The address was in the upwind area of the civilian district, an ordinary residential complex.","After providing identification and paying one month's rent, they received the keys and returned to their room.","The room had two bedrooms, a living room, a kitchen, and a bathroom. The decor was quite nice, with all sorts of facilities complete. Apart from daily necessities, they basically didn't need to buy anything new.","\"Big sister, this place is so beautiful,\" Miaomiao exclaimed in wonder.","Having grown up in the slums, she had never seen such a nice-looking house.","Tong Yang said, \"If you like it, let's find a way to earn money and buy it.\"","The security guard had told them that since it was a house allocated by the Joint Government, they had priority to purchase it, and the price was very favorable.","\"Great! Big sister, let's earn money together and buy this place!\" Miaomiao said enthusiastically.","She ran to the window and pushed it open. The room was on the ninth floor. Looking down, she could see the surrounding environment. A cool breeze gently brushed her cheeks. Closing her eyes, she could feel the faint fragrance floating in the air. Everything was so wonderful, completely different from the chaotic environment of the slums.","The upwind area wasn't a particularly bustling location, but there were plenty of shopping malls and streets nearby. Living here was indeed quite nice.","Tong Yang put down her backpack, looked at the excited Miaomiao, and fell silent for a few seconds before saying, \"Miaomiao, I think I've told you before.\"","Miaomiao turned around, her face overflowing with joy. \"Big sister, what is it?\"","Tong Yang said, \"For certain reasons, we are only living together temporarily.\"","The delight on Miaomiao's face gradually faded. She lowered her head and, after a long moment, mumbled, \"Anyway, you'll leave the money for me when you leave, right? What's wrong with us earning money together?\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"It's good that you understand that.\"","Tong Yang walked to the doors of the two bedrooms and looked in. They were roughly the same size. Carrying her backpack, she entered one of them and said to Miaomiao, \"I have some things to take care of. You can look around the apartment and see what's missing. I'll take you out to buy things later.\"","Miaomiao replied sullenly, \"I know.\"","Immediately after, Tong Yang closed the door.","Walking to the desk, she put her things down. Tong Yang raised her hand and knocked on the wall. The echo was significant; the room's soundproofing was quite good.","Sitting at the desk, Tong Yang took out her phone. Tong Le had called and messaged her many times these past few days. Because Tong Yang had warned him in advance that he might not be able to reach her, he wasn't too anxious, just asking her to call him back to let him know she was safe once she saw the messages.","Besides him, Chu Shiyu, Xu Junyue, and others had also called her a few times.","Ye Huai, on the other hand, didn't call. Like clockwork, he sent messages every day asking about her situation.","Tong Yang didn't reply to their messages immediately. Instead, she called Wu Pingxue.","The phone rang a few times before the other party answered.","\"Hello.\" Wu Pingxue's calm and collected voice came through. It even sounded like she took a sip of water while speaking. \"You've finally left the slums.\"","Hearing this made Tong Yang's teeth itch. \"You knew I was in the slums?\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"Of course. I can see your coordinates, though the range is a bit smaller than in the First World.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Damn old woman.\"","Wu Pingxue wasn't angry but laughed instead. \"Alright, let's get down to business. What did you find?\"","Tong Yang's voice grew a few degrees heavier.","She said, \"They forced me to enter the First World early, with the goal of using me as a pretext to bomb the slums.\"","Tong Yang gave Wu Pingxue a rough overview of what had happened.","Finally, Tong Yang said, \"I don't understand. What reason does the First World have to do this? It's not like the Parallel World, which needs to massacre and plunder existing resources. The First World's technology is so advanced, resources are produced continuously. Why would they expend more effort to eliminate fifty percent of the world's population?\"","After hearing Tong Yang's words, Wu Pingxue fell silent.","\"What's wrong?\" Tong Yang asked.","After a long while, Wu Pingxue sighed and said, \"Tong Yang, we have to find a way to stop this, to protect the lives of the people in the slums as much as possible.\"","Tong Yang didn't understand. \"Why?\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"Haven't you noticed? People in the First World don't rely on gene medicine, not even the defective or inferior versions.\"","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes. \"The slums indeed have no access to those things.\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"It's more than that.\"","\"How so?\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"Inferior gene medicine did initially spread from the First World into the Parallel World. However, the development of high-quality gene medicine without side effects was all conducted within the Parallel World.\"","Tong Yang pondered. \"With the First World's advanced technology, it should be easier for them to manufacture high-quality gene medicine.\"","\"Correct. Think about it. The technological gap between the First World and the Parallel World is so vast. Why couldn't the First World completely wipe out the people of the Parallel World back then? Instead, they had to cease fire and coexist peacefully.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Because only the Parallel World can manufacture high-quality gene medicine?\"","\"Exactly.\" Wu Pingxue sighed. \"But it's not just that.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"The First World used magnetic field energy to raise their technological level. Apart from that, their development of magnetic field energy only extended to creating defective and inferior gene medicine.\"","Tong Yang's breathing grew slightly heavier. \"So you're saying that the Cycle, brain development, the creation of high-quality gene medicine, using magnetic field energy to control the entire planet and even influence human brains... all of that is the Parallel World's development of magnetic field energy?\"","No wonder Tong Yang felt that First World humans were closer to ordinary people in the real world. It was because their brains hadn't been affected by magnetic field energy yet.","The Parallel World had developed magnetic field energy too well, to the point of being almost omnipotent. Not only could they possibly create various gene medicines and command programs, but they could also control all existing humans on Earth.","\"What the Parallel World developed, the First World isn't incapable of developing, but rather lacks the conditions to develop.\"","Tong Yang was stunned. Lacks the conditions to develop? What conditions?","What conditions does the First World lack compared to the Parallel World?","Whether it's technology or Earth's resources, the First World surpasses the Parallel World by more than just a little. What condition is the First World missing?","Initially, Wu Pingxue's goal was to kill seventy percent of the real world's population to obtain its resources.","The Parallel World's goal, however, is to kill everyone in the real world and seize their resources.","But if it's just about obtaining resources, why not follow the First World's example and divide humans into three different classes?","Slums, civilian district, affluent district...","Although the classes are distinct, it at least ensures resource regeneration, without the need to go through the great trouble of plundering resources from another world.","Moreover, the Parallel World wants her dead immediately, while the First World does the opposite. Why?","If we don't know what the First World lacks, then how about looking at it from another angle?","What's different between the Parallel World and the First World?","In the First World, the affluent district and the Joint Government control the entire planet. In the Parallel World, the middle and lower classes have either already died or had their brain neurons extracted to become Order Maintainers.","What is the difference between them?","It's...","Thinking of this, Tong Yang almost gasped.","\"The fewer people alive, the more effectively the magnetic field energy can be utilized?\" Tong Yang asked.","Wu Pingxue chuckled wryly. \"Exactly. Magnetic field energy is not an inexhaustible resource after all. It's just that the way it manifests is different. Almost everyone can consciously control its power. Only when there are fewer living people, fewer conscious individuals, can the energy be concentrated and exert its maximum effect.\"","A chill crept up Tong Yang's spine. Perhaps until now, she had been trapped in a misconception.","She had always thought that the humans in the parallel world engaged in mutual slaughter and self-destructive games because they had abandoned all resources requiring human development, leading to the collapse of the social system and creating the current state of affairs.","However, in reality, from the very beginning, the resource they were fighting over and developing was the magnetic field energy?","They didn't care at all what happened to the social system.","Everything done up to this point was for the sole purpose of fully harnessing the magnetic field energy?","Wu Pingxue said, \"Precisely because of this. Otherwise, why would we choose self-destruction?\"","Tong Yang's eyes darkened. \"What's the First World's reason for doing this? Haven't the two worlds long since become indistinguishable?\"","This way, even if the First World couldn't fully develop the magnetic field energy, they could still benefit from the parallel world's achievements in developing it.","Wu Pingxue sighed. \"How can the initiative be left in someone else's hands forever?\"","\"The First World not only wants to develop the magnetic field energy, but also desires stable resources.\" Wu Pingxue's voice was flat. \"Over a decade ago, they began working on creating androids. Once the androids are successfully developed and mass-produced, and the value created by other humans can be replaced, there will be no need for them to stay alive.\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together, her expression grim.","\"Are you saying the bombing of the slums is just the beginning? In the future, they'll extend their reach to the civilian zones as well?\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"Originally, I wasn't sure about this point. But now it seems that is indeed the First World's plan. Once their purpose is exposed, or if they bomb the slums on a large scale without reason, it would inevitably provoke resistance and discontent, even making everyone in the civilian zones fear for their own safety. However, using you as a pretext is just perfect, logical, and wouldn't raise anyone's suspicions.\"","Tong Yang frowned tightly. \"Just as insane as the parallel world.\"","Wu Pingxue did not deny this, saying, \"The reason the First World is keeping you alive, besides using you as an excuse, another layer is probably to prevent the parallel world from immediately invading the real world. Otherwise, the initiative would forever remain in the hands of the parallel world.\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang narrowed her eyes. \"So, forcing me into the First World actually protects me?\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"Possibly. However, the greater reason is likely to control your life and death, and to catch up to the parallel world's development of magnetic field energy before you die.\"","Wu Pingxue smiled slightly and continued, \"By then, androids will be created on a large scale to generate resources and maintain the social system. The First World will be in a position to advance or retreat as needed. Whether the parallel world successfully invades the real world or not, the First World has a perfect future ahead.\"","Tong Yang sneered, \"It seems the First World's Joint Government has some brains after all.\"","\"Yes, but the parallel world may not be inferior to the First World. It's just that after experiencing an unparalleled war, if we couldn't use magnetic field energy to suppress the First World, we would have lost long ago.\"","Tong Yang offered no comment on this and instead said, \"Regardless, I'm actually safer in the First World. As long as their development of magnetic field energy hasn't reached the parallel world's level, I'm not in mortal danger.\"","Dr. Wu said, \"Mm, but we can't let them proceed unchecked. Otherwise, given the First World's technological level, it won't take long for them to catch up to the parallel world.\"","Tong Yang said coldly, \"You overestimate me.\"","Wu Pingxue's tone was helpless. \"Of course, it's impossible for you to achieve this alone, and I don't intend for you to completely stop the bombings of the slums. The First World conducts a bombing every ten days. You just need to try to ensure more people survive. With fifty percent of Earth's population, it's impossible to kill everyone within a year or so.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Then I'll do my best, but don't expect much.\"","\"I know. There should be quite a few people in the First World willing to help you.\"","\"Such as?\"","Tong Yang knew this old fox often lied and spoke in half-truths; he might not really be unaware of who in the First World could help her.","Sure enough, after she asked, he didn't choose to keep her in suspense any longer.","\"For example, Maynard.\"","Tong Yang was taken aback. \"Maynard? He's in the First World?\"","After the Maynard family was annihilated by the \"Forerunners,\" Maynard and some key family members disappeared.","\"He was originally from the First World.\"","\"He's from the First World?\" Tong Yang showed a trace of disbelief, having never imagined that Ye Tianlin, as \"Maynard,\" was actually from the First World.","\"Yes. The First World won't hold his actions against him.\"","Then, which world did the Ye Tianlin who died at Hailin International School last year belong to?","And which world did Ye Huai belong to?","Wait, Ye Huai should be from the real world. He was able to regain his memories during Tong Yang's loops; only someone from the real world could do that.","But then, why was he so good to Ye Huai? Making him the second Maynard, even preparing so many clean assets for him in the real world.","Wu Pingxue cautioned, \"When you can't do anything, stay put and don't arouse suspicion. They can't kill you, but they can control you.\"","Tong Yang said, \"You don't need to tell me that.\"","Wu Pingxue was long accustomed to her attitude. \"Alright then, let's keep in touch.\"","\"Mm.\"","After hanging up, Tong Yang immediately called Tong Le.","The phone rang for over ten seconds. Finally, just before it disconnected automatically, it was answered.","\"Hello, Sis!\"","Before Tong Yang could speak, Tong Le's breathless voice came through.","Listening carefully, there was also the sound of reading in the background.","\"Mm, where are you?\" Tong Yang asked.","Tong Le said, \"I'm outside the classroom.\"","\"During class?\"","Tong Yang checked the time. It was indeed still class hours. She had been careless; she should have picked another time to call him.","\"Mm...\" Tong Le's voice sounded a bit muffled. \"But I got the teacher's permission.\"","Since the call was already connected, Tong Yang didn't dwell on it.","\"It's nothing urgent. My phone died, had no signal, just charged it.\"","Tong Le breathed a sigh of relief. \"That's good. Sis, you're not hurt, are you?\"","\"No.\"","\"Have you been eating properly?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I will eat properly from now on.\"","Tong Le's voice paused. \"You weren't eating properly before?\"","Tong Yang relaxed her body, leaning back in the chair. \"I wanted to, but didn't have the chance.\"","After all, there wasn't much edible food in the slums.","\"The best thing I ate was a five-dollar bowl of vegetable noodles.\"","\"Sis!\" Tong Le's tone became upset. \"Use my money! Go buy something nutritious.\"","Tong Yang laughed, \"It's not that I don't want to buy things, it's that I can't buy anything.\"","Tong Le grumbled, \"Where did you go? It's not a war zone, is it? How could you not be able to buy anything?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I'm in a very faraway place, a rather poor one.\"","\"Give me your address, I'll mail you some things,\" Tong Le said.","Tong Yang chuckled, \"It's fine now, I can buy things already.\"","Tong Le said, \"Then you absolutely must eat properly, don't skimp. Teacher said the little robot we developed has been sold, for a huge amount of money, all transferred to the card I gave you. Don't worry about not having money, I'll earn more!\"","Tong Yang said, \"I know.\"","\"How have Dad Yang and Mom Yang been lately?\"","Tong Le said, \"Dad Yang, Mom Yang, and Grandma are all very worried about you, but you don't need to worry. I, along with Yang Lin and Sister Shiyu, will help explain things to them. Sister, you just take care of yourself out there.\"","\"Okay, please relay to them that I'm fine.\"","\"I know!\"","\"Mhm.\"","Sensing Tong Yang's intention to hang up, Tong Le asked cautiously, \"Sister, can I call you in the future?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Don't call unless it's important. I'll contact you occasionally myself.\"","\"Oh...\"","\"Hanging up now. Take care of yourself.\"","\"Okay! Sister, you take care of yourself too!\"","\"Mhm.\"","Tong Yang hung up the phone and switched to a social media app.","Chu Shiyu and Xu Junyue had both sent her some messages. Xu Junyue told her their final exams were over, and their academic advisor wanted her to get in touch when she had time to arrange a make-up exam online.","Tong Yang replied with a few sentences to each, planning to contact the advisor about the make-up exam in a couple of days.","Besides these two, several other acquaintances had also sent messages. However, she never had the habit of replying promptly, often going ten days or half a month without checking messages, so everyone was already used to it.","Entering the \"Netizen Gossip 007\" group chat, it was as lively as ever. It wasn't the first time she'd disappeared like this, so everyone took it in stride, discussing gossip in the group, occasionally @-ing her to see if she was around. If she wasn't, they'd just continue gossiping.","[So bored...]","[What exactly has Sister Tong been up to?]","[Things have been so calm lately it's killing me, nothing's happening.]","[Ahhhhhh Sister Tong what are you doing!]","[Ahhhhhh has the parallel world situation been resolved?!]","[@Learning is for Making Money @Learning is for Making Money @Learning is for Making Money]","[Ahhhhhhhhh sister please come out!!!]","Taking pity on them, Tong Yang walked to the window, opened her phone camera, zoomed in, focused the frame, took a photo, and sent it.","[Whoa???]","[What is that floating thing?]","[Holy crap?? Why are there spaceships?]","[Huh?? What are those futuristic-looking buildings?]","[Wait, Sister Tong, where are you? Filming a movie?]","[Goodness, there are lasers on that building too. I can't even imagine how spectacular it must look at night.]","Learning is for Making Money: [The First World]","[???]","[?????]","[Huh????]","[What world???]","[No, I, you...]","Learning is for Making Money: [.]","[Video!]","[Please, we beg you, video call!]","[(On knees) Please video chat with us!]","[Just go under that floating thing, let me see what it actually is.]","[Strongly request to board a spaceship for a look.]","[Let me see the people of the First World, that's fine too.]","[I want to see what kind of three-headed, six-armed monsters they are, turning the parallel world into that ghostly state.]","[Sister Tong, kill! Massacre these culprits!]","Learning is for Making Money: [Can't kill them.]","[Wuwu the First World looks so technologically advanced.]","[I want to go play there too.]","[Wonder if there are robots.]","Learning is for Making Money: [There are androids.]","[Sister, show us.]","[Sister, show us.]","[Sister, show us.]","...","Learning is for Making Money: [...No conditions. I'll take photos if I get the chance, one hundred per photo.]","[(Pointing fingers) So rich already, and still thinking about making money.]","[That's right, that's right.]","Learning is for Making Money: [One hundred total, for all of you combined.]","[(Well-behaved) Sister, you're practically a philanthropist.]","[That's right, that's right.]","[I want to see a photo of sister.]","Just then, someone with the nickname Little Pink Flower spoke in the group.","[???]","[?????]","[Huh????]","[Wait, who are you?]","[@Little Pink Flower You stop right there!]","[@Little Pink Flower Don't you run!]","[What's going on with this group! Was it you who did this?!]","[Damn it! What's your connection to the parallel world?]","...","Learning is for Making Money: [picture.jpg]","[lick]","[lick lick]","[Soaking up that beauty.]","[Sister is so gorgeous! Sister, I love you!]","Little Pink Flower: [Sister, can I get an advance of 100?]","Learning is for Making Money: [Okay]","[???]","[What does that mean?]","[Sister Tong, you two know each other?]","[You've already met?]","[@Learning is for Making Money You know who he is?]","Little Pink Flower: [Good afternoon, brothers and sisters.]","[?]","[Who are you calling brother?]","[Who are you calling sister?]","[You, a big brother/sister from 2036...]","Learning is for Making Money: [He is Tong Le.]","[???]","[Who?]","[Who is who?]","[Huh? Who is he?]","[Huh????]","Little Pink Flower: [Good afternoon, brothers and sisters. I am sister's younger brother, Tong Le.]","[No, wait...]","[Don't argue, I'm thinking.]","[Don't argue, I'm taking the college entrance exam.]","[Don't argue...]","[Let me sort this out... You're Tong Le from 2036, who created this group in 2026, and pulled us into the group in 2036?]","Little Pink Flower: [That's correct.]","[Why?]","[How did you manage to do that?]","[Is technology that advanced in 2036? Any photos? Does 2036 have floating structures like the First World?]","Little Pink Flower: [2036 doesn't have floating structures like that.]","[...You wouldn't be the Tong Le who grew up in the timeline after Sister Tong died, and in 2036 pulled us into this group chat to save your sister, would you?]","Little Pink Flower: [More or less. Because I missed my sister very much.]","[Wuwu...]","[My eyes are crying. It must have been so hard growing up alone.]","[Studying hard to save your sister wuwu my good baby.]","[Lele is such a cute, hardworking, sister-loving baby.]","The group members had only seen the nine-year-old Tong Le, unaware that the 2036 Tong Le had already grown taller than Tong Yang.","Little Pink Flower: [It was a bit hard, but it was all worth it.]","[It's okay, my treasure, you can be with your sister forever from now on!]","[Right! Sister Tong will definitely resolve the parallel world and First World situation!]","Little Pink Flower: [I believe my sister can definitely do it.]","[We believe in Sister Tong too!]","[Parallel world, go die! Don't you dare separate our Lele and his sister!]","[Lele has always been a good baby since childhood, don't bully our baby.]","Little Pink Flower: [Thank you, brothers and sisters.]","Studying is for making money: 【Shameless】","Little Pink Flower: 【Panda nuzzling.jpg】!"]},{"number":108,"title":"Chapter 108","paragraphs":["In 2036, Tong Le made his first appearance in the group chat. The members were very enthusiastic, chatting with him about matters related to the future.","Apart from information concerning parallel worlds, Tong Le from 2036 answered almost every question.","The Tong Le from that timeline probably didn't have many chances to make friends, so he enjoyed chatting with them.","After exchanging a few words, Tong Yang exited the group chat. Seeing a message from Ye Huai, she immediately video-called him.","A few seconds later, Ye Huai appeared on the screen, wearing a white lab coat and a mask.","\"When did you change professions?\" Tong Yang teased.","She had never seen Ye Huai dressed like this before; he looked quite the part of a professional.","Ye Huai's eyes were a light color. He smiled, his eyes crinkling, and took off his mask. Perhaps the air wasn't great on his end, as he coughed twice before saying, \"I'm at Bureau 749, conducting experiments with them.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"What kind of experiments?\"","\"Artificial hearts.\"","Tong Yang raised an eyebrow. \"What's the success rate?\"","\"The purpose of the experiment is to improve the success rate,\" Ye Huai replied.","Tong Yang nodded. \"No rush. You should still have a few years left to live.\"","Ye Huai chuckled. \"Well, I'll take that as a good omen.\"","After a pause, Tong Yang added, \"Then you'd better live a few more years. Don't die before we've dealt with the parallel worlds.\"","\"Don't worry,\" Ye Huai said. \"Even if I were dying, I'd hold on until then.\"","Ye Huai's hereditary heart condition could only be cured by either injecting high-quality genes or replacing his heart.","The former was out of the question—neither Tong Yang nor Ye Huai would ever consider injecting themselves. The latter was undoubtedly the best option, but modern science hadn't advanced enough for it to be reliable, with a low success rate.","Artificial hearts were far superior to ordinary man-made ones, having almost no side effects and functioning much like a natural human heart. They didn't require frequent recharging, but more experiments were needed to ensure a higher success rate for the replacement procedure.","\"And you? How are things on your end?\" Ye Huai asked.","Tong Yang briefly explained the situation in the First World and her current circumstances.","\"Have you contacted Dr. Wu?\"","\"Yes. He told me to do everything I can to reduce the death toll in the slums.\"","Ye Huai frowned. \"That's asking too much of you. Even if the First World won't harm you in the short term, once they realize you're sabotaging their plans, it shouldn't be hard for them to control you.\"","\"True, but he said someone could help me.\"","\"Who?\" Ye Huai asked.","\"Maynard.\"","Ye Huai looked momentarily stunned. \"Maynard? He's in the First World?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Wu Pingxue mentioned that he was originally from the First World. That's why Tong Yang from the First World spared the key members of the Maynard family and let them return.\"","Ye Huai fell into deep thought, murmuring, \"What exactly is he trying to do?\"","Ye Huai had doubted his own identity countless times, until Tong Yang proved he wasn't from a parallel world. But why would the First World's Maynard—also known as Ye Tianlin—want him to become a Maynard?","\"Whatever his intentions, at least in Wu Pingxue's view, he will help the real world. If you get the chance to meet him again, you can ask him yourself.\"","Ye Huai nodded. \"Alright.\"","He didn't dwell on the issue further.","After studying her through the screen for a moment, Ye Huai said, \"Tong Yang, have you lost weight?\"","Tong Yang didn't really feel it. She shrugged. \"I just got out of the slums. It'd be hard not to lose weight.\"","Ye Huai pressed his lips together, looking at her.","Tong Yang said, \"You haven't changed much, though. Your complexion is as pale as ever.\"","Ye Huai sighed helplessly. \"Are you making fun of me?\"","\"No, I'm mocking you,\" Tong Yang said, her eyes smiling. \"You're in a sorry state yourself, yet you still have the energy to worry about others.\"","Ye Huai couldn't help but laugh. \"Then mock me all you want.\"","\"That's enough.\"","\"What's your next move?\" Ye Huai asked.","Tong Yang replied, \"According to Zhan Zicheng, Xue Wei wants me to participate in the 'Forerunner' training and selection.\"","Hearing this, Ye Huai's brow furrowed slightly. \"You want to give it a try?\"","\"Yes. The Forerunner selection is extremely difficult, but they don't use gene injections. It might be a good opportunity to improve myself and get closer to the Unified Government.\"","Ye Huai understood Tong Yang's personality. She would never pass up a chance to kill two birds with one stone. Moreover, even the trainees who failed the selection had managed to overpower them on Harker Island. Undergoing Forerunner training would undoubtedly yield great benefits for Tong Yang.","Ye Huai said, \"Even if the First World doesn't know the identity or appearance of the Time Anchor, you look exactly like Tong Yang from the First World. Someone is bound to notice.\"","Tong Yang said, \"I've considered that. I've heard that Tong Yang from the First World is unorthodox, uncontrollable, has offended many people, and killed quite a few. So far, only high-level officials in the Unified Government know what she looks like. I won't be interacting with government higher-ups in the short term, and there are many participants in the Forerunner training. It shouldn't be that easy to be discovered.\"","Tong Yang paused. \"Besides...\"","She had another thought, but if she voiced it, Ye Huai might not agree.","Unexpectedly, Ye Huai finished her sentence. \"Besides, you think it wouldn't matter even if you were discovered.\"","Tong Yang looked at him, her expression complex, and nodded. \"Exactly.\"","Ye Huai said, \"They won't kill you. If they find out you've infiltrated them on your own, they might play along, pretending not to know, letting you enter the Unified Government right under their noses, hoping to control you.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Exactly.\"","Ye Huai sighed. \"So, whether they discover your identity or not, they probably won't stop you.\"","\"Nothing ventured, nothing gained.\"","Ye Huai chuckled. \"You know your own limits. Nothing I say will change your mind.\"","Once Tong Yang made a decision, others could only stand by and watch. In the past, she wouldn't even bother mentioning her plans before acting. At least her approach was a bit softer now.","\"You know it well,\" Tong Yang said, quite matter-of-factly.","Ye Huai smiled. \"Keep in touch. Communicate anytime something comes up.\"","Tong Yang nodded, then seemed to remember something. \"What's the situation with Xu Junyue?\"","The last message from Xu Junyue on her phone was sent over half a month ago, which was very unlike her.","Ye Huai said, \"She's lost sight in one eye. It's different for her compared to others, but fortunately, her other physical functions are excellent. Mr. Du has already sent her for special training.\"","\"I see.\"","Ye Huai continued, \"I heard that after her final exams, Miss Chu also applied to join the training. She'll probably head over in a couple of days.\"","\"Chu Shiyu?\"","\"Yes.\"","Tong Yang laughed. \"She's never really suffered hardship. Now she wants to suffer alongside Xu Junyue.\"","Ye Huai said, \"Miss Tang and the others are also on a secret mission. They'll all be able to help you when the time comes.\"","\"That's good.\"","After chatting with Ye Huai for about ten more minutes, Tong Yang wrapped up the conversation, promising to connect when they had time, and hung up.","After putting her things away, Tong Yang pushed open the door and walked into the living room.","Miaomiao was sitting by the coffee table. She had somehow found paper and a pen and was scribbling away at something.","\"What are you doing?\" Tong Yang asked.","Miaomiao looked up, waving the paper in her hand. \"I've written down everything we don't have at home.\"","Tong Yang walked over to the coffee table, took the paper, and saw it densely covered with all the instant foods they used to eat in the slums.","Tong Yang said, \"No need to buy this instant stuff anymore. We'll cook for ourselves from now on.\"","Miaomiao said blankly, \"But I don't know how.\"","\"Learn.\"","\"Oh...\"","Tong Yang walked around the room herself. Pots, pans, bowls, and dishes were all there. Going out to buy some oil, salt, soy sauce, vinegar, and ingredients would be enough.","The bathroom lacked more items and needed some supplies.","For the rest of the time, Tong Yang and Miaomiao went out together to buy some daily necessities. In the evening, they casually boiled a bowl of noodles.","\"Wow! Sis, the noodles you made are so delicious!\" Miaomiao exclaimed after taking a bite, utterly amazed. \"Much better than that noodle shop in the slums!\"","Tong Yang said, \"I can teach you.\"","Miaomiao said, \"As long as you don't make me learn math, you can teach me anything!\"","\"You have to learn math too.\"","\"Sis...\"","\"Eat your food.\"","After the meal, Tong Yang had her wash the bowls while she herself ducked into the bathroom for a shower.","Xue Wei had said he would come find her after handling some matters, but over ten days had passed without any movement.","During this time, the slums had suffered a bombing. As for the casualties, no related reports appeared in the civilian district.","Living in the civilian district was simply too expensive. If things continued like this, the savings Tong Yang had wouldn't last more than a few months. Left with no choice, she found a part-time job nearby, taking care of delivery dogs every day.","Most deliveries in the First World relied on machine dogs. You just needed to put the item in its belly, input the address, and it would deliver the item to the customer within the stipulated time, overcoming all difficulties and dangers.","Tong Yang's job was to label each item with its destination and occasionally observe the delivery situation through the monitor on the dog's eyes.","Besides the delivery dogs, the shop also had machine meal delivery, machine cleaning, and machine service. The two other employees and herself were bored out of their minds. The work that should have been done by them had already been taken over by machines.","\"Little Yang, do you know how to play cards?\"","One of the employees sneakily pulled Tong Yang aside.","Tong Yang glanced at him and said, \"I'm working right now.\"","\"Pfft! What work needs you? The robots are more than enough.\"","Even so, Tong Yang had never liked slacking off or wasting time. She refused, saying, \"You guys play. I'll keep working.\"","What Tong Yang called \"work\" was sitting in front of the computer during the delivery dogs' trips, observing through the monitors for any abnormal situations in the surroundings.","Usually, there were no abnormalities because the Coalition Government had issued very strict protective measures for machine-produced items like delivery dogs, even more rigorous than the protection for humans in the civilian district.","The attendant complained a couple of times, then found a table with the other person to play cards.","Tong Yang put on her headphones. The delivery dogs could pick up all surrounding sounds, which was perfect for eavesdropping. Maybe she'd get an unexpected harvest.","However, based on the situation during this period, there had been no harvest at all.","Tong Yang didn't like leaving her brain idle. Even though she knew she wouldn't get any useful information, she still watched the electronic screen very seriously.","She didn't know how much time had passed. Wearing the headphones, Tong Yang sensed someone standing behind her. Unsure who it was, she didn't turn around rashly, pretending she knew nothing.","The two attendants were sitting not far away, playing cards especially happily. Tong Yang had no intention of warning them.","\"Well done.\"","Suddenly, the person standing behind her patted Tong Yang on the shoulder.","Tong Yang turned to look. The boss, with a large head and big ears, looked at her with a very satisfied expression.","The two attendants also noticed the boss and hurriedly put away their playing cards.","Then, the boss looked at the two of them, his smile gradually fading. \"Neglecting your duties during work hours. You're fired.\"","\"What...\"","\"Boss, we know we were wrong! We, we only did it when there was nothing to do...\"","The boss wore an expression of strict impartiality. \"Nothing is an excuse for your dereliction of duty. Look at the new Little Yang here, what an earnest work attitude she has!\"","The two stood up, flustered and nervous. \"Boss, give us another chance. Jobs are hard to find now.\"","The boss sneered, \"So you know jobs are hard to find now? I've been more than generous, keeping you idle folks on the payroll for nothing. Who knew you were so unambitious, even playing cards during work hours? Hurry up, pack your things and get out!\"","Nowadays, robots had already replaced some of the tasks ordinary humans could do. The labor of ordinary people would become cheap, to the point that having them or not didn't affect normal operations. Then, they would be discarded.","Discarded ordinary people could only struggle on the poverty line. If they failed to pay rent or living expenses for over a year, they would be stripped of their civilian status and thrown into the slums, with no chance of ever climbing out again.","The two attendants probably realized the real reason the boss was firing them and left, their faces ashen.","\"Keep it up, work hard.\" The boss turned back, smiling at Tong Yang.","\"Mm.\" Tong Yang replied flatly.","Driving away two full-time employees and keeping her, a part-timer, was probably because her wages were lower.","The shop basically didn't need supervision; machines could handle most of the work. The boss wandered around for a bit and then returned to his office.","At that moment, the delivery dog had finished its delivery and was on its way back. A conversation came through the monitor.","\"Heard she's working part-time nearby?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"That short on money? I told her to wait for me.\"","\"Brother Xue, it's been almost half a month. With little savings, they'd have to find work.\"","\"Where's she working part-time?\"","\"Brother Xue, don't disturb her at work. Just wait for her at home.\"","\"That works too. Have her quit that lousy job.\"","\"Don't worry, Brother Xue. Since you're willing to offer her this opportunity, how could she give it up for such a pittance? She'll definitely be grateful to you.\"","Tong Yang checked the time, silently took off her headphones, turned, and walked to the door of the boss's office.","She knocked on the door. After a moment's wait, the boss told her to come in.","\"Boss, it's almost time to get off work. I'm here to collect today's wages.\"","Being a part-timer, she was paid her wages at the end of each day.","The boss pushed the red envelope prepared in advance towards her, squinting his eyes. \"You did well today. Added three hundred for you.\"","\"Thank you, boss.\" Tong Yang took the red envelope and put it away.","\"Little Yang, considering becoming a full-time employee? Monthly salary, twenty-eight hundred.\"","Tong Yang glanced up at him. Did he think she was young and easy to bully? The two full-time employees he fired had monthly salaries of over five thousand. For her, he directly halved it?","Hiring new employees specifically to then fire the old ones? So new employees are easier-to-cut chives?","Tong Yang paused and said, \"By the way, boss, I won't be coming tomorrow.\"","The boss was stunned. \"What did you say? You're not coming tomorrow?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I'm just a part-timer. What's wrong with not coming tomorrow?\"","\"What about after that?\"","\"Most likely, I won't be coming back in the future either.\"","The boss twitched his jowly face and said, \"Is it because the pay is too low? We can still negotiate.\"","\"No, I said it was a part-time job from the very beginning.\" Tong Yang glanced at the time. \"My shift is over, I'm leaving.\"","Tong Yang turned and left the office. Not far away, she heard the boss's voice on a phone call from inside the room.","\"Hey, I've thought about it. You usually work quite diligently. How about I give you five thousand five hundred, and you come back to work tomorrow?\"","\"What? You've already found another job? That fast?\"","...","\"Hey, I've thought about it. You usually work quite diligently. How about I give you five thousand five hundred, and you come back to work tomorrow?\"","\"What? You've found another job too? At the same place as him?\"","Before Tong Yang had even left the restaurant, the boss came striding out, panting, \"Little Yang, I'll give you four thousand a month. Come back to work tomorrow, alright?\"","Tong Yang asked, \"Didn't you offer them five thousand five hundred?\"","The boss gritted his teeth. \"They have more experience than you. The most I can give you is five thousand!\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"Let's talk about it if there's a chance. I'm leaving.\"","With that, Tong Yang walked straight out of the restaurant without looking back.","Although machines had replaced part of the labor force, they still couldn't operate independently. Just like delivery bots, they required human input for addresses.","Following the current trend, cheap labor would inevitably be replaced by machines.","But definitely not now.","Two thousand eight hundred? Five thousand five hundred? In the commoner district, where the cost of living was high, there were no wages lower than those.","Even though the job was easy and only suitable for someone like Tong Yang in a brief transitional period.","Tong Yang returned to her lodgings with a red envelope containing three hundred yuan more than usual.","After opening the door, she found Xue Wei and a woman with an ingratiating smile sitting in the living room.","\"Long time no see. Surprised?\" Xue Wei said.","The woman stood up and extended her right hand to Tong Yang. \"Hello, Miss Yang. I'm Lin Luqing.\"","Tong Yang looked at the face before her, subtly narrowing her eyes without a change in expression.","She shook Lin Luqing's outstretched hand and said, \"Hello. You look very familiar.\"","Lin Luqing fawned, \"Really? I also feel like Miss Yang and I hit it off right away!\"","Tong Yang found the smile on her face utterly incongruous. She never expected Officer Lin from the First World to be playing such a role.","Tong Yang shifted her gaze and asked, \"Where's Miaomiao?\"","\"She's resting in her room.\"","Tong Yang said, \"What did you come to see me for?\"","Xue Wei said with a smile, \"I'd like to invite you to participate in a certain training.\"","\"What kind of training?\"","\"Training to become a 'Pioneer'.\"","\"Why?\"","Xue Wei said, \"Your physical capabilities are excellent. One could say you have great potential to become a 'Pioneer'.\"","Tong Yang said expressionlessly, \"What's in it for me if I join the training?\"","By becoming a 'Pioneer', you can go directly to the affluent district and enjoy all its resources.","Tong Yang said, \"That's too far off. I want benefits I can see in the short term.\"","Xue Wei and Lin Luqing looked at each other. After a moment, Lin Luqing asked, \"Miss Yang, what do you mean...\"","\"Participating in the training doesn't guarantee becoming a 'Pioneer', right?\" Tong Yang led them on.","Lin Luqing nodded. \"Yes.\"","\"In that case, why should I give up present opportunities for an uncertain future?\" Tong Yang's gaze swept over both of them. \"I need to earn money to support my family. Can you understand that? Instead of wasting time on training, it's better to seize the chance to make enough money to stay in the commoner district. Otherwise, Miaomiao and I will end up back in the slums sooner or later, won't we?\"","Xue Wei raised an eyebrow. \"So, you're going to waste your talent.\"","Tong Yang sighed. \"For the sake of survival, there's no other choice.\"","\"This...\" Lin Luqing was deeply troubled.","Xue Wei scoffed. \"Just say it. What do you want?\"","Tong Yang didn't hesitate. \"This apartment and two hundred thousand.\"","Xue Wei pursed his lips. \"You really dare to ask, don't you? Brazenly trying to take advantage of me.\"","Tong Yang said indifferently, \"You want me to join the training. I want an apartment and money. An equivalent exchange. What's the problem?\"","Xue Wei was amused by her words. \"No problem. Since you put it that way, how could there be a problem?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Good. When can we handle the transfer procedures?\"","\"Not so fast. I have one precondition.\"","\"Let's hear it.\"","Xue Wei said, \"You must at least last until the sixth round before being eliminated. Otherwise, I reserve the right to take back the apartment and the two hundred thousand at any time.\"","The sixth round? That would already be at the level of a trainee soldier. In World A, Chu Shiyu was eliminated in the third round.","Tong Yang didn't hesitate for too long and agreed. \"No problem.\"","Anyway, she planned to get close to the unified government; she would at least need to become a trainee soldier.","\"Good. I can transfer the apartment to your name tomorrow.\"","\"No need. Transfer it to Miaomiao.\"","\"I want to join the training too!\"","Just then, Miaomiao rushed out of the room.","Tong Yang glanced at her, then said to Xue Wei, \"Sorry, I have one more condition.\"","\"What?\" Xue Wei asked curiously.","\"Find a school for her.\"","Miaomiao's eyes widened in disbelief. \"Sis...\"","Tong Yang frowned. \"Be obedient.\"","They had made an agreement earlier: Tong Yang would keep her by her side, with the sole requirement being obedience.","Miaomiao looked at her, her eyes gradually reddening.","Xue Wei said, \"There happens to be a middle school next to the training base.\"","\"Mm, that works.\"","Instantly, Miaomiao's eyes lit up. \"Then can I see Sis at school?\"","Xue Wei said, \"You can during holidays.\"","\"Great! I'll go to school.\"","Lin Luqing remarked with feeling, \"You sisters have such a good relationship.\"","Tong Yang and Miaomiao exchanged a glance.","\"Average.\"","\"Not bad.\"","Xue Wei looked them over, a meaningful smile appearing on his face.","The next day, Xue Wei took them to handle the transfer, putting the apartment under Yang Miao's name.","Immediately afterward, Tong Yang was to depart with Xue Wei for the training base. Because the commoner district followed the same timeline as the real world, schools were on summer break. For now, Miaomiao could only stay in the apartment under Lin Luqing's care.","Hearing that the middle school had an entrance exam, before leaving, Tong Yang specially bought her some study materials. Reviewing over the summer, plus the tutoring she'd received earlier, should be no problem.","By the time Tong Yang arrived at the training base with Xue Wei, it was already evening.","\"This year, there are quite a few more people participating in the 'Pioneer' training and selection compared to previous years,\" Xue Wei said.","Another person walking beside them said, \"The Second World sent a batch of people over.\"","\"So that's why.\"","Tong Yang followed behind the two. The parallel world sent a batch of people? Among them, there wouldn't happen to be someone who knew her, would there?","It probably wasn't likely. Even in the parallel worlds, there weren't many living people who knew her.","Stopping outside a room, Xue Wei said, \"Rest here tonight. Assembly is at six-thirty tomorrow morning.\"","\"Alright.\"","With that, Tong Yang showed no reluctance and turned to enter the room.","Entering the room, she bumped shoulders with someone coming the opposite way.","Her brow furrowed slightly, and she looked up at almost the same moment as the other person. Their eyes met, and for an instant, the familiar face left them both momentarily stunned.","Then, as if nothing had happened, they both averted their gaze with practiced ease, a wordless understanding passing between them.","Sometimes, some things just happen to align this way."]},{"number":109,"title":"Chapter 109","paragraphs":["Newly arrived, the training base didn't strictly assign dormitories, merely separating men and women to sleep in a large communal room.","Late at night, the sound of breathing rose and fell around her.","Tong Yang got up and walked through the passage left in the middle of the floor-level communal bedding, heading to the restroom not far outside.","After checking the restroom, she found it empty except for herself.","After waiting several minutes, a figure slowly walked in.","\"What are you doing here?\"","\"What are you doing here?\"","Tong Yang and the other person spoke almost in unison.","After a moment of silent standoff, the other person spoke first, saying, \"Didn't you tell me to get as close to the higher-ups as possible? So, I came to participate in the 'Forerunner' selection.\"","Tong Yang said, \"I'm here to get close to the First World United Government.\"","The familiar face appearing here was none other than Meng Xiao, who had previously cooperated with Tong Yang and maintained an ongoing partnership.","The two stood under the dim light, staring wide-eyed at each other. After a few seconds, they said in unison, \"We don't know each other.\"","\"Understood.\"","Meng Xiao shook the hand she extended.","\"How are things in the parallel world?\" Tong Yang asked.","Meng Xiao said, \"They know you entered the First World, but they can't reach directly. After hearing the First World bombed the slums looking for you, they sent some people to participate in the 'Forerunner' selection to find you.\"","Tong Yang nodded, \"Who else besides you?\"","\"Almost everyone.\" Meng Xiao crossed her arms. \"We can't act freely during the Forerunner selection. We all thought you'd be hiding in the slums. I was even thinking of finding some opportunity to look for you. I never expected you to be so bold, coming here for the selection. You really aren't afraid of death.\"","Tong Yang shook her head, \"I'm actually safer here.\"","After a slight pause, Tong Yang asked, \"Besides you, do the others know what I look like?\"","Meng Xiao said, \"Those old fogies are trying to repair your coordinates. No one has actually seen you except me.\"","Tong Yang nodded. Compared to finding her existence by appearance in a vast sea of people, which was like looking for a needle in a haystack, the coordinates of the time anchor were much simpler and clearer. Besides, the parallel world heavily relied on coordinates anyway.","\"That puts my mind at ease,\" Tong Yang said.","Meng Xiao asked, \"How's my sister been lately?\"","Tong Yang said, \"She's been adapting well recently, helping out at the base.\"","Meng Ting was different from others in the parallel world. Due to being frail and sickly since childhood, she had little contact with the outside world. Her survival was entirely due to Meng Xiao and their parents, and she did have some mental health issues. After such a long period of recuperation, she was basically no different from a normal person. However, due to her identity, she couldn't be allowed to leave the base and live independently.","\"That's good.\"","The two didn't linger long, returning to the room one after the other.","The next morning, everyone was startled awake from their sleep by a bell and gathered on the training ground.","A training regiment instructor spent an hour explaining the base rules, then had them collect daily necessities and training uniforms. They were to first find their assigned dormitories, change into the training uniforms, and return to the training ground in two hours.","The training uniforms were completely different from real-world military uniforms. They were made of a black, rubber-like material that could freely stretch, perfectly conforming to the body's shape. However, the material wasn't actual rubber; it was highly breathable, impervious to water and fire, and even had some white stripes deliberately designed to enhance visual appeal.","It's worth mentioning that Tong Yang and Meng Xiao were, quite coincidentally, assigned to two adjacent dorm rooms.","Immediately afterward, basic training began.","The basic training was similar to what Tong Yang had undergone under Wu Pingxue's tutelage before, posing no challenge to her, and her performance remained consistently good.","The base didn't directly confiscate their electronic devices. As long as training was over, they could contact the outside world anytime.","Given the current situation, besides training hard to pass the selection, Tong Yang couldn't do anything else. She simply shut out everything from the outside world, throwing herself wholeheartedly into the training.","Xue Wei, as one of the training base instructors, was extremely harsh on Tong Yang. Where others could pass by achieving eight out of ten, he demanded Tong Yang achieve twelve. It was unclear whether this was revenge for Tong Yang's personal slight of saying he was \"average-looking.\"","One day after training ended, Tong Yang was punished with an extra hour of training by Xue Wei due to a mistake in one movement. She didn't head to the cafeteria until after everyone else had finished eating.","With a full bowl of food, Tong Yang was eating heartily when Xue Wei approached from behind.","\"Starving, aren't you?\" Xue Wei teased.","\"Get lost,\" Tong Yang cursed without looking up.","Xue Wei snorted a laugh and said, \"Still not satisfied? Others are breaking their necks trying to get in here. I coaxed you in with an apartment plus two hundred thousand. What's wrong with training a bit more than them?\"","\"Nothing's wrong,\" Tong Yang said.","She liked to maximize her use of time. Even if Xue Wei didn't punish her with extra training, Tong Yang would train on her own. So, Xue Wei's strict demands actually suited her just fine. It was just...","\"I just don't want to see your face.\"","This guy always wore a smug, triumphant expression when he appeared before her as an instructor.","\"Such a handsome face like mine, you...\"","Before he could finish, Tong Yang looked up at him seriously and said, \"Honestly, very average.\"","Xue Wei's face darkened. He had thought Tong Yang had learned to behave during this period of training.","\"Hope you choke on it!\" Xue Wei said through gritted teeth.","Tong Yang couldn't be bothered with him and continued eating.","That night, after training ended, Tong Yang returned to her dorm.","On her phone, her academic advisor had sent a message. Her online final exam scores from a while back were out. Her grades were still first in the entire major. However, due to the different exam format, her scores wouldn't be included in the ranking, making her ineligible for scholarship competition.","Tong Yang replied to the teacher that she wouldn't participate in scholarship competition anymore.","\"The slums have been bombed for the fourth round. Don't know what's happening.\"","\"Whatever. As long as they haven't found the time anchor, the bombing will continue. It's not like their lives have much meaning anyway.\"","\"Right! If they die and the time anchor dies too, that would be a great achievement!\"","...","Others in the dorm started discussing the slum bombings.","During Tong Yang's training period, after the first bombing, the slums had suffered three more rounds of bombing. News in the civilian districts only reported that the slums had been bombed. Specific details like the scope or casualty figures were never reported.","However, the number of dead and injured was likely not low.","Even if one was lucky enough to survive with injuries from the bombing, under those conditions, without medical resources, wounds would continue to worsen, leading inevitably to death.","So far, Tong Yang had no power to stop this. However, the \"Forerunner\" selection probably wouldn't end anytime soon. Letting the situation deteriorate unchecked might lead to things spiraling out of control.","Given the slum environment, if too many corpses accumulated within a certain area, it could breed viruses and cause an epidemic. Then, everyone in the slums would be hard-pressed to escape death.","She had no chance to contact Maynard, and even if she did, it likely wouldn't change anything. The only person who could rival the United Government...","Suddenly, Tong Yang remembered something. She put down her things, turned, left her dorm, and arrived at the door of the neighboring dorm.","\"Meng Xiao, come out for a moment.\"","Since the two dorms were close and they interacted frequently, most people knew each other's names.","Meng Xiao looked up at her, understanding passing between them. \"Coming.\"","The two left the residential area and found a secluded spot.","Unlike the parallel world, the First World wasn't blanketed in surveillance cameras. As long as they avoided the visible ones, no one could discover them.","\"Need something?\" Meng Xiao asked.","Tong Yang said, \"Can you contact the parallel world?\"","\"Obviously. What's up?\"","Tong Yang stated, \"Tell them about the First World bombing the slums and forcing me into the First World.\"","Meng Xiao was puzzled. \"Why?\"","Tong Yang explained, \"The First World's purpose in bombing the slums wasn't me, but to reduce the Earth's population capable of controlling magnetic field energy. They are unwilling to let the parallel world monopolize it. Otherwise, after seizing the real world, you would gain more magnetic field energy, and the First World's situation would become extremely dangerous.\"","Meng Xiao frowned. \"You're saying the First World wants to develop magnetic field energy themselves? So, forcing you into the First World was actually more about protecting you from being killed by the parallel world, while they use this time to gradually reduce the Earth's population and develop magnetic field energy to catch up to the parallel world?\"","\"Exactly.\" Tong Yang nodded. \"We don't want the First World to smoothly develop magnetic field energy, and the parallel world probably feels the same. If the First World's magnetic field energy development catches up to the parallel world, given their current scientific technology, they could likely devour the remaining two worlds.\"","Meng Xiao seemed to grasp it partially. \"You want me to tell the parallel world, have them figure out a way to check the First World, and then cooperate with the parallel world?\"","Tong Yang shook her head. \"Not cooperation. Utilization.\"","Cooperating with Wu Pingxue was only because he had already defected from the parallel world. No matter what happened, Tong Yang would absolutely never cooperate with the parallel world.","Meng Xiao said, \"I understand.\"","\"Alright.\"","After returning, Meng Xiao sent the message back to the parallel world.","In the following days, the neighboring middle school started its semester, and Xue Wei had promised Tong Yang she could go see Miaomiao.","\"Sister!\"","Miaomiao, carrying her backpack, ran towards her delightedly.","After not seeing her for a while, Miaomiao had clearly gained some weight, her cheeks rosy.","\"Mm.\" Tong Yang gave a slight nod, escorted her into the school, and found her dorm.","\"Sister, is that your training camp over there?\"","Miaomiao stood by the window, pointing at the buildings not far away.","\"Mm.\" Tong Yang spread the cotton padding on her bed, answering absently.","Miaomiao said, \"Great, I can see you often then.\"","Tong Yang glanced at her. \"Your eyesight is that good? You can see me from such a distance?\"","Miaomiao laughed. \"My vision has always been great. I can even see people practicing boxing on the playground over there.\"","Tong Yang looked out the window. Although the training base and the school weren't far apart, both covered large areas, and the distance between them wasn't short. The playground Miaomiao mentioned was southwest of the training base. Tong Yang could only see a few bright red running tracks, nothing else.","\"Let's go, I'll show you the cafeteria.\"","\"Oh.\"","Tong Yang took her around the school to familiarize her with the environment. After lunch, she returned to the training base.","That day, Xue Wei, who was usually all smiles, was uncharacteristically stern-faced as he led them through a full day of training. When it ended, he didn't give Tong Yang a hard time and dismissed them.","Unusual behavior signals trouble. After dismissal, Tong Yang didn't immediately return to her dorm. She caught up to Xue Wei and asked, \"Instructor Xue, not settling personal scores today?\"","Xue Wei shot her a look. \"Looking for trouble?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Not really. As your trainee, noticing you're in a bad mood, I thought I'd come help share your burdens.\"","Xue Wei sneered. \"Share my burdens? I thought you'd be clapping and cheering.\"","Ignoring the sarcasm in his words, Tong Yang asked, \"What's going on, really?\"","Xue Wei narrowed his eyes, looked at her for a few seconds, and said, \"Curious?\"","\"A little.\"","\"Why?\"","\"I want to know what's got you so glum, so I can enjoy it.\"","Xue Wei wore an \"I knew it\" expression.","Tong Yang said, \"So, what is it?\"","Xue Wei's face darkened a bit. \"Well, you're somewhat involved anyway, so you might as well hear it.\"","\"Go on.\"","The two walked to an unused training area. Tong Yang hoisted herself onto the parallel bars, sitting on one side, her feet propped on the other, looking down at Xue Wei from above.","Xue Wei looked up, about to speak, but seeing Tong Yang looking down at him, he said exasperatedly, \"I'm the instructor.\"","\"Cut the crap.\"","Xue Wei pursed his lips and said, \"This morning, the leader of the Second World issued a statement, championing the cause of the slums, saying the United Government is depriving them of their human rights, demanding an end to the indiscriminate bombing.\"","Tong Yang nodded slightly. Meng Xiao's message had probably taken effect.","Xue Wei cursed, \"Those bastards! They hold power of life and death over people in their own world, yet come to the First World to boss us around! Haven't they deprived enough human rights themselves? Just look at how rotten their social system is!\"","Tong Yang paused briefly and said, \"They've discovered the United Government's goal? But why try to stop it?\"","Xue Wei didn't know Tong Yang was already aware that reducing the population was necessary to maximize magnetic field energy development, so Tong Yang had to pretend she didn't know.","Xue Wei's expression turned grim. \"What other possibility is there? Fighting for the human rights of slum dwellers? Bullshit! They just want to be the sole superpower!\"","Tong Yang furrowed her brows. \"How would they know?\"","Xue Wei said, \"Not many people know the inside story, only the dozen or so people dispatched by the United Government.\"","Tong Yang said, \"I know too.\"","Xue Wei shook his head. \"You only know the United Government wants to kill the poor, not the real reason. The United Government anticipated that as the situation developed, the Second World would eventually catch on. They just thought it would take at least half a year. They didn't expect to be discovered before the fifth round of bombing could even be carried out.\"","Tong Yang pondered for a moment. \"Now that the Second World knows the United Government's goal, they definitely won't stand by. What do they plan to do?\"","Xue Wei looked at her and didn't speak.","Tong Yang knew his nature—he'd say what he was supposed to say, and not a word more.","Telling her about the parallel world leader's statement probably meant everyone in the First World, except the slum dwellers, already knew.","Without waiting for his answer, Tong Yang continued on her own, \"The United Government probably doesn't want to openly break with the Second World. It's not to our benefit. Otherwise, an unavoidable war would break out between the two worlds.\"","Xue Wei lowered his gaze, remaining silent.","Tong Yang went on, \"Naturally, the Second World also doesn't want war with the First World. The end result would be mutual destruction. Moreover, they share a common target—the Third World.\"","Xue Wei raised his head and declared, \"Go on.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Although the true intentions of the United Government and the reasons for the Second World's obstruction are unclear, I believe both the United Government and the Second World should take a step back. After all, the Time Anchor's whereabouts are unknown; she must be found first.\"","Xue Wei asked, \"How do you think they should compromise?\"","Tong Yang pondered for a moment, then said, \"The bombing of the slums should continue, but the frequency must be reduced. The United Government won't easily abandon bombing the slums, and to a certain extent, the Second World can only accept that, otherwise neither side will convince the other.\"","Xue Wei stroked his chin, his gaze turning distant. \"Even if the frequency is reduced, the Second World won't just let it go.\"","Tong Yang replied, \"Right. So they will demand to join the search for the Time Anchor and then work on fixing the fuzzy coordinate issue. Reducing the bombing frequency is to buy time to find the Time Anchor, leaving the United Government with no excuse to continue bombing the slums.\"","Xue Wei said, \"You make a good point.\"","Then, he asked another question, \"How do you think the United Government should respond?\"","Tong Yang answered, \"As long as the United Government finds the Time Anchor before the Second World does and hides her, they can continue bombing the slums and think of other excuses to fob off the Second World later.\"","Xue Wei rested his chin on one hand, lost in thought for a long while. \"That makes sense. The United Government probably has that very plan.\"","Tong Yang exclaimed in surprise, \"Really?\"","\"Mhmm. The bombing frequency will change to once a month.\"","Tong Yang remained expressionless, but inwardly she breathed a sigh of relief. Changing from three bombings a month to just one had already significantly reduced the losses.","Moreover, the slums covered a vast area, meaning more people would likely survive by chance.","Within a few days, the United Government announced its decision, which differed little from Tong Yang's speculation.","The only unfavorable development for her was that the First World would probably redouble its efforts to find her.","As for the Parallel World getting involved, Tong Yang wasn't worried. As long as she stayed at the training base, the Parallel World couldn't possibly find her.","She was quite pleased with this situation of mutual restraint.","After the bombing frequency was reduced, Tong Yang didn't make any further moves. Over time, this raised no suspicion.","After all, who could guess that the Time Anchor, who had entered the First World alone, not only now had a child with her but had also entered a training base?","However, Tong Yang wasn't entirely certain she hadn't been discovered. It was possible someone in the United Government had already found her and was just going with the flow.","Time flew by, and it was now December 2025. The weather was bitterly cold, and training became even more arduous.","During this period, the Parallel World not only applied to provide living and medical resources to the slums but also conducted a large-scale airdrop of winter supplies as the cold set in.","When Tong Yang learned of this, she found it laughable. The lower-class people in their own world were dying or going insane, yet for the sake of interests, they would actually share their already scarce resources with the slum dwellers.","Be that as it may, it suited Tong Yang's purposes just fine.","The United Government was already highly displeased with the Parallel World repeatedly meddling in its affairs. Relations between the two worlds had become extremely tense. Furthermore, news of Maynard being in the First World had somehow been leaked. Now, with the Parallel World and the First World at daggers drawn, it seemed that once the Time Anchor was found, they wouldn't even be able to maintain a facade of peace.","Naturally, Tong Yang very much hoped to see them fight like dogs.","One noon, Xue Wei came to the training squad. He selected over fifty people, mostly the top performers, including Tong Yang and Meng Xiao, to accompany him by vehicle to another location.","\"Instructor, where are you taking us?\"","\"We've even left the training base.\"","Xue Wei, sitting in the passenger seat, glanced back at them. \"Don't ask. You'll know when we get there.\"","\"Oh.\"","After nearly two hours of driving, the vehicle brought them to a place resembling an airfield.","\"Zhan's Technology Research Base?\"","\"Oh my god!\"","\"Instructor, you're not going to show us combat aircraft, are you?\"","Xue Wei smiled mysteriously. \"Not just show you. You're going to learn.\"","\"Wh-what?\"","\"Learn how to build aircraft?\"","Xue Wei shot them a look. \"Learn how to pilot them, of course.\"","\"Huh??\"","\"You're letting us learn to pilot combat aircraft?\"","\"Wow! I can't wait!\"","Tong Yang, who had been resting with her eyes closed, became somewhat interested upon hearing their conversation. She opened her eyes and looked outside.","\"Whoosh—\"","\"Whoosh—\"","Just then, two combat aircraft flew over the group's heads.","\"Wow! So cool!\"","\"I heard only 'Forerunners' are qualified to pilot combat aircraft. Can we really do it too?!\"","Tong Yang looked at one of the combat aircraft and saw the person in the cockpit through the glass.","That person also saw Tong Yang and dove the combat aircraft straight toward her, aggressive and swift.","Tong Yang, unflustered, drew the military knife she carried at her waist and hurled it at the aircraft. With a sharp \"clang,\" it struck the aircraft's glass.","Immediately after, the aircraft slowly came to a halt, hovering in mid-air.","The glass window lowered, and Zhan Zicheng stood up, waving both hands at her. \"Yang Tong... Ah!\"","Before he could finish calling her name, the other combat aircraft slammed into his.","\"Miao Ya, what are you doing?!\" Zhan Zicheng nearly got knocked right out, cursing loudly.","The girl in the other combat aircraft looked at him coldly, seemingly saying something.","Zhan Zicheng's face stiffened. \"Yang... Yang Le, right? I almost remembered it wrong.\"","Xue Wei also couldn't help but let out a sigh of relief.","Tong Yang's expression remained unchanged throughout. She picked up her knife from the ground.","Ten minutes later, Zhan Zicheng led them into the test flight base. Full of pride, he began explaining the principles of the combat aircraft. However, everyone else was too eager to get up close to the aircraft. Only Tong Yang and Meng Xiao listened patiently to his explanation.","When he mentioned that all aircraft could be considered \"sons\" of the first-generation aircraft, with all flight data needing to be fed back to it, Tong Yang suddenly thought of something.","\"Do the aircraft absolutely require a human pilot?\"","Having listened to his lengthy introduction, Tong Yang felt the aircraft's underlying principles were somewhat similar to those of drones.","Zhan Zicheng said, \"Not necessarily. They can be controlled via the first-generation aircraft. The first-gen is basically obsolete now, no longer flight-worthy. It's just that there's a connection between each generation of aircraft, allowing remote control through the first-gen. So, the first-generation aircraft only serves to monitor data from the other aircraft now.\"","Tong Yang thought for a moment. This connection seemed similar to the programs of the Parallel World. Since it was related to magnetic field energy, perhaps all aircraft shared a single program—essentially, one energy terminal.","After a while, Tong Yang asked, \"What about the androids? Is there any connection between them?\"","\"Bionic humans?\" Zhan Zicheng frowned. \"I don't know what connection exists between them, but bionic humans can also be controlled through the first generation of bionic humans.\"","So it seemed the first-generation aircraft and the first-generation bionic humans were akin to energy terminals. The magnetic field energy converged on the original systems, allowing the subsystems to be manipulated through them.","Zhan Zicheng said, \"However, the United Government, fearing that bionic humans might evolve human emotions and subsequently destroy humanity, executed all the original bionic humans capable of controlling others. Now, only the United Government can control bionic humans.\"","At that moment, Miao Ya, walking behind them, spoke up: \"If I recall correctly, when the United Government created the original bionic humans, they were built exactly like human bodies, almost indistinguishable from humans. This led to one of the bionic humans having a child with a human. That's why the United Government chose to destroy the original generation, and later models were specifically designed to exclude human emotions.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"What happened to that child?\"","Miao Ya replied, \"The United Government feared that the child of an original bionic human might also be able to control other bionics, so they had the child's body... pulverized.\"","\"Is that so.\"","Tong Yang lowered his gaze, feeling it was a terrible waste.","If they could find a way to control the bionic humans, their chances in the real world would increase by a significant margin.","After all, they couldn't truly contend with the First World or the parallel worlds on their own."]},{"number":110,"title":"Chapter 110","paragraphs":["Operating the combat aircraft was extremely complex. After several hours of training, the group could barely manage to stay steady in the air.","Tong Yang had some experience piloting helicopters, so her learning progress was faster than the others. She became proficient at maneuvering the aircraft through the test flight area filled with buildings.","Before long, Xue Wei had them stop for a short rest.","Zhan Zicheng swaggered over to Tong Yang and said, \"So? Found out that piloting an aircraft isn't as simple as you imagined, huh?\"","Tong Yang, holding her silver helmet, took a sip of water.","Miao Ya said, \"Yang Le is already more skilled at operating the aircraft than you are.\"","\"Nonsense! She can barely avoid obstacles. Can she fire the missiles?\"","Tong Yang swallowed the cold water, put her helmet back on, and said, \"Want to make a bet?\"","Zhan Zicheng looked at her suspiciously. \"Bet on what?\"","Tong Yang pointed towards the distant trenches. \"Bet on whether I can hit the targets in the trenches with the aircraft's weapons.\"","Zhan Zicheng snorted coldly. \"What are the stakes?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I haven't decided yet. What do you want if you win?\"","Zhan Zicheng puffed out his chest. \"If I win, you have to call me 'big brother'.\"","Tong Yang looked him up and down. \"Childish.\"","\"What's it to you? Do you bet or not?\"","\"I bet.\"","Tong Yang left them with a view of her back as she returned to the combat aircraft.","Miao Ya said, \"You're definitely going to lose.\"","Zhan Zicheng was displeased. \"What do you mean?\"","Miao Ya said, \"Twenty minutes ago, while you were in the restroom, she was already able to hit the targets in the trenches. Bullseye.\"","Zhan Zicheng's eyes widened. \"Why didn't you tell me earlier?\"","\"You didn't ask.\"","\"Then why are you telling me now?\"","Miao Ya said matter-of-factly, \"I'm just giving you a heads-up.\"","\"You...\" Zhan Zicheng glared angrily. \"Maybe she just got lucky.\"","Miao Ya shrugged. \"Does she look like someone who relies on luck to you?\"","During their conversation, the aircraft piloted by Tong Yang had already taken off smoothly and was flying towards the trenches.","Riding in the aircraft felt somewhat different from a helicopter. It was noticeably much more stable, giving a sensation similar to riding a high-speed train.","Furthermore, the craft was equipped with over a dozen medium and small-sized weapons. Tong Yang activated one of the smaller weapons, positioned herself above the trench, and pressed the launch button.","\"Whoosh—\"","\"Whoosh—\"","\"Whoosh—\"","Several consecutive shots successfully struck the bullseye of the target.","Zhan Zicheng picked up a pair of binoculars for a look and cursed, \"Damn! All hits.\"","Miao Ya said gleefully, \"I told you so.\"","At that moment, Xue Wei walked up behind the two and asked, \"What do you think of her?\"","Zhan Zicheng said grudgingly, \"She's just decent at piloting. I could do that too.\"","Miao Ya pondered for a moment and said, \"To be objective, she's exceptional. A very fast learner, and she has great determination. She doesn't seem like someone who grew up in the slums.\"","Xue Wei let out a meaningful chuckle. \"Not necessarily. Someone like her would excel no matter where she grew up.\"","Miao Ya asked, \"Brother Xue, should we investigate her background thoroughly?\"","Xue Wei shook his head. \"No, there's no need.\"","Seeing their puzzled expressions, Xue Wei explained, \"I'm not interested in her origins.\"","\"But...\"","Miao Ya wanted to say more, but Xue Wei's gaze towards her turned deep and intense, carrying an inexplicable pressure. He said, \"Of course, I also wouldn't want anyone disturbing her participation in the selection. Have I made myself clear enough?\"","Miao Ya's face paled, and she hastily averted her eyes. \"I... I understand.\"","Xue Wei resumed his usual smiling face. \"Not many people know about Yang Le's identity, so I'm counting on you both to keep it a secret.\"","Miao Ya nodded hurriedly. \"I understand!\"","Zhan Zicheng's eyes shifted between the two, his face full of confusion. \"What are you talking about? I don't understand.\"","Xue Wei patted his shoulder, smiling warmly. \"It's alright, you don't need to understand. In short, you must never tell anyone about Yang Le's original identity, or it could bring fatal trouble.\"","Zhan Zicheng was puzzled. \"Why... Mmmph!\"","Miao Ya covered his mouth and nose with her hand and said to Xue Wei, \"Brother Xue, we understand.\"","Tong Yang landed the combat aircraft steadily on the ground, opened the hatch, removed her helmet, and walked over to the three of them.","\"So?\" Tong Yang raised an eyebrow at Zhan Zicheng.","Zhan Zicheng said, \"A bet's a bet. Go on, what do you want me to do?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I haven't decided yet. I'll tell you later.\"","\"Fine. Consider me owing you one favor.\"","\"Well done,\" Xue Wei praised.","Tong Yang glanced at him and replied perfunctorily, \"Thanks.\"","Xue Wei said, puzzled, \"Wait, do you have some issue with me? Why are you so reluctant when talking to me?\"","Tong Yang said, \"No, you're overthinking it.\"","\"I'm definitely not overthinking it.\"","Zhan Zicheng expressed understanding. \"What student actually likes their teacher?\"","Tong Yang waved a hand. \"If there's nothing else, I'll continue training.\"","\"Wait a moment,\" Xue Wei called out to her as she prepared to leave.","Tong Yang frowned. \"Is there something else?\"","Xue Wei said unhurriedly, \"Aren't you curious why we brought you here today to learn how to pilot combat aircraft?\"","Tong Yang's eyes darkened slightly. She turned around and asked, \"Why?\"","\"For the bombing of the slums on February 1st. You will be participating,\" Xue Wei said.","Tong Yang's frown deepened. \"Why?\"","Xue Wei said, \"Because becoming a 'Pathfinder' requires learning to pilot combat aircraft. This is a hard-won opportunity for practical combat training I secured for you.\"","Tong Yang's expression remained unchanged. \"I see.\"","\"Is there anything else?\" Tong Yang asked.","Xue Wei smiled. \"No, that's all.\"","\"Alright.\"","With that, Tong Yang returned to the aircraft.","Sitting in the cockpit, Tong Yang started the aircraft and took off. Her lips were pressed into a tight line, her expression grim.","They wanted her to bomb the slums? Weren't they afraid she might 'accidentally' drop a bomb into the affluent district?","Although reluctant, Tong Yang had to admit this was a good opportunity to understand the situation in the slums.","Over the following period, Tong Yang and the others would go to the Zhan family's territory every few days to practice with the combat aircraft, gradually mastering various techniques.","At seven in the morning on February 1st, dozens of combat aircraft flew over the city of the commoner districts, like a dark cloud descending, moving closer to the slums.","Looking down from high altitude, people on the ground uniformly looked up, casting gazes of awe towards them.","As they approached the slums, a sharp alarm sounded in the air. Tong Yang looked down. The buildings near the twelve gates had already been reduced to ruins.","Some people were curled up on the ground, their bodies trembling with fear, seemingly believing they would be mistaken for corpses and thus spared. Unfortunately, they clearly didn't realize that from high above, every move they made was clearly visible, laid bare.","\"Whoosh—\"","\"Boom!\"","A bomb dropped from the aircraft to Tong Yang's right. Upon hitting the ground, it erupted with a deafening blast. Instantly, those people's bodies were blown apart, flesh and blood flying everywhere.","\"Seven o'clock direction, east.\"","Xue Wei's voice came through the headset. A nearby aircraft dropped a bomb, leaving the person hiding there with no escape, dying amidst the billowing smoke.","Tong Yang's lips tightened into a thin line. Even though in her understanding, both the First World and the Parallel World were invasive species encroaching on the real world, compared to these First World poor who looked no different from ordinary people, she preferred to take action against the Parallel World humans who were affected by magnetic energy and turned into monsters.","However, now was not the time for her to dwell on such distinctions.","Before departure, Xue Wei, representing the United Government, had given them the order to kill everyone they could see until the bombing campaign was called off.","These First World people were becoming increasingly brazen.","Since the area near the Twelve Gates had already been bombed, they searched for survivors as they proceeded toward the center of the slum.","\"First team to the southeast, second team to the southwest, the remaining two squads continue forward,\" Xue Wei's voice transmitted over the radio.","Tong Yang was in the third squad, flying forward behind the aircraft piloted by Xue Wei.","Soon, explosions echoed all around, thick smoke filled the air, mingled with wails and cries. The ground was stained red with blood, buildings collapsed in large numbers with thunderous roars.","Xue Wei led the remaining personnel to a relatively densely populated area of the slum. As he hadn't given the bombing order yet, Tong Yang kept observing the situation on the ground. Some poor had already sensed the danger, scrambling to find places to hide. Unfortunately, their hiding spots were completely visible from high altitude.","However, Tong Yang noticed something unusual.","The number of people in this area seemed surprisingly low. The streets were empty and deserted. Whether they had evacuated beforehand or were hiding inside the houses, it was eerily quiet, hinting at something out of the ordinary.","Tong Yang's senses became highly alert. She felt things weren't that simple, that someone was watching from the shadows. She didn't alert the others, instead subtly increasing her aircraft's altitude, widening the distance from the ground.","Just then, Xue Wei's voice rang out: \"Prepare to commence bombing.\"","Almost as the words fell, a crisp click sounded from the ground. Several transparent fishing lines with iron hooks shot towards them. Having gained altitude earlier, Tong Yang had a bit more reaction time. She banked right, dodging the incoming lines.","Others, however, were not so lucky.","The lines shot upwards had special hooks at their tips. Made from some unknown material, they easily pierced the aircraft's outer skin, embedding deeply into the fuselage. The flying machines instantly pulled the lines taut into straight lines, yet couldn't budge them an inch.","\"Careful, that's anti-gravity filament. The more you struggle, the tighter it gets.\"","Despite Xue Wei's warning, the others, upon being hooked by the anti-gravity filament, instinctively accelerated, trying to break free. This caused the filaments to tighten, dragging the aircraft down, gradually losing balance and tilting towards the ground.","Tong Yang and a few other aircraft were spared. They piloted to a safe position, awaiting Xue Wei's instructions.","Tong Yang calmly observed the ground situation. The anti-gravity filament was completely transparent, nearly impossible to distinguish from high altitude, making it hard to pinpoint their locations.","\"Yang Le, go down and see what's happening. Be careful,\" Xue Wei said.","\"Okay,\" Tong Yang responded.","The environment of the slum could be described as worlds apart from the civilian and affluent districts. How could anti-gravity filament appear in a place where even electricity was extremely precious? The name alone suggested it was high-tech.","Tong Yang dove her aircraft downward. Upon reaching a certain altitude, the ground shot more anti-gravity filaments at her. Tong Yang dodged them deftly, using the opportunity to survey the ground.","Some people were hiding inside buildings, holding numerous firearms, watching them intently.","\"What's the situation?\" Xue Wei asked.","Tong Yang replied, \"Armed militants.\"","\"Use your discretion on whether to bomb,\" Xue Wei said.","Without hesitation, Tong Yang said, \"I don't think we should.\"","\"What's your reasoning?\"","\"Their weapons seem comparable to ours. The others' aircraft are immobilized. If I attack recklessly, it might provoke them.\"","Tong Yang hadn't clearly seen all their weapons, but under the premise of ensuring her own safety, offering a bit of vague information to guide the situation seemed like a good idea.","\"Return for now,\" Xue Wei said.","Before Tong Yang could answer, weapons fire came at her from behind. She piloted her aircraft swiftly through the gaps between buildings, successfully dodging each attack, and found an opportunity to return to high altitude.","The armed militants likely weren't from the slum. They handled weapons proficiently, understood the aircraft's capabilities, and specifically used anti-gravity filament to immobilize them. It was unclear if they were from the First World or the Parallel World. Their objective was probably to resist the United Government's indiscriminate bombing. Tong Yang was happy to see this. As long as she wasn't in mortal danger, she wouldn't engage them.","Giving things a little nudge wasn't a bad approach either.","Xue Wei ordered, \"First and Second squads, return to support.\"","The two flight teams dispersed in the southeast and southwest received the command and swiftly flew towards them.","Simultaneously, Tong Yang saw several armed militants stealthily setting up a rocket launcher on a building rooftop, aiming at one of the aircraft caught by the anti-gravity filament.","As Tong Yang hesitated whether to give a warning, Xue Wei, piloting his aircraft not far away, had already fired a shell at the rooftop.","With a loud boom, the building was blasted with a large crater, but no bodies were left in the hole—they had dodged it.","Xue Wei's voice remained calm and measured, seemingly unperturbed, as he reminded them, \"Those caught by the anti-gravity filament, don't make rash moves. Try to maintain balance. Don't use your weapons; the recoil will pull you towards the ground.\"","The aircraft carried a large amount of explosives. A severe impact would definitely cause a massive explosion.","\"First and Third squads, provide covering fire. Second squad, assist them in evacuating from the aircraft.\"","\"Understood.\"","After all, everyone had undergone some training. Under Xue Wei's command, they continuously dropped bombs towards the ground, while the Second squad personnel transferred the trapped pilots into their own cockpits.","Tong Yang symbolically dropped a few bombs while observing the attire of those people. She couldn't discern any particular faction; they dressed similarly to others in the slum, but their movements were remarkably agile, showing no fear of their firepower.","\"Just who are they?\" Tong Yang murmured.","Xue Wei said, \"Unclear. No need to continue bombing. Withdraw immediately.\"","Everyone participating in the bombing today were recruits with less than half a year of training, not yet proficient in handling combat aircraft. They hadn't anticipated encountering well-trained armed militants in the slum specifically targeting them. Minimizing losses was the priority now.","The sound of explosions continued in her ears as Tong Yang piloted her aircraft through the hail of gunfire.","Suddenly, she felt a wave of heat and shock. Through the long, wide street, an aircraft restrained by anti-gravity tethers let out a deafening roar. Fierce flames churned in the air, the resulting shockwave slamming several nearby aircraft aside.","The other aircraft, also controlled by anti-gravity tethers, resisted, causing the tethers to rapidly retract and yank them crashing to the ground.","\"Boom!\"","\"Boom!\"","\"Boom!\"","Ear-splitting sounds echoed across the sky. Buildings struck by the impacts and explosions began to collapse. Flying debris and thick smoke made it impossible for Tong Yang to see the flight path ahead, forcing her to desperately steady her craft and navigate based on memory.","Even so, she couldn't avoid being struck by falling debris, though fortunately, the aircraft was sturdy enough to withstand it.","Breaking free of the smoke and climbing back to a higher altitude, Tong Yang let out a sigh of relief and looked down. Seven or eight combat aircraft had crashed and exploded, while others, thrown off by the blasts, had collided with buildings.","Xue Wei's stern voice came through: \"They're not ordinary people. We can't continue this engagement. Everyone, retreat immediately.\"","\"Instructor Xue, what about them?\"","Those aircraft that had crashed, though not exploded, had sustained varying degrees of damage and likely couldn't fly again anytime soon.","Xue Wei replied, \"We'll take them with us, naturally.\"","Tong Yang hadn't taken any action from the start; a mutually destructive outcome was exactly what she wanted to see.","Hearing Xue Wei's words, Tong Yang felt puzzled.","How could they possibly evacuate with the other aircraft in this situation?","\"Hummm—\"","A low hum rose from the ruins. The aircraft that had crashed into the ground and buildings began to vibrate slightly. A faint blue glow enveloped them, as if invisible hands were lifting them from the ground, raising them into the air.","Witnessing this, Tong Yang was momentarily stunned.","She recalled what Zhan Zicheng had said that day: the first-generation aircraft could control second, third, and even the latest generation models.","She just hadn't expected they could still be controlled even after sustaining severe damage.","\"Warning—\"","\"Warning—\"","Just as Tong Yang was marveling, a loudspeaker blared from the ground.","\"Demand the United Government cease bombing the slums—\"","\"Demand the United Government cease bombing the slums—\"","\"Otherwise, we will resist to the end—\"","\"Otherwise, we will resist to the end—\"","\"Remember the warning from the slums—\"","\"Remember the warning from the slums—\"","Tong Yang was utterly astonished. These people were from the slums? How did they manage this? How could they possess so many weapons? And how dare they so brazenly challenge the United Government?","Xue Wei paid no heed to the ground's announcements, instructing them via the intercom: \"Withdraw.\"","The combat aircraft squadron that had set out so confidently to bomb the slums now retreated ingloriously back to the civilian districts.","Although most pilots from the crashed aircraft had managed to eject before the explosions, they had still lost eight aircraft. The remaining ones all bore varying degrees of damage. It was, by any measure, a humiliating retreat.","After returning to the Zhan Technology Research Base, the wounded were taken for treatment. Xue Wei ordered the others to stay in a room while he went to report the situation.","\"That was terrifying!\"","\"Yeah.\"","Everyone in the room discussed the narrow escape.","\"How could the slums have such powerful weapons? Anti-gravity tethers, I thought only the United Government used those.\"","\"The hooks on the tethers actually contained micro-explosives. It's lucky everyone was evacuated in time, or the consequences would have been unthinkable.\"","\"They actually called it a warning to the United Government? They're insane, don't they value their lives?\"","Tong Yang sat in a corner, silently listening to their discussion.","The slums accounted for fifty percent of the First World's population. Even if most believed the United Government's promise to stop the bombing and repeal the lawlessness decree once the temporal anchor point was found, it was inevitable that some would have a stronger will to resist.","After all, the United Government's bombing was essentially indiscriminate slaughter. It wasn't strange at all for people to become aware of it and fight back.","What puzzled Tong Yang was why the slums possessed such a large arsenal of heavy weapons and anti-gravity tethers specifically designed to counter combat aircraft.","Could the Parallel Worlds be involved? Were they already planning to openly oppose the United Government?","Tong Yang looked up and made eye contact with Meng Xiao across the room.","The latter had sustained minor injuries from the blast shockwaves. As if knowing what Tong Yang wanted to ask, Meng Xiao gave an almost imperceptible shake of her head.","It seemed she didn't know about this, so it was probably unrelated to the Parallel Worlds.","But if not the Parallel Worlds, who opposed to the First World, who else had the capability to manufacture so many lethal weapons in the slums?","\"I wonder how the United Government will handle this.\"","\"We damaged eight combat aircraft. They won't make us pay for them, will they?\"","\"As long as we're not punished, paying some money is fine.\"","\"Right. It would be terrible if they disqualified us from the 'Pathfinder' selection because of this.\"","\"Please, no. We've worked so hard to get this far.\"","...","The topic of discussion shifted quickly. Tong Yang quietly closed her eyes.","Who on earth could amass so many weapons in the slums? The Maynards?","The Maynard family had just fled back from the Parallel Worlds. They wouldn't risk offending the First World at such a critical juncture. Even if they were up to something, they wouldn't be so blatant unless they truly had a death wish.","But if it wasn't the Parallel Worlds, and besides the Maynard family, what other powerful family in the First World would aid the slums? Or was it simply a desire to thwart the First World's population reduction plan?","Who exactly was behind those armed militants?","A few hours later, Xue Wei returned to the room. Without a word, he took them by vehicle back to the training base.","For the next several days, their lives and training continued as usual. Every day was spent in drills, and Xue Wei showed no signs of anything being amiss.","The bombing incident of February first seemed as if it had never happened.","\"Instructor, about that day's events...\"","Finally, after a training session, someone couldn't hold back any longer and asked.","Xue Wei stopped and looked puzzled. \"What events?\"","\"It's... it's about those armed militants that appeared in the slums. Who exactly are they?\"","Xue Wei adopted an expression of sudden understanding. \"You don't need to concern yourselves with that. The United Government will find a way to handle it. Just focus on your training.\"","Tong Yang stood at the edge of the group. She had initially thought to seize the chance to inquire, but hearing Xue Wei's response, her interest immediately waned. She wouldn't get anything else out of him; this man wouldn't utter a single word he wasn't supposed to.","\"Then, does the United Government know who they are?\"","Tong Yang, feeling hungry and not believing Xue Wei would give a serious answer, turned to leave.","Xue Wei said, \"The United Government has decided not to use force to suppress them for now. It has immediately sent personnel to negotiate with them.\"","\"From the negotiations, we learned that the person behind them is likely a temporal anchor point from the Third World.\"","Tong Yang halted her steps and turned back to look at Xue Wei.","Meeting her gaze, Xue Wei's eyes curved into a smile."]},{"number":111,"title":"Chapter 111","paragraphs":["Tong Yang walked into the kitchen alone and served himself a bowl of rice.","He appeared calm and unbothered about his current situation—having done little but still bearing the brunt of the blame.","After training ended that evening, Tong Yang returned to the dormitory and found a quiet spot to call Wu Pingxue.","“Hey, how have you been lately?” Wu Pingxue greeted him casually.","Without wasting time, Tong Yang cut straight to the point: “What’s your connection to the armed militants appearing in the slums?”","Whenever something like this happened, Tong Yang’s first thought was always Wu Pingxue—the cunning old fox.","Wu Pingxue sounded surprised. “What armed militants?”","Tong Yang pursed his lips. “Don’t play dumb.”","Wu Pingxue chuckled softly. “Nothing gets past you.”","Tong Yang frowned. “Is it really connected to you?”","Wu Pingxue replied, “A little bit.”","“What’s going on?”","Wu Pingxue explained, “You should already know that before you discovered the parallel world, some people from the real world accidentally slipped into it.”","“And?”","Wu Pingxue continued, “Those who ended up in the parallel world without finding a way back have no choice but to stay there forever—and there are quite a few of them.”","Tong Yang’s eyes dropped. “People who vanished without a trace?”","“Exactly,” Wu Pingxue confirmed. “Over the past decades, eighty percent of the people who disappeared from the real world without any bodies found actually slipped into the parallel world and the First World through some kind of mysterious trigger.”","Tong Yang lowered his gaze and asked, “So the armed militants in the slums... they’re all from the real world?”","“More or less,” Wu Pingxue said. “After arriving in the parallel world, some died under the harsh social system; some adapted completely and became part of the oppressors; the rest hid in the slums, barely surviving, waiting for a chance to return home.”","Tong Yang fell silent for a long moment before asking, “How did you find them?”","Wu Pingxue answered, “The government of Country Z established contact with them. If they hold on a little longer, they’ll be able to bring them back to the real world.”","“And the weapons? Who supplied them?”","“They developed them on their own.”","Tong Yang was stunned. “They managed to create weapons under those conditions?”","Wu Pingxue smiled. “I thought it was unbelievable too. But they did it. Over time, they’ve built up a formidable arsenal. Apparently, they originally planned to overthrow the First World’s Unified Government and find their own way back to the real world.”","Tong Yang felt shocked but also deeply moved. Throughout this time, she had never considered that these people came from the real world—and that under such harsh conditions, they created their own weapons stockpile.","“Under the influence of the magnetic field energy, the people of the First World and the parallel world have hardly ever thought of resisting, nor had the ability to do so. But the humans from the real world never gave up on their dream of returning home. They kept striving, building everything from nothing. How could that not inspire respect?” Wu Pingxue sighed, “This is the true brilliance of human nature.”","Tong Yang’s lack of understanding of the brilliance of human nature didn’t stop her from admiring those living far away in strange lands. If she were in their shoes, she probably would have become a ruthless aggressor herself, desperately searching for a way back to the real world.","“They’re acting like this, but the United Government won’t just stand by and watch. No matter how many weapons they have, it wouldn’t be hard for the United Government to wipe them out,” Tong Yang pondered, then continued, “The parallel world knows that the person behind them is the Time Anchor. They won’t let them off either.”","Wu Pingxue said, “The parallel world might take action against them, but the First World might not.”","Tong Yang asked, “Why not?”","“As far as I know, the First World hasn’t yet located your position. Suddenly, a group of armed militants appears, wielding a large number of firearms, and they claim the person behind them is you. The First World has no reason not to believe it.”","Hearing this, Tong Yang understood. “Now that the parallel world is also watching closely, the First World at least needs to ensure the Time Anchor never falls into the hands of the parallel world.”","No wonder, after losing eight combat aircraft, the United Government didn’t immediately strike back but chose to negotiate instead. They must have already been suspicious.","After a brief pause, Tong Yang asked, “Besides delaying the First World’s bombing of the slums and creating a balance between the First and the parallel worlds, what else is the purpose of this?”","Wu Pingxue smiled, “There’s an old saying: ‘He who wins the hearts of the people wins the world.’ The First World uses you to bomb the slums, but they also use you to protect the slums at the same time. When things reach a certain point, the United Government’s lies will collapse on their own.”","“But they can’t stop the United Government’s actions; they can only resist stubbornly and minimize casualties in the slums.”","Tong Yang paused thoughtfully, then said, “What do you need me to do?”","Wu Pingxue replied, “Find a way to get in touch with them.”","“Got it.”","After a few seconds of silence, Wu Pingxue continued, “There are twelve gates leading from the slums to the civilian areas, each corresponding to one of twelve families in the wealthy district. One of them is the Maynard family.”","Tong Yang asked, “What about the other eleven families?”","“Unknown.”","“Maynard doesn’t know either?”","“That’s right. Only insiders within the families know.”","“Should I find them?”","“Yes, you must find them.”","“Is it related to magnetic field energy?”","“Exactly.”","Tong Yang said, “I understand.”","Having learned the information she wanted, Tong Yang ended the call and returned to her dormitory.","In the corridor, she passed by Meng Xiao, and the two exchanged nods in greeting before heading back to their respective rooms.","After spending so much time together at the training base, there was no need to pretend not to know each other.","As for how to get in touch with the armed militants in the slums, it was a bit difficult for Tong Yang.","She decided to take it one step at a time.","Not long after, the identities of the armed militants in the slums were exposed—the mastermind behind them was revealed to be the Time Anchor of the Third World.","The residents of the slums were stirred into a fervor, hoping the United Government would soon round up all the armed militants in one decisive sweep. Yet, contrary to everyone's expectations, the government didn’t clash with the militants. Instead, they repeatedly sent envoys to negotiate, claiming to respect the human rights of the slum dwellers and shifting the blame onto a parallel world—after all, official statements had been issued demanding justice for the slum population.","However, almost every negotiation ended in failure.","Normally, information between the slums and the civilian districts was strictly compartmentalized; news about the militants should have been kept under wraps. Yet, inexplicably, every time the United Government dispatched someone to negotiate, the media would report it, making the whole civilian district aware.","During that period, the atmosphere at the training base grew tense. The instructors’ demands became increasingly stringent. Even Xue Wei, usually cheerful and welcoming, wore a constant frown.","Sometimes, when Tong Yang passed by him, she could hear his sighs.","“Sigh.”","Without expression, Tong Yang pinched her water cup and walked past him.","“Sigh!”","Perhaps feeling ignored, Xue Wei deliberately raised his voice and glanced at Tong Yang with a raised brow.","Tong Yang still paid him no mind.","“Hey!” Xue Wei called out, unable to hold back any longer.","Tong Yang looked coldly in his direction, her face showing clear impatience.","“Your esteemed instructor is in a bad mood. As a student, shouldn’t you care? Ask me what’s wrong, and help me ease my worries,” he said.","Tong Yang looked at him with disdain. “If there’s nothing else, I’m leaving.”","“Wait!” Xue Wei shot her a sharp look. “Don’t you know what’s going on in the slums lately?”","Tong Yang turned and faced him. “I’ve heard. So? What does that have to do with me?”","Xue Wei replied, “How could it not involve you?”","Tong Yang’s smile was faint and ambiguous. “How exactly does it concern me?”","Her eyes darkened, hinting at some hidden meaning.","Xue Wei said, “It’s not just about you—it affects the entire First World.”","Growing impatient, Tong Yang asked, “So what exactly are you trying to say?”","Xue Wei stared at her quietly, a trace of dissatisfaction in his gaze.","After her phone call with Wu Pingxue, Tong Yang hadn’t taken any action—partly because she hadn’t had the chance, and partly because she didn’t want to raise suspicion.","She had planned to wait for the right moment to ask questions, but hadn’t expected Xue Wei to approach her first.","With a sigh, Xue Wei said, “In the past two days, all attempts at negotiation between the United Government and the militants have been flatly rejected.”","Tong Yang responded, “If they’ve already refused to negotiate, why not just take action? Doesn’t the United Government have the means to wipe them out completely? That can’t be the case.”","Xue Wei explained, “You know as well as I do—the United Government doesn’t want to harm the Time Anchor. If they attack those militants, the Second World might seize the opportunity to intervene. If the Time Anchor falls into the hands of the Second World, it would be disastrous.”","Tong Yang nodded. “Then the United Government could keep negotiating, or propose a meeting with the Time Anchor. Maybe they could even cooperate to resist the Second World together.”","Xue Wei rested his hands behind his head and sighed, “The coalition government shares your view—negotiating face-to-face with the Time Anchor could at least secure a temporary truce. The problem is that those armed militants have completely refused to negotiate with us. They threaten us with force at the slightest provocation. Meanwhile, the Second World is stirring unrest, and the higher-ups are overwhelmed, completely at a loss.”","Tong Yang pondered for a moment before saying, “Then you should think of other solutions.”","Xue Wei immediately asked, “Do you have any ideas?”","Tong Yang replied, “If they refuse to negotiate, then find a way to force them to.”","“For example?”","“For example, threats, or taking hostages. They’re supposedly protecting the slums, right? Taking a few people from the slums as leverage shouldn’t be difficult.”","Xue Wei lowered his gaze, lost in thought. “There’s a chance it could work, but it might also enrage them further.”","“Then think of something else.”","Xue Wei rubbed his chin with his right hand, his expression distant. “What if we sent someone from the slums themselves to negotiate? Would that make things any easier?”","Tong Yang narrowed his eyes. “You don’t mean you want me to go negotiate alone, do you?”","Xue Wei looked surprised. “Are you scared? I thought you were fearless.”","Tong Yang: “?”","“Do you think reverse psychology works on me?”","Xue Wei sighed helplessly. “A few months ago, if someone from the slums had negotiated with them, their resistance probably wouldn’t have been so fierce.”","“I might die.”","“What are you saying? Of course, we’ll find a way to keep you safe.”","Tong Yang eyed him suspiciously. After a long pause, she asked, “What’s in it for me if I take the risk and negotiate with them?”","Xue Wei looked at her incredulously. “You expect a reward for contributing to society?”","“No? Then don’t come to me with this.”","Seeing her turn to leave, Xue Wei hurriedly said, “Wait, we can negotiate!”","“How so?”","“What do you want?”","Tong Yang said, “I’ll keep it pending. I’ll tell you when the time comes.”","Xue Wei raised an eyebrow. “You’re agreeing to this?”","Tong Yang nodded. “Yeah, I’m quite interested in them.”","“Alright then, I’ll report to the higher-ups. Get ready—should be within the next couple of days.”","Tong Yang said, “Not tomorrow. I promised Yang Miao I’d pick her up on Friday.”","Xue Wei didn’t insist. “Alright.”","“I’m off.”","The next day, at 3:30 p.m., Tong Yang rode a black military-grade motorcycle to pick up Miao Miao.","The training base and the school were not far apart—about a twenty-minute walk.","But since they occasionally rode the military motorcycles to nearby places to buy things, Miao Miao had seen it and insisted strongly that Tong Yang pick her up on the bike today. Plus, with her progress in the entrance exams, Tong Yang agreed.","Tong Yang swung her long legs over the motorcycle, put on her helmet, and left the training base.","Meanwhile, outside the Experimental Middle School, cars came and went in a steady stream.","Since this place was a fair distance from the city, every Friday when school let out, parents would come by car to pick up their children.","Tong Yang was usually busy with training and rarely came to pick her up. Most of the time, she stayed at school or was taken out for a meal on weekends. She had never appeared in front of her classmates with her family.","Several cars were parked along the wide roadside, and a group of students wearing white school uniforms stood nearby.","Yang Miao looked toward the opposite direction of the traffic, backpack on her back, eagerly waiting.","After all this time of recuperation, she had gained quite a bit of weight, and her cheeks had become a little fuller.","“Yang Miao, that’s the way back home!”","A boy pointed toward the city and called out loudly.","“I’ve never seen your family, and you never mention your parents. Are you sure you’re not lying?”","“What do you know! Sister Yang Miao is at the training base, she goes there all the time!”","“Really? The training base is so close to school, why hasn’t your sister come to see you?”","Yang Miao said, “Sister is very busy and works hard. She used to pick me up on weekends.”","“Weekends? You stay at school all weekend. Who knows if that’s true? No one else has seen her. We’ve all been waiting here with you for a long time.”","Yang Miao replied, “I never asked you to wait with me. Isn’t your mom already here? You should go with her.”","The boy snapped, “If you hadn’t said your sister would come on the training base’s motorcycle, I would have left already!”","“Well, you can leave now,” Yang Miao said, her tone sharp and unwelcoming.","“You...” The boy glared at her angrily but, for some reason, didn’t dare to pick a fight. Instead, he turned to the others. “Do you really believe she has a sister? No one’s ever seen anyone pick her up, no one’s ever called or brought her anything. Not even at the parent-teacher meeting last semester.”","The others looked confused and said, “But I really want to see the training base’s motorcycle. It’s so cool.”","“The training base’s motorcycle is really cool. I wish I could ride it!”","The boy said, “She doesn’t have a sister at all! School ends at three. If her sister was really at the training base, she’d have been here long ago. We’ve waited for half an hour, and no one’s come.”","Yang Miao tightened her lips and shot him a look. “I didn’t ask you to wait. You can leave.”","Kids around eleven or twelve were very sensitive about their pride. Yang Miao’s calm, indifferent attitude felt like an insult to him. None of the other students sided with him. Furious, the boy shouted, “You’re a liar, an orphan! I heard from the teacher that you’re the only one who hasn’t paid tuition. You’re an orphan... ah!”","Before he could finish, Yang Miao kicked him hard in the chest.","The boy fell to the ground with a thud, staring blankly at her.","“Your whole family is a bunch of orphans,” Yang Miao shot back bitterly.","“Stop! What are you doing, hitting someone?!”","A woman jumped out quickly from one of the cars parked by the roadside, her eyes blazing as she marched toward Yang Miao.","“Mom... boohoo...”","Apparently, someone was backing him up. The boy clutched his sore backside and started to whimper.","“What do you think you’re doing!” The woman suddenly shoved Yang Miao hard and turned to help the boy.","Yang Miao stumbled backward a few steps. Having spent so much time with Tong Yang, she hadn’t learned much else—except how not to let herself get the short end of the stick. Knowing she couldn’t take on an adult, she lunged forward and kicked the boy hard.","“How dare you hit my son?” The woman was furious, raising her hand to slap Yang Miao.","Just then, the distant roar of a motorcycle engine broke through the tension.","“Here they come!” someone shouted from the crowd.","“Smack—”","Yang Miao failed to dodge in time and a solid slap landed across her cheek, which quickly swelled visibly.","But she wasn’t about to back down. She lunged forward and bit the woman’s arm.","“Ah!” The woman screamed in pain.","At the end of the road, a black motorcycle sped toward the crowd like a leopard on the hunt.","The woman gritted her teeth in pain and shoved Yang Miao away with all her strength.","Yang Miao, after all, was just a child. She fell to the ground, and the woman, boiling with rage, raised her foot to kick her.","“Mom!”","Suddenly, the boy cried out.","The woman instinctively looked up just as the black motorcycle barreled straight toward her at full speed.","She tried to dodge, but her mind went blank in that moment, her limbs weak and unresponsive. She could only widen her eyes and watch the motorcycle grow closer and closer.","The black motorcycle was moving so fast it was almost a blur. The rider hunched low over the handlebars, eyes calm and deep behind tinted goggles. At just a meter away from the woman, the rider slammed on the brakes, spun the bike sharply, and the rear wheel barely scraped the tips of her toes before coming to a steady stop right in front of her.","The woman, clearly shaken, felt her legs give out and she collapsed to the ground, murmuring, “You’re crazy... you’re insane...”","“So cool!”","“Yang Miao, is that your sister? She’s so cool!”","Tong Yang put down the kickstand, planted his long legs firmly on the ground, and removed his helmet. His gaze swept over the woman on the ground and the stunned boy before he walked over to Yang Miao and helped her up.","“Sis,” Yang Miao looked up at her, a clear fingerprint mark on her right cheek, her eyes reddening.","“I-I’m going to report you! Are you from the training base? I’m going to file a complaint right now!” The woman scrambled to her feet, using both hands and feet, pointing at Tong Yang with venom.","Tong Yang glanced at the fingerprints on Yang Miao’s face, then at the woman. “You hit her?”","Yang Miao’s voice was a faint buzz. “It was her. Sis, my face really hurts.”","For some reason, the boy seemed afraid of Tong Yang and stammered, “Ya-Yang Miao hit me first... she started it...”","Yang Miao said, “Who told you to insult me? Not only did you insult me, you even cursed my sister!”","The boy’s eyes widened. “When did I ever curse your sister?”","“You called me an orphan. Isn’t that wishing your sister would die sooner?”","Tong Yang shot her a sharp glance. Yang Miao immediately fell silent, standing quietly at her side, head bowed.","“Yang Miao is under twelve years old. If you harm a child, you’ll face criminal charges. Serious cases can lead to fines, detention, or even being sent to the slums. Or if you come from the wealthy district, maybe you can ignore the laws of the commoners?”","Hearing the words \"slum,\" the woman’s face paled slightly. She stammered, \"I—I just accidentally hit her once. She didn’t bleed, and her mental state is fine...\"","Before she could finish, Yang Miao, who had been quietly standing beside Tong Yang, suddenly twitched all over and collapsed to the ground.","The woman was stunned. \"This... this has nothing to do with me...\"","\"Whether her mental state is okay isn’t up to you to decide,\" Tong Yang said firmly.","The woman gritted her teeth. The situation wasn’t as serious as Tong Yang made it out to be; no irreparable damage had been done. But since the other party was from the training base, she dared not continue to argue.","\"What do you want to do?\" the woman asked.","\"Apologize. That shouldn’t be hard, right?\"","The woman slapped the back of the boy’s head. \"Apologize to your classmate!\"","The boy looked aggrieved. \"I’m sorry!\"","Tong Yang kicked Yang Miao, who was still on the ground. \"Get up.\"","Yang Miao quickly opened her eyes and got to her feet. \"I don’t accept it.\"","The boy’s eyes widened in disbelief as he stared at her.","\"Don’t push your luck.\"","Yang Miao snorted coldly. \"For your sister’s sake, I’ll reluctantly forgive you.\"","Tong Yang glanced at the circle of teeth marks on the woman’s arm and said, \"I think that’s enough. Let’s all back down a bit. What do you think?\"","The woman scowled but nodded, quickly pulling the boy back to the car.","As they passed the motorcycle, the boy glanced back longingly.","\"Sis.\"","After they left, Yang Miao stood in front of her, cautiously looking at her expression. \"Did I cause you trouble?\"","Tong Yang looked down at her and said, \"Next time something like this happens, I don’t recommend you just jump in and hit someone.\"","Yang Miao was momentarily stunned. \"...Huh?\"","She had expected to be scolded.","\"There are many ways to get back at someone. Given your situation, direct confrontation is the dumbest choice.\"","Yang Miao nodded, half understanding. \"I get it.\"","Tong Yang took off the other helmet from the motorcycle and handed it to her. \"Your classmates?\"","\"Hello, sis!\"","\"Hello, sis! We’re Yang Miao’s classmates!\"","Yang Miao said, \"They’re all my classmates.\"","Tong Yang nodded and greeted them. \"Hello.\"","No wonder she insisted on riding the motorcycle.","\"Let’s go,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Okay!\"","Yang Miao put on the helmet and sat on the back seat of the motorcycle.","The boy and his mother seemed to be waiting for someone and hadn’t left. He sat in the passenger seat, cradling a lifelike doll, staring longingly at Tong Yang and Yang Miao.","Yang Miao shot him a glare that clearly said, \"What are you looking at?\"","The boy glared back defiantly.","It was obvious neither of them was willing to back down.","As long as the adults didn’t get involved, Tong Yang couldn’t be bothered to settle petty squabbles between kids.","After folding up the motorcycle’s kickstand and preparing to leave, Tong Yang suddenly heard a crisp slap.","Without warning, the lifelike doll in the boy’s arms raised its hand and slapped him.","\"Nyah nyah nyah!\"","The boy was stunned, while Yang Miao looked thoroughly pleased with herself."]},{"number":112,"title":"Chapter 112","paragraphs":["\"What's wrong?\" Tong Yang asked, turning her head.","Yang Miao immediately wiped the taunting look off her face and shook her head innocently. \"Nothing, sis.\"","Tong Yang pursed her lips, glanced at the boy at the car window who wore a look of resentment, and decided not to stir up trouble. She told Yang Miao to hold on tight, started the motorcycle, and headed back to the training base.","Back at the training base, Tong Yang parked the bike and put the helmet back in its place. Looking down, she saw Yang Miao wiping blood that had flowed from her nose.","\"What happened?\" Tong Yang asked.","Yang Miao flinched, guiltily looked away, and hid her hand behind her back. \"Maybe I'm just... heaty.\"","Tong Yang said, \"You might as well say she hit you too hard.\"","Another trickle of blood ran from her nostril. Knowing Yang Miao didn't want to talk about it, Tong Yang didn't press further. \"Let's stop the bleeding first.\"","\"It's fine, it'll stop on its own soon,\" Yang Miao said with an air of indifference.","Tong Yang paused. \"Has this happened before?\"","\"Sometimes. It's not a big deal. Maybe I caught a chill.\"","Catching a chill doesn't cause nosebleeds. Tong Yang didn't call her out on it. If she said her body was fine, it wasn't Tong Yang's place to argue.","That night, Yang Miao stayed over at the training base.","The next day, Xue Wei found her, and the two of them dropped Yang Miao off at school before taking an aircraft to the slums.","\"Did the higher-ups agree?\" Tong Yang asked.","Xue Wei said, \"No other choice. Might as well go for broke now.\"","Tong Yang stayed silent, offering no opinion.","Soon, the combat aircraft arrived over the slum district. Besides theirs, several other escort aircraft flanked them.","Arriving at a spot frequented by militants, one of the aircraft lowered its window and broadcast its purpose to those on the ground below.","The ground was eerily quiet. The neatly arranged buildings showed no sign of human life.","\"Cease the bombing of the slums, or we will not accept any terms.\"","The broadcast voice echoed. With too many hiding spots on the ground, it was impossible to tell where the speaker was concealed.","\"The United Government respects the human rights of the slum dwellers. Please do not view us with hostility. If there is any misunderstanding regarding Yang Tong's death, after a thorough investigation, the United Government will certainly clear your names.\"","This broadcast was clearly aimed at the Time Anchor.","It was precisely because they had pinned Yang Tong's death on the Time Anchor that they had a pretext to bomb the slums.","\"Your negotiation lacks sincerity. We have decided to cease talks until you stop bombing the slums,\" said the militants.","\"Since you are unwilling to negotiate with the United Government, we have specifically found a slum resident willing to help ease relations to convey the United Government's intentions. If you are distrustful, she can come alone to negotiate with you.\"","After the aerial announcement ended, the ground fell silent for several minutes.","The voice continued, \"The United Government is reluctant to use force against innocent people. This stalemate benefits no one. Please consider this carefully.\"","After several minutes of silence, a voice finally came from below.","\"Send her down alone. Otherwise, we will continue our attacks.\"","Inside the aircraft, Xue Wei and Tong Yang exchanged a glance.","\"Be careful.\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"Mm.\"","Xue Wei said, \"If you encounter any unexpected situations, find a way to extract yourself. We'll provide cover from out here.\"","\"I understand.\"","The combat aircraft slowly descended. The hatch opened, and Tong Yang stepped out.","Xue Wei then piloted the aircraft back into the air, circling overhead.","Tong Yang scanned her surroundings, sensing several pairs of eyes fixed on her from the shadows.","\"Put your hands up,\" a voice came from just behind a wall.","Tong Yang obediently raised her hands. Moments later, she heard light footsteps approaching from behind. She instinctively began to turn her head but was immediately stopped.","\"Don't move!\"","The voice sounded like a young woman's.","Tong Yang remained perfectly still. She didn't know if the armed militants were aware of her identity. It would be disastrous if they decided to open fire at the slightest provocation.","A few seconds later, the person walked up behind Tong Yang, pressing the cold muzzle of a gun against her back. \"Walk forward.\"","\"Alright,\" Tong Yang complied with a nod.","Following the woman's directions, Tong Yang walked to an unfamiliar street. An eyepatch was handed to her from behind.","\"Put it on.\"","Tong Yang took the eyepatch and put it on.","Plunged into darkness, her other senses heightened. The woman didn't speak again, simply grabbing her arm and leading her on a winding route.","After a few minutes, Tong Yang heard a loud \"creak\" ahead.","The sound echoed in a hollow passageway. Tong Yang understood; she was being taken underground. This must be their temporary hideout.","Entering the passage, their footsteps echoed. After walking for about ten minutes, the woman stopped. \"Take it off.\"","Tong Yang removed the eyepatch. Harsh light made her frown in discomfort. After adjusting for over ten seconds, she opened her eyes.","A brightly lit room came into view. Before she could take it all in, a youthful face leaned in close.","\"Hey there! Long time no see, sis!\" The boy revealed sharp canine teeth, his eyes curved into a pleasant smile.","Seeing the vaguely familiar face, Tong Yang's expression wavered for a moment.","\"Whoa! You haven't forgotten me, have you?\" The boy widened his eyes in mock hurt, pointing at himself. \"Me! It's me! We met at the research base! You guys even snacked on a bunch of our food!\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang remembered. This was one of the \"Spider\" members they had encountered during their first visit to the 749 Bureau.","\"What are you doing here?\" Tong Yang asked.","The boy said, \"Same as you, on a mission.\"","Tong Yang looked around. Several people in the corners watched her with intense vigilance, gripping their weapons tightly, poised for action.","The boy explained, \"Relax, everyone. She's one of us.\"","It seemed the others weren't aware of Tong Yang's identity yet.","Tong Yang asked, \"Is anyone else here besides you?\"","The boy said, \"I'm Mi Qi. Besides me, there's Sister Tang Li and the others, but they're not here. They have other tasks.\"","\"Tang Li is here too?\"","\"Yeah, Sister Tang Li arrived earlier than you. She's in the affluent district, I think. I can't reach her.\"","Tang Li was in the affluent district? Did that old fox Wu Pingxue deliberately send her to the slums?","Mi Qi turned to the others, seeming quite familiar with them already. \"No need to be nervous, everyone. She is the Time Anchor.\"","Tong Yang raised an eyebrow, surprised he would state it so bluntly.","Noticing her surprise, Mi Qi explained, \"Don't worry, sis. They're all trustworthy people.\"","\"I'm Bai Sining.\"","The girl who had brought Tongyang in stepped forward to introduce herself.","Tong Yang shook her hand. \"I'm Tong Yang.\"","Mi Qi couldn't help but marvel, \"Sister Tong Yang, I really didn't expect you to infiltrate the United Government. Aren't you afraid of being discovered?\"","Tong Yang lowered her gaze. \"Most likely, I already have been.\"","Mi Qi blinked. \"What?\"","\"But... he probably won't tell.\"","Mi Qi asked curiously, \"Who?\"","Tong Yang said, \"You don't know him.\"","The person Tong Yang was referring to was Xue Wei.","Upon careful reflection, almost every step Tong Yang took was facilitated by Xue Wei, including her first participation in the bombing and this current negotiation.","Whatever Tong Yang wanted to do, he would deliver the opportunity right into her hands, making her deeply suspicious of his motives.","\"Tch, I'd know her if you just told me.\"","Tong Yang ignored him, looking around the room's facilities, which were fully equipped.","\"Were all these made by yourselves?\"","Even though she already knew, Tong Yang still felt a sense of astonishment.","In the resource-scarce slums, this place was almost identical to the real world, truly remarkable.","Bai Sining said, \"Wasn't the real world built from nothing too? Moreover, we have the experience of our predecessors; creating these things isn't difficult.\"","Tong Yang nodded, \"That's true.\"","\"Have a seat and some tea.\"","Tong Yang sat down at the table. The people standing in the corners gradually came forward, looking at her with curiosity.","\"You're so young.\"","\"I thought you'd be older.\"","\"I've heard so much about you, you're amazing!\"","\"Yeah, those guys in the Second World are especially wary of you.\"","\"I saw you last time! Your reflexes are so fast, my anti-gravity filament couldn't catch up.\"","\"Never would have thought you actually infiltrated the training base.\"","\"The United Government is so sinister, framing Yang Tong's death on you, making you bear the blame while they bomb the slums without a shred of guilt.\"","\"That Yang Tong isn't a good person either; she never actually died.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"How do you know she's not dead?\"","\"We found Yang Tong's corpse. Although the face was destroyed, she had many illnesses before death, probably incapable of self-care. How could she possibly pass the slum test? It can only mean the dead person wasn't Yang Tong at all.\"","\"She must be in cahoots with the United Government, disregarding the lives of everyone in the slums!\"","Mi Qi let out a snort, watching them as if enjoying a show.","Tong Yang remained perfectly calm and said, \"I am Yang Tong.\"","\"You think she's no good too... huh?\"","\"Who? Who are you?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I am Yang Tong. After passing the civilian district test, they came for me at night and brought me into the slums. I didn't know their purpose beforehand.\"","Everyone looked embarrassed, awkwardly saying, \"I thought so. On second thought, there's a strange connection between your two names.\"","\"So it's you...\"","Tong Yang smiled and said, \"Let's skip the small talk for now and get down to business. The United Government wants to meet with the Time Anchor—that is, me.\"","\"Mhm, we know. Anyway, we only have weapons. Whatever you plan to do, we'll try our best to cooperate.\"","\"Everything is to return to the real world.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Actually, there's a way to take you all back right now.\"","As long as Wu Pingxue guides Yan Qing from the parallel world, it could be done.","\"Really?\"","\"Is that true?\"","Mi Qi was somewhat surprised that Tong Yang was telling these people so directly, especially since they still needed their help.","Tong Yang nodded, \"Yes.\"","The development of events would inevitably involve sacrifices. She didn't like sacrifice, nor did she like others sacrificing. Laying everything out clearly and letting others choose to stay or leave meant they would bear the consequences of their own choices, with no one to blame but themselves.","Mi Qi didn't quite understand her actions but didn't interrupt.","They had been dragged into the parallel world for no reason, hiding in the slums all these years just to return to their former home. The conflict among the three worlds would certainly cause casualties. They were just ordinary people and shouldn't be sacrificed passively.","\"If we can go back now, that would be great! But if we don't resolve this matter completely, others will be dragged in for no reason too.\"","\"Exactly, we've already put in so much effort; we can't give up now. You also need help.\"","\"We're all fighting for the real world. How can we abandon you and go back by ourselves at a time like this?\"","\"We'll complete the mission and go back together!\"","Tong Yang lowered her gaze. She had guessed as much.","People who could persist for decades under such circumstances, searching for a way home, and who, failing that, would forge a new path to overthrow the United Government—even as ordinary people, they wouldn't quietly return to the real world just like that.","Hearing their answers, Mi Qi looked somewhat stunned and couldn't help saying, \"Staying in the First World could mean many people will die.\"","\"So what? Haven't enough of us died already?\"","\"If we go back like this and the mission fails, others who get dragged in will have to start from scratch. It's better for us to continue. We've been here so many years anyway; a little more time won't matter.\"","Bai Sining said, \"However, even if the mission fails, the survivors can still return to the real world, right?\"","Tong Yang nodded, \"Correct.\"","A smile appeared on Bai Sining's face. \"Thank you for telling us this. When this is over, we'll go back together.\"","\"Right, we'll go back together!\"","\"Together!\"","Mi Qi laughed heartily, \"Then let's all go back together.\"","Bai Sining asked, \"What now?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I want to talk with the United Government. I don't know what their real plans are.\"","Bai Sining said, \"Then you stay here for now. I'll go out and notify them that we're willing to negotiate.\"","Tong Yang thought for a moment, \"Use me as a hostage. Have them send someone else over.\"","\"Alright then.\"","\"Okay.\"","Bai Sining left the room to relay the message to Xue Wei and the others that they were willing to negotiate.","Mi Qi asked the others to leave temporarily, leaving only him and Tong Yang in the room.","Mi Qi asked, \"You plan to cooperate with the United Government?\"","\"Not cooperate. Utilize.\" Tong Yang said.","Wu Pingxue wanted her to find the twelve families corresponding to the twelve doors. There were many families in the affluent district; finding them all would take who knows how long. It was better to find another way.","Moreover, given the current situation, the parallel world that had overdeveloped magnetic energy held the initiative. If she could find a way to suppress them first, the situation might improve.","Just as she used the parallel world to pressure the First World into bombing the slums, perhaps she could also use the First World to pressure the parallel world, reaping the benefits herself.","But she still needed to see what the United Government intended.","A little over ten minutes later, Bai Sining returned to the basement with several people.","Leading them was an elderly man with greying temples, followed by Xue Wei.","Bai Sining said, \"I only agreed to negotiate with you again because I heard you bear no ill will towards the Time Anchor. If you dare deceive me or try any tricks, I guarantee you won't leave here alive.\"","The elder asked, \"May I ask where the Time Anchor is? I hope to meet and negotiate with her directly.\"","Bai Sining said coldly, \"On this point, let me reiterate: it is impossible for you to meet the Time Anchor. Who knows what tricks you might try to pull.\"","The old man said helplessly, \"We've come here without carrying any weapons. How could we try to trick you? Unless we have a death wish.\"","Xue Wei chimed in, \"Miss, there are some matters we must discuss with the Time Anchor in person. If we wanted to play tricks, why would we keep choosing to negotiate with you despite repeated setbacks?\"","Bai Sining remained unmoved. \"I will relay any message for you.\"","The old man, truly out of options, said, \"At the very least, prove to us that the Time Anchor is in the slums. Your word alone isn't enough; we can't fully believe it.\"","Mi Qi let out a derisive laugh, twirling a silver-white dagger in hand. The blade rested against Tong Yang's cheek. With an innocent smile but eyes like a venomous snake, she said to Tong Yang, \"And this is what you call sincerity?\"","Tong Yang looked up. \"Sincerity should be mutual. You claim to work for the Time Anchor, yet the Time Anchor hasn't shown herself from start to finish. We just want proof, any form will do.\"","The old man nodded. \"She's right. Any method will do, as long as it can prove she is here.\"","Bai Sining's attitude softened slightly, and she glanced at Mi Qi.","Mi Qi rested her elbow on Tong Yang's shoulder, tapping the blade idly against her cheek. She smiled, revealing sharp canine teeth. \"Alright, you want proof? That can be arranged.\"","The old man asked, \"How do you plan to provide it?\"","\"How about coordinates?\"","The old man narrowed his eyes. \"Coordinates?\"","\"If the Time Anchor's coordinates appear here, wouldn't that be the best proof?\" Mi Qi said.","Tong Yang shot her a discreet glance. She wasn't wrong; the Time Anchor's coordinates appearing here would indeed be the best proof.","The old man looked at the group. \"After negotiating for so long, I never asked: why exactly are you working for the Time Anchor, and how did you manage to shield her coordinates?\"","Mi Qi said with a smile, \"Sorry, that's classified. If you need proof, the Time Anchor's coordinates will appear in the slums in ten minutes.\"","The old man gave her a deep look and, surprisingly, refused. \"No need. I believe the Time Anchor is in the slums at this very moment.\"","Mi Qi wasn't surprised and smiled. \"It's best that you believe us. To be honest, providing proof would make things very troublesome.\"","The old man smiled. \"Exactly.\"","As for the \"trouble\" they mentioned, it was undoubtedly the Parallel World.","Once the Time Anchor's coordinates were revealed, the Parallel World might detect them immediately, which would be detrimental to both the First World and Tong Yang.","Mi Qi said, \"Old sir, speak plainly. What are your intentions?\"","The old man said, \"The United Government wants the Time Anchor to enter the affluent district. The Second World has been coveting her life, and they might directly attack you soon. If she enters the affluent district under our protection, she will at least be temporarily safe from mortal danger.\"","Tong Yang's gaze turned distant. Such high-sounding words were merely for the sake of controlling her whereabouts.","Mi Qi laughed. \"And then conveniently place the power of life and death over the Time Anchor in your hands? What's the difference between dying immediately at the hands of the Second World and dying a little later at yours?\"","The old man said, \"As long as she is willing to cooperate, we will not harm her.\"","Mi Qi asked, \"Not now, and not ever in the future?\"","The old man replied, \"Never in the future.\"","Mi Qi found this laughable. \"What? Have you given up on the Third World?\"","The old man then said, \"As long as she is willing to cooperate, we have a way to erase the Time Anchor from her.\"","Hearing this, everyone in the room was stunned.","Mi Qi's pupils narrowed. \"What do you mean?\"","The old man smiled gently. \"This is the United Government's greatest show of sincerity. With her consent, we can transfer the Time Anchor to another person.\"","\"And the condition?\" Mi Qi asked.","\"She needs to stay in the affluent district to contain the Second World until the United Government is fully prepared,\" the old man stated.","The room fell into silence.","Transferring the Time Anchor? Wu Pingxue had never mentioned such a thing. The Parallel World couldn't kill her and had no such plans either. It seemed this was something only the First World could do.","The Time Anchor could actually be transferred?","Unheard of.","Fortunately, Mi Qi didn't give an answer immediately. Her gaze grew profound, displaying a maturity that didn't match her age. \"There are no conditions for transferring the Anchor?\"","The old man said, \"There are.\"","\"What are they?\"","\"First, it requires her complete and voluntary consent. Second, it can only be transferred to someone who shares a blood relation with her.\"","In the real world, there was only one person related by blood to Tong Yang: Tong Le.","Mi Qi lowered her gaze, looking at Tong Yang's grim expression. It was no exaggeration to say she could sense killing intent emanating from her.","Mi Qi smiled. \"It seems the negotiations are about to fail. The Time Anchor will not agree to your conditions.\"","The old man said, \"Blood relations can be reconstructed through technology. As long as she agrees, anyone in the Third World can share a blood relation with her.\"","Disgusting.","Tong Yang felt nothing but disgust.","Mi Qi smiled, but there was no mirth in her eyes. \"We are deeply sorry, but the negotiations are over.\"","\"If you continue to bomb the slums, we will continue to resist.\"","Bai Sining raised her pistol, aiming at the three. \"Please leave.\"","The old man said helplessly, \"Why be like this? We still hope you will convey this to the Time Anchor and let her make the decision.\"","Bai Sining repeated, \"Please leave.\"","Xue Wei walked to Tong Yang's side, pulling her up from the chair. \"Let's go.\"","The old man said no more and was the first to leave the room.","In the underground passage, cold air poured in, carrying a faint, elusive scent of rust.","The fluorescent lights above the passage had inexplicably dimmed compared to when they arrived, casting a faint yellowish glow.","\"Drip—\"","A drop of bloody water seeped through the ceiling and fell right in front of Tong Yang.","\"Swish—\"","\"Swish—\"","Several strange sounds came from ahead. Xue Wei suddenly grabbed the old man's clothes and pulled him in front of the group as a shield.","\"Thud—\"","\"Thud—\"","Metal arrowheads pierced through the old man's body. His eyes widened in disbelief, and blood trickled from the corner of his mouth.","\"Go back!\" Xue Wei threw down the old man's corpse and said to the three others.","The four quickly retreated into the room and shut the door.","\"Tap—\"","\"Tap—\"","In the empty passage, a chilling sound of footsteps echoed.","Bai Sining asked, \"What's happening?\"","Tong Yang observed their surroundings. Some things had already quietly changed.","\"This is the Parallel World,\" Tong Yang stated.","Bai Sining was taken aback. \"The Parallel World...\"","Mi Qi frowned. \"Has the Parallel World discovered us?\"","Tong Yang, however, snatched the dagger from Mi Qi's hand. She grabbed Xue Wei from behind, pressing the knife tip against his flesh, and said coldly, \"Did you do this?\"","The one who had caused Tong Yang to come here in the first place was Xue Wei.","Xue Wei glanced at her sideways but didn't answer immediately.","From under the door crack, a crimson liquid began to seep in."]},{"number":113,"title":"Chapter 113","paragraphs":["A river of blood spread, reaching the feet of the group.","The sound of footsteps echoed in the underground passage, not stopping at the door of the room but pacing back and forth continuously, as if deliberately tormenting them.","\"Tap, tap, tap—\"","The footsteps suddenly quickened, as if someone was running in the passage.","Tong Yang tightened her grip on the dagger, ignoring the commotion outside the door. To her, Xue Wei, with his unclear identity and motives, was more dangerous.","The other two were like her, watching Xue Wei warily, turning a blind eye to the noises outside.","Xue Wei's eyes narrowed slightly. Even with the blade pressed against his throat, he remained composed and said, \"Is this how I taught you?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Speak properly. If you die here, no one will ever know why.\"","Xue Wei sighed, \"This place is different from the Third World. After entering the Second World, their actions are not bound by rules.\"","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes, \"So you really do know my identity.\"","Xue Wei said, \"Yes, I know.\"","\"Who else knows besides you?\"","\"For now, only I know.\"","Tong Yang frowned and let go, \"How did you know?\"","Xue Wei had known her identity all along but had never exposed her, nor had he told others. He had even repeatedly provided her with opportunities. At least from the current situation, he harbored no ill intent.","Xue Wei shrugged, \"Now's not the time to talk about this. Let's find a way out first.\"","\"Bang!\"","As soon as the words left his mouth, a giant axe split the door plank. Through the crack, a burly man stared at them.","Mi Qi crouched and moved behind the door, his hands moving deftly as he wrested the axe away, then turned and swung it down at the man.","A section of the man's wrist was chopped off, blood splattering across Mi Qi's face. He kicked the man away forcefully and discovered many more people standing in the passage. A grin spread across his face, \"Been so bored lately, finally something to do.\"","With that, he plunged headlong into the crowd. Soon, the sound of tearing flesh came from outside the door.","Xue Wei clicked his tongue, \"Are kids from the Third World always this brutal?\"","Tong Yang said, \"No, most are quite docile. He's the exception.\"","\"Hey! What are you standing around for? Let's go!\" Mi Qi shouted.","Unfazed by the situation, the three of them calmly stepped into the passage.","The walls were stained with blood, corpses littered the ground, and a river of blood flowed. Mi Qi swung the axe, carving a gory path.","\"Follow me.\"","The three followed him out of the underground passage.","It was daytime. A thick fog filled the air, making everything beyond two meters completely invisible. The surrounding buildings were shrouded in smoke, making it impossible to discern direction.","A rustling sound arose, as if someone was moving through the dense fog. In this pitch-black place where you couldn't see your own hand, the situation was highly unfavorable for them.","\"How do we get back?\" Tong Yang asked.","Having entered from the First World, the actions of people in this parallel world weren't restricted. Most likely, the methods for leaving and entering this parallel world were different from those in the real world.","Xue Wei said, \"Let's find a safe place first.\"","Before they could hesitate, people from the underground passage had already chased them out.","Mi Qi scanned the thick fog and faced one direction, saying, \"This way.\"","\"Go!\"","Mi Qi, axe in hand, led the way. Tong Yang and Xue Wei walked in the middle, with Bai Sining bringing up the rear.","\"Thud—\"","Mi Qi, with his keen sense of smell, detected someone approaching and swung his axe.","Tong Yang gripped her dagger tightly, vigilantly scanning the surroundings. Those who had chased them from the underground passage were eliminated one by one by Bai Sining.","Xue Wei was unarmed, observing the disturbances in the thick fog caused by people passing by.","They kept moving forward, dealing with everyone they encountered along the way. Soon, they stopped in front of a house. Several metal arrows pierced through the void with a \"zing,\" embedding themselves in the wall.","\"Get inside first, assess the surroundings.\"","The four pushed open a window and climbed in, immediately locking it behind them.","The interior of the house was furnished with old, worn items, showing no signs of recent habitation. Large patches of brown liquid covered the floor, emitting a strong odor of decay.","The four found the staircase and went upstairs, looking down from a window.","The fog reached about two stories high. Some other buildings were visible around, but from their appearance, they were completely abandoned, exuding an aura of age and decay.","\"Seems they didn't follow us up,\" Mi Qi said, standing by the window and glancing down a few times.","Tong Yang said, \"Since no rules can restrict their actions, why aren't they trying to wipe us out completely?\"","Xue Wei said, \"I don't know.\"","Tong Yang shot him a glance, \"This matter has nothing to do with you?\"","\"No, why would I create trouble for myself?\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang frowned.","Xue Wei had a point. If it were related to him, he had simpler ways to deal with Tong Yang, especially since she was right under his nose.","Had she already been discovered by others?","But there had been many opportunities before. Entering the parallel world didn't require a specific location. Why was she discovered only after meeting with Bai Sining and the others?","Mi Qi said, \"It's not necessarily that you were discovered.\"","Xue Wei and Tong Yang looked at him simultaneously, their expressions stunned.","If Tong Yang's identity wasn't discovered, there was another possibility for why they were attacked after meeting Bai Sining.","\"The parallel world deliberately brought us here. Their goal isn't necessarily to kill us, but to deepen the conflict between you and the United Government?\" Tong Yang said.","Xue Wei frowned, \"Then that's bad.\"","The old man's corpse, which Xue Wei had used as a shield, would return to the First World. Others seeing his body and the disappearance of Tong Yang and the others might think the negotiations failed and a conflict erupted, resulting in the old man's death at the hands of Bai Sining and Mi Qi.","The United Government would eventually learn about the failed negotiations and the old man's death. Coupled with their disappearance, the two sides were highly likely to erupt into conflict, allowing the parallel world to reap the benefits without lifting a finger.","\"The nature of failed negotiations is different from killing someone after failed negotiations. We must find a way back to prevent them from clashing with the United Government.\"","The parallel world hadn't seen through Tong Yang's identity. Otherwise, they would have acted during Tong Yang's first solo negotiation attempt. But they waited until the second time when the old man and Xue Wei came together. Their goal was likely to deepen the conflict between the two sides.","Then, whether the parallel world wanted to target Bai Sining's group or the United Government, it would be effortless.","They probably never imagined that, through a twist of fate, they had dragged in Tong Yang, the temporal anchor point.","\"How do we leave this place?\" Tong Yang turned to Xue Wei and asked.","Xue Wei said, \"Although there are no rule restrictions in the Second World, for those who enter the Second World through non-standard channels, we need to fulfill certain conditions to return.\"","Seeing their puzzled looks, Xue Wei explained, \"They are rules established by the United Government and the Second World to prevent people from shuttling freely between the two worlds.\"","\"What are the conditions?\"","Xue Wei shook his head, \"I don't know. There should be an energy terminal nearby. Finding it will reveal the conditions.\"","Mi Qi said, \"The longer they keep us here, the more likely conflict with the United Government becomes. The energy terminal probably won't be easy to find.\"","\"Aside from that, is there any other way?\" Tong Yang asked.","Before coming, Tong Yang and Xue Wei had left all their belongings in the aircraft, so there was no way to contact others. Furthermore, the slums had no satellite signal coverage, and Bai Sining and the others had no communication devices, making it impossible to send messages to either side via electronic means.","Although the United Government had not taken action against Bai Sining and the others before this, that was based on the condition that there were no casualties on either side. Now, the elder who was negotiating had died on Bai Sining's turf. How long could the United Government tolerate such a blatant provocation?","Xue Wei said with difficulty, \"I've never left the First World. I don't know if there are other methods.\"","\"Then the only option is to find the energy terminal.\"","\"The Parallel World hasn't continued their attack on us. If we search for the energy terminal, they definitely won't just sit back and do nothing.\"","Tong Yang pondered for a moment and said, \"I have an idea.\"","The other three focused their gazes on her, asking in confusion, \"What idea?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Although I don't know how to enter the First World, I do know how to return to the Real World from the Parallel World.\"","Mi Qi's eyes widened. \"You mean...\"","\"Since we can't go directly to the First World, we'll return to the Real World first.\"","Then, Yan Qing from the Parallel World would send them into the First World.","At this point, Tong Yang looked at Xue Wei, who widened his eyes in disbelief. \"You're not planning to leave me here alone, are you?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I don't understand your motives. If I rashly take you into the Real World, who knows what you might do.\"","Of course, Tong Yang didn't believe he could actually accomplish much in the Real World; she just wanted to use the opportunity to pry some information from him.","Xue Wei said helplessly, \"What could I, an unarmed person, possibly do to you?\"","He glanced at Mi Qi. \"I'm no match for this little one.\"","Mi Qi, shouldering her axe, chuckled. \"You flatter me.\"","Though young, Mi Qi, as a member of \"The Spiders,\" possessed genuine skills.","Tong Yang gave Xue Wei a deep look, knowing she wouldn't get any information out of him for the time being. She didn't press further and said casually, \"Why are you afraid I'll leave you behind? Is there no way for the First World to enter the Real World?\"","Xue Wei smiled. \"There is, but it can only be implemented from within the First World.\"","Xue Wei's gaze shifted among the three of them. \"However, I'm curious. You all should be from the Third World, right? How will you take us to the Third World?\"","\"I naturally have my methods.\" Tong Yang didn't answer directly. From this, it seemed the First World truly knew very little about her, unaware that she had replaced human tissue from the Parallel World.","Tong Yang thought for a moment and said, \"The three of us are from the Real World and aren't bound by the energy cycle restrictions.\"","Each energy cycle only allows five people from the Parallel World to enter the Real World.","\"If five people are already in the Real World during this energy cycle, you won't be able to enter.\"","Xue Wei said, \"You don't need to worry about that. After learning you entered the First World, the Second World has focused its attention entirely on the First World.\"","Tong Yang said nothing more, feeling somewhat irritated. This guy Xue Wei was too much like Wu Pingxue—chatty about trivial matters but tight-lipped about any crucial information. Equally annoying.","Mi Qi looked around at their surroundings and said, \"Sister Tong Yang, is there enough space here?\"","Tong Yang said, \"It should be sufficient.\"","\"Then let's hurry and leave...\"","Before she could finish, a soft, derisive snort suddenly came from the room.","The sudden sound instantly put all four on high alert. They looked up towards the source of the noise.","On the open railing of the fourth-floor balcony, a figure had appeared at some unknown time.","The person was dressed in black leather, the heel of her short boot lightly resting against the railing. Her hands braced on the railing, body leaning back slightly, head tilted up, yet her eyes looked down at them.","Seeing the person's face clearly, Tong Yang's pupils constricted sharply. Beside her, Mi Qi and Xue Wei also wore expressions of facing a formidable enemy.","Bai Sining was utterly astonished, his eyes shifting between Tong Yang and the newcomer.","They hadn't heard any movement, completely unaware of when she had appeared or how long she had been watching them.","\"Don't be nervous. I'm just bored and wanted to come find you to play.\" The woman narrowed her eyes teasingly, staring at Tong Yang. \"Long time no see, darling.\"","Tong Yang felt a chill. The person who appeared was none other than the \"Forerunner\" Tong Yang she had encountered once on Harker Island—that is, the Tong Yang from the First World.","Cold sweat slid down Tong Yang's temple. She hadn't expected the First World's Tong Yang to appear here. If she wanted to take action, Tong Yang and the other three would be no match for her.","The First World's Tong Yang released her grip on the railing and leaped down, landing lightly in front of the group with almost no sound. Even the air currents around her remained undisturbed, as if she were a ghost.","Even though the other party had done nothing, the four were already drenched in cold sweat.","Xue Wei feigned composure and said, \"Yang Le, no wonder I always felt you seemed familiar. So you are her from the Third World.\"","The First World's Tong Yang gave a mocking laugh, crossing her arms. \"Yang Le? Your new name?\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together, discreetly preparing her defenses. The power level of the First World's Tong Yang was simply not in their league. If she wanted to act, they would have no time to react.","The First World's Tong Yang said with feigned helplessness, \"Aren't you on good terms with the 'us' from the Second World? Being so guarded against me hurts my feelings.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"What do you want?\"","\"Didn't I say? Bored. Came to try my luck, and didn't expect my luck to be this good.\"","The First World's Tong Yang must have learned that the person behind Bai Sining and the others was Tong Yang. Combined with the Parallel World's scheme to sow discord, she had come to join the commotion. By sheer coincidence, she had run into Tong Yang herself.","She thought her luck was good. Tong Yang felt her own luck was rotten to the core.","\"Which world are you actually working for?\" Tong Yang asked.","The First World's Tong Yang leaned her back against the wall and smiled. \"What do you think?\"","Tong Yang said, \"You're so capricious, I can't guess.\"","The First World's Tong Yang smiled without answering. \"I originally came to watch the show, but unfortunately, you're too good at finding loopholes. Letting you return to the Third World would be far too boring.\"","\"So, what do you intend to do?\"","Speaking of which, even if others didn't know the identity and appearance of the Time Anchor, the First World's Tong Yang absolutely knew. With her presence, both the First World and the Parallel World could locate her immediately.","However, most people who had seen Tong Yang were dead. The remaining few basically maintained a cooperative relationship with her. Most people who had seen the First World's Tong Yang were also dead. Those still alive only cared about the coordinates and hadn't seen Tong Yang.","If the First World's Tong Yang intended to expose her, she only needed to tell those people that the Tong Yang from the Real World was the Time Anchor, and the search scope for her would shrink dramatically. Yet, until now, she hadn't done so.","The First World's Tong Yang said, \"I guess you're wondering why your identity hasn't been exposed.\"","Tong Yang neither confirmed nor denied it, saying, \"Are you willing to explain it to me?\"","\"It's an honor.\" The First World's Tong Yang gave a faint smile. \"The First World indeed knows very little about you, nothing beyond your coordinates.\"","\"The Second World at least knows your name besides your coordinates. It's just a pity that our parallel world selves have no intention of getting involved in these conflicts, and I long ago abandoned that name. Apart from a few people close to me, no one knows it.\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"I see.\"","No wonder Wu Pingxue had told her that shielding her coordinates and changing her name would prevent her identity from being easily exposed.","\"After saying all that, you still haven't stated your purpose,\" Tong Yang said.","The First World's Tong Yang lowered her gaze, her long lashes casting a shadow on her cheeks.","\"These worlds are boring,\" the First World's Tong Yang said with a sigh. \"So boring that I don't really care what happens.\"","Tong Yang stared at her fixedly, then after a moment asked, \"What about Tong Le?\"","The First World's Tong Yang let out a muffled laugh. \"The place I used to live was in the slums.\"","\"Dead?\"","\"Yes. A few days before I passed the test to enter the commoners' district.\"","Tong Yang understood. \"Your parents?\"","\"I killed them.\"","Tong Yang fell silent. The social structure of the First World offered little difference for those at the bottom. Tong Yang had to admit she was luckier than the other two Tong Yangs, living in a timeline with a completely different social structure where a Tong Le suffering from a high fever could receive medical treatment.","If Tong Le had died back then, Tong Yang would have died on May 28th, 2024, and would never have become a temporal anchor or a temporal dislocation.","Different causes yield different results.","Tong Yang was just a bit luckier than them. Back then, she had chosen Tong Le over her parents.","Too much time had passed. Tong Yang could barely recall the true events of that day now.","Carrying the unconscious Tong Le on her back, and her parents in the twisted, mangled car, coughing up blood and begging her for help.","Tong Yang didn't know why they were begging her for help. She could do nothing. She could only take advantage of the truck driver calling the police to climb into the car and take the wallet from her mother's body.","Without money, she could do nothing. She couldn't save Tong Le.","She took Tong Le to the hospital. The doctor said if she had been a few minutes later, he couldn't have been saved.","At that time, Tong Yang felt profoundly grateful.","By the time she went to identify the bodies, two days had passed.","According to the police handling the incident, there were no surveillance cameras on that road. Footage from other sections showed her parents were driving under the influence and going the wrong way, bearing full responsibility for the accident.","Tong Yang had never felt any guilt over what happened that night. It was exactly what those garbage parents deserved.","If she had hesitated that night, if she had stayed at the crash scene, Tong Le would most likely have died too.","Whenever she thought about it, all Tong Yang felt was relief.","Tong Yang looked up and met her gaze. In that instant, she saw something in the First World Tong Yang's eyes that was identical to her own.","The significance of Tong Le was entirely different for them.","That tiny child was the only person in the world who loved them.","\"I didn't mean to tell you all this. It's meaningless,\" the First World's Tong Yang said.","Tong Yang pressed her lips together. \"If you have nothing else, don't waste our time.\"","\"I enjoy wasting time, especially the time of people like you who race against the clock. I quite like seeing you people get flustered, angry, and hysterical.\"","Tong Yang said, \"It seems you're not planning on becoming friends with me.\"","\"Of course not. I don't need to be friends with you.\"","The other three watched their strange standoff, unable to interject.","\"I heard you're afraid of rats. Why?\" Tong Yang asked.","The parallel world Tong Yang had told her that.","Tong Yang couldn't understand. What was there to fear about something so fragile she could crush it with one hand?","The First World's Tong Yang narrowed her eyes, the corners of her mouth turning down, the air around her seeming to freeze.","\"You really want to know?\" the First World's Tong Yang said calmly.","\"If I want to know, you'll tell me?\"","\"Of course.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"Why?\"","The First World's Tong Yang lowered her head, her hair falling over her chest, the line of her profile tense.","\"After that, I could never find Tong Le's body.\"","\"I spent a long time and finally found him in a garbage dump.\"","Tong Yang guessed what was coming, her face stiffening, her breath catching.","The First World's Tong Yang let out a hollow laugh. \"I heard 'squeaking' noises coming from the trash pile and searched through the overwhelming stench of decay.\"","\"Then, I discovered the source of the decay was Tong Le's corpse, and the source of the 'squeaking' was the rats eating his body.\"","Tong Yang lowered her eyes and said softly, \"I'm sorry.\"","The First World's Tong Yang scoffed. \"Why apologize? It wasn't your fault.\"","The First World's Tong Yang gradually shifted her gaze to the other three.","\"You're from the United Government?\" she said, looking at Xue Wei.","Xue Wei said, \"Hello, I'm Xue Wei.\"","The First World's Tong Yang said lazily, \"So, you plan to cultivate another version of me to replace me?\"","Tong Yang frowned slightly, looking at Xue Wei.","\"I wouldn't dare,\" Xue Wei said.","The First World's Tong Yang looked back at Tong Yang. \"I've always looked forward to your growth.\"","\"And so?\"","\"Let's play a game,\" the First World's Tong Yang said.","\"What game?\" Tong Yang asked, her expression unchanged.","\"A fun game. I originally wanted to play it with our Second World self, but unfortunately, she refused.\"","Tong Yang was silent for a moment, remembering what the parallel world Tong Yang had said. \"You want me to become a 'Forerunner'?\"","\"The United Government wants a compliant weapon. So they want me dead, but also want me alive until they find a replacement weapon.\"","\"Go on,\" Tong Yang said.","\"The temporal dislocation on you will probably disappear around 2027. I can give you two years. You must become someone capable of replacing me, kill me, or die by my hand. Before that, I will clear all obstacles for you.\"","Tong Yang's eyes darkened. \"Why?\"","\"So it won't be boring anymore.\"","\"You should know, even if you gave me ten years, I wouldn't be your match,\" Tong Yang said.","The First World's Tong Yang smiled. \"I know. But aren't you clever? Think of another way. Or die by my hand in two years, and the Third World will be completely overrun.\"","Tong Yang said, \"If I win, what's in it for me?\"","\"Your goal is probably the magnetic field energy. I'll pave the way for you. If you can win, everything will be resolved. Do you want to play?\"","Tong Yang chuckled wryly. \"It seems this isn't just a contest between you and me, but between the First World and the real world.\"","The First World's Tong Yang said, \"If I win, the Third World falls. If you win, the Third World achieves its goal.\"","\"For you, this is a hard-won shortcut.\""]},{"number":114,"title":"Chapter 114","paragraphs":["This hard-won shortcut seemed to have no reason to be refused.","To clear all obstacles for her, all she needed to do was kill the First World's Tong Yang in two years. What seemed like an utterly impossible task was, for Tong Yang, no different from a pie falling from the sky.","The fight against the First World and the Parallel Worlds had now become a fight against the First World's Tong Yang.","However, all the heavy burdens would fall on Tong Yang alone.","If successful, everyone would rejoice; if not, she would not only lose her life but also bear the infamy of causing the Real World's invasion.","\"Well?\" asked the First World's Tong Yang.","It seemed she didn't believe Tong Yang would refuse.","If Tong Yang participated in this game, she would shift from passive to active. Once she failed, the blame would rest solely on her shoulders.","Tong Yang didn't care about that. What happened after her death had nothing to do with her, and she wouldn't know anyway.","Her judgment was that she should participate in this game and make use of the First World's Tong Yang.","\"I'm willing to play this game with you, but this isn't just a matter between you and me,\" Tong Yang said.","The First World's Tong Yang laughed. \"It seems the Third World isn't so boring after all. You think they still have a reason to exist.\"","Tong Yang said, \"I need to return to the Real World once.\"","Tong Yang believed she should join the game, staking the entire Real World. However, she didn't want the Real World's fate—life or death—to be decided arbitrarily without its knowledge.","They might not be willing to entrust their lives to Tong Yang, for her to bear alone.","The First World's Tong Yang immediately said, \"Fine, I can let you return.\"","Tong Yang said, \"To prevent the situation from worsening further, you need to replace me and return to the First World with them to stop the conflict between the United Government and the slums from erupting.\"","Tong Yang spoke with righteous confidence. The First World's Tong Yang narrowed her eyes at her. Clearly, no one had dared make such a demand of her before.","Tong Yang said, \"This is a basic condition.\"","The First World's Tong Yang said with an ambiguous tone, \"You really know how to make the most of everything.\"","Xue Wei and Mi Qi stared dumbfounded at the woman who seemed like a god of death, saying in disbelief, \"You're letting her go back with us?\"","\"No way, I don't want to be around her.\"","Bai Sining wore an equally wary expression.","Tong Yang said, \"I don't want to waste time. If she wants to take action against you, does she need a specific time and place?\"","\"Well, that's true.\"","The First World's Tong Yang's mouth turned down in a sigh. \"You're so adorable, I can't even refuse you.\"","\"You must have a way to take them back to the First World, right?\"","\"Naturally.\"","\"Then that's settled. I might stay for a few days when I go back. Sorry for the trouble.\"","The First World's Tong Yang raised an eyebrow. \"You really don't stand on ceremony at all.\"","Tong Yang pondered for a moment, then looked at Xue Wei and said, \"You also wouldn't want our game to be sabotaged. If anyone tries to interfere, I wouldn't mind if you killed them.\"","She was saying this to the First World's Tong Yang.","The First World's Tong Yang chuckled darkly. \"Getting addicted to ordering me around? However, I certainly won't let anyone ruin the game I've so carefully prepared.\"","Xue Wei hurriedly said, \"I won't interfere.\"","\"Who knows.\"","Tong Yang said, \"I'm leaving. You all take care.\"","\"I look forward to your answer.\"","Tong Yang parted ways with the four of them and used the \"Elevator Game\" to return to the Real World, appearing in Country M.","All the items Tong Yang carried with her were left in the First World. She could only borrow a passerby's phone to contact Mr. Meng.","\"Tong Yang?\" Mr. Meng asked in surprise. \"Where are you? Why are you calling me?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Mr. Meng, I'm in a bit of a bind. Could you send someone to pick me up and contact Country Z?\"","\"What's your location? I'll send someone immediately.\"","Tong Yang reported her location. After waiting two or three hours, a helicopter sent by Mr. Meng picked her up and took her to his home.","Personnel dispatched by the Country Z government arrived the following evening. Everyone gathered in the study of Mr. Meng's house.","Mr. Du asked, \"How did you end up here?\"","Tong Yang told them about her experiences in the slums and the appearance of the First World's Tong Yang.","Hearing this, everyone fell into deep thought.","\"What are your chances of success against the First World's Tong Yang?\" Mr. Du asked.","Tong Yang said, \"Less than ten percent.\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"Given the current situation, with the First World slaughtering humans in the slums to prepare for developing the Magnetic Field Energy, our chances of destroying the Magnetic Field Energy would also be greatly reduced, even to less than ten percent.\"","Mr. Du said, \"Tong Yang, this is not a simple matter. If you agree to her demands, the help we can provide you will be very limited.\"","Tong Yang shook her head. \"Even if I don't agree to her demands, the help the Real World can provide me is also very limited.\"","The situation facing the Real World was too passive. Coupled with the existence of the Magnetic Field Energy, they had almost no means to fight back.","On one hand, they couldn't make any major moves; on the other, their understanding of the two worlds was one-sided. If not for the appearance of Tong Yang as a temporal anchor point, their situation might have been even worse than that of the Parallel World.","Apart from assisting Tong Yang in completing her plan, the Real World could do little. The Magnetic Field Energy was an insurmountable chasm for them.","Mr. Du sighed. \"I'm sorry to disappoint you.\"","\"There's no need to say that. Without the Magnetic Field Energy, the Real World inherently can't do much.\"","The 749 Bureau had been involved in these matters, obtaining some key information and even high-quality genetic serums. Unfortunately, it was merely a drop in the bucket. Against the formidable Magnetic Field Energy, ordinary people simply couldn't contend.","\"I didn't expect the First World's Tong Yang to intervene. I don't know if this is ultimately a blessing or a curse,\" Wu Pingxue said gravely.","Tong Yang said, surprised, \"I thought it was within your expectations.\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"I can't predict the future.\"","Mr. Du pondered for a moment and said, \"Tong Yang, I'd like to hear your thoughts.\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"Tell us your plan.\"","Tong Yang's gaze swept over the two of them. After a few seconds of silence, she said, \"The First World's Tong Yang is extremely powerful. Even if given ten or twenty years, I might not necessarily be able to defeat her.\"","During her growth period, the First World's Tong Yang definitely wouldn't stand still waiting for her.","In two years' time, early 2028, she couldn't possibly be a match for the First World's Tong Yang.","Tong Yang continued, \"Therefore, I hope the plan proceeds as usual. She will pave a road for me. Killing her means victory at the end of that road. I want to open a hidden path along this road. Even if she wins and I die, the Real World can still reach the end of that road.\"","\"Not only will I agree to her conditions, but I will also utilize her as much as possible, squeezing out all her value. However, I will stay at the training base from now on. These tasks will have to be carried out by you.\"","Tong Yang did not deny that she was a greedy person.","Admittedly, it was almost impossible for her to defeat the First World's Tong Yang. But she wasn't just fighting for herself. Even if she failed and died, she had to ensure the Real World achieved its goal.","This was the equivalent exchange Tong Yang had set in her heart for herself and the Real World.","The fate of the real world rests on her shoulders alone, and she is doing her utmost to leave them a way out.","Tong Yang felt she might be overthinking things, but it didn't matter.","Wu Pingxue looked at her deeply and said, \"So, you've prepared yourself for certain death.\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"Yes.\"","She didn't want to die. In the time she had left, she would strive with all her might to grow stronger, even though the hope of defeating the Tong Yang from the First World was exceedingly slim.","Tong Yang disliked sacrifice, so she didn't consider her actions sacrificial.","In her view, this was simply an equivalent exchange.","\"It will be very difficult for me to win. Utilizing her to destroy the magnetic field energy would be much simpler.\"","Wu Pingxue didn't directly tell Tong Yang what the method to destroy the magnetic field energy was. The information they currently possessed was insufficient—such as the twelve families corresponding to the twelve gates, and the internal distribution within the United Government. Using the First World's Tong Yang would make everything clear at a glance.","Moreover, with parallel worlds watching covetously, the First World's Tong Yang was of great use. Tong Yang felt they should seize this opportunity.","Silence fell in the room. Mr. Du sighed. \"Tong Yang, have you thought this through?\"","Wu Pingxue's expression was also uncharacteristically serious.","Tong Yang said, \"This is just a contingency plan for the real world. I care about my own life more than any of you.\"","You can't have your cake and eat it too, but Tong Yang was determined to try.","If her hope of beating the First World's Tong Yang was slim, then she would find another path—at the very least, ensuring the real world remained in an invincible position.","Tong Yang was too rational. Her ideas left no room for others to find fault, because aside from the cost to herself, there was no harm to the real world.","This child, full of edges and corners, wasn't as cold as she appeared on the surface.","After the discussion concluded, Tong Yang and the others met with the M-country government before setting off to return home.","Uncertain when she might return to the real world, Tong Yang planned to settle all her affairs before heading to the First World.","Back in the capital, Tong Yang went to Yang Lin's parents' home. She didn't explain much, afraid they might notice something amiss.","Then she went to visit Grandma Yu. The outcome was predictable—she got an earful.","She found Chu Shiyu, and together they picked up Tong Le and Yang Lin from school, had a meal out, and sent the two children home.","That evening, Chu Shiyu contacted Xu Junyue and the others.","Xu Junyue was at the military camp and temporarily couldn't get away, so Tao Bai and a few others came out to meet.","After a few drinks and some pleasantries, Tong Yang got straight to the point.","\"How is Ji Jia'en considering things?\" Tong Yang asked.","There were less than three months until Ji Jia'en's death date in May 2026. After Tong Yang went to the First World, she wouldn't return, so she could only take this chance to ask. If the other party didn't believe her, she wouldn't waste any more energy on such matters.","Zhou Jingyun was taken aback. \"Jia'en-jie never mentioned this to me. She's probably forgotten all about it.\"","Tong Yang nodded, her expression unchanging, and said, \"I suggest you ask her what kind of funeral she'd like and pick out a cemetery plot in advance.\"","Zhou Jingyun: \"...\"","\"May I ask the time and place of her passing?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Mid-May, at the Hongyang Grand Hotel.\"","She had said her piece. How things developed afterwards was none of her concern.","Zhou Jingyun nodded. \"Thank you.\"","Chu Shiyu had trained with Xu Junyue for a period but returned to school after it started.","\"You seem to be in a real hurry this time,\" Chu Shiyu said on the way home.","Tong Yang had no intention of hiding it from her and bluntly voiced her thoughts.","After hearing her out, Chu Shiyu looked at her in silence for a long time.","\"Tong Yang, you always walk ahead so fast, all by yourself,\" Chu Shiyu said, her voice slightly hoarse.","A cold wind brushed her cheeks. Tong Yang looked into the distance and said, \"Don't worry, Wu Pingxue won't let you all stay idle.\"","Keeping the real world unscathed under such circumstances was no simple task.","As for how to do it, Wu Pingxue had a good sense of proportion.","Chu Shiyu gave a wry smile, her tone lightening a little. \"It's strange. You're too capable. I always feel like you won't lose. It seems like you've never lost, either. No matter how desperate the situation, you always find a solution.\"","Tong Yang smiled. \"Let's hope so.\"","The next day, Tong Yang contacted Mr. Du, informing him that a certain model of aircraft would crash in mid-to-late 2026 and that they should take preventive measures in advance.","Upon learning this, Mr. Du immediately dispatched people to investigate.","Tong Yang quite liked this feeling—not having to exhaust herself explaining things.","After that, Tong Yang returned to school to apply for a leave of absence. It was a pity, but there was no helping it. This wasn't like the time in Dongyang Community where academics were the top priority. Now, she cared more about her own life and needed to devote all her energy to protecting herself.","With her worries settled and all matters of the real world no longer requiring her consideration—and with the First World's Tong Yang clearing obstacles in both the First World and parallel worlds for her over the next two years—she actually felt an immense sense of relief.","On her final day in the real world, Tong Yang went to find Ye Huai.","Ye Huai had been extremely busy lately. Rumor had it he'd had a heart attack mid-way and nearly died, though he hadn't let Tong Yang detect any signs.","\"Hello, I'm looking for Ye Huai.\"","Tong Yang didn't have a communication device on her, so she went directly to Ye Huai's company.","After returning to the real world, she hadn't found the time to contact him.","The receptionist said, \"You're looking for President Ye? Do you have an appointment?\"","Tong Yang was momentarily stunned. \"Is an appointment necessary?\"","Tong Yang had never met anyone who required an appointment, feeling a bit helpless. She still had to go to the public security bureau in two hours.","The receptionist smiled and said, \"Miss, President Ye is usually very busy with work. Generally, you need to schedule an appointment in advance to secure his time.\"","Tong Yang nodded and asked, \"I didn't bring my phone. Could you contact him for me? If he's unavailable, that's fine.\"","The receptionist patiently asked, \"May I have your surname, please?\"","\"Tong Yang.\"","\"Alright, please wait a moment.\"","The receptionist made a call.","\"Hello, front desk. Could you please get President Ye? A Miss Tong is here to see him.\"","\"Okay.\"","After a brief conversation on the other end, the receptionist hung up.","\"Miss Tong, please have a seat in the waiting area.\"","\"Thank you.\"","Tong Yang sat in the lounge area to wait.","The receptionist brought her a cup of hot tea. \"President Ye will be right down.\"","\"Okay, thank you.\"","Tong Yang hadn't waited more than a few minutes when slightly hurried footsteps sounded from behind her.","Tong Yang turned around and locked eyes with Ye Huai, who was dressed in a deep blue suit.","Months apart had made the young man seem much more mature. His eyes held a smile as he quickened his pace to reach her. \"Long time no see.\"","Tong Yang observed him comfortably. \"Looking more and more like an adult.\"","Ye Huai chuckled. \"You sound like an elder.\"","Tong Yang didn't mind. \"Do I?\"","Ye Huai said, \"Do you have time? Come up to my office for a bit.\"","\"I have two hours,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Then let's go.\"","Tong Yang walked with him into the elevator and up to his office.","\"Why didn't you contact me in advance? I could have prepared.\"","Tong Yang said, \"No need. I just came to see you. I'll only stay for a little while before leaving.\"","\"What would you like to drink?\"","\"I already had something downstairs.\"","Ye Huai closed the office door and the blinds, sitting with her on the sofa.","\"Is everything going smoothly?\" Ye Huai asked.","\"Mm, relatively smooth.\"","Ye Huai tilted his head to look at her and remained silent for a long time.","\"What's wrong?\" Tong Yang asked, puzzled.","Ye Huai said, \"Sorry, I didn't expect you to be here.\"","Tong Yang asked with keen interest, \"Are you happy?\"","Ye Huai nodded frankly. \"Happy. I thought we wouldn't meet again until next year, or the year after.\"","In the First World, even though she could contact people in the real world, Tong Yang was busy with training all day long. She never visited without a reason and rarely contacted them.","His answer was so straightforward that it actually made Tong Yang feel a bit uncomfortable.","\"I heard you almost died?\" Tong Yang asked bluntly.","Ye Huai said, \"It wasn't that exaggerated. I just forgot to take my medicine by accident.\"","Tong Yang said, \"You've been taking medicine for so many years, and you still forgot?\"","\"Maybe my health is a bit better than before, so I got careless.\"","Tong Yang said with a half-smile, \"That's great. While I was fighting for my life in the First World, you were also fighting for your work.\"","Ye Huai looked at her and said sincerely, \"I cherish my life, really.\"","\"I hope so.\"","Tong Yang hadn't come to him for this. She glanced around Ye Huai's office. The decor leaned toward a steady, solemn style, with a large medical kit placed in one corner.","Tong Yang pondered for a few seconds and asked, \"If you had a sudden heart attack, would the medicine in there be enough?\"","Ye Huai, not understanding her point, replied, \"If it's not serious, it's enough.\"","\"What if it's very serious?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"The family doctor's office is on the seventeenth floor. It would only take two minutes for them to get here.\"","\"Oh.\" Tong Yang nodded. \"That's good then.\"","Ye Huai asked, puzzled, \"What's the matter?\"","Tong Yang didn't answer. Looking at his pale lips, she leaned forward without warning and kissed them.","Ye Huai's pupils dilated. He didn't react even after Tong Yang pulled back.","\"What kind of reaction is this?\" Tong Yang looked at his calm face. \"I thought you'd faint like last time.\"","Ye Huai's gaze rested on her face in a daze, his pale skin flushing slightly. He pursed his dry lips, his expression turning odd.","\"You...\"","He wanted to say something but hesitated.","Tong Yang's motto had always been to talk less and do more. She grabbed Ye Huai's shoulders and kissed him again.","Ye Huai's skin was too fair; a light pinch left a large red mark.","Breath brushed between their noses. Tong Yang didn't close her eyes. She curiously observed Ye Huai's reaction and found that he, with trembling long eyelashes, hadn't closed his eyes either.","The moment their eyes met, Ye Huai bit her lips, not too lightly, not too heavily.","He grasped Tong Yang's hand, his palm temperature scalding hot, his voice hoarse: \"Close your eyes.\"","Tong Yang looked at him suspiciously. Why close her eyes? She liked observing Ye Huai's reactions.","Not getting a reply, Ye Huai leaned in and kissed her.","\"Wait.\"","Tong Yang leaned back, not letting him kiss her. \"Why close our eyes...\"","Before Tong Yang could finish her sentence, a hand pressed against her waist, silencing her lips.","Seeing the other person close his eyes, Tong Yang, as if bewitched, closed hers as well.","The feeling was completely different from having eyes open. Darkness amplified the body's senses infinitely. It was very gentle and very comfortable.","Ye Huai was naturally gifted, completely mastering the rhythm of breathing, causing the kiss to last a long time.","When they parted, Ye Huai rested his forehead against hers and said hoarsely, \"You came to find me just for this?\"","Tong Yang pressed her tingling lips and said, \"Yeah.\"","Seeing the meaningful look in his eyes, Tong Yang, feeling somewhat unwilling to admit defeat, said, \"Not just that.\"","\"Hmm?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I want to do other things too.\"","\"What things?\"","Tong Yang glanced at the hem of his clothes and said, \"What do you think?\"","Ye Huai chuckled. \"Are you always this frank?\"","Tong Yang said, \"But forget it. Your physical condition isn't up to it.\"","Ye Huai's body stiffened slightly. He narrowed his eyes at her. \"Are you doing this on purpose?\"","\"No, just saying it offhand, don't take it seriously.\" Tong Yang couldn't hide the teasing on her face.","Ye Huai pursed his lips, looking at her, his expression betraying a hint of resentment. After a long moment, he gently rested his forehead on her shoulder and said, \"Don't provoke me. This is an office. There are surveillance cameras.\"","Tong Yang was stunned. \"There are cameras?\"","\"Mm.\"","\"Why didn't you say so earlier?\" Tong Yang pushed him. \"Let go, I'm leaving.\"","Ye Huai didn't let go. He raised his head,","raised an eyebrow at her with a smile, as if having scored a point, and said, \"I was lying. There are no cameras.\"","Tong Yang was speechless. \"Childish.\"","\"Hungry? Let me take you to get something to eat.\" Ye Huai smiled.","Tong Yang shook her head. \"No need. I'll stay a little while longer and then go.\"","\"Okay.\"","Just staying like this didn't seem bad either.","Tong Yang propped her elbow on his shoulder and looked at the ceiling light for a while.","\"Something on your mind?\" Ye Huai asked.","\"Mm.\" Tong Yang nodded.","What she was going to do, Ye Huai would find out sooner or later. She hadn't planned to hide it anyway.","\"Before coming back, I met with the Tong Yang from the First World.\"","Ye Huai's brow furrowed slightly. \"What did she do?\"","Tong Yang said, \"She wanted to play a game with me. She gives me two years, she'll pave the way for me. If I can kill her after two years, the goal in the real world will be achieved. If I lose, the real world will probably lose too.\"","Ye Huai's expression turned grave. \"What do you think?\"","\"I want to agree to her, but I don't plan to follow her instructions. If I lose, the real world cannot lose. So, Wu Pingxue's plan will proceed as usual. I want to use her to achieve the goal.\"","Ye Huai's lips tightened into a line. \"You think your chances of killing her are slim, so you're taking a desperate gamble to ensure the real world won't be affected?\"","Tong Yang looked momentarily taken aback. \"You think I'm that kind-hearted?\"","Ye Huai looked at her deeply and said, \"Tong Yang, you've always been doing equivalent exchanges. But some things are unconditional.\"","Tong Yang had never gained anything unconditionally. She believed everything in the world was like a monetary transaction; only by giving up something could you get what you wanted.","\"It doesn't matter whether you're kind-hearted. Doing what you believe is right is enough in itself,\" Ye Huai said.","Tong Yang silently lowered her eyelids. \"I've always been doing what I believe is right.\"","\"The only thing I can't set my mind at ease about is that after I die, Tong Le will try to go back to the past to save me.\"","Just like after her death on May 28th in the original timeline, whether it's the Tong Le from the current timeline or the Tong Le from the 2036 timeline, they would likely choose to do that.","Ye Huai looked at her quietly, his eyes inscrutable and hard to fathom. \"Have you ever thought that perhaps I would too?\"","Tong Yang stared at him blankly, suddenly remembering what he had once said.","\"Would you mind if an interesting story ended briefly?\" Tong Yang asked.","Ye Huai's eyes were deep, his tone firm: \"I won't let it end.\""]},{"number":115,"title":"Chapter 115","paragraphs":["Leaving the real world, Tong Yang returned to the First World, the location still being the slums.","To allow the First World's Tong Yang and Tong Yang to reasonably swap identities and return to their respective positions, Xue Wei and the others spent several consecutive days negotiating with the armed militants in the slums, staying for half a day each time.","When Tong Yang found Bai Sining and the others' base, Mi Qi threw himself into her arms, tears welling in his eyes.","\"Sister Tong Yang, you're finally back... sob...\"","Tong Yang disgustedly pushed against his forehead, her face cold. \"How revolting.\"","Mi Qi immediately cried even harder. \"How can you say that! None of you Tong Yangs are any good!\"","Tong Yang couldn't be bothered to deal with him. She stepped past him into the room. The First World's Tong Yang was sprawled casually on a chair, with Xue Wei and Bai Sining on either side—one serving tea, the other feeding her fruit—attending to her like she was royalty.","\"You're back.\" The First World's Tong Yang lazily raised her eyes and smiled.","Xue Wei and Bai Sining simultaneously shot her a resentful look; it seemed they had been thoroughly tormented these past few days.","Tong Yang frowned. \"Don't use my identity to do such things.\"","The First World's Tong Yang was unperturbed and asked, \"What's the result?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I agree to your terms, but during this period you cannot interfere with anything I do, and you must keep the promises you made to me.\"","Based on Tong Yang's understanding of herself, once she promised something, she would absolutely never go back on her word. She wasn't worried about that point.","The First World's Tong Yang's eyes darkened a few shades, and she narrowed them mischievously. \"I know what you want to do. If you can manage it, I don't mind.\"","\"Good then.\"","Tong Yang wasn't sure how much she knew, but having her commitment was enough.","The First World's Tong Yang stood up, walked over to Tong Yang, extended her right hand, and raised an eyebrow. \"Pleasure doing business?\"","Tong Yang shook her hand. \"Pleasure doing business.\"","The First World's Tong Yang stretched with a yawn, sounding listless. \"Have Xue Wei relay any questions. I'm bored to death. I'm leaving.\"","The other three collectively breathed a sigh of relief. This formidable presence was finally leaving.","After spending a few days with the First World's Tong Yang, even Tong Yang seemed amiable and kind in their eyes.","\"Mhm.\" Tong Yang didn't pay it much mind, simply acknowledging.","The First World's Tong Yang walked out of the room yawning, her footsteps echoing softly in the underground passageway before disappearing after a few steps.","Tong Yang looked at the three and asked, \"What's the explanation for the United Government?\"","Xue Wei said, \"The truth. The Second World is causing trouble.\"","Tong Yang nodded. A few seconds later, her probing gaze landed on Xue Wei.","\"Now that there's time, let's have a chat about your... situation.\"","Bai Sining and Mi Qi instinctively positioned themselves behind Tong Yang, united in their hostility as they stared at Xue Wei.","The latter let out a helpless sigh. \"What situation could I possibly have? I'm just an unremarkably handsome guy.\"","Mi Qi made a disgusted face. \"Shut up, you!\"","Tong Yang said, \"I hope your answers will satisfy me.\"","...","Not long after, Tong Yang and Xue Wei piloted an aircraft back to the civilian district.","No longer worried about her identity being exposed, Tong Yang had far fewer concerns.","Around the same time, the typically elusive \"Forerunner\" officer—The Slayer—who spent most of her time in the Second World, appeared at the United Government and would participate in all its affairs thereafter.","It was said she always wore a white cat-face mask, and almost no one had seen her true appearance.","Simultaneously, the first round of \"Forerunner\" selection was set to begin in May 2026. Tong Yang focused entirely on the upcoming selection, no longer inquiring about the plan's progress.","During her final contact with the people in the \"Melon-Eating\" group chat, she learned their timeline was in February 2027. The time flow differential was now less than a year.","Moreover, because Tong Yang was in the First World, the parallel worlds had turned their full attention there. This gave the real-world national governments time to make comprehensive deployments. Coupled with the presence of Yan Qing in the parallel world, a fragile peace was barely maintained.","In mid-May 2026, the first round of selection officially began.","Over two thousand new recruits participated, with twenty percent being eliminated.","Each selection round was spaced a week apart. After the first round, they returned to the training base.","The training intensity in the First World was far more brutal than in the real world, possibly related to magnetic field energy. Even though Tong Yang consistently came out on top in both training and selection, she still found it strenuous.","The second round of selection began in early June, which Tong Yang passed without question.","The third round was the stage where Chu Shiyu from World A had been eliminated. Compared to the first two rounds, it was noticeably more difficult.","According to Xue Wei, successfully passing the third round would grant an opportunity to go to the affluent district.","Although Tong Yang found it challenging, passing the selection wasn't particularly difficult for her.","In late July, before the fourth round of selection began, the training base gave the seven hundred who had passed the third round a two-day holiday to relax properly.","When Tong Yang woke up, her dorm room was already empty. All the new recruits who had shared her dorm had been eliminated in the first three rounds.","Watching the sunlight streaming in through the window, Tong Yang felt a rare moment of disorientation.","She dug out her phone from the locker. Having not been turned on for so long, it had long since run out of battery and shut down.","Tong Yang plugged it in to charge and went out to wash up and have breakfast.","By the time she returned, the phone had charged enough to power on.","During this period, Tong Yang hadn't contacted anyone. With no more worries holding her back, she had poured all her energy into the selection.","Opening her phone, a screen full of messages gradually popped up, mostly greetings. Tong Yang replied briefly to a few, then called Tong Le.","Tong Le was about to start middle school and had been busy attending a summer camp.","They didn't chat long before Tong Le was called away for a class, and they hung up.","During this time, Zhou Jingyun had sent her a message.","In May, Ji Jia'en had been attacked at a hotel. Fortunately, thanks to her warning and Detective Lin's covert surveillance of Ji Jia'en, the police officers deployed at the hotel arrived in time when the incident occurred. Ji Jia'en suffered some shock but was not injured.","Afterwards, to thank Tong Yang, Ji Jia'en transferred several million into her bank account.","Tong Yang transferred half of that amount to the members of the \"Melon-Eating\" group chat. This was their pre-agreed fifty-fifty split of rewards. For any incident involving the group chat, Tong Yang would give them half the payment.","[(Hands clasped in prayer) Thank you, Sister Tong!]","[Sob... a struggling new graduate who can't find a job and was about to starve. Thank you, Sister Tong, for saving my life!]","[Ahhhhh so much money so much money!]","[What's this called? This is called choice outweighing effort!]","[Hehehe...]","[Sister Tong, we'll be able to meet before long! When we do, I'm definitely going to kowtow to you!]","[Me too!]","The timeline for the \"Melon-Eating\" group chat members differed from Tong Yang's.","Since discovering the parallel worlds, Tong Yang had experienced over two years, but the time flow for the group chat members was almost three times slower. Their timeline had only progressed nine months.","The time flow differential between the two spaces was nearly threefold, meaning Tong Yang would likely catch up to them around June 2027.","For the group chat members, that was only a little over two months away. For Tong Yang, she had less than nine months left.","Learning Is For Making Money: [It might be a bit later.]","The time she had agreed upon with Tong Yang from the First World was early 2028. Only then would everything be settled, and if she was still alive, could she return to the real world.","Little Pink Flower: \"Morning or night, it doesn't matter!\"","\"Wow wow wow! Lele!\"","\"@Little Pink Flower What's going on with you! You only show up when Sister Tong appears\"","\"Then we'll get to see Lele too, right? Even if it's just a mini-version of Lele\"","\"@Little Pink Flower I want to see the 2036 version of Lele (twiddles fingers)\"","Little Pink Flower: \"Sister, do you want to see?\"","\"Studying is for Making Money transferred 20,000 to Little Pink Flower\"","Studying is for Making Money: \"Let me see\"","\"Holy crap! Sister, sister, do you want to see me!\"","\"Me, me! I'm cheap! I only want two thousand!\"","\"Damn, 20,000 for one photo of Lele, that's a steal!\"","\"My sister is truly spending a fortune for a beauty\"","Two minutes later, Little Pink Flower posted a video.","In the footage, the 2036 version of Tong Le was sitting somewhere very high. The wind tousled his hair, revealing two sharp canine teeth as he shouted, \"Hello, brothers and sisters! I'm the 2036 version of Tong Le. I'm really looking forward to meeting everyone.\"","He looked at the camera, eyes curved into crescents, \"Sister, you gave me too much!\"","Then, the video abruptly ended.","\"!!!\"","\"Holy shit!!!\"","\"You grow up to be this handsome???\"","\"How dare you! Are you doubting Sister Tong's family genes?\"","\"Ahhh little brother, I'm yours!\"","\"Little brother, ever considered cosplay?\"","...","Little Pink Flower: \"...\"","Studying is for Making Money: \"They're crazy, don't bother with them\"","Little Pink Flower: \"I know, sister\"","Tong Yang reopened the video and saved it.","Having not taken a vacation in a long time, Tong Yang slept half the day in her dorm. In the evening, she rode her bike to the neighboring middle school. Yang Miao hadn't started summer break yet and was still in supplementary classes.","There were no evening self-study sessions during supplementary classes, so Tong Yang took her back to their home in the city, returning to school the next day.","After the two-day break ended, the instructors at the training base gathered everyone on the field that morning to make an announcement.","\"The fourth round of the Vanguard selection will be held in the affluent district. Those eliminated in the fourth round can stay to work in the affluent district if they gain the appreciation of the wealthy.\"","\"Those eliminated in the fifth round and above will permanently obtain affluent district identification and be assigned to work for various families.\"","\"Successfully passing the sixth round of testing and becoming a 'Vanguard' allows one to bring three family members to also obtain affluent district identification. The Unified Government will transfer some assets to your name free of charge.\"","In the First World, affluent district identification was the ultimate symbol of authority.","People from the slums could enter the commoner district through tests and proving their worth. However, for commoner district residents to enter the affluent district, the only path was to participate in the \"Vanguard\" selection and persist until at least the fourth round.","Yet becoming a \"Vanguard\" was entirely different from the commoner district tests. First of all, even becoming a new recruit and entering training was a peak most ordinary people could never reach, let alone passing the many rounds of selection.","But the fourth round would be held in the affluent district!","As long as they performed outstandingly in the fourth round and gained the appreciation of the wealthy, they could stay in the affluent district even if eliminated!","Elimination in the fifth or sixth round meant directly obtaining affluent district status. Passing the sixth round even granted them assets. This was truly a chance for a meteoric rise!","Everyone in the First World knew that the affluent district possessed eighty percent of the Earth's resources. They had the right to enjoy priority access to all the planet's resources.","\"Excellent!\"","\"Finally made it!\"","The new recruits were thrilled. This was their only chance to defy fate, and now it was just within reach!","Xue Wei said, \"I know you're excited, but don't celebrate too soon. The upcoming selection is exceptionally brutal. Last year, fewer than a hundred passed the fourth round, only seventy passed the fifth, and only two passed the sixth round to become 'Vanguards'.\"","Those who had successfully passed the third round weren't discouraged by his words. They tacitly believed that one of the two who would pass the sixth round and become a \"Vanguard\" would be one of them.","The training base arranged vehicles to transport them to the affluent district.","Nighttime. The vehicle traveled along a quiet road.","A gentle pitter-patter of rain tapped against the glass. Distant lights made the raindrops look multicolored.","Within the rain and mist, a city of towering buildings and dazzling lights appeared not far away.","The sky was illuminated by neon lights, resembling a city that never slept.","Headlights flickered in the rain. Small aircraft flew at low altitudes, patrolling the streets in an orderly manner like patrol officers.","This was a city straight out of the future.","\"It's only past eight, why isn't there a single car on the streets?\"","Someone in the vehicle asked in confusion.","Xue Wei said, \"They don't use this road.\"","Tong Yang looked at the sci-fi movie-like buildings outside the window, a heavy stone pressing on her heart.","The things she had seen in the commoner district already seemed beyond belief. She never imagined the affluent district would feel as if it existed in a different dimension from the other two places.","On the road they traveled, they hadn't seen a single person. Even upon arriving here, they weren't taking the same paths as the wealthy, so the scenery they saw was naturally different.","The driver took a small path, bringing them to the back of a circular building.","They entered the circular building one after another. Everything they saw along the way could be described as breathtaking.","Doors that change shape at will, murals that move freely, magnesium lights that adapt to natural light... Even a seemingly ordinary button that fell to the ground could transform into a miniature car and swiftly disappear from sight.","Stopping outside a room, Xue Wei said, \"Rest for the night. I'll take you into the fourth round selection tomorrow at ten in the morning.\"","Entering the room, rows of white hibernation pods lay neatly inside.","Xue Wei said, \"The hibernation pod will adjust you to your optimal state. Rest well.\"","The next day, ten o'clock.","Everyone, in high spirits, was led to the center of the circular building.","It was a massive open-air platform. Audience seating surrounded it on all sides, with several LED screens on both sides.","The fourth-round selection will be held here and will take the form of arena-style matches. As you can see, in two hours spectators from the affluent district will be admitted to watch the entire selection process. Next, I will announce the rules for the fourth round.","First, the fourth round will be conducted in a one-on-one arena format, using a single-elimination system. Before entering the affluent district, you will already have received your identification number. The live audience can randomly select two sets of numbers within the assigned number range for a head-to-head match.","Second, the arena competition has two elimination rules. First, when a clear winner emerges in a PK, the live audience can bid to purchase the losing party, causing their elimination. The eliminated person will also become the auctioneer's property and remain in the affluent district. Second, when a clear winner emerges in a PK, if the losing party's injury assessment reaches eighty percent, they are eliminated.","Tong Yang frowned deeply. Let's not even talk about the first elimination method. The second method requires an injury assessment of eighty percent? That's practically beating someone half to death before they're eliminated?","She knew both the First World and the Parallel World were messed up, but she hadn't realized they were equally sick.","The rules for the fourth round of selection seemed entirely designed for the amusement of the wealthy, treating the participants as commodities. Buying the right to eliminate the loser, making them the property of the auction winner—it was utterly disgusting.","\"Instructor, is voluntary elimination not allowed?\"","Xue Wei replied, \"It is allowed if the injury assessment exceeds eighty percent. However, those eliminated this way will be repatriated to the civilian zone after the game ends.\"","\"What?\"","\"They actually get sent back to the civilian zone?\"","Xue Wei continued, \"Third, if the difference in injury assessment between the two parties reaches forty percent or more—for example, one at ten percent and the other at fifty percent—the party with the lower percentage will face elimination by the audience. If no audience member is willing to bid for your elimination right, and your injury assessment exceeds eighty percent, you can choose to eliminate yourself or continue the match.\"","\"If you choose to continue, and no one bids for your elimination right midway, you can only opt for voluntary elimination once your injury assessment reaches ninety percent. If your injury assessment exceeds ninety percent and you still choose to persevere, and during that time, no one bids for your elimination right, then only death counts as voluntary elimination.\"","\"I must remind you, in previous years, some audience members deliberately waited until the injury level reached over ninety percent before bidding for the elimination right. I hope you can make the right choice.\"","Tong Yang clenched her teeth. Deliberately waiting until the injury assessment is over ninety percent to bid? Isn't that like dangling a bone in front of them, deliberately stringing them along?","Persisting even after injuries exceed ninety percent, where only death counts as voluntary elimination.","That means, some people cling to hope, persisting until their injuries reach ninety percent. If no one in the audience bids for their elimination right, only death ends the match.","These bastards from the First World are no better than those from the Parallel World.","Or perhaps, the people sitting in the audience today originally come from both worlds.","Xue Wei went on, \"Of course, if no one initiates an auction, I suggest you opt for voluntary elimination immediately after your injury assessment reaches eighty percent.\"","After explaining the rules, the area they were in slowly descended, entering an underground space.","Everyone discussed the fourth round of selection, strategizing on how to win the audience's favor so they could remain in the affluent zone even after losing.","Tong Yang walked over to an electronic screen in the underground space and sat down, not participating in the discussions.","She realized something: Xue Wei hadn't mentioned when the selection would end. The arena format, with the audience choosing at random, seemed to have no other restrictions. Therefore, those who won in the arena could very likely participate repeatedly, multiple times.","Otherwise, this round would only eliminate half the participants.","Time ticked by. The electronic screen randomly refreshed their numbers, unrelated to rankings from previous rounds. Tong Yang was number 101.","People gradually filled the audience seats. Over an hour later, a woman's voice came over the broadcast, explaining the rules to the live audience.","Once the injury assessment difference reached forty percent, they simply needed to press the button on the right side of their seats to gain auction rights. If there was no competition, they could purchase the eliminated participant at the starting price based on the comprehensive ranking from the first three rounds. If there was a bidding war, the highest bidder would win.","The host whipped up the atmosphere. Simultaneously, the electronic screen in the underground space displayed a live feed of the audience seating and the arena.","Next, we will randomly select a member of the audience to choose the numbers of the participants for the upcoming arena match.","The large screen scrolled rapidly before stopping on a woman with deep red hair.","The woman looked toward the camera, boldly blowing a kiss, and said, \"Today, nine and six are my lucky numbers. I choose contestant number nine and contestant number sixty-six.\"","\"Excellent! This stunningly beautiful lady has chosen contestants number nine and number sixty-six. Now, please let the two contestants prepare.\"","Contestants nine and sixty-six walked to the designated area, standing between two machines. A beam of white light scanned their entire bodies, and a voice announced: \"Body data of contestant number nine recorded.\"","\"Body data of contestant number sixty-six recorded.\"","The machines slowly lifted them. A circular opening appeared in the ceiling above, transporting them both to the arena.","At the same time, large screens on both sides of the audience displayed the injury percentages for both contestants: 0%.","The arena match is about to begin! Which contestant will emerge victorious? Let's wait and see!","\"Contestant number nine takes the initiative to attack! Wow! What sharp moves!\"","\"He blocked it! Contestant number sixty-six actually blocked it!\"","\"Contestant number sixty-six counterattacks! A hit!\"","Contestant sixty-six was clearly more skilled than contestant nine. The latter was forced to retreat step by step, his face quickly turning bruised and swollen, blood flowing from his nose.","Tong Yang looked at contestant nine's injury percentage. Several minutes had passed; he was beaten black and blue, with a bloody nose, yet the injury percentage was only 1%.","\"Our contestant number sixty-six appears to have sharp movements, but unfortunately, he hasn't inflicted much damage on contestant number nine... Contestant nine has tackled number sixty-six to the ground!\"","\"Contestant number nine has broken his opponent's arm! Contestant sixty-six's injury assessment suddenly jumps to 3%!\"","\"Keep it up! Keep it up!\"","Tong Yang frowned. A broken arm bone, and the injury value is only 3%? What exactly does it take to reach eighty percent?","\"Contestant sixty-six counterattacks! Success!\"","Contestant sixty-six seemed to gain insight from the increase in injury assessment. It wasn't just about inflicting damage to raise the value; it required causing significant trauma.","Contestant sixty-six reset his own arm, but the value on the screen didn't decrease because of it.","The only silver lining was that the injury value wouldn't decrease.","\"What is contestant sixty-six doing? He's grabbed his opponent's arm, oh my god!\"","A clear \"crack\" sound echoed in the room. Contestant sixty-six completely dislocated the other's shoulder and forcefully wrenched it backward.","\"Ah!!\"","After a scream, contestant nine's injury value skyrocketed to 10%.","Contestant sixty-six pressed his advantage, dislocating contestant nine's other arm and both legs. The injury value reached 29%.","This still wasn't enough. There needed to be at least a forty percent difference before the audience could bid for contestant nine's elimination right.","However, Contestant Nine collapsed, sprawled on the ground like a dead fish, completely unable to resist.","\"Contestant sixty-six seems to have victory in his grasp. Let's see what he does next!\"","To increase his opponent's injury value, contestant sixty-six had no choice but to inflict various injuries on him. Although contestant nine continuously wailed in agony, the injury value increased at a painfully slow rate.","Under this torment, contestant nine's consciousness grew hazy, hovering on the brink of death.","Contestant sixty-six, sweating profusely, watched the climbing value. They were still three percent short of the forty percent difference.","The host kept cheering him on. Contestant Sixty-Six gritted his teeth and drew the short blade he carried with him.","\"Using weapons in the ring is not against the rules!\" the host reminded.","Sixty-Six bent down, thrust the knife into Contestant Nine's shoulder, and dragged it downward with force. Blood splattered across the stage. He glanced at the electronic screen—Nine's injury value had increased by two percent.","He had no choice but to continue, splitting a bloody line down the arm. Flesh instantly burst open to both sides.","\"Injury assessment at 45%!!!\"","\"The injury differential between the two contestants has exceeded forty percent! Interested audience members may now choose to bid!\"","\"Any takers? Any takers?\"","The crowd watched the spectacle on the stage with keen interest, as if appreciating an elegant musical, without making a move.","\"Ah!\" the host sighed.","\"Unfortunately, no one is willing to bid for Nine's elimination right.\"","Though her words said so, her tone carried no trace of regret—instead, it was brimming with excitement.","\"The match continues!!!\""]},{"number":116,"title":"Chapter 116","paragraphs":["As time passed, Contestant No. 9's injury value kept climbing, and the enthusiasm of the on - site audience soared.","However, Contestant No. 9 had already lost consciousness under the torture. All the audience could see was Contestant No. 66 unilaterally torturing the other to increase his injury value, which had nothing to do with the ring match anymore.","What excited the on - site audience was not the competition itself, but the satisfaction of their deformed inner desires.","They wanted cruelty, they wanted bloodshed, and they just wanted to see the contestants being tortured.","The ring was covered in blood. Contestant No. 9's body was contorted in an inhuman state. The flesh and blood on his left forearm had been removed, leaving only bare bones.","The injury value of Contestant No. 9 shown on the big screen on the left was 78%. He still needed 2% more to choose to withdraw voluntarily.","\"Contestant No. 9's condition is very bad!\"","\"If his injury appraisal reaches 80% and he doesn't choose to withdraw, the game will continue!\"","Contestant No. 66 was not in a much better state. In order to end the match, he had no choice but to do so. During this period, no one in the audience was willing to press the button to let Contestant No. 9 withdraw in advance, so he had no other options.","There were indeed many psychologically distorted people in the First World and the parallel world. There were also ordinary people like Contestant No. 66. The recruits participating in the competition now were all comrades - in - arms who had spent the past year together. As an ordinary person with normal human emotions, how could he torture his comrade - in - arms without any psychological burden?","Contestant No. 66's eyes were red, his whole body was dripping with sweat, and the blade of the dagger in his palm was curled and dull.","\"This is the purpose of the United Government,\" Meng Xiao said in a deep voice, not knowing when he had walked up to Tong Yang.","Tong Yang's face was gloomy, his lips tightly pursed.","\"They're destroying humanity and becoming the United Government's cruel weapons for power and resources.\"","In the underground space, not everyone was like Tong Yang and Contestant No. 66. They observed and participated in this inhumane game. Some people were in high spirits and couldn't wait to get involved. Just like those in the wealthy area, they were enjoying this farce.","They were the weapons the United Government wanted.","\"Ding - Contestant No. 9's injury appraisal has reached 80%. Please choose whether to continue the competition.\"","The focus of the whole audience was on the unconscious Contestant No. 9.","\"Please make a response within ten seconds, otherwise the game will continue.\"","\"Ten, nine, eight, seven... three, two, one! Contestant No. 9 has not made a choice. The game continues!\"","Contestant No. 66 looked dejected and tightened his grip on the dagger. Contestant No. 9 was in a deep coma and couldn't wake up on his own. After his injury appraisal reached 90%, he also wouldn't be able to choose to withdraw voluntarily. Instead of continuing to torture his former comrade, it was better to end his pain here.","Given Contestant No. 9's current physical condition, it was impossible for him to recover with only the medical level in the civilian area.","Contestant No. 66 bent down, looked at the other's pale face, and inserted the dagger into his throat.","\"You lost,\" Contestant No. 66 murmured.","Although he didn't want to torture the other, as the winner of the ring match who passed the fourth - round selection and would obtain the wealthy - area identification, he had no other choice but to end Contestant No. 9's life as soon as possible.","\"Gurgle -\"","Blood bubbles were coming out of the slit throat, making a sound like boiling water.","Contestant No. 9's injury appraisal value kept climbing.","84%... 86%... 88%... 91%... 95%... 99%...","\"Beep—\"","Just as the injury assessment was about to reach 100%, a long beep suddenly rang out in the venue.","\"My goodness!!!\"","\"Miss Hilda has bid for the elimination right of Contestant No. 9!!!\"","The injury assessment on the screen stopped scrolling and froze at 99%.","The big screen switched to the red - haired woman. She gave a sweet smile at the camera. \"I said, No. 9 is my lucky number.\"","\"Is there anyone else participating in the auction?\"","\"Three, two, one... Congratulations, Miss Hilda! You've successfully bought the elimination right of Contestant No. 9 at the auction price!\"","Tong Yang looked at Contestant No. 9 on the ring with blood gushing from his throat. It seemed that he was on the verge of death and couldn't be saved. What was the point of bidding for him?","\"Please rest assured that our side will definitely let Miss Hilda see a perfectly intact Contestant No. 9!\"","\"I believe that the audience who are watching the competition for the first time may feel a bit confused. How can Contestant No. 9, who is on the verge of death, become perfectly intact? Please rest assured that the damaged organs of Contestant No. 9 will be replaced by bionic technology. Presumably, you all know that bionic technology is something that can replace and even surpass humans.\"","This is where the difference lies between the First World and the Parallel World. For those who are like tasteless food but a pity to discard, the Parallel World will choose to inject them with inferior genetic drugs, while the First World will use bionic technology to replace their bodies and organs.","Tong Yang felt heavy - hearted. Hilda's act of bidding for Contestant No. 9 was undoubtedly telling the other participants in the selection that as long as they held on until the end and someone was willing to bid for their elimination rights, no matter how seriously injured they were, the organizers of the competition could use bionic technology to restore their bodies and let them stay in the wealthy area intact.","After a year of training and passing three rounds of selection, the recruits who finally entered the wealthy area would not give up easily here.","Even Tong Yang wouldn't give up at this stage.","So, the following competitions would become more and more intense and cruel.","This was exactly the scenario that the United Government and the wealthy area wanted to see.","Contestant No. 9 was carried off the ring, and Contestant No. 66 also won the competition amidst the host's congratulations and went to the seat of the winning side to wait.","Tong Yang noticed the status of their numbers displayed on the big screen. For Contestant No. 9, who was eliminated by the audience but allowed to stay in the wealthy area, the number was in gold - gray. Gray symbolized elimination, while gold symbolized staying; the number of Contestant No. 66, who won the competition, was in red.","The gold - colored number represented staying. That is to say, Contestant No. 66, who won the ring competition, did not pass the fourth - round selection because of this.","The fourth - round selection didn't end just by winning the competition!","Realizing this, Tong Yang took a deeper breath.","After the first group of the competition ended, the on - site audience was immediately drawn to select the contestants for the second group of the competition.","Having learned from the first group, the contestants in the second group didn't waste any time. Every move was aimed at giving each other a fatal blow. However, their strengths were quite similar, and they fought back and forth. The injury values remained at a similar percentage all the time, which made it impossible for the on - site audience to conduct an auction. They had to fight desperately to consume each other's injury values to nearly 80%.","\"Oops, the two contestants are fighting fiercely. The difference in the injury appraisal values has always remained at around 5%. So when one of the contestants' injury value exceeds 80%, they can directly go through self - elimination or audience elimination. Audience members who are interested should get ready.\"","Finally, the injury value of the contestant on the right reached 80% first. As expected, the contestant didn't choose to self - eliminate.","\"The contestant didn't choose to eliminate! No one in the live audience has bid for his elimination right. The game continues!\"","Since the difference in values between the two sides has always been small, soon, the injury value of the contestant on the left also reached 80%.","\"She still didn't choose to eliminate! The game continues!\"","Although the difference in values between the two sides is small, as long as this difference is maintained, the contestant on the left can win with a slight advantage.","\"Contestant No. 478's injury appraisal has exceeded 90%!!! Will he choose to eliminate? If not, apart from the live audience bidding for his elimination right in advance, he can only be eliminated by reaching 100% injury (death elimination)!\"","\"Oh my god! Contestant No. 478 still didn't choose to eliminate! The game continues!\"","Two minutes later, the injury appraisal value of the other contestant also exceeded 90%. Similarly, she didn't choose to eliminate.","\"Here I need to add a rule. When the difference in the injury appraisal values between the two contestants doesn't exceed 40%, the live audience can only start the auction after one of the contestants exceeds 80%, and they can only auction the one with the higher injury appraisal.\"","The two contestants, covered in wounds, fought desperately, and their injury values increased slowly.","Contestant No. 478 looked at the constantly rising numbers. He was at the end of his rope. Suddenly, he seemed to have a surge of energy. He suddenly pounced on the other contestant and knocked her to the ground. Both of them were already exhausted. Under Contestant No. 478's all - out attack, the other contestant lost her balance and fell to the ground.","Contestant No. 478 seized the only chance. With blood all over his hands, he firmly grabbed the other contestant's neck. The choking made her cheeks turn red, the veins on her forehead bulge, and her consciousness fall into a coma.","\"Contestant No. 478 has counter - attacked successfully! The other contestant's injury appraisal is catching up! 91%, 92%, 93%... It's only 2% away from catching up!\"","\"Ninety - four percent, per...\"","\"Beep—\"","Just when the other contestant's injury value was about to catch up with Contestant No. 478, a sharp, long beep sounded in the arena.","\"Mr. Brewer!!! He bid for Contestant No. 478's early elimination at the critical moment!!!\"","\"Oh my god!!! Mr. Brewer is really an interesting person!\"","Tong Yang was stunned, and so was Contestant No. 478 on the ring.","Clearly, the other contestant was in a coma and had no ability to resist. Clearly, in just one more second, the other contestant's injury value would exceed that of Contestant No. 478. Clearly, he only needed one more second to win the game and get the chance to enter the fifth - round selection.","Just one more second.","Contestant No. 478 was forcibly pulled away from his opponent. He stared blankly at his own hands, looking dazed.","\"Hahaha...\"","\"Fun!\"","\"So much fun!\"","\"Mr. Brewer is truly a genius! Look at his reaction. It's so interesting!\"","...","Wild laughter came from the audience seats.","They were mocking the contestant who was fighting desperately and on the verge of victory. When Contestant No. 478 was about to become the winner, they blocked his way.","None of the people participating in the training had spent so much effort to reach the fourth round of the selection only to become auction items and slaves of others.","It would be all right if he lost because his skills were inferior, but Contestant No. 478 could have won.","He could have won.","\"Ah!!!\"","\"Ah!!!\"","\"Why... why...\"","Contestant No. 478 pounded the floor hard, roaring heart - rendingly. Blood flowed from the corners of his eyes and his nostrils, and his tears mixed with the blood dropped onto the ring.","He was like a trapped beast, hysterically venting his emotions.","\"Hahaha...\"","\"He's so cute!\"","\"Mr. Brewer, can you sell him to me again?\"","\"I really want him too.\"","...","They were like spectators of a play. Clearly standing on the sidelines, they were actually involved.","The venue staff carried him away. The unconscious contestant was declared the winner.","On the big screen, Contestant No. 478's number turned golden - gray, while the opponent's number turned red. The opponent was carried to the winner's seat for treatment.","In the underground space, all the contestants who had been watching the game with great interest fell into silence.","They realized one thing: if they couldn't widen the gap with their opponents in the early stage of the competition, they might also face the same situation as Contestant No. 478 later.","As recruits in the fourth - round selection of the \"Pioneers\" appearing in the rich area, they were all toys for the rich to amuse themselves.","The third group's match began.","After the host announced the start, the two sides immediately engaged in a scuffle, holding weapons in their hands and each strike with the intention of killing the other.","Even if the opponent was a comrade - in - arms they had spent a year with day and night, if they wanted to win, they had to widen the gap as early as possible, preferably disabling the opponent.","Immersed in the battle, they were like beasts only knowing how to hunt, baring their sharp fangs.","This was exactly the scene that the United Government and the rich people wanted to see.","The two contestants in the third group still held on until their injury level reached 90%. Then the losing side had their elimination right bought.","Immediately afterwards were the fourth, fifth groups...","The results were still similar to the first three groups. It seemed that as long as they held on until their injury level reached 90%, the on - site audience would buy their elimination rights.","When it came to the fourteenth group, the two contestants were in the same situation as Tong Yang.","\"Contestant No. 224's injury appraisal has reached 90%! Will she choose to continue?\"","\"Sure enough! She chooses to continue!\"","\"Ninety - one percent, ninety - two percent, ninety - three percent... ninety - seven percent, ninety - eight percent!\"","\"The injury appraisal is about to reach 99%. Will the audience buy her elimination right before it reaches 100%?\"","\"The injury appraisal is 99%!\"","On the ring, the winner stopped attacking.","Contestant No. 224 was lying on the ground, barely breathing.","As long as she held on to this point, the rich people would buy her elimination right.","The winner seemed to have the same thought, so he stopped attacking.","However, the long - awaited whistle of hope didn't sound in the air.","The winner was sitting on the ground, gasping for breath, while Contestant No. 224 was looking at the evening sky, with the sound of her gradually weakening heartbeat echoing in her ears.","That long whistle didn't sound for her.","So, she slowly closed her eyes.","\"100% injury assessment! Contestant No. 224 is eliminated!!!\"","\"The first casualty in the competition has appeared!!!\"","On the big screen, the number of Contestant No. 224 turned gray.","\"What a pity...\"","\"Such a young girl. It's really a shame.\"","\"May she rest in peace.\"","\"I thought you would bid. If I had known, I would have...\"","...","Contestant No. 224's body was put into a black body bag, and the winner walked numbly towards his seat.","After quickly cleaning the ring, the next group of matches was carried out without delay.","Sure enough, no one bought the elimination right of the loser in this round.","\"You look in a bad mood,\" Meng Xiao said.","Tong Yang looked at the electronic screen, with the corners of her lips drooping. \"Really?\"","Meng Xiao said, \"I thought you were used to it.\"","Tong Yang said, \"The reason I'm here is that I can't get used to it.\"","It's true that Tong Yang's living environment is a bit worse than that of ordinary people in the real world, but she has a legal and compliant opportunity to be respected and climb upwards.","As long as she has enough ability, she can change her living environment.","But in this place, there is probably only one Tong Yang from the first world who has climbed from the slums to her current position.","After witnessing the behavior in the rich area, some of the losers in the subsequent matches chose to self - eliminate after their injury assessment reached 80% and were sent back to the civilian area in a mess.","As time gradually came to midnight, the people in the audience were still enjoying themselves.","When a contestant with an 80% injury assessment was unconscious and unable to make a self - elimination choice, the audience once again chose to buy his elimination right.","They were deliberately tempting the remaining people. Those who chose to persevere couldn't guess in advance what their ending would be, as it was all in the hands of the audience.","Some people won the bet, and some lost.","\"Next, a live audience will be randomly selected to choose the contestants for the next group of matches.\"","The big screen kept scrolling and finally stopped on a woman wearing a white cat - faced mask.","Her seat was different from others. There was a long black table in front of her, and she was the only one around.","She rested her hands behind her head, crossed her long legs on the table. The dazzling lights shone on her, making her look elegant and pleasing to the eye.","\"Wow! Lady Slayer, you are so heroic!\"","The Slayer looked in the direction of the camera. Her expression couldn't be seen under the mask. She said, \"Thank you.\"","\"The Slayer? Why is she here?\"","\"When did she show up?\"","\"I heard she killed a lot of people in the rich area! How can she still appear here so openly!\"","\"Isn't she a lackey of the United Government? Why did she kill the high - ranking officials of the United Government and the important members of several families, but didn't get punished?\"","\"Lady Slayer is the one who can lead us forward. No matter what she does, there is a reason for it.\"","...","There were discussions in the venue.","The Slayer didn't seem to care. She smiled and said, \"Why did I kill those people?\"","\"The reason is quite simple. It's because they saw my face.\"","\"Ah! I love you, Lady Slayer!\" The host let out an excited cry on the radio. \"Everything you do is right!\"","In the underground space, Tong Yang looked complicated.","In the first world, Tong Yang has such a crazy personality, yet she has gained the adoration of so many people. No wonder the United Government can't do anything to her for the time being.","\"Lord Slayer, please select the next two contestants for the competition.\"","The Slayer pondered for a moment and said, \"Contestant No. 1 and Contestant No. 101.\"","\"Okay! Next, please get Contestant No. 1 and Contestant No. 101 ready!\"","Tong Yang gritted her teeth and cursed. This guy definitely didn't choose her number by chance. Most likely, that idiot Xue Wei told him.","Tong Yang and Contestant No. 1 stood on the machines respectively.","\"Physical data of Contestant No. 1 has been recorded.\"","\"Physical data of Contestant No. 101 has been recorded.\"","A circular hole opened in the ceiling, and the machines lifted the two of them up.","\"Phew! They're finally gone!\"","\"Since entering the training base, no one has ever won against them in a PK.\"","\"I was worried about what to do if I ran into them.\"","\"Anyway, it's great!\"","The remaining contestants for the selection heaved a huge sigh of relief.","Tong Yang had received professional training and had a relatively good learning ability. Although the real world couldn't compare to the intensity of the training base, she was still able to top the list in training and selection.","Apart from her, there was another person whose performance was equally outstanding.","The Contestant No. 1 standing opposite her was named Wen Qin. Like Meng Xiao, she came from a parallel world.","It was said that the parallel world had high hopes for her and intended to let her replace Tong Yang's current position in the first world.","For Tong Yang, she was the most threatening competitor in the training base.","Fortunately, Tong Yang never harbored any illusions. When she learned the rules of the fourth-round selection, she had mentally prepared herself for the possibility of facing Wen Qin.","\"I don't like this way.\"","As the machines were lifting them up, Wen Qin suddenly said.","In Tong Yang's impression, she was a taciturn person.","The two of them had hardly communicated with each other in the past year, but they were very in sync during team training. Compared with the chatty others, Tong Yang preferred to be with Wen Qin.","So they often trained together without saying a word.","Unexpectedly, she would take the initiative to speak. Tong Yang said, \"I don't like it either.\"","Wen Qin said, \"I don't want to fight you. I feel like I can't win.\"","Tong Yang was slightly surprised and said, \"You're very good.\"","\"I know, and you're also very good.\"","After a moment of silence, Wen Qin said, \"I don't like being toyed with by them.\"","\"Coincidentally, I don't like it either.\"","\"Let's discuss it?\"","Tong Yang raised her eyebrows. \"What do you mean?\"","\"The United Government has long noticed us. No matter which one of us is eliminated in the competition, it will be filmed.\"","\"So?\"","Wen Qin said, \"The elimination by the audience doesn't mean the end of the selection. After they are transformed by bionic technology, they will have another PK with the winner. That's the real selection.\"","Tong Yang frowned. \"How do you know?\"","\"I have a backer,\" Wen Qin said calmly.","Tong Yang looked at her suspiciously. After training together for nearly a year, she hadn't noticed that she was such a person.","\"What about the people who were eliminated before?\"","\"The comprehensive strength has been evaluated in the first three rounds of selection. Those who self - eliminated or were eliminated by death were probably those who failed the evaluation.\" Wen Qin paused for a moment and said, \"I rank first in comprehensive strength.\"","Tong Yang frowned and said, \"Where did I lose?\"","\"I have a backer.\"","Tong Yang: \"...\"","\"You're amazing.\"","\"I don't want to waste time and energy. The one who touches the other first is the winner. We should quickly widen the injury difference to forty percent. The United Government won't let us undergo transformation, so they'll soon make a decision.\"","\"Why?\" Tong Yang was puzzled. It sounded like bionic technology was more powerful than humans.","\"As of now, bionic technology can't replace top - notch humans.\"","Tong Yang fell silent and then said, \"It seems that The Slayer deliberately grouped us together. We'll probably face each other in the real selection.\"","\"The Slayer can't interfere in this. The United Government won't let us be eliminated in the fourth round.\"","As long as they don't PK against each other, they'll definitely not lose.","Tong Yang thought for a while and nodded. \"Okay.\"","Finally, Tong Yang commented, \"You really have a strong background.\"","\"Born into a wealthy and influential family. Don't envy me.\"","Tong Yang laughed. She was an interesting person. It was a pity that they lived in a parallel world.","The machine finally sent them to the ring.","\"Please get ready, Contestant No. 1 and Contestant No. 101. The competition officially begins!\"","Tong Yang said, \"Your condition is a bit unreasonable.\"","\"What?\" Wen Qin asked in confusion.","\"Whoever touches the other first is too easy.\"","\"How so?\"","\"Let me ask you, what's three plus two minus five?\"","Wen Qin was stunned for a second. \"It equals...\"","Tong Yang put her hand on Wen Qin's shoulder. \"You're too slow. It equals zero.\"","Wen Qin: \"...\"","\"...Damn it! I should have said whoever inflicts damage on the other first.\"","\"Do it again?\"","\"No, I'll admit defeat. Hit me harder.\" Wen Qin said.","\"Okay.\"","Host: \"...\"","Show some respect for the competition rules!!"]},{"number":117,"title":"Chapter 117","paragraphs":["\"The match between the two contestants is incredibly intense!\"","\"Contestant 101 is moving so fast! She actually managed to inflict injuries amounting to 40% on Contestant 1's damage assessment in just a few short minutes!\"","\"Attention, friends in the live audience! The difference in the contestants' damage assessments has now reached forty percent, making the elimination right available for auction!\"","\"Of course, our audience friends are very patient and won't easily interrupt the battle between the contestants. Can Contestant 1 stage a comeback in the remaining time? Let's wait and see...\"","\"Beep—\"","A long siren sounded across the arena after Wen Qin's damage assessment reached forty percent.","\"Mr. Armand Brad has purchased the elimination right for Contestant 1!!!\"","Tong Yang stood up, finding the name familiar. She looked up at the large screen; the man had a pair of blue eyes.","She remembered. This was Tang Li's fleeting romantic encounter on Hake Island.","At the same time, Tong Yang spotted a familiar face to his right.","A woman wearing an elegant green cheongsam, her long hair cascading over her shoulders.","\"Wow! The lady next to Mr. Armand is so beautiful,\" the host exclaimed.","The woman looked at the camera and smiled slightly.","Armand put his arm around the woman's shoulders and said with a laugh, \"She is my beloved.\"","Tong Yang: \"...\"","Hold on, others might not know who she is, but doesn't Armand know?","The woman sitting to his right was none other than Tang Li, who had entered the First World on a special mission.","However, Armand was someone from the First World Tong Yang's side, and Tang Li knew the boundaries.","\"What a pity,\" Tang Li sighed.","\"Hmm? What is it that makes you, this beautiful lady, feel regret? Can't Mr. Armand fulfill your wishes?\" the host teased.","Tang Li said, \"I was very interested in Contestant 101. I feel rather unwilling that I didn't get the chance to buy her elimination right.\"","Armand said, \"Contestant 101 didn't give us the opportunity.\"","\"No matter, Contestant 101 would surely be very willing to get to know both of you.\"","Tong Yang couldn't be bothered to listen to their duet. Tang Li's appearance by Armand's side proved this person was not a threat. She bent down to look at Wen Qin on the ground, realigned the dislocated bones in her body, and then helped her up.","\"Thanks,\" Wen Qin said.","\"Don't mention it.\"","Unlike the fierce battle before, the two were now as calm as if they had just shared a meal. Without needing staff reminders, they each walked back to their own seats.","Wen Qin was also the only person so far who retained free mobility after being eliminated by an audience member.","\"Boring.\"","The killer wearing a white cat-face mask said lazily.","She crossed her arms in front of her chest, lost interest in the following matches, and closed her eyes for a nap.","The fourth round of selection involved over seven hundred participants and more than three hundred arena matches. One day was definitely not enough; the arena matches continued for nearly half a month.","The audience never tired of it, constantly seeking entertainment while watching the matches.","The First World's Tong Yang did not appear after the first day's matches.","During this period, the winners and those eliminated by the audience remained in the affluent area. Apart from not being allowed to go to other areas, they could move freely within the venue.","Tong Yang wasn't interested in the subsequent matches. With the information Wen Qin had provided, she was almost certain she could pass the fourth round of selection.","These days, Tong Yang spent her time wandering around the venue when she had nothing to do, trying to find a chance to meet Tang Li. However, as the audience seating and internal passages were not connected, she hadn't been able to meet her.","August 17, 2026, the final day of the arena matches.","Tong Yang watched a few matches from her seat. Contestants voluntarily eliminating themselves were becoming more and more common, with the live audience occasionally taking pity and auctioning for a contestant's elimination right.","Seeing Tang Li and Armand leave their seats together in the audience section, heading in the direction of the restrooms.","After waiting a moment, Tong Yang followed.","\"Ali, I'll wait for you outside.\"","Tong Yang walked near the restroom area and saw Tang Li and Armand standing at the end of the corridor.","Armand leaned down and kissed Tang Li's forehead, reluctantly letting go. He nodded towards Tong Yang before leaving, giving them space.","\"Looks like you're doing alright,\" Tang Li said with a smile.","Tong Yang walked up, momentarily speechless. \"Don't be sarcastic. While you were enjoying fine food and drink in the affluent district, I was still eating instant noodles that cost one-fifty a pack in the slums.\"","Tang Li was shocked. \"That's something people eat?\"","Tong Yang's face darkened. \"Don't push your luck.\"","Tang Li chuckled, sighing, \"Long time no see. You've become much more mature.\"","Tong Yang said, \"I'm in a very bad mood right now, I don't want to chat.\"","Tang Li laughed helplessly. \"It's not my fault. Wu Pingxue said some of his men were in the wealthy district, so he sent me over. Who knew? Before I could even begin to act, I ran into Armand.\"","Speaking of Armand, Tong Yang couldn't help but ask, \"You and him...\"","Tang Li feigned a helpless sigh and said, \"He knows both our identities and what we look like. He threatened that if I didn't cooperate, he would expose us to the United Government. For the sake of our safety, I had no choice but to pretend to go along.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Pretend? You looked like you were enjoying it.\"","\"I didn't expect... he's such a gentle man. A pity...\" Tang Li shook her head. \"But, having a taste isn't bad either.\"","Tong Yang wasn't entirely sure what adults meant by \"having a taste,\" but it definitely wasn't just about eating.","\"Alright, let's talk business,\" Tong Yang said.","Tang Li's expression turned more serious. \"We can't wait until 2028.\"","Tong Yang's agreement with the First World's Tong Yang was set for 2028.","\"Why?\" Tong Yang asked.","The relationship between the First World and the parallel world has become extremely tense. With the help of the parallel world, Mi Qi and the people in the slums have built underground shelters. Fewer and fewer people are dying from the bombings. The First World's plan to reduce the population and develop magnetic field energy has failed.","Tang Li's expression was grave as she continued, \"They have discovered the secret of the time dislocation. Since the magnetic field energy in the real world hasn't been developed, and you, as the temporal anchor point, are within the time dislocation, it's possible to use the parallel world's magnetic field energy as an anchor point for a cycle.\"","It was only a matter of time before they discovered this, so Tong Yang wasn't surprised.","Tang Li went on, \"The First World and the Parallel World have discovered another spacetime where a time dislocation exists, and have calculated that the time dislocation will completely disappear on May 28, 2027.\"","May 28, 2027, the same date as Tong Yang's death on the original timeline in 2024.","\"The First World and the Parallel World have no intention of going to war with each other; it would only result in mutual destruction. So, they have set their sights on the Real World after May 28, 2027. Whoever obtains the Real World's magnetic field energy first will become the undisputed overlord. Both the Real World and you will be sacrificed.\"","The corridor fell silent. Tong Yang's heart sank to the depths.","\"Tong Yang, there are many ways they could kill you. We cannot resist.\"","Tong Yang understood her meaning. The technological level of the First World and the Parallel World had left them far behind. When the time came, even if Tong Yang had defenses of iron, she would be hard-pressed to escape death. The real world, devoid of magnetic field energy, would surely be the first to fall.","Tong Yang said solemnly, \"Therefore, we absolutely must achieve our goal before May 28th, to make the magnetic field energy disappear.\"","Tang Li nodded. \"That's right.\"","Tong Yang said, \"That's almost impossible to achieve.\"","Tang Li lowered her eyes. \"Perhaps it can be done.\"","\"Really?\"","\"Mhm. The prerequisite is that your 'game' with the Tong Yang from the First World cannot proceed simultaneously.\"","As she said this, Tang Li's expression grew complicated.","Tong Yang seemed to understand her meaning. \"So, the real world needs to abandon me.\"","Destroying the magnetic field energy likely required the use of a Time Anchor, which was why Wu Pingxue had sent her to the First World. However, her 'game' with the First World's Tong Yang would prevent the plan from proceeding smoothly before May 28th.","Tang Li had been undercover in the First World for so long; she should know that the First World could transfer the Time Anchor to another person. As long as Tong Yang cooperated with the First World to transfer the Time Anchor to anyone who shared a blood relation with her after genetic modification, she would become useless. Her game with the First World's Tong Yang would then no longer affect the real world's plan.","They only needed to exclude Tong Yang from the plan before May 28th arrived, leaving her alone to continue her game with the First World's Tong Yang.","Tong Yang pondered for a moment. \"If the plan is feasible, I have no objections.\"","Tong Yang's tone was too calm, as if the person who might be squeezed dry of her last use and then discarded wasn't herself.","This was Tong Yang's consistent way of operating.","She needed to choose the closest-to-perfect answer. Regardless of who benefited from that answer, as long as it was correct, she could do it.","Tong Yang's rationality was terrifying, yet it also inspired awe.","Before uttering these words, Tang Li had imagined many of Tong Yang's possible reactions: disappointment, anger, sorrow, or even choosing to cooperate with the First World for self-preservation. She hadn't expected Tong Yang to answer her so calmly.","Tong Yang was a person worthy of respect.","Tang Li raised her hand, pressing it against Tong Yang's cheek. \"This is only a choice when there are no other choices left. We won't let things reach that point.\"","Tong Yang moved her face away from Tang Li's hand, giving her a look of disgust up and down. \"Let's hope so.\"","Unwilling to relent, Tang Li pounced and hugged Tong Yang. \"Little sister, you're too captivating. Can't you seriously consider me?\"","\"Let go! Are you insane?\" Tong Yang pushed her but couldn't break free; the soft body clung tightly to her.","Meanwhile, at the other end of the corridor.","\"Brother...\" Wen Qin called out in a daze.","Armand Brad said impatiently, \"Don't you dare cry.\"","\"Wuwu...\" Wen Qin tugged at the corner of his clothes. \"I don't want to either, but she's just too amazing!\"","\"I noticed her a long time ago. I never expected her to be the Time Anchor! Anyway, sister-in-law is on the same boat as her. Shouldn't we stop listening to the United Government?\" Wen Qin asked, her eyes brimming with tears.","\"I heard you put on quite the act at the training base. How are you still so emotional?\"","\"I couldn't embarrass you all.\"","Armand Brad paused, then said, \"I have never worked for the United Government.\"","Wen Qin was taken aback, wiping her tears away. \"The Slaughterers?\"","\"Mhm.\"","Tong Yang and Tang Li gathered some information. With the help of the First World's Tong Yang, they had learned which families corresponded to the Twelve Gates. As for how to proceed afterward and how to destroy the magnetic field energy, Tang Li didn't know either. Wu Pingxue had only told them what they should do for now.","Aside from her, other members of the \"Spiders\" were partly in the First World and partly in the Parallel World, carrying out different tasks.","Xu Junyue and the others were also involved in the missions, but Tang Li didn't know their specific locations.","Before parting, Tong Yang said, \"If you have time, help me inquire about someone.\"","\"Who?\" Tang Li asked.","\"He Jingjing (Sister). She used to be an undercover agent in the real world. After failing, she was taken back to the First World.\"","Tang Li nodded. \"What does she look like?\"","Tong Yang opened her phone, pulled up a photo of He Jingjing, and said, \"She looks just like her.\"","Tang Li glanced at it. \"He Jingjing? Isn't she the one by Wu Pingxue's side?\"","\"Her younger sister.\"","Tang Li nodded. \"Alright, I understand.\"","Tong Yang said, \"We'll be in touch.\"","\"Okay. The plan remains unchanged for now. But you need to mentally prepare yourself in advance. Even if we need to transfer it to someone else, we won't abandon you.\"","Tong Yang said, \"That's not the main point. Just maximize the benefits.\"","Tang Li sighed helplessly. \"Alright.\"","That day, the arena matches concluded. 154 contestants were eliminated by audience vote, 81 self-eliminated, 125 were eliminated by death, and 360 were victorious.","Xue Wei did not give them any time to relax, announcing that in three days, the 154 audience-eliminated contestants would face off again against the victors in PK matches, with different rules from the arena matches.","When the 154 audience-eliminated contestants participated in PK, a single loss would result in direct elimination from the fourth round of selection. Winning the first PK match would allow them to proceed against the next victor; a loss there would still mean elimination, while a victory would mean passing the fourth round of selection.","In other words, audience-eliminated contestants could not lose at all and had to win two consecutive matches to pass the selection.","The rules for the arena victors were slightly different. If they won against an audience-eliminated contestant, they passed directly. If they lost, they entered a pending zone. After the second round of PK matches concluded, those in the pending zone would have one final PK match. Victory meant passing, defeat meant elimination.","The second PK match held no pressure for Tong Yang. After winning, she successfully passed the fourth round of selection.","Wen Qin had been audience-eliminated and needed to win two consecutive matches against victors to pass. Tong Yang went to watch her matches. Wen Qin overwhelmingly won both matches.","Within a week, the fourth round of selection ended. Out of over seven hundred participants, one hundred and twenty-eight passed.","Those who passed obtained identity credentials for the affluent district, even if they were eliminated in the fifth round.","The fifth round of selection took place in a holographic simulation scenario. Tong Yang passed smoothly. 59 people were eliminated, leaving only 69.","The sixth round of selection was the final round of the \"Pathfinder\" selection. Those eliminated became training soldiers, entering various families. Those who passed became \"Pathfinders,\" entering the United Government.","On September 23, 2026, the sixth round of selection began.","They needed to fight against—androids.","Androids were different from robots. In appearance, they were indistinguishable from ordinary people, but their physical capabilities were far superior.","The battle, lasting half a month, was extremely brutal.","Out of the sixty-nine participants in the sixth round of selection, sixty-seven were eliminated, and only two passed.","Without a doubt, those who passed the selection were Tong Yang and Wen Qin.","Everyone else, including Meng Xiao, was eliminated, suffering damage to various body organs, later restored using android technology.","The elimination rule for the sixth round dictated that during duels with androids, candidates could not sustain any loss of limbs or fatal injuries. Such injuries would require bionic repair, yet \"Pathfinders\" were strictly forbidden from using any bionic technology. Consequently, the only two to pass were her and Wen Qin.","On October 7, 2026, Tong Yang obtained permanent residency and brought Yang Miao to the Wealthy Zone.","At the same time, she transferred all the assets the United Government had gifted her to Yang Miao.","\"Sister!\"","Yang Miao jumped off the aircraft, rushing toward her with glee.","\"Sister, you're amazing! You defeated the androids! You're so incredible!\"","Tong Yang caught her and said, \"Those were just experimental androids.\"","Even so, defeating them had been incredibly difficult; both Tong Yang and Wen Qin had sustained varying degrees of injury.","\"I don't care! You're just amazing!\"","Tong Yang looked into her sparkling eyes, lightly patted the back of her head, and said, \"Keep it down.\"","Xue Wei closed the cabin door, walked up behind them, and smiled. \"Congratulations. You achieved your heart's desire.\"","Tong Yang glanced at him. \"This isn't my wish.\"","Xue Wei sighed helplessly. \"Isn't it good to have reached a milestone?\"","Tong Yang let out a cold laugh. \"It's just a milestone. It’s not worth celebrating.\"","\"You're too greedy,\" Xue Wei remarked.","Yang Miao asked curiously, \"Sister, do you have a wish? I can help you grant it.\"","\"You?\" Xue Wei scoffed, poking her forehead. \"What can a little brat like you do?\"","\"None of your business!\" Yang Miao glared at him, then continued asking Tong Yang, \"Sister, tell me. I'll work hard to make it happen for you!\"","Tong Yang said, \"You don't need to know.\"","Yang Miao froze slightly, understanding Tong Yang's meaning.","She didn't need to know because Tong Yang's affairs had nothing to do with her.","Sister had said that she would leave one day.","Yang Miao lowered her head dejectedly and mumbled, \"I just wanted to help you.\"","\"Not needed,\" Tong Yang replied.","Yang Miao’s mouth turned down, her eyes reddening.","\"Let's go. I'll take you to buy a couple of outfits.\"","Yang Miao’s eyes lit up instantly. \"Thank you, Sister!\"","Xue Wei watched them, shaking his head in resignation.","After the selection ended, she and Wen Qin did not go directly to the United Government. Over the past year and the final few months of selection, they had only rested for two days, so the United Government granted them permission to report one week later.","The Wealthy Zone was filled with towering skyscrapers and immense luxury.","Here, most humans didn't need to work; the labor force had been replaced by androids.","That evening, the two of them ate at a restaurant.","Aside from the owner, everyone in the restaurant was an android.","Sitting by the window, the city lights were a blur of dappled colors.","\"Sister, it's so beautiful here,\" Yang Miao marveled.","The restaurant was on the forty-seventh floor; looking down, one could see the entire surrounding environment.","\"Is it?\" Tong Yang said, lacking interest.","Yang Miao said, \"As long as we live here, we won't lack for anything.\"","Tong Yang's expression was indifferent. \"That's good, then.\"","Yang Miao lay on the table, observing Tong Yang's expression. \"Sister, now that you've become a 'Pathfinder' and work for the United Government, does that mean you can stay here?\"","Tong Yang raised her eyes to look at her. \"No.\"","Regardless of whether her plan succeeded, Tong Yang would certainly not remain in the First World.","\"Why?\" Yang Miao sat up straight abruptly, staring at her with wide eyes.","Tong Yang frowned slightly. \"Yang Miao, I told you from the very beginning. I will leave sooner or later.\"","Yang Miao pursed her lips and hung her head. \"Why? Do you not like it here?\"","\"No.\"","\"But it's beautiful. It's the most beautiful place in the world.\"","Tong Yang was noncommittal. \"Maybe I just don't like beautiful things.\"","\"You're lying!\" Yang Miao shouted angrily.","Tong Yang had no patience for comforting a child. \"Enough. I don't want to discuss this topic. I will do everything I promised you. The assets in the Wealthy Zone have already been transferred to you.\"","Yang Miao’s eyes gradually turned red with anger. \"So annoying! I don't want any of that!\"","She let out a low growl, and at the same moment, a loud bang rang out. An android carrying food had suddenly smashed its tray violently against the wall.","The metallic crash against the wall drew everyone's displeased gazes.","The owner, who had been dozing behind the counter, woke with a start and hurriedly told the crowd, \"I'm so sorry, the server isn't functioning well. Your meals are on the house today, please don't mind this.\"","The android stood where it was, its expression ferocious, staring straight at Tong Yang.","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes, murmuring, \"Do androids lose control, too?\"","The owner took the android to the back kitchen and had someone clean up the food scraps. The restaurant returned to silence.","Tong Yang withdrew her probing gaze and looked back at Yang Miao.","A streak of bright red caught her eye. Yang Miao pulled out a few tissues to wipe the blood flowing from her nose, looking up at her with a guilty expression.","Tong Yang froze. The last time Yang Miao had a nosebleed for no reason was at the training base, after a conflict with a boy in her class.","If she remembered correctly, the boy had been holding a bionic doll.","At that time, the doll also seemed to have made an unusual movement.","\"Sister...\" Yang Miao called out cautiously, looking uneasy.","Tong Yang remained composed. \"Stop the bleeding first, go wash your face. After we eat, I'll take you to the hospital.\"","The medical standards in the Wealthy Zone were quite advanced; combined with bionic technology, they could almost bring the dead back to life.","Yang Miao shook her head immediately. \"No! I'm fine! I'm not going to the hospital!\"","Her eyes were filled with panic, terrified that Tong Yang would take her there.","Tong Yang watched her in silence, then asked, \"I don't think I've ever asked you—where are your biological parents?\"","When she met Yang Miao, the girl had been living with a woman who had been dead for a long time, treating her as her mother.","Later, she learned that Yang Miao simply recognized anyone willing to give her food as \"Mom,\" and that woman wasn't her real mother.","Yang Miao shook her head, her gaze unfocused, daring not to meet Tong Yang's eyes. \"I-I don't know. I've never seen them. They must be dead.\"","Tong Yang looked at her with a complex expression. \"If you want to hide something, try to hide it a bit better. Don't make it so full of holes.\"","Yang Miao looked up in fear. \"I-I...\"","Tong Yang lowered her eyes and said nothing.","After a few seconds of silence, Tong Yang asked, \"Are you full?\"","Yang Miao nodded timidly. \"I'm full.\"","\"Let's go, then.\"","They left the dining area and walked down the street, one after the other.","The place wasn't far from where they lived, so Tong Yang decided to walk home.","On the way, neither spoke a word.","Tong Yang always walked fast. In the past, Yang Miao loved to hold her hand and walk alongside her, but today, for some reason, Yang Miao lagged a few steps behind, wanting to catch up but not daring to.","Passing a supermarket, Tong Yang stopped. \"There are no toiletries for you at home.\"","Yang Miao paused, then said in a muffled voice, \"I brought some.\"","\"Okay.\"","Tong Yang didn't say anything else and continued walking.","\"Sister!\"","After a moment of internal struggle, she suddenly grabbed Tong Yang from behind.","Tong Yang turned sideways and asked, \"What's wrong?\"","Yang Miao mumbled, \"Don't be angry.\"","\"I'm not angry,\" Tong Yang replied.","Yang Miao looked up, studying her expression. \"Do you think I'm really stupid?\"","Tong Yang didn't deny it. \"A little bit. So?\"","\"I can tell you who my biological parents are.\""]},{"number":118,"title":"Chapter 118","paragraphs":["The room was silent. Tong Yang and Yang Miao sat facing each other on the sofa.","\"Sister, you might not believe what I'm about to say, but I'm really not lying to you,\" Yang Miao said anxiously.","Tong Yang glanced up at her and said, \"I heard the child of the first-generation android and a human had its body... pulverized.\"","Yang Miao hurriedly explained, \"That's not true. My mother sent me to the slums long ago. I've lived there since I was little.\"","\"Is that so,\" Tong Yang mused.","Yang Miao claimed to be the child born of a first-generation android and a human. While Tong Yang found it surprising, it also made a certain sense.","Hiding her in the slums wouldn't be easily discovered. Even if she could unintentionally control other androids, the slums were a place where electricity was a rarity, let alone androids, so no one would have been able to uncover her identity.","Yang Miao said, \"Sister, I'm really not lying. I am...\"","\"I know. I believe you're not lying to me.\"","\"Really?\" Yang Miao asked in surprise.","\"Mhm.\"","As if remembering something, Yang Miao's expression gradually grew uneasy. \"Sister, can you promise not to tell anyone else? My mother said my identity must not be known by others, or it could bring fatal danger.\"","\"Then why did you tell me? If you hadn't said anything, I wouldn't have asked,\" Tong Yang replied.","Yang Miao smiled shyly. \"Because you saved me, sister. So you wouldn't hurt me.\"","Tong Yang neither confirmed nor denied this, simply stating, \"I won't tell anyone about your identity.\"","\"Thank you, sister.\"","Tong Yang thought for a few seconds before asking, \"Do you know you've inherited the ability to control other androids?\"","Yang Miao nodded. \"I know.\"","\"Since when?\"","\"Since I was little. I hadn't even come into contact with androids back then. I just felt I could control them.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"Why do you get nosebleeds?\"","Yang Miao wrinkled her nose. \"I don't know.\"","\"Does it only happen after you control an android?\"","\"Yeah, it's strange. Besides the nosebleed, there's no other discomfort.\"","Tong Yang thought for a moment. \"Is it related to the number of androids you control?\"","Yang Miao carefully recalled before answering after a long pause, \"I don't know. I've only ever controlled one android at a time.\"","Even if first-generation androids could control others, as their descendant, Yang Miao had inherited a portion of that ability. However, being half-human naturally imposed limitations. The nosebleeds after each instance of control were her body suffering a backlash.","Tong Yang said, \"From now on, don't control androids unless absolutely necessary. Your body won't be able to withstand it forever.\"","Yang Miao nodded. \"I understand, sister.\"","Yang Miao's identity was ultimately unimportant to Tong Yang. It had no bearing on Tong Yang's plans, nor on the plans for the real world.","A week passed quickly. Yang Miao was enrolled in a middle school, staying in the dormitory during the term and only returning home on holidays.","On October 15th, Tong Yang entered the United Government building, led by Xue Wei.","\"Let me remind you, newcomers are usually assigned elsewhere to adapt for a period of time,\" Xue Wei said.","\"What kind of place?\" Tong Yang asked.","Xue Wei replied, \"It's not certain. Generally speaking, some families will actively seek to recruit you. 'Pioneers' hold a very high status. It's an opportunity for them to build connections.\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"I see.\"","That didn't seem so bad. It might even be a chance to gather some information.","Xue Wei stopped with her at a corridor intersection, looking down one particular passageway. \"That direction leads to the 'Pioneer' sector. I don't have clearance to enter. Wen Qin is already there. Go on by yourself.\"","\"Mhm.\"","Tong Yang turned and walked into the passageway.","Tang Li had told her that, at this stage, what Wu Pingxue wanted them to do was integrate into upper-class society and continue gathering intelligence.","Tong Yang walked forward alone. Before long, she saw an open room.","Wen Qin was sitting inside. Hearing footsteps, she looked up.","\"You're here,\" Wen Qin greeted.","\"Mhm,\" Tong Yang acknowledged with a nod.","\"Which family do you plan to cooperate with?\"","\"Cooperate?\" Tong Yang's brow furrowed slightly. \"Isn't it about who actively recruits us?\"","Wen Qin looked at her. \"You don't know?\"","\"Know what?\" Tong Yang was puzzled.","Wen Qin said, \"Many families are actively trying to recruit us. We have to choose for ourselves.\"","Tong Yang raised her eyebrows in surprise. Having gone through the fourth round of arena matches, she had assumed the affluent district wouldn't give them a second glance. In their eyes, it was probably just an entertaining performance.","As if guessing Tong Yang's thoughts, Wen Qin continued, \"Don't even mention those who participated in the fourth round of selection. In their eyes, there's a complete difference between regular trainees and 'Pioneers.' Otherwise, why do you think The Slayer can be so brazen, yet the United Government can't do anything about her?\"","Tong Yang knew the status of 'Pioneers' was high in both the First World and the Parallel World. It was just that, having grown accustomed to the arrogance of the upper class, it was somewhat hard to imagine.","Tong Yang asked, \"What do you mean by 'cooperate'?\"","Wen Qin explained, \"Some factions in the affluent district have their own jurisdictions to manage, related to androids. Since all first-generation androids were destroyed, the remaining ones are all controlled by humans. Although they were shielded from human emotions during subsequent manufacturing, some androids have a strong capacity for imitation. They can learn the behaviors of everything around them. Therefore, androids with varying degrees of awakened consciousness occasionally appear.\"","\"So?\"","\"Our first assignment is to cooperate with some families to destroy all androids with awakened consciousness.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"Since they can be controlled by humans, there should be a unified energy terminal. Why can't commands be issued through that terminal to destroy them?\"","Aircraft, androids, and game programs all had an energy terminal to connect to the magnetic field energy.","The first-generation androids were essentially an energy terminal themselves. After they were destroyed, the United Government controlled the others through different energy terminals. Since the energy terminals are closely linked to the magnetic field energy, they should be able to control them completely.","Wen Qin was astonished. \"You even know about energy terminals??\"","Tong Yang said, \"Haven't you heard about what happened on Hacker Island?\"","Wen Qin was Armand's half-sibling and knew about Tong Yang and Tang Li's identities.","Wen Qin said, \"I heard about it. You killed a 'Pioneer' officer.\"","Tong Yang raised an eyebrow. \"That's it?\"","\"That's it.\"","\"Is the lack of information flow really that severe?\"","Wen Qin said, \"What's strange about that? The upper class is divided into many factions. They generally don't interfere with each other.\"","Tong Yang shrugged and said no more.","Having been in contact with the Parallel World for so long, the only thing Tong Yang had ever seen used to transmit information was the broadcast system. Even in the safe zones, communication was via broadcast. Electronic devices seemed to be a luxury in the Parallel World.","Wen Qin snorted and steered the conversation back on track. \"Logically speaking, after the first-generation bionics were decommissioned, the United Government artificially created an energy terminal system. All bionics should receive commands from this terminal, but for some reason, there are still bionics whose consciousness awakens and slip from control.\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang frowned slightly, suddenly thinking of something.","If we use the time anchor as an example, in the parallel world, Yan Qing, as the time anchor, can control the cycle of a magnetic energy loop. She is equivalent to an energy terminal. However, besides her, there exist other energy terminals in the parallel world capable of manipulating the cycle time, though the cycle time of the parallel world's Yan Qing takes priority.","Moreover, through the parallel world's Yan Qing, one can also see all the parallel world's humans located in the real world.","If we apply this analogy, the reason for bionics' awakened consciousness escaping control becomes very clear.","Because the first-generation bionics were not completely destroyed. The child born between a first-generation bionic and a human—Yang Miao—is still alive.","Yang Miao inherited a portion of the ability to control bionics, which is why the United Government cannot fully control them.","Those bionics with awakened consciousness are probably all subconsciously influenced by Yang Miao.","\"What's wrong?\" Wen Qin asked.","Tong Yang shook her head. \"Nothing.\"","It's just that, this being the case, Yang Miao's existence absolutely must not be discovered, or she would be doomed.","Tong Yang felt conflicted. Perhaps keeping Yang Miao in the slums was the safest course of action.","After waiting a moment, a woman led them to another room.","The spacious room was occupied by quite a few people. The Slayer, wearing a cat-faced mask, sat at the head of the table, flanked by the parallel world's Ye Huai and Armand.","Additionally, there were some well-dressed, elegantly attired wealthy individuals in suits and fine gowns, including Tang Li.","As Tong Yang and the other woman entered the room, all eyes in the room gathered on them.","The parallel world's Ye Huai wore a gray trench coat, leaning back in his chair, his gaze coldly fixed on Tong Yang's face.","Compared to the real world's Ye Huai, he appeared somewhat more aloof.","\"These are this year's two newcomers. Discuss it among yourselves and let me know once you have a result,\" The Slayer said before getting up and leaving the room.","Armand and the parallel world's Ye Huai remained in their seats.","\"Miss Yang, I'm Hilda. Very pleased to meet you. If you don't mind, perhaps we could speak privately?\"","\"Why should you speak privately? Hilda, I've had enough of this; it was the same last year.\"","\"Miss Yang, your capabilities are evident to all. We hope you'll make the right choice.\"","\"What we can promise you, others may not be able to offer. If you would honor us with your attention...\"","\"What are you all arguing about?\"","Just then, a somewhat childish voice rang out from the crowd.","Tong Yang glanced sideways. Zhan Zicheng stood with his arms crossed, chin raised, speaking arrogantly, \"I knew her the earliest, of course she'll cooperate with our Zhan family.\"","Several months apart, and Zhan Zicheng still hadn't grown a brain.","\"Yang Le, right?\" Zhan Zicheng threw Tong Yang a look seeking agreement.","Tong Yang smiled ambiguously. \"That's right.\"","\"See, I told you!\" Zhan Zicheng looked at the others triumphantly.","Ignoring the ongoing disputes, Wen Qin walked to stand behind Armand.","\"Miss Wen choosing to cooperate with Mr. Armand is hardly surprising,\" someone in the room remarked with a sigh.","It seemed Wen Qin and Armand's relationship was no secret in the affluent district.","Tong Yang abruptly looked at the parallel world's Ye Huai and asked, \"Does this gentleman also belong to a family?\"","She didn't know which world this \"Ye Huai\" before her came from. If he was from the First World, the family behind him would be the Maynard family.","After the events on Hake Island, all members of the Maynard family returned to the First World. After all this time, it should no longer be a secret, yet the parallel world hadn't pursued Maynard's \"betrayal\" any further; the matter was simply dropped.","\"Ye Huai\" looked at her, his eyes deep, and asked, \"What, are you interested in cooperating with me?\"","\"Not exactly. It's just that seeing you reminds me of a friend,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Ye Huai\" curled his lips in a cold smile. \"Is that so? I wonder which world this friend is from?\"","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes. This guy was subtly threatening her.","After all, she had a weakness in his grasp. Although he was allied with the First World's Tong Yang, there was no guarantee he wouldn't suddenly turn on her, given there were few normal people here.","Tong Yang said, \"No, it's nothing. I just felt an instant connection upon seeing you. It was merely a line for striking up a conversation.\"","\"He's backed by the Maynard family. Are you interested?\"","Suddenly, a voice came from the doorway.","Turning to look, the First World's Tong Yang leaned against the doorframe with her arms crossed, speaking leisurely.","After her words, the room's atmosphere froze. The air around \"Ye Huai\" noticeably chilled. Others sensed it, kept their eyes downcast, and remained silent.","After a long moment, Ye Huai said with a cold face, \"So what if I am?\"","Tong Yang gave a charming smile. \"It has nothing to do with the backing family. I simply want to get closer to you.\"","\"Ye Huai\" stared at her, his expression darkening.","\"Wait, you're not choosing me?\" Zhan Zicheng pointed at himself, incredulous.","Tong Yang said, \"Sorry, I forgot about you.\"","Zhan Zicheng: \"...\"","Zhan Zicheng glared at her furiously.","Tong Yang and Wen Qin each chose the families they would cooperate with. The others exchanged a few polite words before leaving somewhat disgruntled.","The First World's Tong Yang stood in the corridor, giving Tong Yang a meaningful look before turning and leaving.","She wouldn't easily interfere in Tong Yang's affairs before the agreed-upon time arrived.","\"I'm leaving first. Let's keep in touch,\" Wen Qin waved to her, standing beside Armand and Tang Li.","Tang Li and Tong Yang exchanged a glance before leaving with Armand and the others.","\"Where are we going?\" Tong Yang asked proactively.","\"Ye Huai\" looked at her icily and said, \"You are a detestable woman.\"","\"Thank you, but please don't waste my time,\" Tong Yang replied flatly.","Since it was confirmed his backing was the Maynard family, it meant he, like Maynard, was from the First World—he was the First World's Ye Huai.","The First World's Ye Huai was in a foul mood, likely not solely because of Tong Yang. He had worn a scowl even before she entered the room.","Walking in silence down the long corridor, the First World's Ye Huai directly led her out of the United Government building. They boarded a vehicle and headed elsewhere.","Throughout the journey, the two did not exchange a single word.","Tong Yang could roughly guess their destination: the location of the Maynard family.","The closer they got, the more oppressive the aura around the First World's Ye Huai became. Inside the enclosed vehicle, the atmosphere was particularly tense.","Tong Yang remained completely unaffected, continuing as she pleased.","Finally, after driving for a while, the vehicle stopped in front of a villa on the mountainside.","\"Mr. Ye.\"","Someone dressed like a butler opened the car door for them.","\"Go in,\" the First World's Ye Huai said to Tong Yang.","Tong Yang asked, feigning ignorance, \"Aren't you coming in?\"","The First World's Ye Huai glanced at her. \"None of your business.\"","Tong Yang pushed the car door open and got out. Since her objective had been achieved, she didn't plan to waste any more time.","\"Wait a moment.\"","Just as Tong Yang was about to leave, Ye Huai from the First World suddenly called out to her.","Tong Yang turned back to look at him. \"Is something the matter?\"","Ye Huai from the First World sat inside the car, watching Tong Yang through the window. He raised a hand to cover his chest, a smile curling at the corner of his mouth.","Tong Yang felt puzzled but didn't speak.","\"How has the owner of this heart been all these years?\"","Tong Yang's breath hitched. \"What?\"","The First World's Ye Huai didn't answer her question. He seemed to be in a much more pleasant mood. He raised his hand and gestured to the driver, who started the vehicle and drove away from the villa.","Tong Yang watched the receding car with a dark expression.","—How has the owner of this heart been all these years?","The meaning conveyed by those words was all too clear.","If he wasn't lying, the healthy heart beating in his chest originally belonged to the real-world Ye Huai.","\"Please.\"","The butler stood in place, bowed to her, and made a gesture.","Following the butler into the villa, he led her directly to a study.","\"The master is inside the room. Please enter.\"","It seemed the other party had long known Tong Yang would come seeking him.","Eager for the truth, Tong Yang pushed the door open and entered.","A bright study came into view. Before the floor-to-ceiling window stood a familiar face.","Ye Tianlin sat at the desk, looking at Tong Yang with a gentle gaze.","\"Pleased to meet you. I am Ye Tianlin.\"","\"It's not our first meeting. I was outside the window the night you appeared in the Ye family study.\"","\"Is that so.\" Ye Tianlin nodded, seemingly unconcerned about Tong Yang's tone. \"I apologize for not noticing you at the time.\"","Tong Yang didn't want to waste time with him and frowned. \"Why did your son say that heart isn't his?\"","Ye Tianlin smiled and signaled for the butler to close the door.","With the study door shut, only the two of them remained in the room.","Ye Tianlin said, \"Please, have a seat. Rest assured, I have no intention of hiding anything from you.\"","Tong Yang walked to the desk and pulled out a chair to sit.","\"Then tell me everything,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Alright.\"","Ye Tianlin from the First World and the real-world Ye Tianlin were completely different people apart from their appearance. In him, Tong Yang could see some resemblance to Ye Huai.","You must have discovered that Ye Huai has organs from so-called \"parallel-world\" humans inside him, which is why he can take you through parallel worlds.","\"Yes, I discovered that.\"","Ye Tianlin said, \"That is precisely the case. He and my son, Menard, exchanged hearts.\"","Tong Yang's lips tightened into a line. \"Why? Was there something wrong with Ye Huai's original heart?\"","Ye Tianlin said, \"There was, and it was no small problem.\"","Tong Yang couldn't help but frown. \"Stop beating around the bush.\"","Ye Tianlin gave a wry smile and said, \"Once, I made a deal with Ye Huai's father.\"","\"What kind of deal?\"","\"I could revive his company, and in return, he needed to hand Ye Huai over to me for an experiment.\"","\"An experiment?\" Tong Yang said in a low voice.","\"Twenty years ago, although medical standards in the First World were advanced, they were not foolproof. I didn't want to inject Menard with genetic medicine, so I had them find a way to cure his heart.\" Ye Tianlin sighed. \"A method was found, but the risks could not be ignored.\"","Tong Yang understood the implication and sneered. \"So, you made a deal with the real-world Ye Tianlin. You gave him resources to build the White Horse Group, and he gave you his son for the experiment. Ye Huai bore the risk of death, and after the surgery succeeded, you transplanted his healthy heart into your son's body?\"","Ye Tianlin's gaze lowered. He nodded. \"Yes, that is indeed what I did at the time.\"","Tong Yang said, \"And then? Did you have a pang of conscience, regret it? So you pretended to be a benevolent father to compensate him?\"","Ye Tianlin did not deny it. \"In the years that followed, I observed Ye Huai's physical condition. For some reason, after Ye Huai's father achieved success in his career, his personality became increasingly stubborn. He wanted to stop supplying Ye Huai with the medication more than once. I did not allow him to do so.\"","Tong Yang silently watched Ye Tianlin, waiting for him to continue.","\"Often, successful people, cloaked in glory, always want to erase what they perceive as stains. Ye Huai, whom we used in our transaction, after replacing Menard's heart, was seen by his father as the greatest stain on his own life. I couldn't understand it, nor could I interfere too much.\"","So, he could only choose this method.","The development of events was beyond Tong Yang's expectations, yet it made sense.","Ye Tianlin said, \"If you have the chance, please convey a message to him for me: I am sorry for what happened in the past, but if given the choice again, I would still make the same decision.\"","Regarding the matter between Ye Huai and the First World's Ye Tianlin, Tong Yang couldn't pass judgment, nor could she dig out the First World Ye Huai's heart and return it to its true owner.","She could only, as the other said,","convey his words to Ye Huai.","Tong Yang asked about other matters: \"Why are you helping us? Out of guilt?\"","Ye Tianlin shook his head. \"My thinking aligns with Wu Pingxue's. Only when the social system completely collapses will the First World be revitalized. Otherwise, no matter how many parallel worlds we occupy, we will ultimately head toward destruction. It's merely a matter of time.\"","\"You will help us?\"","\"The existence of magnetic field energy will inevitably lead to competition and exploitation among the worlds. Immortality is the lifelong pursuit of humanity, yet truly achieving it is as difficult as climbing to heaven. Even if we fully exploit the magnetic field energy of all three existing worlds, it might not be enough. If the Third World fails, they will search for a fourth.\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"So, that means our goals align, correct?\"","Ye Tianlin said, \"You could understand it that way.\"","The Menard family held considerable influence in the First World. With his help, it would naturally be twice as effective with half the effort.","\"So, what exactly should we do? Is Wu Pingxue going to keep being cryptic?\" Tong Yang said.","Ye Tianlin said, \"If Wu Pingxue hasn't told you, he naturally has his reasons. However, you should know very soon.\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together. She had thought she could learn something from him about destroying the magnetic field energy, but like Wu Pingxue, he left her with nothing.","How could the magnetic field energy be completely eradicated from the three worlds? What must be done to separate the magnetic field energy onto another timeline?","Tong Yang asked, \"What next? What should I do?\"","Ye Tianlin said, \"You should know by now why you've appeared here.\"","\"Yes. The Unified Government wants us to help destroy the androids who have gained consciousness.\"","\"You don't need to do that.\"","Tong Yang was taken aback. \"What?\"","Ye Tianlin said, \"The androids who have gained consciousness can become our greatest asset. We must not kill them.\"","Tong Yang frowned deeply. \"How is that possible?\"","\"Your companion has already infiltrated the group of conscious androids ahead of you.\"","\"Who?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"If I remember correctly, one of them has the surname Xu.\""]},{"number":119,"title":"Chapter 119","paragraphs":["October 24, 2026, Tong Yang entered the territory of the androids on behalf of the Maynard family.","The androids, who had achieved consciousness, had established an independent space outside Gate Twelve of the slums, using a glass dome to enclose the entire area near Gate Eleven.","The glass dome operated on a program related to magnetic field energy. No external force could destroy it; it could only be deactivated by an internal command. Humans from the First World could only enter the Gate Eleven area in limited numbers.","\"Every android on this roster once belonged to the Maynard family.\"","Tong Yang took the roster from Ye Tianlin's hand—over ten androids were listed. \"I understand.\"","\"Take care.\"","\"Mm.\"","Tong Yang turned and left, joining Wen Qin and others waiting outside the dome.","Besides Wen Qin, representing the Armand family, there were some trainees who had been eliminated in the sixth round of selections. They represented their respective families, totaling no more than fifteen people.","\"Let's go.\"","\"Mm.\"","Wen Qin placed a chip in her hand into a groove on the glass dome. As if sensing it, the patterns on the dome lit up with a white light, opening a door just wide enough for one person to pass through.","\"What is this?\" Tong Yang asked.","Wen Qin said, \"A chip from a first-generation android.\"","Tong Yang nodded. It seemed her guess was correct. The reason for the androids' consciousness awakening was likely due to Yang Miao's existence.","Before coming here, she had reminded Yang Miao more than once not to reveal her identity or abilities in front of anyone. She usually listened to Tong Yang, so there shouldn't be any problems.","\"There are many slum dwellers living in Zone Eleven. Try not to expose your identities.\"","\"Understood!\"","Led by Wen Qin, they filed through the door in the glass dome and entered Zone Eleven.","As they belonged to different families and had different target androids to eliminate, they split up to act alone after entering the zone.","Zone Eleven wasn't much different from other areas of the slums, except the streets were somewhat cleaner, without the usual litter everywhere. It resembled a somewhat backward ordinary town.","Tong Yang walked alone on a quiet path, the hood of her sweatshirt up. She pulled out her phone from her pocket and glanced at the status bar—no signal inside the glass dome.","According to Ye Tianlin, Xu Junyue and the others had already infiltrated the area to prepare for the plan, but they hadn't been able to make contact due to the lack of satellite signals in the slums.","Tong Yang's purpose in entering here was to make contact with Xu Junyue's group and secretly assist them in building rapport with the conscious androids.","However, Zone Eleven was vast, and Tong Yang had no idea when she might find them.","The glass dome loomed overhead, and as dusk fell, the surroundings grew dim.","Light footsteps crunched softly on the sandy ground.","The wind blew past old houses, causing hinges to sway with eerie creaks. The area was too quiet, devoid of any sounds of living people moving about.","The oversized hood obscured Tong Yang's face. A gentle evening breeze blew, and she suddenly halted, turning her head to look at the buildings lining the street.","\"Creak—\"","A half-open door, pushed by the wind, emitted a chilling sound.","Without a moment's hesitation, Tong Yang spun around and sprinted towards the door. She vaulted up the wall, crashed through a swaying window, drew the blade hidden at her waist, and upon landing, swiftly grabbed a masked figure by the window, pinning them to the floor.","\"Whoosh—\"","A sound came from behind. Tong Yang nimbly rolled on the ground, dodging a chair flying from nearby. With a loud thud, the chair hit the wall and shattered.","Tong Yang moved like a leopard, too fast for the eye to follow, pouncing on another person. She wrapped her legs around their neck and slammed them heavily onto the ground.","\"You're asking for it!\"","A figure lunged at Tong Yang from a side room. Unable to dodge in time, Tong Yang was slammed into the wall. She hammered the hilt of her knife against the person's shoulder blade, and the arm restraining her instantly went limp.","Tong Yang flipped the person over and pressed them down, swiftly snatching the mask from their face in a flash.","\"Damn...\"","\"You really went all out!\" Xu Junyue raised her heterochromatic eyes, her tone accusatory. \"We were just messing with you, and you come at us for real?\"","Tong Yang silently pressed her head against the floor before letting go and standing up. \"If I'd been any rougher, you'd be meeting your mom down below.\"","\"You're a real beast.\"","Chu Shiyu from World A took off her mask, grumbling.","The person by the window also removed their mask, revealing a dust-streaked face. \"How did you know it was us?\"","This person was He Jingjing.","Tong Yang said, \"I didn't know at first. I knew as soon as she showed up.\"","Xu Junyue got up from the floor, pointing at herself. \"Me? Why?\"","Tong Yang glanced at her fluorescent green hair, a faint smile playing on her lips. \"Guess.\"","\"How am I supposed to guess?\"","He Jingjing, however, understood. \"Not many people dye their hair such a conspicuous color besides you.\"","Xu Junyue grabbed a strand of her hair and held it before her eyes, muttering, \"Really? I was thinking of dyeing it even darker.\"","\"Are special forces allowed to dye their hair?\"","Xu Junyue said, \"I'm not a real special forces operative. Like Tang Shuyan, I'm auxiliary personnel, just training with them for a while.\"","Tong Yang's gaze swept over the three of them. \"How did you know I was here?\"","He Jingjing explained, \"Anyone entering the glass dome is detected immediately.\"","Xu Junyue stepped forward and hooked her arm around Tong Yang's. \"It's been almost a year since we last met. Your skills have gotten even better. I thought I could overpower you.\"","During the earlier scuffle, like Tong Yang, Xu Junyue hadn't used her full strength.","Even so, being able to take down all three of them in the blink of an eye showed Tong Yang's formidable ability.","Tong Yang said, \"I passed the 'Forerunner' selection.\"","Chu Shiyu from World A exclaimed in surprise, \"What? Which round? Don't tell me you got eliminated in the third round like me?\"","Xu Junyue shot her a look. \"Don't compare our boss to you. It must have been after the third round, maybe even the sixth, becoming a training soldier.\"","Tong Yang said, \"Do you know what 'passed' means?\"","Chu Shiyu from World A: \"?\"","Xu Junyue was stunned. \"Boss, you don't mean...\"","\"Impossible! Absolutely impossible! The 'Forerunner' selection is so difficult, there's no way you could have passed!\"","\"Believe what you want.\" Tong Yang couldn't be bothered to explain.","Xu Junyue said discontentedly, \"What do you mean by that? Why couldn't our boss do it? Weren't you just taken down before you even realized what was happening?\"","\"That was a momentary lapse!\"","\"Shameless. You just couldn't beat the boss. You can't even beat me.\"","As usual, Xu Junyue and Chu Shiyu from World A couldn't go three sentences without arguing.","Tong Yang asked, \"Can the androids completely control access in and out of the glass dome?\"","He Jingjing answered, \"Pretty much.\"","\"What's the situation like here?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"It's truly bizarre! Those bionics are almost identical to humans, impossible to tell who's human and who's bionic,\" Xu Junyue exclaimed.","He Jingjing said, \"The bionics are very wary, but they get along with Xu Junyue, so our relationship with them is relatively harmonious.\"","Tong Yang nodded and said, \"The reason I and the others entered this place is to eliminate bionics whose consciousness has awakened.\"","\"I know them well! Which one do you want to eliminate? I'll show you the way,\" Xu Junyue said enthusiastically.","Chu Shiyu from World A curled her lip, \"Don't you usually call them brothers and hang out with them?\"","Xu Junyue pouted, \"Brotherhood is one thing, stance is another. I still know right from wrong on major issues.\"","Even though Xu Junyue's thought process isn't quite like a normal person's, she's probably the most ideologically sound one among them.","Tong Yang said, \"That's just the goal of the others.\"","\"What do you mean? What about you then?\"","\"Ye Tianlin said that bionics with awakened consciousness could become our allies.\"","He Jingjing said gravely, \"We need to win over the bionics living here?\"","\"Mhm.\" Tong Yang thought for a moment, then asked, \"Before entering here, didn't Wu Pingxue tell you what you should do?\"","He Jingjing nodded, \"Dr. Wu did tell us.\"","\"Dr. Wu would of course tell us,\" said Chu Shiyu from World A.","Xu Junyue said, \"He told us to find a person.\"","\"Who?\"","\"Don't know.\"","Tong Yang frowned, \"Don't know?\"","He Jingjing explained, \"Dr. Wu told us to look for a little girl around ten years old, living in the slums, probably connected to the bionics. Finding her would be enough.\"","Tong Yang fell silent for a moment, then asked, \"Anything else? Why find her?\"","\"The specific reason isn't clear. He gave us some information about the girl. We've been searching the slums these past days, but because of the bombings, most residents have gone into the underground shelters. Trying to find the girl under these circumstances is like looking for a needle in a haystack.\"","The little girl they were looking for was probably the child born to a first-generation bionic and a human—namely, Yang Miao, whom Tong Yang had taken into the affluent district.","Since Yang Miao had already left the slums, the three of them naturally couldn't find her.","The reason Wu Pingxue wanted them to find Yang Miao wasn't hard to guess. As the child of a first-generation bionic, Yang Miao had inherited some ability to control bionics. Using her, they could manipulate bionics with awakened consciousness for the use of the real world.","He Jingjing continued, \"We couldn't find the little girl. There's no signal in the slums to contact the outside world either, so we guessed it might be related to the bionics. We stayed inside the dome, trying to find a way to get close to them.\"","Tong Yang fell into thought. She didn't know exactly what Wu Pingxue wanted with Yang Miao, but it definitely wasn't on a whim. Yang Miao's existence seemed to be of great use to the real world.","\"What's wrong?\"","Seeing Tong Yang's serious expression, the three asked in confusion.","Tong Yang pressed her lips together and said, \"I know where the little girl Wu Pingxue told you to find is.\"","\"Wha... what?\"","\"Really? How do you know?\"","Tong Yang said, \"After entering the First World, I ran into her by chance.\"","\"Where is she?\"","Tong Yang didn't answer directly, saying instead, \"I need to know what Wu Pingxue wants to do after finding her.\"","Yang Miao was so obedient to her that she could reveal her identity to her without any defenses. If Tong Yang asked her to do something, she would do it without complaint. Using her to control bionics with awakened consciousness wouldn't be difficult. The hard part was that Yang Miao's body might not be able to withstand the strain. She would need to ask Wu Pingxue to explain why.","\"Right now?\"","\"No.\" Tong Yang shook her head.","With no signal in the slums, they could only leave this place and then find a way to contact Wu Pingxue.","\"So what do you plan to do?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Watch and wait.\"","He Jingjing pondered, \"Since the people who entered here with you aim to eliminate the bionics, we just need to find a way to stop them, right?\"","Tong Yang nodded, \"That's what I intend to do.\"","It was uncertain if Yang Miao could help them successfully control the awakened bionics. Before that, they naturally needed to find a way to win over these bionics.","\"Stepping in at the critical moment leaves a deeper impression,\" Tong Yang said.","\"If necessary, they can all be eliminated.\" Here, Tong Yang paused, \"You must be especially careful of a woman named Wen Qin. She's very formidable.\"","Chu Shiyu from World A and Xu Junyue spoke in unison, \"How formidable?\"","Tong Yang said, \"She's someone who passed the 'Forerunner' selection with me.\"","\"I'd actually like to meet her,\" Xu Junyue said.","Chu Shiyu from World A shook her head frantically, \"I don't want to at all!\"","Tong Yang thought for a moment, then asked, \"Besides you three, who else is involved in this?\"","Xu Junyue said, \"Chu Shiyu and CEO Ye, and that guy surnamed Tang.\"","\"Where are they?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"They're in the parallel world carrying out another mission. Oh, right, Yan Qing (Parallel World) and Liang Xi from the parallel world went with them.\"","Tong Yang looked slightly taken aback, \"Them? Aren't they worried they'll find a way to escape once back in the parallel world?\"","Chu Shiyu from World A said smugly, \"They're both under Dr. Wu's command now, obeying his every word. They would never betray him.\"","Tong Yang raised an eyebrow. Could it be that Wu Pingxue's words that day really fooled them?","It wasn't impossible. After all, they were just two students inexperienced in the ways of the world.","However, what exactly were they planning to do that they would risk involving Yan Qing (Parallel World) and Liang Xi?","\"Tong Yang, you...\" He Jingjing looked at her, biting her lip, hesitant to speak.","Tong Yang understood her unspoken words and lowered her gaze, saying, \"I haven't found any trace of He Jingjing(Sister).\"","He Jingjing's eyes fell dejectedly, \"I understand. Thank you.\"","In the following days, Tong Yang stayed in Zone Eleven and met with several bionics who had once belonged to the Menard family.","Unexpectedly, they didn't show hostility towards her because of her appearance. Things progressed more smoothly than Tong Yang had imagined.","Apart from Wen Qin, the other training soldiers involved in the operation weren't too difficult to handle. Xu Junyue's training hadn't been for nothing after all. With the help of the bionics, they could hold their own against them.","As for Wen Qin, after entering Zone Eleven, she hadn't taken any action for the time being. Tong Yang didn't know which bionics she needed to eliminate, nor was she clear about her whereabouts. Fortunately, several days passed, and Zone Eleven remained calm.","After staying for a while, Tong Yang left Zone Eleven and headed for the location where Mi Qi and Bai Sining were.","With no satellite signal in the slums, electronic devices couldn't be used to monitor their movements. After warning the three to be careful of Wen Qin, Tong Yang left the glass dome with the help of the bionics.","Mi Qi and Bai Sining's base was underground. During this time, they had been expanding the underground shelters in Tong Yang's name. The Joint Government had subsequently gone to negotiate with them multiple times, even offering them the chance to enter the civilian district, but all attempts ended in failure.","Moreover, they were stockpiling gunpowder, preparing for a possible war in the near future.","Tong Yang didn't gain much information from them. After telling Mi Qi what she knew, she returned to Area Eleven.","Wen Qin never showed up, not until the day they were supposed to gather and leave Area Eleven.","After bidding farewell to Xu Junyue and the other two, Tong Yang arrived at the rendezvous point early.","The trainees' operation had been thwarted by Xu Junyue and his group, resulting in many deaths. The survivors hid in various places, waiting for the designated time to leave.","After Tong Yang arrived at the location, the surviving trainees trickled in.","Finally, Wen Qin arrived late, acting as if nothing was wrong.","The chip to exit the glass dome was in her hand.","\"It seems everyone had similar experiences,\" Wen Qin said.","\"Those who haven't arrived yet probably won't be coming back,\" Tong Yang stated.","Wen Qin looked at the sorry state of several trainees and sighed, \"I didn't expect Area Eleven to house such formidable androids.\"","She spoke as if she had experienced it firsthand, when in fact, she hadn't appeared at all for nearly two weeks.","\"Let's go.\"","They left the glass dome, found their pre-parked aircraft, and returned empty-handed.","On the way back, Tong Yang and Wen Qin shared an aircraft.","\"Where have you been these days?\" Tong Yang asked.","Wen Qin countered instead of answering, \"And where have you been these days?\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together. \"Your real purpose for going to Area Eleven wasn't to destroy the androids, was it?\"","\"Was your real purpose for going to Area Eleven to destroy the androids?\"","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes and fell silent.","Both she and Wen Qin had come here with their own hidden agendas.","After a long silence, Wen Qin spoke up first. \"Even though you didn't show yourself, I know it was you who directed those people to sabotage our operation from behind the scenes.\"","Wen Qin knew her true identity, which didn't surprise Tong Yang.","\"You're helping the Armande family look for someone,\" Tong Yang said abruptly.","Wen Qin stiffened, turning her head to look at Tong Yang, her gaze turning dangerous. \"What did you say?\"","Her hands paused on the controls, causing the aircraft to jolt.","Tong Yang said, \"You must have known the reason for the android consciousness awakening long ago.\"","Even someone like Tong Yang, who only had a superficial understanding of magnetic field energy and the energy terminal, could guess the reason for the android awakening, let alone Wen Qin and Armande.","The lines of Wen Qin's profile tightened, her voice turning icy. \"Who told you?\"","Tong Yang chuckled. \"Wasn't it you?\"","\"Me?\" Wen Qin found it absurd. \"That day, I only exchanged a few words with you.\"","\"That was enough,\" Tong Yang said.","Wen Qin gritted her teeth and glared at her. \"Are you a monster? How could you guess that?\"","\"It wasn't difficult,\" Tong Yang replied, looking at her. \"So, the child born between a first-generation android and a human didn't die. She's in Area Eleven?\"","Tong Yang didn't want to draw suspicion to Yang Miao, so she deliberately guided Wen Qin's attention to Area Eleven.","Wen Qin said, \"How should I know? In any case, the android consciousness awakening is due to some influence. Being able to break free from the energy terminal's control must be related to the first-generation androids.\"","\"The complete destruction of all first-generation androids is beyond doubt. The only possibility is that child is still alive. Since the awakened androids are gathering in Area Eleven, that child is most likely here too.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"So? Any leads?\"","\"Don't ask questions you already know the answer to.\"","\"What about you? Is your purpose the same as mine?\"","\"Not the same. But now it is.\"","Wen Qin: \"...\"","\"The United Government should know about this. Why aren't they taking action?\"","\"As long as they continue developing magnetic field energy, they can prevent consciousness awakening. So, their action is to develop magnetic field energy.\"","Similar to the situation in the parallel world, once magnetic field energy is developed to a certain level, they can issue commands to everyone on the planet. By then, how could a child with only half-human bloodline pose a threat to them?","\"If the United Government has decided to develop magnetic field energy, why are you looking for her?\"","\"And you? Why are you looking for her?\"","Tong Yang said, \"She wasn't the purpose of my coming here, so finding her isn't an absolute necessity. But since she's so useful, having her under control wouldn't be a bad thing. It's just too hard to find her if she's only in Area Eleven or the slums.\"","\"So I chose to ask directly.\"","Perhaps because Tong Yang was being very forthright, Wen Qin stated her own purpose for this trip.","\"Developing magnetic field energy is a lengthy process. Currently, the affluent districts harbor many families from the First World. The two worlds are now at a tense standoff. If a direct conflict breaks out, the United Government will inevitably collapse. At that time, whoever holds the control over the androids will control the situation.\"","\"You're telling me this so directly. Aren't you worried I'll interfere?\"","Wen Qin said, \"Why would I? Our goals don't conflict. We can even cooperate temporarily. Didn't you make a deal with The Slayer? Finding that child benefits us both, which is why my brother didn't expose you.\"","\"Cooperate...\" Tong Yang narrowed her eyes. The internal structure of the First World's affluent districts was truly complex, but for Tong Yang, this counted as a good thing.","Tong Yang smiled. \"You make a good point. Perhaps we can cooperate temporarily.\"","\"Mhm. If you or your companions discover anything, you can tell me.\"","Tong Yang said, \"I'm only speculating that the child is alive.\"","\"To be honest, we're also speculating, but there's about an eighty percent chance she's alive.\"","The plan for two \"Forerunners\" and several trainees to enter Area Eleven to destroy the awakened androids ended in miserable failure, shocking the entire affluent district.","Especially the United Government, which gathered everyone involved in the incident at the base.","They interrogated the trainees separately and reached the same conclusion: the androids in Area Eleven were becoming increasingly powerful.","The trainees didn't know the true identities of Xu Junyue and his group, and coupled with their frequent association with androids, they arrived at this conclusion.","Tong Yang and Wen Qin also underwent interrogation. Their interrogators were Armande and Ye Huai from the First World respectively. Everyone understood the situation, so it was just a formality.","Afterwards, the two left the United Government.","Upon returning to her residence, Tong Yang immediately contacted Wu Pingxue to ask him about matters related to Yang Miao.","After listening to her account, Wu Pingxue countered with a question instead of answering: \"Do you have a lead on that child's whereabouts?\"","Tong Yang didn't deny it. \"If you plan to use her to control all androids, I'm afraid it won't go so smoothly.\"","Wu Pingxue understood. \"So you really have found her.\"","Tong Yang said, \"What exactly do you want to do? Just tell me directly.\"","This old fox was hiding who knew how many things.","Wu Pingxue said, \"Hand her over to Xue Wei.\"","Tong Yang cursed under her breath. \"I knew he was your man.\"","Wu Pingxue chuckled. \"I heard you two got along quite well.\"","Tong Yang said coldly, \"I need a reasonable explanation.\"","Wu Pingxue fell silent for a moment before saying, \"Tong Yang, if you've already found her, it means your luck is good.\"","\"What she can control isn't limited to just androids.\""]},{"number":120,"title":"Chapter 120","paragraphs":["The phone line fell into a brief silence. Tong Yang's breath hitched.","\"What do you mean?\" Tong Yang asked.","Wu Pingxue let out an almost inaudible sigh and said, \"The bionic technology of the First World is highly advanced. Some people, having experienced its convenience, apply it to themselves. But bionic technology isn't a simple replacement; it must integrate and become one with the body's entire meridian system. Tong Yang, do you understand?\"","Wu Pingxue always spoke this way, never giving Tong Yang the answer directly but guiding her to think.","Almost every time, Tong Yang could find the correct answer through his \"riddles.\"","Hearing Wu Pingxue's words, Tong Yang's expression turned to shock as she grasped some key information.","If bionic technology needs to integrate with the human meridian system to achieve seamless use and a man-machine unity, then are humans who have undergone bionic procedures still purely human?","Why couldn't Tong Yang and Wen Qin, ranked first and second in overall strength in the \"Pioneer\" selection, use bionic technology? Not only them, but none of the Pioneers had ever used bionic technology.","Why?","Bionic humans cannot replace top-tier humans, but bionic organs are certainly more powerful than those of ordinary humans. Why is the United Government willing to apply them to those who failed in the fourth round of selection arena battles, but unwilling to let the \"Pioneers\" use them?","Why?","Why was Ye Tianlin unwilling to let Maynard receive a bionic heart replacement, instead making Ye Huai take the risk to cure his own heart first, then transplant it to Maynard?","Why?","Because he understood the drawbacks of bionic technology?","Including bionic humans, can all those who have undergone bionic procedures be controlled by the first-generation bionic human?","\"Can she control everyone who has undergone bionic procedures?\" Tong Yang asked gravely.","Wu Pingxue gave a light laugh. \"Correct.\"","Tong Yang's heart felt as if a heavy stone were pressing on it. She hadn't realized Yang Miao's role was so significant.","\"Tong Yang, finding her means our plan is fifty percent successful. Even if the First World's Tong Yang stands in our way, as long as we seize the right moment, we can complete the plan without direct confrontation.\"","The implication behind the phrase \"seize the right moment\" was too grand.","As if finding the child of the first-generation bionic human would solve everything.","Tong Yang didn't ask what the so-called \"moment\" was. Wu Pingxue most likely wouldn't tell her directly.","\"What do you plan to do after handing her over to Xue Wei?\" Tong Yang asked.","Wu Pingxue didn't answer immediately, instead asking, \"Is she by your side right now?\"","Tong Yang had always appeared very rational. If she had merely discovered this person's identity, she should have agreed without hesitation to use her for the plan. Since she was asking this way, their relationship couldn't be just a passing acquaintance.","\"Answer my question first,\" Tong Yang said.","Her tone was forceful. Knowing Tong Yang well, Wu Pingxue replied, \"Hand her over to the United Government.\"","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes. \"What did you say?\"","\"She survived the destruction of the first-generation bionic humans by chance, and now you want me to hand her over to the United Government?\"","Wu Pingxue said helplessly, \"Hear me out first. Although there are risks, the United Government probably won't kill her immediately.\"","\"Why?\" Tong Yang asked.","Wu Pingxue explained, \"Bionic technology isn't used only in the First World. The energy terminal created by the United Government can only control bionic humans, not those who have undergone bionic procedures.\"","Tong Yang said, \"The United Government should know she's alive but has never sent anyone to look for her. They want to develop magnetic field energy to free bionic humans from the first-generation bionic human's control. So, handing her over to them carries significant risk.\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"The United Government isn't completely indifferent to the existence of the first-generation bionic human's descendant. The reason they haven't acted is that the First World doesn't know about her yet.\"","\"The slums are too vast. Any major move on their part would be immediately detected by the First World. Developing magnetic field energy is no small project. If they can control the first-generation bionic human's descendant, they could use her to control all those in the First World who have undergone bionic procedures if conflict arises between the two worlds.\"","After a pause, Wu Pingxue continued, \"At least until they develop magnetic field energy capable of replacing the first-generation bionic human, that child's life won't be in danger.\"","\"If we hand her over to the United Government, how do you plan to control her?\" Tong Yang asked.","Wu Pingxue said, \"It's not difficult. What I did to the First World's time anchor, I can do to her as well.\"","Wu Pingxue wasn't just spouting nonsense about easily manipulating two naive girls. He had the ability to develop uses for parallel worlds that even Yan Qing herself didn't know about.","He could make the first-generation bionic human's child serve his purposes.","However, perhaps he wouldn't need to go that far. Yang Miao would listen to Tong Yang.","That child's personality was actually quite stubborn. Even though Tong Yang had reminded her countless times that they were merely cooperating and she would leave one day, Yang Miao still held onto hope.","Tong Yang wasn't sensitive about emotions, but Yang Miao was too dependent on her.","After a long silence, Tong Yang said, \"She probably can't do what you said, control others.\"","\"You've really met her? Why do you say that?\" Wu Pingxue asked.","\"I've seen her control another bionic human. Even though it was just one person, her body couldn't handle the strain. She got a nosebleed.\"","Wu Pingxue said gravely, \"Which group of bionic humans did she control?\"","\"Which group?\"","\"One group of bionic humans is under the control of the man-made energy terminal. Another group has broken free from that control, their consciousness awakened.\"","Tong Yang said, \"The former.\"","The bionic humans appearing in the civilian zones and First District were naturally under the energy terminal's control.","\"That explains it,\" Wu Pingxue sighed. \"She is ultimately different from the first-generation bionic human. She can only control bionic humans who have broken free from the energy terminal. Forcibly controlling others causes backlash on her body, which could even be fatal. However, humans who have undergone bionic procedures aren't controlled by the energy terminal. So, she can control awakened bionic humans and those with bionic modifications without it affecting her body.\"","Tong Yang paused, then asked, \"If the energy terminal is destroyed, could she then control all bionic humans?\"","\"Yes, but that's basically impossible. Being able to control humans with bionic modifications is enough.\"","Tong Yang thought for a long time. Wu Pingxue's plan seemed feasible. Before implementing it, Yang Miao had to know. She wouldn't refuse Tong Yang—that shouldn't be a concern.","\"I can hand her over to Xue Wei, on the condition that I know the complete plan.\"","Tong Yang hated acting on half-knowledge, like a headless fly.","The plan certainly required coordination with the time anchor. Even though he knew the first-generation bionic human's child was with Tong Yang, Wu Pingxue couldn't act alone. Given Tong Yang's personality, the plan would likely struggle to proceed smoothly otherwise.","Wu Pingxue had no choice but to inform Tong Yang of the complete plan.","The situation exceeded Tong Yang's understanding.","On the weekend, Tong Yang and Meng Xiao went together to pick Yang Miao up from school.","Meng Xiao had been eliminated in the sixth round. During the battle with the android, she had sustained serious injuries, and her body had been restored using bionic technology.","After the three of them finished dinner, they returned to the apartment where Tong Yang and Meng Xiao lived.","\"Yang Miao.\" Tong Yang called her out from the room where she was doing her homework.","\"Sister, what is it?\" Yang Miao walked to the doorway, puzzled.","Meng Xiao sat opposite Tong Yang and, like Yang Miao, didn't understand why Tong Yang had gathered them there.","\"Sorry about this.\" Tong Yang suddenly spoke, raising her hand sharply to strike Meng Xiao's temple.","Meng Xiao didn't react at all. Her vision went dark and she fainted.","Yang Miao immediately ran into the kitchen. After a rustling sound, she returned to the living room holding a pile of plastic sheets and two kitchen knives.","Tong Yang was taken aback. \"What are you going to do?\"","Yang Miao said with a serious face, \"You can't kill people here without permission. We need to quickly figure out how to cut her up, pack the pieces separately, and throw them in the trash. It'll be terrible if someone finds out.\"","Tong Yang frowned. \"What on earth are you talking about? I'm not killing her.\"","Yang Miao immediately breathed a sigh of relief, put everything back, and returned to the living room.","\"Sister.\"","Watching her run back and forth, Tong Yang suddenly felt a doubt about whether she really knew how to raise a child. Whose child, upon seeing her \"commit murder,\" would specifically prepare tools to help her dismember the body?","\"Try to control her,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Oh.\" Yang Miao didn't ask why and did as she was told.","Without knowing what Yang Miao did, Meng Xiao, who was unconscious, suddenly stood up from the chair and walked toward Yang Miao's bedroom with her eyes closed.","\"What did you make her do?\" Tong Yang asked.","Yang Miao said, \"Help me with my homework.\"","\"Alright, make her come back now.\"","\"Oh.\"","Meng Xiao returned to her seat, lay her head on the table, and continued to sleep.","\"Is she an android?\" Yang Miao asked curiously.","\"No.\" Seeing that Yang Miao's complexion was normal, Tong Yang continued, \"Are you feeling any discomfort in your body?\"","\"Not at all.\" Yang Miao shook her head. After two or three seconds, she realized something and said joyfully, \"Sister, my nose isn't bleeding!\"","Tong Yang nodded. Wu Pingxue hadn't lied to her. As long as she controlled awakened androids or people who had undergone bionic technology procedures, it wouldn't affect Yang Miao's body.","Tong Yang thought for a moment, then told Yang Miao to go back to her room to finish her homework first. Afterwards, she carried the unconscious Meng Xiao to the sofa.","She sat in the living room, deciding to tell Yang Miao her thoughts after Meng Xiao woke up and left.","After resting for over half an hour, her phone vibrated. Tong Yang picked it up and saw a message from Tong Le, saying he was already on holiday and had returned home.","Although Tong Yang didn't often contact him, Tong Le didn't dare call her. He frequently sent messages on his own, reporting his whereabouts throughout the day to Tong Yang.","Come to think of it, it had been a long time since she had spoken to Tong Le on the phone.","Tong Yang walked to the window and dialed his number.","\"Sister!\"","\"Sister!\"","Two voices sounded simultaneously, one from the phone and one from behind.","\"Who is it?\"","\"Who is it?\"","Hearing each other's voices, both immediately became alert.","\"Sister.\" Yang Miao rushed to her side in a few quick steps, uneasily grabbing hold of her clothes. \"Who are you talking to on the phone?\"","On the phone, Tong Le fell silent.","\"Sister, if you're busy, I'll call back later,\" Tong Le said.","Tong Yang, not thinking too much about it, replied, \"It's fine, I just wanted to check on you.\"","\"I'm fine, sister. Take good care of yourself. Sister, you must take good care of yourself,\" Tong Le said.","\"Mm, I know.\"","After hanging up the brief call, Tong Yang looked down at the person beside her and asked, \"What's wrong?\"","\"Who is he? Why does he call you sister?\" Yang Miao was like a bristling kitten, her round eyes fixed on Tong Yang.","Tong Yang said, \"My brother. My biological brother.\"","Yang Miao's eyes widened. \"How long has he been your brother?\"","\"About eleven years. Why?\"","Yang Miao: \"...\"","\"Oh, I've only been one for a year. That's fine then, I don't mind.\"","Tong Yang glanced at her and said, \"Would it matter if you did mind?\"","\"Hehe, no, it wouldn't.\"","Meng Xiao slept for a full day before waking up, looking at Tong Yang with utter exasperation.","After seeing Meng Xiao off, Tong Yang called Yang Miao to the living room with a serious expression.","\"Yang Miao, I will keep your secret for you. In exchange, I will also tell you a secret about me,\" Tong Yang said.","Yang Miao looked curious and asked, \"What secret?\"","\"I am not from the First World,\" Tong Yang stated.","\"I know that,\" Yang Miao nodded.","\"I come from the real world, what you call the Third World.\"","Yang Miao continued to nod. \"I know that too.\"","Tong Yang narrowed her eyes. \"What else do you know?\"","\"You are Tong Yang, the anchor point of the Third World,\" Yang Miao said innocently.","Tong Yang had guessed she might have noticed clues, after all, only Yang Miao knew she had appeared almost out of nowhere.","\"What's your brother's name?\" Yang Miao asked.","Tong Yang said, \"Tong Le.\"","\"Then I want to change my name! Tong Miao? Tong Miaomiao? How about that?\"","Tong Yang chuckled. \"There's no need...\"","\"Why not?\" Yang Miao said discontentedly.","\"I've already decided. In the future, I'm going back to the Third World with you!\""]},{"number":121,"title":"Chapter 121","paragraphs":["Before this, Tong Yang had not considered bringing Yang Miao back to the real world.","Because the three worlds were parallel to each other, a person existing in the First World also existed in the real world. Two completely identical individuals could not exist in the same world, at least not in the real world.","However, Yang Miao was the child of an android and a human. Androids had never existed in the real world, so naturally, Yang Miao, as a descendant of an android, did not exist there either.","Bringing her back wasn't impossible.","Tong Yang did not immediately respond to her words, saying, \"It's not too late to decide after you hear what I have to say.\"","Yang Miao asked curiously, \"What is it?\"","Tong Yang said, \"As a descendant of the first-generation androids, you can control not just androids, but all people who have undergone androidization procedures. Because you have half human blood, your body cannot withstand the strain when trying to control androids linked to the energy terminal. Forcing control could be fatal.\"","Yang Miao nodded, somewhat understanding, and said, \"And then?\"","\"Although you cannot directly control the androids linked to the energy terminal, a portion of androids have already awakened their consciousness and broken free from that control. You can control them and others who have undergone androidization.\" After finishing, Tong Yang looked at her steadily. \"Your ability is very useful to us.\"","Yang Miao only partially grasped her meaning, but upon hearing the last part, she had a sudden realization. \"I can help you! But, in the future, you have to take me back to the Third World... no, the real world!\"","Tong Yang was not surprised by her answer.","\"Listen to me first,\" Tong Yang said.","\"Oh,\" Yang Miao nodded obediently.","\"It's great that you're willing to help us, but due to certain reasons, I must report your existence to the United Government. That means I will hand you over to them.\"","Yang Miao was stunned. \"Sis, do you want to trade me for something?\"","\"No.\"","\"Will I die?\"","Tong Yang said, \"There is some risk, but it's very small.\"","Yang Miao fell silent. As the child of first-generation androids, she was different from ordinary children. She remembered almost everything from her childhood clearly: how her parents died, how she was sent to the slums, how she managed to survive there for eleven years.","The existence of the United Government filled her with deep fear, but with her sister by her side, it felt like there was nothing to be afraid of.","Her sister was incredibly capable. There wasn't a single thing she set out to do that she didn't succeed in, like an omnipotent superhero, just like her mother, who could do anything.","She believed her sister's words and also wanted to return to the real world with her.","\"Okay, Sis, hand me over to the United Government,\" Yang Miao said firmly.","Even though her answer wasn't unexpected, Tong Yang's feelings were still complicated. Was it really good for her to trust so easily?","\"Do I need to do anything to enter the United Government?\" Yang Miao asked.","Tong Yang shook her head. \"For now, do nothing. I will try my best to secure a certain degree of freedom of movement for you, at least allowing you to stay at school.\"","Yang Miao glanced at her timidly and whispered, \"It's okay if I don't stay at school, I don't really want to...\"","Before she could finish, Tong Yang shot her a sharp look. Yang Miao immediately straightened up, putting on a righteous expression. \"I love going to school. My favorite thing in the whole world is going to school.\"","Tong Yang was speechless. How could anyone not like something as interesting as school?","\"Alright, go back to your room. I'll tell you when action is needed later.\"","\"Oh, I understand.\"","Yang Miao went back to her room to do homework, and Tong Yang also returned to her room, redialing Tong Le's number.","\"Sis...\" Tong Le's voice sounded a bit hoarse through the phone. \"Are you done?\"","\"Yes. Are you at home?\"","\"Yeah, Yang's mother and the others went out. I'm home alone.\"","\"Making your own food?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"Right...\"","Tong Le, who usually loved chattering away with her, was uncharacteristically quiet.","Tong Yang asked, \"What's wrong?\"","Tong Le asked cautiously, \"Sis, who is that child?\"","Tong Yang said, \"A girl I found, a little older than you.\"","Tong Le fell silent again. After a few seconds, he said, \"Has she been by your side all this time?\"","\"Pretty much,\" Tong Yang replied.","Tong Le fell silent for the third time.","\"Why can she, but I can't?\" Tong Le asked softly.","As if afraid Tong Yang would be upset, his tone was very gentle, without any hint of accusation.","Tong Yang said, \"It's dangerous here. You can't come. Besides, you have to go to school, and she has to go to school too.\"","Tong Le didn't respond immediately. After a pause, he asked, \"In the future, will she be my sister too?\"","Tong Yang knew he was always sensitive and sensible. She sighed and said, \"She doesn't have to be, but she will probably return with me.\"","\"Does she have no parents, like us?\"","\"Yes.\"","“Sis, you must protect yourself. I'll wait for you to come back,” Tong Le said, offering no further words—just a final admonition.","Tong Yang acknowledged. After a few seconds, she suddenly said, \"Lele, you are the most important to me.\"","More important than anyone or anything.","\"I know, Sis. You are also the most, most important person to me. I'm sorry, I'm still too little, I can't help you.\"","\"You've already helped me a lot.\"","\"Thank you, Sis.\"","Tong Yang could roughly understand Tong Le's feelings. No matter what happened, they would always be the most important people to each other. Even if equally important people might appear in their future lives, their significance to each other was unique.","On Sunday, Tong Yang brought Yang Miao before Xue Wei.","After hearing her explanation, Xue Wei was dumbfounded. \"Sh-she is the child of the first-generation androids?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Neener neener neener!\" Yang Miao and Xue Wei didn't quite get along. She stuck her tongue out at him.","\"You knew all along? So you've been keeping her by your side?\" Xue Wei asked in surprise.","Tong Yang said, \"No, I found her by chance, to throw people off the scent.\"","Xue Wei couldn't help clicking his tongue. \"Your luck is too good, right? You just randomly pick up a major boss.\"","\"You'll have to ask Wu Pingxue about that. He teleported me nearby.\"","Tong Yang continued, \"I have one condition for handing her over to the United Government: it must not interfere with her schooling.\"","\"No wonder you brought her on a Sunday. Get it settled and she goes back to school tomorrow, right?\"","\"Yes.\"","Xue Wei nodded. \"I'll try my best.\"","\"Must.\"","Xue Wei didn't delay, immediately reporting the news. The United Government took them to a base.","Entering a bright conference room, over a dozen people sat solemnly, including Ye Tianlin and First World Tong Yang.","First World Tong Yang's demeanor was different from everyone else's. She lounged lazily in her chair, her gaze from behind the mask resting on Tong Yang, its meaning unclear.","Yang Miao was nervous after all, following closely behind Tong Yang, not daring to look around.","Tong Yang, however, openly surveyed the people in the room, spotting several familiar faces she had seen in the real world.","\"Is she the child of the first-generation androids?\"","\"Correct,\" Tong Yang said.","\"What is her relationship to you?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I met her in the slums; we relied on each other since childhood. After entering the affluent district, I discovered by chance that she could control bionics, which made me suspicious of her identity. Furthermore, having recently visited District Twelve, I believe Yang Miao's existence is very useful to the United Government.\"","The people in the room exchanged glances, not immediately expressing their stance.","\"You are correct, she is indeed very useful to us.\"","Amidst the silence, First World Tong Yang spoke up.","Tong Yang glanced at her but said nothing, waiting for the others to state their positions.","\"Yang Le, revealing her identity to us is indeed a great service.\"","Tong Yang lowered her eyes, \"I don't deserve such praise; it's what I should do.\"","Things proceeded more smoothly than imagined. After the United Government conducted tests on Yang Miao's body, they agreed to the conditions Tong Yang proposed, allowing her to continue attending school, with the stipulation that her every move must be under the United Government's control.","When Tong Yang left the United Government, First World Tong Yang and a few others stood at the base entrance, quietly watching her.","Yang Miao needed to remain temporarily with the United Government under Xue Wei's care, leaving Tong Yang alone.","First World Tong Yang leaned against the wall with her arms crossed, watching her with leisurely composure.","First World Ye Huai and Armand stood on either side of her, while Wen Qin stood at the back, looking at Tong Yang with clear displeasure.","\"Just to be safe, I want to ask, is our agreement still valid?\" First World Tong Yang asked.","Tong Yang pressed her lips together. She had already learned the entire plan from Wu Pingxue. At least until \"that day\" arrived, the plan could not be disrupted.","Tong Yang nodded, \"It's valid.\"","First World Tong Yang scoffed, \"Is that so?\"","She straightened up, paced over to Tong Yang, placed a hand on her shoulder, reached around the back of her neck, and without warning, gripped her throat, forcing Tong Yang to look up.","Tong Yang did not resist. There was simply no point in resisting someone as powerful as First World Tong Yang; it would just waste energy.","\"Somehow, I feel the agreement might need to be moved up,\" First World Tong Yang said dangerously, narrowing her eyes and pulling Tong Yang closer by the neck, her cold mask almost touching Tong Yang's nose.","Even with her throat in the other's grip, Tong Yang still appeared calm and collected. When she decided to do this, she knew she absolutely couldn't hide it from First World Tong Yang. After all, strictly speaking, they were exactly the same person. Whatever Tong Yang could think of, First World Tong Yang naturally could too.","\"Is that a bad thing?\" Tong Yang retorted.","\"Yes, it is. The two-year period was the minimum time I estimated for you to possibly catch up to me. A one-sided crush is meaningless,\" First World Tong Yang said.","Tong Yang struggled to breathe, her face flushing red. \"Then why not expand the game between you and me to include others, how about that?\"","First World Tong Yang narrowed her eyes, \"Oh?\"","Tong Yang said, \"You have companions, and so do I. I may not be your match, but 'we' might not necessarily be a match for 'you all'.\"","First World Tong Yang gave a cold laugh and released her hand, \"Is that so.\"","Wu Pingxue's plan could indeed avoid direct conflict with the First World. If they could avoid it, that would be for the best. Tong Yang disliked breaking promises, but she wasn't a fool either, to overestimate her strength and fight First World Tong Yang at such a time.","As long as the plan succeeded, everything would be fine.","Tong Yang covered her neck, coughing heavily a few times. \"Well?\"","First World Tong Yang looked at her with interest and said, \"Fine, let's change the rules of the game then.\"","\"Not you and me, but you all and us all,\" First World Tong Yang lightly touched her mask. \"But in return, aside from your identity, I may interfere in any action you take from now on. As for what I'll interfere with, that depends entirely on my mood.\"","Tong Yang gradually recovered and replied, \"Alright.\"","Apart from agreeing with First World Tong Yang, she had no other choice.","Fortunately, even if First World Tong Yang discovered Wu Pingxue's plan, she couldn't stop it.","Just as Wu Pingxue predicted, the United Government did not harm Yang Miao, nor did they reveal her identity to the outside world, allowing her to return to school as usual.","Tong Yang remained with the Maynard family, helping with some trivial matters while waiting for what Wu Pingxue called the \"right moment.\"","In mid-January 2027, Tong Yang and Wen Qin, within their respective cooperating families, received recall orders from the United Government.","Coincidentally, the two were carrying out a mission at the same location and boarded an aircraft to head to the United Government.","Ever since Tong Yang handed Yang Miao over to the United Government, Wen Qin had never initiated conversation with her again, and even when Tong Yang spoke to her, Wen Qin responded with indifference.","\"Do you know why the United Government is recalling us?\" Tong Yang asked from the co-pilot's seat, seemingly casual.","\"No,\" Wen Qin said coldly.","Tong Yang glanced at her. \"Did I offend you? You seem really displeased with me.\"","\"No,\" Wen Qin's expression remained frosty.","Tong Yang didn't mind. \"Even if you're displeased, you'll just have to bear with it. I can't change.\"","Wen Qin's face darkened. \"Let me ask you something.\"","\"Hmm?\" Tong Yang responded.","\"Why did you hand Yang Miao over to the United Government? You clearly know she was almost destroyed by them at birth, and now you've delivered her right into their hands.\"","\"That's a secret,\" Tong Yang didn't answer.","Wen Qin turned her head to glare at her. \"You might as well have handed her over to us. At least we could guarantee her safety. Even without a blood relation, she's the sister you lived with day and night.\"","Tong Yang smiled. \"So you're standing up for her?\"","\"I just look down on people like you who will stop at nothing,\" Wen Qin said.","\"What does that have to do with me,\" Tong Yang remained unperturbed.","Wen Qin said, \"I really misjudged you.\"","\"That's enough,\" Tong Yang said impatiently. \"Worry about yourself.\"","Wen Qin glared at her angrily. \"Are all you people from the Third World so inhuman?\"","Tong Yang: \"?\"","\"Are you introducing yourself?\"","Wen Qin snorted coldly. \"Do you have some other scheme?\"","Tong Yang said, \"You guess.\"","\"I guess you're playing a big chess game.\"","\"Wrong guess.\" Tong Yang looked out the window, her expression calm. \"Someone is playing a big chess game. I'm just a piece.\"","Wen Qin narrowed her eyes. \"What are you going to do?\"","Tong Yang looked at her with a faint, ambiguous smile. \"Do you think I'd tell you?\"","\"No.\"","\"Exactly.\"","Not long after, the aircraft they were piloting arrived at the United Government.","Xue Wei stood at the main entrance waiting for them.","As they approached, Tong Yang asked, \"What's the matter?\"","Wen Qin said, \"Under normal circumstances, they wouldn't recall us.\"","Xue Wei's expression was solemn. \"The Second World has sent envoys to negotiate with the United Government.\"","Wen Qin frowned. \"The Second World sent people to negotiate?\"","The First World and the Second World nearly broke ties over the bombing of the slums, and they have been in covert conflict ever since. Why would they send envoys to negotiate now?","Tong Yang remained expressionless. \"Why?\"","Xue Wei shook his head. \"Not sure. Let's go inside to discuss.\"","\"Alright.\"","The three of them entered the Joint Government and headed for the conference room.","\"Dong dong—\" Xue Wei raised her hand and knocked on the door. A few seconds later, the door was opened from the inside.","Tong Yang focused her gaze and saw that quite a few people were seated in the conference room. Some of them she had met before—senior leaders of the Joint Government and some \"Forerunners\"; the other part sat opposite them, all wearing suits and ties and face masks, regardless of gender.","When Tong Yang and the other two walked in, everyone looked over in unison.","Tong Yang's gaze swept over the group from the parallel world, her eyes narrowing almost imperceptibly.","At their head was a young man wearing a black half-face mask. The skin visible on his face had an unnatural paleness. When their eyes met, beneath the calm surface, it felt as if an electric current had shot through her entire body.","Tong Yang calmly averted her gaze. Just like her, he didn't reveal anything out of the ordinary.","Tong Yang looked at the others beside him. Even with the upper halves of their faces completely concealed, she could still tell who was who.","Ye Huai, Chu Shiyu, Tang Shuyan, the parallel world's Yan Qing, Liang Xi... not a single one missing.","It seemed the so-called \"opportune moment\" Wu Pingxue had mentioned had arrived.","Ye Huai and his group had made preparations in the parallel world, though it was unclear exactly what they had done to appear here now as representatives of that parallel world's humanity.","\"Almost everyone is here now. May we ask the purpose of your visit, esteemed guests from the Second World?\" a member of the Joint Government inquired.","Ye Huai gave a slight smile and said, \"We have come for two matters only.\"","\"Oh?\"","\"What might those be?\"","Ye Huai stated, \"First, the 'experimental subject' previously handed over to the Joint Government will be reclaimed by us.\"","\"You think you can just send her over and take her back whenever you please?\"","Ye Huai's attitude was not overly aggressive, but firm and respectful. \"The experimental subject originates from the Second World, so naturally she should be reclaimed by the Second World.\"","\"She's dead.\"","First World Tong Yang spoke up without warning.","At the same time, Tong Yang realized who the \"experimental subject\" Ye Huai referred to was.","Probably He Jingjing, one of the fifty people sent to the real world since childhood.","There was no obvious change in Ye Huai's expression. \"If she is dead, then the Joint Government broke the agreement first. Whatever happens hereafter, you cannot utter a single word of complaint.\"","First World Tong Yang let out a low chuckle. \"Are you threatening us?\"","\"No. Handing over the 'experimental subject' for you to record physiological data was an agreement between both parties. If the 'experimental subject' died during the recording process, the responsibility lies with you,\" Ye Huai said.","\"Slayer, your stance is not clear. Please remain silent during the discussion.\" Ye Huai's businesslike tone was unpleasant.","First World Tong Yang didn't seem to mind much. \"Just a joke. She's still alive.\"","Ye Huai said, \"That's good.\"","A member of the Joint Government spoke, \"The experimental subject was originally from the Second World, so of course she will be returned to you. Now, what is the second matter?\"","\"Is the child of the first-generation android in the hands of the Joint Government?\" Ye Huai asked.","As soon as these words were spoken, the conference room instantly fell into dead silence.","Too many people had undergone androidization technology. Yang Miao's existence was a threat to everyone.","However, for whichever side could control her, she would become an unparalleled weapon.","Ye Huai's gaze swept over the crowd. \"You don't need to answer directly. Please listen carefully to what I say next.\"","\"The time traveler from the Third World has already appeared.\"","Upon hearing this, everyone's expressions grew even more grave.","Ye Huai continued, \"I presume everyone knows that the appearance of a time traveler means the magnetic field energy is about to be developed, and events will repeat themselves. To prevent this possibility, the Second World has conceived a solution.\"","Someone asked, \"What solution?\"","The development of magnetic field energy by the real world held no benefits for them. Their previous concealment was precisely in hopes of occupying the real world within a relatively short timeframe, depriving them of the opportunity to develop the magnetic field energy.","\"We cooperate to crush the Third World,\" Ye Huai said.","\"How do we cooperate? Explain in detail.\"","\"Currently, our two sides are like fire and water, on the brink of conflict. No one can fully trust the other under such circumstances. An unstable cooperative relationship benefits no one.\"","First World Tong Yang asked with interest, \"So? How do we resolve this?\"","\"Merge the energy cores of both worlds and develop them jointly. Originally, the magnetic field energy could only be developed to 100%. After complete fusion, it can be developed to 200%. At that point, without needing to concern ourselves with the life or death of the time anchors, we can advance unimpeded.\"","Observing the stunned expressions of the crowd, Ye Huai continued, \"After the energy cores merge, a new time anchor will be generated. By concentrating it onto the child of the first-generation android, we can use her to androidize all people from both worlds. They won't be able to consciously manipulate magnetic field energy, but they can continue to create resources for us. With no further worries, we can then continue to explore the next parallel world.\"","This shocking and outrageous speech left everyone speechless.","This was the so-called \"opportune moment\" Wu Pingxue had mentioned.","Isolating the magnetic field energy within a single spacetime could only be achieved by merging the energy cores of both worlds' magnetic field energies.","This was Wu Pingxue's plan, and it likewise carried enormous risks."]},{"number":122,"title":"Chapter 122","paragraphs":["The proposal of the parallel world was impossible to refuse.","By merging the energy cores of the two worlds, the magnetic field energy could be developed to 200%. The First World had already achieved this level without large-scale development. If the magnetic field energies of both worlds were overlapped and fully developed, there was probably nothing that couldn't be done, except perhaps achieving immortality.","\"The time anchor point is not merely a passage; it contains many powers we have yet to uncover. Once the energy cores of the two worlds are merged, and the anchor point lands on the child of the first-generation android, combined with her ability, we can convert all unnecessary people into androids, continuing to create resources for humanity, forever under our control.\"","Ye Huai expounded on the parallel world plan tirelessly.","As the time anchor point of the real world, Tong Yang possessed no abilities, unlike Yan Qing in the parallel world who could obtain others' coordinates and send them to arbitrary locations. The fundamental reason was naturally that magnetic field energy did not exist in the real world; it hadn't been discovered or developed.","The United Government did not give an immediate reply, but most likely wouldn't refuse. After all, the First World and the parallel world were already in a state of semi-fusion. If everyone could reap the greatest benefits from it, why refuse?","\"Speaking of which, this year produced two 'Pioneers'. According to the agreement between the United Government and us, one of them should be handed over to the Second World. It's been quite some time; why has there been no movement?\" Ye Huai tilted his head, looking meaningfully at the several United Government representatives.","Although undercurrents surged between the two worlds, a precarious calm was maintained on the surface.","Hearing Ye Huai's words, Armand smiled. \"Please don't misunderstand, sir. There simply hasn't been an opportunity until now. With your sudden visit today, we have brought the two newcomers immediately.\"","Tong Yang and Wen Qin, having been named, stood between the two parties.","Armand continued, \"These are the two newcomers who passed the tests this year. As an apology, please let the Second World representative choose the preferred newcomer to take away.\"","The gaze behind Ye Huai's mask lingered on Tong Yang for a second or two, then shifted to Wen Qin, not revealing the slightest hint of anything unusual.","Chu Shiyu sat beside him, looking straight ahead without glancing sideways.","Tang Shuyan leaned back in her chair, appearing uninterested in everything.","Yan Qing and Liang Xi from the parallel world stood behind them, winking at Tong Yang.","Tong Yang pretended not to see, her gaze fixed on the ground.","No one had informed them before coming here that one of them would be taken to the parallel world.","\"What are your thoughts?\" Ye Huai asked.","Wen Qin said, \"I don't mind.\"","Tong Yang said, \"In this selection period, her overall strength ranking is first.\"","Wen Qin widened her eyes to look at her, whispering, \"So now you admit it?\"","Tong Yang ignored her. It was just for show. If she inadvertently revealed something, she might alert the First World's Tong Yang to something amiss.","\"It sounds like you're not very willing to pledge allegiance to the Second World?\" Ye Huai smiled slightly, the smile not reaching his eyes.","Tong Yang said calmly, \"I grew up in the First World, so naturally, I'd prefer to stay here.\"","\"Is that so.\" Ye Huai narrowed his eyes with an inscrutable expression.","\"I can't make a choice right away. Fortunately, I need to stay in the First World for a while. You two shall stay by my side for now.\" After saying this, he turned to look at the United Government representatives. \"Do any of you have objections?\"","\"No objections.\"","\"Then it's decided. You two will temporarily follow the several dignitaries from the Second World. If there's nothing else, let's adjourn for now.\"","The United Government wanted to cut the negotiations short, eager to contact others to discuss the plan proposed by the parallel world.","Ye Huai said, \"Good. I will await good news from the United Government.\"","\"Farewell.\"","Ye Huai and the other two stood up, preparing to leave.","Armand said, \"The two newcomers still have some procedures to complete. Please return and rest first; they will arrive later.\"","\"Mm.\"","Ye Huai left first, the others following closely behind.","Shortly after, Armand led the two away.","The \"Pioneer\" selection had ended long ago, and all due procedures should have been completed. Armand keeping them behind likely meant the United Government had some instructions.","\"During this time, you will work alongside the Second World individuals. Find ways to ascertain if they have any other objectives. Report any abnormal situations immediately to the United Government.\"","It was euphemistically called working alongside them, but in reality, it was surveillance.","Tong Yang sneered, \"Aren't you afraid I might just kill them?\"","Armand said, \"I know about your entanglement with the Second World, but you understand the current situation. If your actions implicate Aly, I won't let you off.\"","Tong Yang said with a faint, ambiguous smile, \"You are truly loyal to the United Government.\"","Wen Qin then asked, \"Who does the United Government intend to hand over to the Second World?\"","Armand said, \"Before they proposed the resolution, we intended to hand over neither.\"","After all, \"Pioneers\" were weapons forged with so much time, effort, and resources.","\"And now?\"","\"Probably the one with the lower overall ranking.\"","\"That would be you,\" Wen Qin said, looking at Tong Yang.","Armand glanced sideways at her. \"I meant the real ranking.\"","Wen Qin pointed at herself. \"Me?\"","\"Who else?\"","\"Fine, whatever. I'm just a tool anyway.\"","\"Good that you know.\"","Tong Yang, however, believed Wen Qin was the inevitable choice to go to the parallel world.","The United Government had to consider Tong Yang's relationship with Yang Miao. Moreover, Wen Qin, like the Armand family, seemed to lean towards the First World in stance. Sending her to the parallel world as a mole made sense.","That evening, Tong Yang and Wen Qin arrived at the building where Ye Huai and his group were temporarily staying.","\"Please come in.\"","The two entered the room. The others still wore their masks.","\"No need to be formal. We'll be staying together for this period,\" Ye Huai said.","\"I'm Wen Qin.\"","\"Yang Le.\"","They gave brief self-introductions.","Tong Yang looked around the room, noticing only him and Yan Qing from the parallel world were present. \"Where are the others?\"","\"Meeting with the United Government to pick someone up.\"","\"The test subject?\"","\"Mm.\"","It seemed Wu Pingxue had quite a conscience, not betraying He Jingjing's trust. Moreover, as representatives of the parallel world here, although it was unknown what they had gone through, they had most likely obtained the two high-quality gene medicines promised to He Jingjing.","Wen Qin said, \"I'll go back with you when the time comes.\"","Ye Huai nodded. \"Mm.\"","Tong Yang wanted to inquire about the situation from Ye Huai, but with Wen Qin present, she hadn't found an opportunity.","Not long after, Chu Shiyu and Tang Shuyan returned, their expressions rather grim.","\"How did it go?\" Ye Huai asked.","Chu Shiyu said, \"She remains unconscious, her consciousness sunk very deep. She won't wake up anytime soon and needs special nutrient fluid to sustain her life. We'll take her with us when we leave.\"","Tang Shuyan stated succinctly, \"The only difference from a corpse is that her heart is still beating faintly.\"","Wen Qin asked curiously, \"As an experiment subject, she failed. Why go through the trouble of specifically bringing her back?\"","\"The higher-ups arranged for us to do this; they naturally have their reasons. We are only responsible for carrying out orders.\"","Although Wen Qin came from a parallel world, she was clearly unfamiliar with these matters.","\"I have a letter. Please deliver it to Mr. Armand for me.\" Ye Huai placed a letter on the table and said to Wen Qin.","\"Why not give it to him at the base?\" Wen Qin asked.","\"Too many eyes, it's inconvenient. After all, it's related to the child of the first-generation android.\"","Hearing this, Tong Yang and the others showed expressions of surprise.","Wen Qin exclaimed in shock, \"He told the Second World about the news?\"","Tong Yang, however, frowned. The person behind Armand was Tong Yang from the First World. Could he have done this under the instruction of the First World's Tong Yang?","Ye Huai pressed his lips together and said, \"No comment. Just deliver this letter to him.\"","Wen Qin was filled with inner doubt, unable to understand why Armand would tell the Second World about the android matter. Without thinking too much, she took the letter and left the room.","As the door closed, only the few of them remained in the room.","Tong Yang looked at the others and was about to speak when Ye Huai, on the sofa, covered his mouth and nose, coughing violently.","Suffering from extreme hypoxia, his pale skin visibly turned red. His body hunched over, his spine like a precarious, swaying bridge.","\"Cough...\"","Suddenly, he choked up a mouthful of blood.","Tong Yang's expression changed, and she strode forward. \"What's going on?\"","Without time for explanation, Tang Shuyan walked up to him, took out a silver needle hidden in her sleeve, unbuttoned his clothes to reveal his pale chest, and inserted the needle into an acupoint near his heart.","Liang Xi frantically rummaged for the medicine box, while Chu Shiyu brought over a glass of water.","As the silver needle entered his chest, the coughing gradually subsided. Ye Huai took the medicine and the water glass and swallowed it down.","Yan Qing from the parallel world hurried in with a basin of water. Tong Yang saw a cloth lying inside, wrung it dry, and handed it to Ye Huai.","\"Sorry.\" Ye Huai's voice was hoarse as he wiped the blood from his face and hands.","It seemed this wasn't the first time such a situation had occurred. Each person knew their role clearly and immediately found what they should do.","Seeing his condition improve somewhat, Tong Yang asked, \"What happened? Is your illness getting worse?\"","Before she entered the First World, Ye Huai's health had improved a lot compared to before, and he was cooperating with Dr. Luo on the artificial heart research. How could it have deteriorated to the point of coughing blood?","Ye Huai used his cleaned right hand to grasp Tong Yang's wrist and said, \"It's nothing serious...\"","Tang Shuyan scoffed. \"Nothing serious? If I weren't here, you'd have died who knows how many times already.\"","Chu Shiyu walked to Tong Yang's side and explained, \"For nearly a year, Ye Huai has been staying in the parallel world. To avoid exposing his identity, he received no treatment for his body. This kind of situation happens frequently.\"","Tong Yang frowned tightly. \"Don't you want to live?\"","Ye Huai said, \"I do. I told you, I won't let things end this early.\"","Tong Yang knew what he was referring to, but her brow remained deeply furrowed. \"You're truly insane.\"","Ye Huai moistened his dry lips, smiled slightly, and said, \"It's fine. I know my limits.\"","Tong Yang shot him a glare. What was done was done; blame was pointless now.","\"What exactly have you all been doing?\" Tong Yang asked.","Yan Qing from the parallel world raised her right hand. \"My contribution was huge!\"","Tong Yang raised an eyebrow, looking her up and down. \"You?\"","Ye Huai's breathing gradually steadied. He pulled Tong Yang to sit beside him and explained, \"Her identity provided us with great convenience.\"","\"Don't listen to him making it sound so easy. He suffered a lot in the parallel world,\" Tang Shuyan said.","Ye Huai averted his gaze, changing the subject.","\"Tong Yang, the fusion of the energy cores requires some time. Before that, all we need to do is wait.\"","Tong Yang pondered for a moment. \"If the plan cannot be completed, and the two energy cores fuse, they will enter the real world as if entering unguarded territory. What should we do then?\"","Ye Huai said, \"That's precisely what we've been working on. The plan will not fail.\"","\"Even if we all die here, the plan will not fail. The true goal of the parallel world is to annex the First World's energy core, not to develop it jointly. The magnetic field energy they've developed is higher than the First World's, capable of controlling all parallel world humans. Even if the two energy cores fuse, they hold a certain advantage. Moreover, the human who had a child with the android was originally from the parallel world.\"","Tong Yang said in surprise, \"You mean...\"","\"They can use the magnetic field energy to control the child of the first-generation android. Once the magnetic field energies fuse, the First World will be in grave danger. Therefore, the parallel world will help us complete the plan.\"","Tang Shuyan sneered. \"Wu Pingxue didn't explain much when he sent us into the parallel world. Young Master Ye figured all this out on his own.\"","Ye Huai said, \"Wu Pingxue's intention was exactly this. He just wouldn't say it outright, letting us deduce it ourselves and make the decision.\"","Tong Yang nodded, quite in agreement. That fellow Wu Pingxue was indeed like that.","\"How did you manage it?\" Tong Yang asked.","Ye Huai smiled faintly. \"I impersonated a time traveler from the real world and gave them some false information.\"","\"They shouldn't have believed you easily,\" Tong Yang said.","Ye Huai nodded. \"Right. The real time traveler isn't me; it's Dr. Wu.\"","Tong Yang stared at him blankly. \"Wu Pingxue?\"","\"He is a time traveler from the parallel world, and he also seems to have information on the real world's time travelers. The information he gave me was enough to convince the parallel world.\"","The two looked at each other, understanding passing between them.","Did Tong Le in 2036 know the parallel world's Wu Pingxue?","Ye Huai said, \"Everything is ready; all we need is the east wind.\"","\"When the energy cores fuse, that will be our moment to act. Until then, we just need to hold our positions.\"","The parts of the plan that Tong Yang couldn't access had all been completed by the members of \"Spider.\"","Everything experienced from May 28, 2024, until now was finally coming to an end.","If she could return alive, her life would return to peace.","Tong Yang had waited a long time for this day!"]},{"number":123,"title":"Chapter 123","paragraphs":["January 23, 2027. The First World and the Parallel World formally established an alliance, merging the Energy Cores to jointly develop magnetic field energy.","It is said that the Energy Core is a crystal nurtured by magnetic field energy. Unlike the ethereal and intangible magnetic field energy itself, it is something visible and tangible. Fortunately, magnetic field energy can naturally merge with itself. Although it requires a certain amount of time, the process is not difficult.","Simultaneously, the Joint Government ceased bombing the slums, publicly announcing that the Third World's Time Anchor had departed.","Once the Energy Cores were merged, they would no longer need to concern themselves with the Time Anchor's existence. Capturing or killing the Third World's Time Anchor was no longer an absolute necessity.","In mid-February 2027, Wen Qin followed Ye Huai and his group back to the Parallel World, while Tong Yang went elsewhere on a mission.","A rare peace settled over the First World, the Parallel World, and the Real World.","Everyone lived in their respective worlds, not disturbing each other, as it should have been all along.","Yang Miao, as a crucial part of the plan, had not yet been acted upon by the Joint Government.","March 1, 2027. The Joint Government predicted the Energy Cores would be completely fused by the end of May.","At the same time, the time discrepancy between Tong Yang and the members of the \"Netizen Gossip 007\" group chat was gradually disappearing, expected to fully synchronize by the end of May.","[@Study For Money Sister Tong, let's meet at the end of May!]","[@Study For Money Yeah, I want to meet Sister Tong.]","[Even though we could meet anytime, it only has meaning if we're all together.]","[I wonder if Lele can meet us too.]","Study For Money: [Whatever.]","[That means you agree!]","[Folks, where should we meet?]","[The capital! Sister Tong is there, and I've never been!]","[Okay, let's go there ahead of time then.]","[Where should we meet up?]","[What about Tiananmen Square?]","[Great!!!]","[I'm booking my flight now. Everyone has to be on time! Absolutely no being late! I want to see you all the moment the time difference vanishes!]","2036 Tong Le didn't speak in the group. Tong Yang clicked into her private chat with him. They hadn't been in contact for a long time, and he hadn't replied to the messages she had sent.","Mid-April 2027. Tong Yang went to Zone Twelve again, accompanied by Yang Miao, the child of the first-generation bioroids.","The objective was clear: use Yang Miao to subdue the awakened bioroids.","The process wasn't difficult; Yang Miao's abilities made it easy. However, Tong Yang's purpose for this trip wasn't limited to that. Upon completing the mission and returning to the affluent district, Tong Yang brought Xu Junyue and two others with her.","During this period, Tong Yang didn't take any significant action, and the First World's Tong Yang didn't cause trouble either. Everything remained peaceful.","Mid-May 2027. All individuals related to the incident entered the affluent district of the First World through various means.","May 24, 2027. Representatives from the Second World, led by Ye Huai, arrived at the Joint Government for final negotiations.","The result of the negotiations was that the Energy Cores would complete their fusion at 9 PM on May 27. They needed to immediately set the Time Anchor on Yang Miao; otherwise, the combined magnetic field energy would be too powerful, causing chaos in the barriers between worlds. They could then find themselves shuttling between the three worlds, including the Real World, at any moment.","The Joint Government had no objections, and the meeting concluded.","Upon leaving the base, Tong Yang, walking beside Ye Tianlin, encountered Ye Huai's group coming the opposite way.","\"A word in private?\" Ye Tianlin said.","Ye Huai pressed his dry lips together and nodded. \"Alright.\"","After the alliance was formed, relations between the two worlds had eased, so this wouldn't attract undue attention.","The group went to a building belonging to the Maynard family and entered a room.","\"Ye Huai, it's been a long time,\" Ye Tianlin said with a sigh.","Ye Huai lowered his gaze, his expression unreadable behind the mask. \"Dad.\"","Ye Tianlin looked momentarily stunned. \"I...\"","\"I heard from Tong Yang about you and Maynard. Regardless of the process, I wouldn't have survived until now without you.\"","Even if it was for the purpose of replacing Maynard's heart.","If the Real World's Ye Tianlin hadn't made that deal with him, the company wouldn't have been saved, and there wouldn't have been the vast sums of money needed to sustain Ye Huai's life. Even after the White Horse Group became a multinational corporation, the Real World's Ye Tianlin had contemplated giving up on prolonging Ye Huai's life more than once.","Ye Huai's survival was inextricably linked to Ye Tianlin.","Ye Tianlin walked up to him and gave his shoulder a heavy pat.","\"Cough...\"","\"Gently,\" Tong Yang reminded.","Ye Huai's frame seemed increasingly fragile, as if it could shatter from a single blow.","Ye Tianlin awkwardly withdrew his hand, looking at Ye Huai's pale face. \"How is your health?\"","\"It's fine.\"","Tang Shuyan raised her hand, gesturing a small distance in the air. \"He's about this far from death.\"","Ye Huai said, \"I know my limits.\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together, hoping he truly did.","Tong Yang asked, \"After the Energy Cores merge, what about the Real World?\"","Ye Huai replied, \"They are prepared.\"","\"Yang Miao...\"","Ye Tianlin said, \"Don't worry, I'll take care of her.\"","\"If the combined magnetic field energy doesn't have a Time Anchor set as a channel in time, it will inevitably create an energy storm, plunging space into chaos. We could appear in the First World, the Parallel World, or the Real World at any moment. The Real World has made preparations in advance; there's no need to worry. As long as we successfully return to the Real World before the plan is complete, everything will be accomplished.\"","They had no intention of letting Yang Miao become the new Time Anchor. The Parallel World wanted to control Yang Miao to sanction the First World, so naturally, they couldn't let it have its way so easily.","After all, the Real World was merely using them, not cooperating. No one besides the Real World would benefit from this affair.","Therefore, the energy storm caused by the fusion of the Energy Cores, which would throw the worlds into chaos, was unavoidable.","\"Has Wu Pingxue still not told you how to make the magnetic field energy disappear?\"","Ye Huai lowered his eyes and nodded. \"This is all I know. We just need to merge the Energy Cores, buy time, and then return to the Real World.\"","Wu Pingxue had never told them what exactly needed to be done. Tong Yang only knew that merging the Energy Cores was a prerequisite, but not how to do it or who should do it.","Ye Tianlin said, \"Everyone has different tasks. Perhaps other companions among you are preparing for this very thing.\"","Besides the few people Tong Yang was familiar with, personnel from Department 749 were also involved. Perhaps the person executing this top-secret mission came from Department 749.","\"We only need to complete our own tasks.\"","\"Exactly.\"","Tong Yang stopped dwelling on the matter. Wu Pingxue had already told her everything she could.","At this moment, there were less than four days left until the magnetic field Energy Cores were completely fused.","8:00 PM, May 27, 2027. One hour remained until the fusion of the magnetic field Energy Cores.","The Joint Government and the people from the Parallel World had long been prepared, awaiting the arrival of magnetic field energy unlike any before.","To this end, they held a grand banquet, gathering the prominent figures from the high society of both worlds to witness the birth of a new generation of magnetic field energy.","As a precaution, the Joint Government dispatched \"Forerunners\" to seal off the banquet venue completely.","\"Are you just going to stand by and watch us succeed?\" Wen Qin asked.","They were stationed outside the banquet hall, not far from each other.","Tong Yang stood with her arms crossed, leaning against the wall, looking up at the sky where the moon was bright and the stars sparse.","The sky shimmered with an eerie green light, like a transparent dome enveloping the Earth. Occasional waves of air swept by, carrying a sound akin to a heartbeat.","\"You guess,\" Tong Yang said flatly.","A breeze brushed her cheeks, lifting the hair at her temples.","After tonight, everything would return to calm. Even if they all died here, the real world would be restored to peace.","Tong Yang had never entertained the idea of sacrificing herself for the benefit of others. Yet, with the magnetic field energy core about to fuse, signifying the real world's safety, she felt an immense sense of relief, even though their group was still in danger.","Wen Qin glanced at her sideways and said, \"No matter what happens tonight, I won't be surprised.\"","\"Is that so.\" Tong Yang's tone remained calm.","Apart from Tong Yang staying here, Ye Huai was alone at the banquet, while Chu Shiyu, Xu Junyue, Tang Li, and the others had all gone to carry out their respective missions.","Tong Yang had no mission. Or rather, her mission hadn't appeared yet. Once the Tong Yang from the First World took action, she would have to resist with all her might.","Until then, she only needed to watch and wait.","Tong Yang had unexpectedly become the most idle person in this operation.","She looked at the sky, habitually pondering the matter.","Initially, Wu Pingxue had told her she needed to enter the First World. Later, Tang Li also said the time anchor point was indispensable. If their actions interfered with the First World Tong Yang's game, they might even abandon Tong Yang and transfer the time anchor point to someone else to continue the operation.","But now, Tong Yang was still the time anchor point. Why had she become a dispensable presence in the operation? She was even less crucial than Yang Miao.","Tong Yang didn't necessarily want to do something, nor was she unable to stay idle; she just found it strange. She was the time anchor point, so why wasn't she the one executing that top-secret plan? Could it be the parallel world's Yan Qing? Also a time anchor point.","However, Wu Pingxue had no reason to let the parallel world's Yan Qing execute it.","Then who could it be?","Tong Yang had a faint suspicion, which she quickly dismissed.","She took out her phone, opened the social media app, and looked at the long-dormant chat dialog with 2036 Tong Le, her feelings complex and heavy.","2036 Tong Le and Wu Pingxue were closely connected, though it was unclear how they had met.","2036 Tong Le had said he couldn't interfere with events on this timeline; otherwise, the time loop couldn't be completed.","Reason told Tong Yang it couldn't be 2036 Tong Le, yet intuition made her believe 2036 Tong Le was also involved.","Studying is for Making Money: [Tong Le, where are you?]","As usual, the sent message sank like a stone, with no reply.","Tong Yang closed her eyes. 2036 Tong Le couldn't interfere with this timeline, so it probably wasn't him...","What exactly was this mission? Who was really carrying it out?","Time ticked by, with less than half an hour left until 9 PM.","The banquet hall played soft, soothing light music as the high society guests clinked glasses and chatted amiably.","Just then, someone hurried down the corridor.","\"Yang... Yang Miao is missing!\"","The person rushed into the banquet hall, panting as they spoke.","The vast hall immediately fell into dead silence.","\"What happened?\"","\"She was cooperating with us all along. Just now, she spilled her drink and went to change. I was waiting right outside the changing room. It was barely two minutes, and she completely vanished!\"","The establishment of a time anchor point for magnetic field energy was highly random. If someone was actively chosen to become a time anchor point, a prerequisite was establishing a connection face-to-face or through special means.","For instance, the connection for Tong Yang's time anchor point was established through the \"Netizen Gossip 007\" group chat.","\"Find her! Where's Yang Le? Ask her!\"","\"She must be brought back within twenty minutes!\"","\"Wasn't she cooperating all along? Why disappear suddenly?\"","\"Could someone have taken her?\"","\"The energy cores will fully align in just twenty minutes. If we can't establish the channel in time, it'll be troublesome.\"","\"The Forerunners have been guarding the doors. She couldn't have left; she must still be here.\"","The banquet hall was in an uproar. Tong Yang lowered her gaze to the floor. The operation had begun.","\"Meng Xiao? Where are you going?\"","Wen Qin asked, seeing a person emerge from the passageway.","\"Mr. Maynard is worried things might change. He asked me to return and notify other family members,\" Meng Xiao said.","After being eliminated in the sixth round of selections, Meng Xiao had become a trainee soldier and entered the Maynard family.","\"What's happening in the banquet hall?\" Wen Qin asked as she approached.","Meng Xiao sighed. \"Yang Miao suddenly disappeared.\"","Wen Qin frowned. \"Disappeared? How is that possible? We've been guarding here; no one has left.\"","Meng Xiao shook her head. \"I don't know either.\"","Wen Qin turned to look at Tong Yang and found her pensively gazing into mid-air.","\"I have to go now.\"","Wen Qin didn't think much of it and let her leave.","\"Did you do it?\" Wen Qin asked.","Tong Yang glanced at her. \"I haven't left.\"","\"Then it was your companions.\"","\"Who knows.\"","Wen Qin said, \"We're guarding the entrance. Not even a mosquito could fly out. She's still inside.\"","Tong Yang glanced meaningfully in the direction Meng Xiao had left and said, \"Not even a mosquito could fly out?\"","\"She's not Yang Miao.\"","Tong Yang smiled meaningfully.","Wen Qin asked, half-convinced, half-doubting, \"Something fishy?\"","\"I don't know. I've been here the whole time, haven't left. You can vouch for that.\"","As soon as she finished speaking, several people from the banquet hall approached with serious expressions.","\"Yang Miao is missing. Does this have anything to do with you?\" the leader asked.","Tong Yang said, \"She's missing? I've been here the whole time without leaving. She can vouch for me.\"","Wen Qin pursed her lips and said, \"She really hasn't left.\"","\"Has anyone left through here during this time?\"","Wen Qin said, \"A few. Since Yang Miao disappeared, the only one who left from here was a trainee from the Maynard family.\"","\"Alone?\"","\"Yes. Maynard asked her to return.\"","The leader said gravely, \"From now on, enforce a strict lockdown. No one is allowed in or out.\"","\"Understood,\" Wen Qin replied.","The person looked at Tong Yang and said, \"You, come with me.\"","Tong Yang followed the group into the banquet hall, while Wen Qin remained in place.","Tong Yang knew that Yang Miao had already left the banquet hall, together with Meng Xiao.","At the 749 Bureau base, they had encountered a special particle, created by Nick, adept at simulation. It could overlay existing scenes and even simulate tactile sensations.","Nick had once said this type of particle could only perform one simulation; it would die immediately afterward.","Just now, Tong Yang felt someone lightly brush against her hand—it was very slight, probably Yang Miao, who was covered in special particles.","\"Bzzz—\"","\"Bzzz—\"","\"Bzzz—\"","As they reached an open area, several alarm sounds suddenly rang out over the city.","The man walking beside Tong Yang instantly changed expression, saying sharply, \"The gates are open?\"","\"Bzzz—\"","\"Bzzz—\"","\"Bzzz—\"","The alarm sounds circled in the dark green sky, suddenly giving a feeling that the end of the world was approaching.","\"The slum gates are open?\"","\"One, two...\"","\"Only the energy terminals of the corresponding families can open the twelve slum gates. Why...\"","\"Sister!\"","At that moment, Tong Yang suddenly heard Yang Miao's voice.","She whipped her head around toward the source of the sound.","Under the moonlight, on the edge of a roof, several figures stood.","First-World Tong Yang sat at the edge, holding something in one hand, raised mid-air; her other hand propped up her chin as she looked down at Tong Yang with ease.","Behind her stood four or five people, with Armand and First-World Ye Huai among them.","They looked down at Tong Yang from above, like an immovable mountain, the soft green light spilling over them, casting a long shadow.","With a thud, the unconscious Meng Xiao was kicked off the roof by Armand.","Tong Yang's breath caught—Yang Miao had been captured!","First-World Tong Yang narrowed her eyes, her smile lazy.","\"Tong Yang, the game has begun.\""]},{"number":124,"title":"Chapter 124","paragraphs":["\"Woo——\"","\"Woo——\"","\"Woo——\"","The blare of sirens sounded incessantly over the city.","Armand looked up at the dark green night sky, a smile curling at the corner of his mouth. \"Aly is truly remarkable. She actually did it.\"","After entering the affluent district, Tang Li had located the families corresponding to the twelve gates leading from the slums to the commoners' district. Only through the energy terminals within these families could the corresponding gates be opened.","\"Woo——\"","\"Woo——\"","\"Woo——\"","In the First World, Ye Huai let out a light scoff. \"Don't act as if you were completely in the dark. Without your help, would their progress have been so smooth?\"","Armand wore an innocent expression. \"I didn't do anything.\"","Someone standing behind the trio sneered. \"No point arguing with someone love-struck. Even a dog wouldn't want to eat his brains.\"","\"As long as A'Li likes it.\"","Standing beside Tong Yang, a person from the United Government shouted, \"The Slaughterers? What are you doing here? Armand, does the opening of the gates have something to do with you...\"","Before the man could finish his sentence, the person behind the First World's Tong Yang suddenly flung a shard of glass. It bypassed Tong Yang and swiftly slit the throats of the other several men.","Blood sprayed out with a \"squelch.\" Tong Yang slightly closed her eyes, feeling the warm liquid splatter on her eyelids.","\"Sis! Sis!\"","Yang Miao, covered in special particles, struggled in the grasp of the First World's Tong Yang. Some particles fell from her body like dust, dissipating into the air.","Tong Yang didn't seem surprised. She looked down to check Meng Xiao's condition—injured, but not fatally, for now.","\"She's too young. She doesn't participate in the game,\" Tong Yang stated.","The First World's Tong Yang casually tossed Yang Miao to Armand. \"I know.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"What do you intend to do?\"","The First World's Tong Yang countered, \"Where are your companions?\"","\"They're busy. I'm the only one here.\"","Ye Huai's identity hadn't been exposed. No one would suspect that the representative from the parallel world actually hailed from the Third World.","The First World's Tong Yang narrowed her eyes slightly, speaking ambiguously, \"Is that so.\"","\"Only you, all alone here. Should I believe that? Or shouldn't I?\"","\"What do you think?\" Tong Yang shot back.","It was absolutely impossible for Ye Huai's identity to be discovered. The First World's Tong Yang was most likely bluffing.","The First World's Tong Yang chuckled softly. \"So it really is just you alone.\"","\"So, what's your plan? Hand Yang Miao over to the United Government?\"","The First World's Tong Yang shook her head. \"That would mean you're all dead for sure. No fun.\"","\"But your companions aren't here. What a predicament,\" the First World's Tong Yang said leisurely.","Tong Yang remained silent, wanting to hear her plan.","\"Got it.\" The First World's Tong Yang suddenly remembered something. \"The United Government and the First World won't give up on making the descendants of the first-generation androids the temporal anchors. Once the energy cores fuse, if a channel isn't established promptly, an energy storm will erupt, throwing all three worlds into chaos. How about we play a hunter game instead?\"","\"Whoever is stronger becomes the hunter. Victory is achieved by hunting down the other.\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips together, hating the idea of becoming prey, but she had no other choice.","The First World's Tong Yang continued, \"You and I are the ultimate prey. The game ends immediately if either of us dies. If you win, I'll return her to you. If you lose, I'll hand her over to the United Government. One important note: until the outcome is decided, I won't allow anyone to disrupt the game.\"","Tong Yang looked at her, saying nothing.","Although she didn't know who was executing the top-secret mission, Wu Pingxue had said they only needed to facilitate the fusion of the energy cores, create chaos for the First World, make them panic and buy time. That was enough.","The First World's Tong Yang's threat probably held no weight. Even if Tong Yang and the others all died here, the plan would still succeed.","So, as long as she could stall the First World's Tong Yang, there was no need to worry about other aspects.","The First World's Tong Yang said, \"Tong Yang, I am you, and you are me. Don't think of me as too kind-hearted.\"","Tong Yang's expression froze, her brow furrowing. \"What do you mean?\"","\"You know I can ignore the barriers between worlds, moving freely among them, right?\"","\"Pioneer\" officers injected with high-quality gene serums could all ignore the limitations of magnetic field energy.","\"You've been to the real world?\" Tong Yang's voice turned grave.","During this period, the First World's Tong Yang had hardly appeared, staying unusually quiet. She hadn't caused trouble on a whim as she'd claimed she would. Tong Yang knew things wouldn't end so simply, but she hadn't expected her to go directly to the real world.","The First World's Tong Yang smiled gently. \"I said I wouldn't let anyone ruin the game I've been looking forward to for so long.\"","She sat up straight, removed her white cat-faced mask, revealing features identical to Tong Yang's.","\"Those who break the game's rules should be punished. The outcome between the First and Third Worlds must align with the result of our game. Otherwise, even if you complete your mission, everyone in the real world will die.\"","Tong Yang's heart sank. \"What have you done?\"","\"The Third World also possesses magnetic field energy. Since you're unwilling to develop it, I helped you. If the game rules are broken, the Earth's self-destruct sequence will activate. That's the first program I set. Since I'm the only one controlling it for now, its power is immense.\"","Tong Yang clenched her teeth. \"Are you insane? You'd kill everyone in the real world?\"","The First World's Tong Yang replied, \"If you follow the game's rules, I won't do that. Even if you fail, at least some people will survive.\"","\"You're a complete lunatic!\" Rage surged in Tong Yang's heart. She hadn't anticipated the First World's Tong Yang interfering here.","\"So you must abide by the game's rules,\" the First World's Tong Yang said with a laugh.","\"Full fusion of the energy cores is approximately fifteen minutes away. Fifteen minutes from now, the game officially begins.\"","\"I'm very much looking forward to it.\"","With that, the First World's Tong Yang and her group left the banquet hall.","Simultaneously, all eleven gates in the slums were opened. Countless slum dwellers poured through the passages into the commoners' district.","The previous bombing of the slums, along with the actions of Mi Qi, Bai Sining, and others who had used her name to resist the United Government, had already caused the slum dwellers to lose all trust in the authorities.","Yang Miao's disappearance and the influx of slum dwellers threw the banquet into utter chaos. The United Government immediately dispatched forces to suppress the situation. The scope was likely too vast, involving even some androids.","Yang Miao, taken by them, would be in no immediate mortal danger. There was no need to worry about her. Instead, the problem Tong Yang faced was exceedingly thorny; she couldn't possibly solve it alone.","Tong Yang didn't delay. She informed everyone currently on their missions.","He Jingjing said, \"I've already found Jingjing. I'll be back soon.\"","Tang Li said, \"We've destroyed the energy terminals in the families. We're on our way.\"","Destroying the energy terminals of eleven families was not something Tang Li could accomplish alone. Aside from Mi Qi, who remained in the slums, all other members of the \"Spiders\" rushed to the scene. Chu Shiyu, Xu Junyue, Tang Shuyan, and several individuals from the Z-country military also participated.","Upon learning of this, Ye Huai immediately informed the real world, telling them to brace themselves.","Once the self-destruct sequence was initiated, it could not be canceled. No one had anticipated things would escalate to this point, including Wu Pingxue.","The existence of Tong Yang from the First World was simply too formidable; it was impossible to circumvent her to complete their plan.","Upon hearing this, Wu Pingxue couldn't help but sigh. \"To think we'd be tripped up by Tong Yang of the First World.\"","The self-destruct sequence activates once its trigger conditions are met. They had no way to preemptively divert the magnetic field energy to another spacetime. Even if they somehow managed it, the real world would be utterly destroyed.","They could not break the rules of the game. Even though the energy core was fully integrated and the anchor point fell upon Yang Miao, it was fortunate that the parallel world, being ambitious, had temporarily made the First World its primary target. This meant that even if Tong Yang and the others died in the game, the real world could still cling to life for a while longer.","However, no time traveler had revealed the location of the magnetic field energy. Perhaps, before they could discover it, humanity in the real world would already be extinct, conquered by the parallel world.","Ye Huai said, \"The parallel world believes the United Government has discovered their plan to control Yang Miao and sanction the First World, and that they've hidden Yang Miao away. I'm afraid they'll soon start fighting over control of the energy core.\"","\"I understand.\" Tong Yang leaned against the wall, looking up at the eerie green sky, his mood unnervingly calm.","At this point, aside from engaging in the so-called \"Hunter Game\" with Tong Yang of the First World, they had no other choice.","If the First World and the parallel world fought, it would at least deplete both sides' strength, buying more breathing room for the real world.","\"Mr. Du asked me to relay a message: do your utmost and leave the rest to fate. The real world stands or falls with us.\"","Tong Yang asked, \"Where are you?\"","\"The restroom.\"","Tong Yang chuckled softly. \"Go back.\"","\"Back where?\" Ye Huai's voice faltered.","\"Home.\"","Tong Yang had no intention of letting Ye Huai participate in the so-called game. With things having developed to this extent, there was no need for him to stay here any longer.","There was a long silence on the other end of the line, suddenly broken by a suppressed cough.","Coughing is something that cannot be fully suppressed. Despite Ye Huai's efforts to appear fine, the coughs became wracking, as if he were trying to cough up all his internal organs.","Tong Yang listened quietly. After a few minutes, the coughing finally subsided.","Ye Huai's respiratory tract was already severely compromised.","\"I don't want you to die here. What if... we succeed?\" Tong Yang said calmly.","Ye Huai said, \"I love you.\"","\"I know.\" Tong Yang lowered his gaze. \"Me too.\"","\"I want to stay with you.\"","\"I'll do my best. Go back and wait for me,\" Tong Yang replied.","After a few seconds, Tong Yang added, \"If I don't make it back, before the world ends, please look after Tong Le for me. Don't let him repeat the same mistakes. What happened after May 18th doesn't need to happen again. I couldn't bear it.\"","In 2036, Tong Le had already broken away from the real world's timeline because of this. The next Tong Le must not do the same.","Ye Huai's voice grew hoarse. \"I won't let him do that. But I will.\"","Tong Yang smiled faintly. \"Why bother?\"","That they had managed to come this far was already a matter of perfect timing, geographical advantage, and human unity. Trying again might not yield the same results.","Tong Yang said, \"Go home, before the energy core fully integrates.\"","His physical condition was too poor. Staying here would only become a burden to Tong Yang.","\"I'll wait for you,\" Ye Huai murmured hoarsely.","Tong Yang nodded. \"I know.\"","Tong Yang hung up the phone and checked the time. Only five minutes remained until nine o'clock.","In the \"Netizen Gossip 007\" group chat, the atmosphere was buzzing.","[I'm here! I'm here!]","[We'll meet tomorrow!]","[So excited!!]","[It's still early. Should we meet up first?]","[No way! As loyal sidekicks to Sister Tong, how could we abandon her!]","[Good point!]","[See you tomorrow!]","[See you tomorrow!]","See you tomorrow.!","Jiao Yang recommends his other works:",":,",":,",":,","Hope you also like them"]},{"number":125,"title":"Chapter 125","paragraphs":["May 27, 2027, 8:59 PM.","A wave of eerie green energy swept across the sky, followed by a rush of scorching heat.","May 27, 2027, 9:00 PM sharp. A fierce wind whipped up sand and dust from the ground, sending stones flying and leaves dancing. Straight tree trunks bent under the gale, their leaves swirling down.","Building windows rattled violently in the wind, making it almost impossible to stand steady.","\"Damn! What a strong wind!\"","\"Has the energy core fused?\"","\"Boss!\"","Xu Junyue and a few others stood within the hazy sand-filled mist, waving towards Tong Yang by the wall.","The strong wind forced Tong Yang to squint. Through the dusty fog, she could make out over a dozen figures. It seemed everyone involved in this operation was present, except for Ye Huai and Mi Qi.","\"Damn... a tornado?\"","\"No way? Is this the so-called energy storm?\"","Following their gaze, Tong Yang saw a tornado over ten meters tall rampaging through the city, destroying surrounding buildings.","At the same time, not far from the tornado, a group of people walked slowly forward.","The Tong Yang from the First World took off her white cat-face mask, standing in the middle of the crowd. Armand and Ye Huai stood on her left and right, flanked by some other \"Forerunners.\"","Tang Li and Xu Junyue moved to stand beside Tong Yang, their expressions grave as they watched the approaching group.","The gale whipped their robes. The First World Tong Yang tied her jet-black hair back.","\"The residents of the affluent district have already taken shelter in the underground city. The rest have gone to suppress unrest in the slums and the commoners' district. Now, only a few of us remain within the energy storm,\" the First World Tong Yang said, squinting contentedly. \"We can have a good, exhilarating fight.\"","The First World Tong Yang didn't care about her own life, the fate of the First World, the parallel worlds, or the real world. She only needed to act on her whims.","For her, this was just a game—a duel with her counterpart from another world. But for Tong Yang and the others, it was a matter of survival for the real world.","\"Vroom—\"","\"Crack—\"","A wave of heat swept past their cheeks. An invisible force tore through the surrounding buildings. Walls as hard as iron were sliced clean through as if they were cake!","Yet, the severed buildings did not collapse. They all hovered in the air. For a moment, time seemed to stand still, and even the massive tornado halted its advance.","The overwhelmingly powerful magnetic field energy made it impossible for them to predict what would happen next within the storm.","The sky resembled a pool of eerie green seawater, gently swaying. The scenery before their eyes began to change noticeably.","In moments, the sci-fi-esque city transformed into a scene of ruins and decay.","Even more astonishingly, behind the First World's Tong Yang group, the sci‐fi city still stood. But behind Tong Yang's group, the city had become desolate and stained with blood.","The two scenes collided, creating a stark and strange contrast.","\"Where is Yang Miao?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"She's safe. At least until our game is over,\" replied the First World Tong Yang.","\"That's good.\"","They stared at each other, a confrontation imminent.","Armand's figure moved like a ghost.","Even though they could see him constantly shifting, they couldn't pinpoint his exact location. In the blink of an eye, he was right in front of them.","Tang Li hooked her long leg, the sharp heel of her high-heeled shoe landing on Armand's shoulder. \"I'll play with you,\" she said.","Armand raised his right hand, gently caressing her ankle. He tilted his head slightly, narrowing his blue eyes, and pressed his cheek to the tip of Tang Li's shoe. \"I'd like to play something else with you. What a pity,\" he sighed.","\"Get out of here, you lovestruck fool!\" someone cursed.","Using her leverage Tang Li spun her body, the heel of her other shoe grazing Armand's eye. She landed steadily and adjusted the cloak on her shoulders. \"Sorry, our little emotional game is over. I don't intend to continue,\" she said.","Armand's deep blue eyes fixed on Tang Li, his expression gradually darkening. \"A'Li, if you say that, I'll get angry,\" he said.","\"And what about the me from the Third World? I look forward to meeting him,\" the First World Ye Huai said coolly.","\"He's not here,\" Tong Yang replied.","\"Is that so? His body must be quite weak. Never mind, you can accompany me in his place...\"","\"I'll accompany you,\" Xu Junyue suddenly stepped in front of Tong Yang, glaring at the other party. \"I've disliked you for a long time. How can the same face look so damn annoying on you?\"","Tong Yang's side was missing a few people.","Chu Shiyu, and He Jingjing (Sister), who had been brought back by He Jingjing.","They were probably hiding somewhere, waiting for an opportunity to strike.","The First World Tong Yang couldn't be bothered listening to their reunions. She raised her right hand. \"I'll count to three. You can choose to run, or you can choose to fight. If you choose the latter, I believe the game will end very quickly.\"","\"Three...\"","Tong Yang tugged at Xu Junyue in front of her. \"Let's go.\"","Xu Junyue said, \"Go where? We definitely can't leave...\"","Before she finished speaking, she turned around and saw that everyone except her had already taken off running, leaving only their backs.","\"Damn! Why are you all running!\" Xu Junyue quickly chased after them.","\"Nonsense! Stay and get slaughtered?\"","\"Tang Li, weren't you going to play with him? Why are you running?\"","Tang Li shot her a contemptuous look. \"A wise man knows when to yield. Don't doubt it; a head-on fight is definitely unwinnable.\"","\"Boss, you...\"","Tong Yang said, \"We can't win. Don't be reckless.\"","Tong Yang herself might be able to exchange a few blows with the First World Ye Huai and Armand, but she had a very strong intuition. Even though she had never seen the First World Tong Yang in action, she felt that the other could crush them as easily as squashing ants. She didn't know if it was because the aura emanating from the First World Tong Yang was too powerful.","Moreover, Tong Yang and Ye Huai in the First World had been injected with high-quality gene drugs, making them extremely difficult to kill. The \"death\" Tong Yang mentioned wasn't about killing her outright, since that was nearly impossible. Tong Yang's side only needed to render her incapacitated, to cause her consciousness to collapse, and they would count that as a victory.","Tong Yang was still in a state of temporal dislocation, just like the First World Tong Yang, meaning she couldn't be directly killed either, unless they fought until the temporal dislocation ended.","\"Two...\"","The voice of the First World Tong Yang faintly reached them. In this \"Hunter Game,\" Tong Yang and her group could only passively become the prey.","\"What do we do? Split up?\"","If they stayed together, the First World group would also stay together, leaving them with no chance of winning. They had to separate them and take them down one by one.","According to the game rules, with Tong Yang and the First World Tong Yang as the ultimate prey, the game would end as soon as one of them \"died.\"","The best plan was to lure the others away, isolate the First World Tong Yang alone, then regroup to confront her together.","\"The Hunter Game has no extra rules. Only the ultimate prey identities belong to me and her. We can find a way to trap everyone except her in other worlds, then deal with her together,\" Tong Yang said.","Leaving aside whether this could even be done, even if it were possible, Tong Yang wasn't confident that so many of them could defeat the First World's Tong Yang.","Nevertheless, they had to separate them; otherwise, they stood no chance of winning.","\"What about the Parallel World's Yan Qing? Perhaps she can do it.\"","\"They are with Chu Shiyu, secretly looking for Yang Miao.\"","Tong Yang said in a low voice, \"Find an opportunity to notify them and Wu Pingxue. If they find Yang Miao, take her back to the real world immediately.\"","Wu Pingxue could utilize the Parallel World's Yan Qing to send them to any location within the First World. Perhaps she could also temporarily trap the \"Forerunners,\" except for the First World's Tong Yang, in other places. Whether it would work or not, they had to try.","\"Where do we rendezvous?\" Tang Li asked.","\"The Dueling Grounds,\" Tong Yang said.","The Dueling Grounds was the place where arena matches were held during the fourth round of \"Forerunner\" selections. Located in the southern part of the affluent district, the wealthy seldom went there except during special periods. It could be said it was prepared specifically for the \"Forerunner\" selections.","Tong Yang had lived there for a period and had a decent understanding of the surrounding terrain and buildings.","\"Alright!\"","\"Rendezvous at the Dueling Grounds!\"","Tong Yang's voice was heavy as she said, \"We only have one chance. If anyone gets separated here, no one will come looking for you. Fight with all your might to survive.\"","Tang Li said, \"Everyone, please remember, our goal is to kill the First World's Tong Yang. No matter how many sacrifices it takes, we cannot stop, and we absolutely must not give up.\"","The weight pressing down on their shoulders came from the entire real world.","Arriving at a fork in the road, the group, as if by tacit understanding, chose different paths.","Following behind them, the First World's Tong Yang and the \"Forerunners\" advanced unhurriedly, seemingly enjoying the thrill brought by their prey's panicked escape.","\"Can we just kill them directly? Including the Third World's Tong Yang.\"","The First World's Tong Yang looked in the direction they had scattered and said lightly, \"As you wish, if you can kill her.\"","Armand said solemnly, \"Miss A Li can only die by my hand.\"","\"Who would fight you for her? That woman looks tough to deal with.\"","\"Is that so? Miss A Li is very gentle.\"","\"Get lost.\"","\"I'll go this way first.\"","\"Then I'll chase this side.\"","\"That green-haired turtle is arrogant enough, my type.\"","The \"Forerunners\" scattered, following their escape routes, leaving only two people at the fork in the road.","\"Aren't you going to chase?\" the First World's Tong Yang asked.","\"You? With your speed, you could definitely catch up to her. Them splitting up is perfect, no one will disturb you two,\" the First World's Ye Huai retorted.","\"She's no match for me. Killing her outright would be too boring.\"","The First World's Tong Yang had sought out Tong Yang precisely because life was too dull; she wouldn't let the game end so simply.","\"Splitting up isn't a wise choice. I suspect they will come looking for me on their own,\" the First World's Tong Yang said, curling her lips.","The First World's Ye Huai said, \"Don't underestimate them too much. I'll accompany you—\"","Slap—","The First World's Tong Yang raised her hand and slapped him. \"Get far away. Don't try to interfere in my affairs.\"","The First World's Tong Yang hit him hard; a red handprint instantly appeared on his pale cheek.","The First World's Ye Huai lowered his gaze, his expression calm. A trickle of blood slid from the corner of his mouth. \"...Understood.\"","With that, he chased after one of the directions.","The First World's Tong Yang stood still in place. The background of the dark green sky swayed like seawater, tornadoes slowly traveled across the ground. Apart from these awe-inspiring and shocking sights, they posed no real threat to anyone.","The First World's Tong Yang pulled a mobile phone from her coat pocket. It was unmistakably the one Tong Yang carried with her! No one knew when it had ended up in her hands; probably even Tong Yang herself hadn't noticed.","She swiped on the screen and, after a moment, dialed a number.","The phone rang for seven or eight seconds before it was finally answered.","\"Sis?\"","On the other end of the line, Tong Le's hesitant voice sounded.","\"Sis, are you done with your work?\" Tong Le asked.","The First World's Tong Yang held the phone to her ear and fell silent.","\"Sis?\"","Not hearing a response for a long time, Tong Le called out, puzzled.","\"Asleep?\" the First World's Tong Yang said.","\"No, I'm doing my homework.\"","\"Still doing homework this late?\"","\"Yeah, I haven't finished yet.\"","\"Do it tomorrow. Rest early,\" the First World's Tong Yang said.","Tong Le paused for a moment, then asked cautiously, \"Are you Sis?\"","The First World's Tong Yang raised an eyebrow. \"Who else would I be?\"","Tong Le chuckled sheepishly. \"Sis said before, today's tasks must be done today. So, I can only sleep after finishing today's homework.\"","The First World's Tong Yang asked with a smile, \"Do you like the Sis from before, or the Sis now?\"","Tong Le declared loudly, \"I like any Sis. As long as it's Sis, I like her.\"","The First World's Tong Yang said, \"What if Sis did something annoying?\"","Tong Le said, \"If Sis does that, there must be a reason for it.\"","\"There's no reason. I just simply want to do it.\"","\"After doing it, will Sis become happy?\"","The First World's Tong Yang said, \"Mm, quite happy.\"","\"Then that's enough! As long as Sis is happy!\"","The First World's Tong Yang was momentarily lost in thought, then smiled. \"You're still the same as before.\"","\"Sis, what did you say?\" Tong Le asked, confused.","\"Nothing.\"","\"Sis, aren't you busy anymore?\" Tong Le asked.","\"Mm, not very busy.\"","Tong Le said happily, \"Then can I call you tomorrow?\"","\"Why call me?\"","\"Tomorrow is Friday. We have an activity in the morning. I'll call you then, okay?\"","\"Mm, if I can answer,\" the First World's Tong Yang said.","\"Sis, you must pay attention to your phone then!\"","\"Mm, I'll try.\"","\"Mm! Sis never breaks her promises to me!\"","The First World's Tong Yang smiled. \"Okay.\"","After hanging up, the smile gradually faded from her face, and she put the phone back into her coat pocket.","I wonder who will answer this phone tomorrow.","After splitting up, Tong Yang found herself in a very strange situation.","It was as if she were trapped inside a jigsaw puzzle. The sky was divided into different components. One part showed a dark green hue, with buildings suspended in the air; another part was an endless dark night, where one could vaguely see abandoned structures standing in the darkness; the remaining part of the sky was bright as day, like a city that never sleeps.","Tong Yang realized they were in a chaotic zone where three worlds intersected. She could see it, others could see it, and people in the real world could see it too.","But Tong Yang wasn't worried. The special particles developed by Bureau 749's Nick could precisely conceal this bizarre phenomenon. At the very least, the real world wouldn't discover the entrances to the First World and the Parallel World.","Tong Yang did not sense anyone pursuing her from behind. She climbed into a building, intending to find a spot with a broad view to assess the situation.","Even if she wasn't being tracked, heading directly to the duel site was pointless. The others wouldn't be able to get there anytime soon. It was better to observe and see if she could seize an opportunity to do something or find any usable conditions.","The affluent district at the epicenter of the energy storm was severely affected. The entire city's power had been cut, plunging the building interiors into darkness.","\"I wonder where Chu Shiyu and the others are,\" Tong Yang murmured to herself.","She hoped they had managed to hide somewhere else without being discovered. Otherwise, they would be the first to die.","Tong Yang lightened her footsteps and entered the pitch-black stairwell.","Reaching the second floor, she suddenly noticed a slender yet unmistakable beam of light.","Pausing her steps, Tong Yang approached the light and found its source was inside a drawer.","Opening the drawer, a purple light ray, thin as a thread yet distinctly bright, emanated from a strange black wristband.","Picking it up, Tong Yang found a button on its side and a pulse-sensing device on the underside.","She pressed the button, and the purple light instantly went out. There were several similar sensor wristbands, not just one or two. At the very bottom lay a brand-new instruction manual.","The wristband could sense the wearer's pulse. Once the wearer encountered a dangerous situation, the sensor ray would activate automatically. If there was no danger, the wearer could manually turn off the ray within one minute.","A purple ray indicated a general situation, red indicated a serious situation, and black indicated a critical, near-death situation. The purple ray could not penetrate walls; the red ray had a penetration range of one hundred meters in all directions; the black ray's range was sufficient to penetrate the entire affluent district.","Note: Pressing the button under normal circumstances will emit a general purple ray, which requires manual deactivation.","Tong Yang's phone was lost at some point, perhaps dropped on the road during her frantic escape. She couldn't retrace her steps to look for it and had lost her means of contacting the others. Perhaps these sensor wristbands could serve a purpose—at least by emitting rays, she could learn their location and general physical condition.","Tong Yang took all the sensor wristbands from the drawer. She would distribute them to the others when they reunited at the duel site.","Tong Yang continued upwards, reaching the floor where the building had been severed by the magnetic field energy.","A fierce wind whipped through the open air. An eerie green light filtered through the floating debris of buildings suspended mid-air, casting patterns on the ground. Overhead, they were shrouded by the massive shadows of structures that seemed poised to crash down at any moment.","Crouching low, Tong Yang moved to the edge. Just as she was about to rise and check the situation, she heard an angry shout from the empty street below.","\"I'll fight you to the death!\"","Frowning, Tong Yang immediately circled to the other side and looked down.","Xu Junyue was confronting a \"Forerunner\" on an adjacent street. Whatever the other party had said had provoked Xu Junyue into a rage.","Under the green phosphorescent glow, her hair shone with a greenish hue as she cursed furiously, \"You're the green-haired turtle! Your whole family are green-haired turtles! Your entire world is full of green-haired turtles!\"","With that, a battle erupted instantly.","Xu Junyue's skills had improved considerably. During her fight with Tong Yang in Sector Twelve the other day, she had clearly been holding back. Now, though gradually losing ground in her struggle with the \"Forerunner,\" she was giving as good as she got.","However, it would be very difficult for Xu Junyue to defeat her opponent, and finding a chance to escape seemed unrealistic. The \"Forerunner\" was fast; they needed a way to stall it.","\"CRASH—\"","While Tong Yang was pondering what to do, a tremendous roar suddenly came from the floating buildings above.","She instinctively looked up. Those structures were actually plummeting toward the ground!","All the city's large buildings had been split in two by the magnetic field energy—one half remained on the ground, the other half suspended in the air. Now, they were rapidly falling.","\"You've got to be kidding me...\" Tong Yang felt a lump in her throat.","\"Holy shit!\"","\"What the hell!\"","Everyone caught in the storm's center was stunned by the sight.","Would they be crushed by these buildings before they even had a chance to fight?","At the same time, Tong Yang noticed rubble falling from one building passing through the fragmented scene and entering another space.","A shudder ran through Tong Yang. \"Oh no!\"","These falling structures would pass through the chaotic dimensional barriers and enter the real world!!"]},{"number":126,"title":"Chapter 126","paragraphs":["The collapsing buildings were like a vast, dark sky caving in, solid walls piercing through the partitioned space and entering different worlds.","\"Boom!\"","A heavy object crashed down beside her, smashing a deep crater into the ground, sending dust flying and smoke billowing.","Tremors shook the earth one after another. Tong Yang ducked into a stairwell, peering outside through a corner window.","In this situation, everyone was struggling to save themselves. Xu Junyue and the \"Forerunner\" ceased their entanglement and fled to find shelter elsewhere.","Clearly, no one had anticipated something like this would happen.","\"Boom—\"","A massive structure crashed onto the roof of the building where Tong Yang was. Debris rained down, the floor beneath her feet shaking violently. She could only stand upright by pressing herself against the wall. Fortunately, the buildings in the affluent district were made of special materials, incredibly sturdy, able to withstand the intense impacts.","However, while the First World could hold, the real world might not.","From the partitioned scenes, one could see the real world was located in a bustling city. If struck by these falling buildings, who knew what scale of disaster would unfold.","\"Boom!\"","The ceiling was smashed open, creating a large hole. Tong Yang gritted her teeth. Now was not the time to worry about the real world. She had to end the game with the First World's Tong Yang as soon as possible. If the energy storm was allowed to persist, the situation would become unimaginable.","\"Boom!\"","The incessant, deafening roars seemed intent on boring through the planet. The tornado was no longer moving slowly; it was now madly advancing towards the city center, sweeping up many of the buildings that had already fallen to the ground.","The eerie green sky was blotted out by a dense shroud of flying sand and stones. The howling wind amplified in her ears, sounding like the end of the world.","Tong Yang felt the building she was in teetering on the brink of collapse. It wouldn't hold much longer. She wondered how the others were faring. If anyone was struck by falling debris or sucked into the tornado, death would be certain.","Tong Yang quickly ran downstairs. It was too dangerous; the game simply couldn't proceed. Perhaps they would die in this chaos without the First World's Tong Yang or the \"Forerunner\" even needing to lift a finger.","What to do?","What should they do?","Tong Yang's expression was grave, her lips pressed into a tight line, her palms slick with cold sweat. They had underestimated the power generated by the energy storm. If this continued, no one would escape death.","Tong Yang circled to the backside of the tornado and jumped down from the second floor of a building. The fierce wind felt like the combined force of dozens of hands, relentlessly pulling at her body. She pressed herself tightly against the back of the building, each step a struggle. But the tornado was getting closer and closer; in a few minutes, this place would be reduced to rubble.","Tong Yang cursed under her breath. What the hell was this magnetic field energy? How could such a powerful tornado appear in the city?","\"Tong Yang!\"","From within the thick fog woven from grit, several figures came running towards her.","\"I'm here!\" Tong Yang called back. Exposing her identity didn't matter anymore; this was beyond anything humans could stop.","\"Give me your hand!\"","Tong Yang reached out and grasped Tang Shuyan's hand, then used the wind's force to leap easily to their side.","\"Put this on,\" said Tang Li.","The wind was too strong; Tong Yang couldn't see her movements clearly, only feeling her fastening something around her waist and hooking one end to the ground. The powerful pulling force from the wind vanished almost instantly.","Tong Yang breathed a sigh of relief and looked at the others. Everyone had gathered except Xu Junyue.","The gale had tangled Tang Li's hair. Her expression was extremely serious. \"In this situation, there's nothing we can do. Even if the 'Forerunner' is stronger than us, they're ultimately only human. They must be facing the same circumstances.\"","Tong Yang nodded. \"Right. No need to head to the duel arena. Let's find a place to take cover for now.\"","The three worlds were thrown into chaos within the energy storm, but the storm itself existed only in the First World. The other two worlds would certainly be affected, but their situation would be much better than here.","\"We're missing Xu Junyue.\"","\"She's in that third building over there. She should still be alive. Let's go find her.\"","\"Let's go!\"","Tang Li pressed a button on the device attached to Tong Yang's waist. The silver hook instantly retracted, and the suction force from the tornado swept over her body once more.","\"What is this?\" Tong Yang asked.","Tang Li replied, \"Anti-gravity wire device. The button on the right launches and retrieves the hook. I, uh, borrowed it from Armand's place before we left.\"","Anti-gravity wire, something used by the military. Militants in the slums had also developed and used it to counter combat aircraft.","Using the anti-gravity wire device in this situation would prevent them from being swept into the tornado.","\"Walking over there is too slow.\"","The tornado was advancing rapidly. If they didn't evacuate quickly, this entire area would be destroyed.","\"Then what do we do? We can only move by repositioning the anti-gravity wire. Otherwise, we risk getting pulled in!\"","Dust swirled around them. Crossing a single street might only take a minute on foot, but constantly repositioning the anti-gravity wire back and forth would take who knows how long. The tornado was right upon them; they had no time to spare.","Tong Yang pressed her lips together tightly, looking at the anti-gravity wire device on her waist. She didn't know how much wire was stored inside. If it was comparable to the length used during the combat aircraft attack, it should be enough to cross this exposed road.","\"Follow me,\" Tong Yang said.","Bracing against the strong wind, she circled around the building to its side, found a suitable spot, and pressed the button on the device. The silver hook shot through the air with a whoosh and, with a sharp thunk, embedded itself in the wall of the building across the street.","\"Success!\"","The others roughly understood Tong Yang's idea and followed suit, launching their own hooks to the opposite side of the street.","\"One, two, three...\"","Tong Yang leaned back. Sure enough, a pulling sensation came from the opposite direction via the anti-gravity wire. Once the force was sufficient, the wire suddenly retracted, and their bodies soared through the night sky towards the opposite street.","\"Holy shit!\"","\"So thrilling!\"","\"This is how you're supposed to use this thing!\"","\"Careful! Let go of the hook before you get too close, or else—\"","\"Thud!\"","Before Tong Yang could finish her sentence, the others promptly pressed their buttons to release the hooks. However, a dull thud sounded beside her as World A's Chu Shiyu slammed straight into the wall, nearly denting it.","\"Damn... you could've said that earlier!\" World A's Chu Shiyu complained, rubbing her nearly-broken neck.","The others landed steadily and quickly took shelter inside the building.","\"Use your head. The others didn't need a reminder,\" Tong Yang said expressionlessly as she climbed into the building.","Tang Li marveled, \"If this thing could be used by the military in the real world, it would be incredibly convenient.\"","Tang Shuyan added, \"True. We might even achieve wall-running and roof-leaping.\"","Tong Yang moved forward, following the traces left on the ground, and said, \"Anti-gravity wire isn't scientifically sound; it's probably related to magnetic field energy. This technology could be realized in the real world, but not by relying on anti-gravity.\"","The group followed Tong Yang forward, the sound of wind and collapsing buildings frequently ringing out. At the same time, they heard the sounds of a fight coming from around them.","\"Be careful, there are others here,\" Tong Yang warned.","The group lightened their steps as they approached the source of the noise, which grew clearer and clearer.","In an open-air garden, fallen debris had smashed through walls and the fountain pool, splashing water everywhere. Two people were fighting amidst the ruined garden, one of them being Xu Junyue.","Her clothes were completely soaked, and there were numerous injuries on her exposed skin. The \"Forerunner\" was in slightly better shape and kicked Xu Junyue into the water pool.","Xu Junyue let out a muffled groan, her hair plastered wetly to her face. With no time to react, her opponent's attack was already upon her. She immediately rolled to the side, pushed off the ground with her hands, and in a reverse hook kick stance, sent the other woman stumbling back.","\"Pah!\"","Xu Junyue stood up, spat fiercely, and cursed, \"A bunch of trash.\"","The other woman sneered, \"You don't seem very afraid of death?\"","\"Open your dog eyes wide. If I were afraid of death, would I still be standing here?\" Xu Junyue retorted coldly.","Suddenly, Xu Junyue seemed to see something and pointed behind her opponent in surprise, \"Watch your back!\"","The woman mocked, \"You think such a trick can fool me? If anyone approached, I'd sense it immediately... Ah!\"","Before the woman could finish, a powerful impact hit her from behind. Her neck was grabbed from behind, and her body was thrown uncontrollably towards the ground. As she tried to resist, Xu Junyue pounced, pinning her arms, leaving her to fall face-first onto the hard ground.","With a thud, her forehead struck the hard stone, blood gushing out.","Apart from the Forerunner officers, others hadn't been injected with the gene serum, so their bodies couldn't heal automatically.","Xu Junyue lifted her chin and sneered, \"Told you to watch your back, idiot.\"","\"Hmph!\"","Tong Yang pressed down on the woman's neck, helping Xu Junyue restrain her. Then, she pulled out a dagger hidden on her person, grabbed the woman's hair, pressed the blade tip against her throat, and slit it open fiercely, blood splattering both of them.","\"Indeed, ambushes work better against them.\"","Xu Junyue tilted her head for a look, \"That's it? Dead? Thought they'd be harder to kill.\"","Chu Shiyu from World A stepped forward, rolling her eyes, \"Forerunners have ranks too, you know? If not for Tong Yang's sneak attack from behind, could you have beaten her?\"","\"Oh? What's a mutt eliminated in the third round barking about?\"","The two could start arguing at the drop of a hat.","\"Shut up.\" Tong Yang, annoyed by their bickering, snapped.","Tang Li said, \"Tong Yang's anti-gravity filament device is the last one. Xu Junyue, you should move together with Tong Yang.\"","\"Anti-gravity filament device? What's that thing?\" Xu Junyue looked up at the sky, puzzled, \"And what's with this place? It's like the apocalypse.\"","\"Probably the effects of the energy storm.\"","As she spoke, Tong Yang handed them the sensor bracelets she was carrying and explained how to use them.","\"My phone is gone, and using communication devices in critical moments isn't convenient. If we get separated, we can use the sensor bracelets to determine each other's location and vital status.\"","\"Not bad, this thing.\"","Tong Yang said, \"We don't know how long this situation will last. People from the First World will also try to avoid it, so they won't have time for us for a while. Let's go.\"","Xu Junyue asked, \"Where to?\"","They definitely couldn't return to the real world; leading the First World's Tong Yang and the others back would be disastrous. They could only choose to temporarily take refuge in a parallel world. Even though parallel worlds were also full of dangers, it was better than continuing to suffer the consequences of the energy storm.","\"Let's go!\"","The group moved through the buildings, planning to enter a parallel world through a spatial rift.","\"Can we reach Chu Shiyu and the others?\"","Chu Shiyu, along with Yan Qing and Liang Xi from the parallel world, had split up to search for Yang Miao's traces and should also be within the energy storm area.","Tang Shuyan said, \"They're fine. They infiltrated the underground city.\"","Chu Shiyu and the other two came to the First World as representatives of the parallel world, so entering the underground city shouldn't pose much danger.","\"Boom!\"","A piece of building debris crashed down behind the group and was simultaneously split by the three worlds, falling into each one.","Tong Yang reached a boundary where space was divided, located the position of the parallel world, and led everyone diving in.","Their figures almost vanished into thin air on the ground. Two people standing atop the collapsed buildings watched this scene.","\"Miss Ah Li is so clever, she actually took my anti-gravity filament device,\" Armand sighed.","Ye Huai from the First World glanced at him sideways, \"Didn't you leave it for her on purpose?\"","Armand wore an innocent expression, \"Menard, what are you saying? Why would I do such a thing?\"","Ye Huai from the First World's eyes turned cold, \"I've told you, that's not my name.\"","Armand scoffed, \"Ye Wen's death isn't anyone else's fault. After all these years, still holding a grudge against your father?\"","Ye Huai from the First World's gaze was like icy daggers, fixed intently on Armand.","\"At that time, the Second World needed to cooperate with the Third World, and the condition was Ye Wen's heart. Weren't you the same? Menard gave you the heart of Ye Huai from the Third World. The Second World gave your brother Ye Wen's heart to Ye Wen of the Third World. The only difference is, the Second World chose not to sustain Ye Wen's life.\"","Ye Huai from the First World said coldly, \"Do you think you know a lot?\"","Armand said, \"I mean no harm. I'm just like you, looking forward to their collapse. To do that, you should cooperate with the Menard family sooner.\"","\"Shut up.\" Ye Huai from the First World stopped responding to him.","\"If Tong Yang from the Third World dies, are we really going to hand over the child of the first-generation android to the United Government?\" Armand mused to himself.","\"Shut up.\"","\"The Slayer doesn't seem to intend to do that. Didn't she just throw Yang Miao out of the energy storm?\"","\"Shut up.\"","Armand didn't mind her attitude and said, \"They've entered the Second World. Pursue them? Commander.\"","Ye Huai from the First World looked in the direction they had left, her expression deep and unreadable.","\"The effects of the energy storm are more than this. The Second World might not be any safer than here.\"","Armand nodded, \"True.\"","\"Those folks in the Second World, their brains have been excessively affected by the magnetic field energy. By now, it's probably already turned into a living hell.\"","\"My dear Miss Ah Li, please take care. At the very least, don't die by anyone else's hand.\""]},{"number":127,"title":"Chapter 127","paragraphs":["The night sky was fragmented by shifting scenes, dimly illuminated by an eerie green light and the neon glow of the city.","The parallel world had been damaged by debris from First World structures, leaving everything around desolate and crumbling. Fortunately, they were not yet threatened by the tornadoes brewing within the energy storms.","Only when the scenes in the sky flickered could they feel the powerful wind tearing through the barriers between worlds.","Retracting the anti-gravity fishing line to their waists and temporarily out of danger, everyone let out a collective sigh of relief.","\"Finally safe!\"","\"That magnetic field energy is terrifying.\"","\"It's hard to imagine how horrifying it would be if the magnetic field energies of all three worlds completely merged.\"","\"It's simply a scourge!\"","The group found a quiet spot, panting heavily as they sat on the ground.","\"What do we do now? We can barely protect ourselves, let alone kill that monster, First World Tong Yang.\"","Tong Yang leaned his back against a wall. Fighting against the other \"Forerunners\" wasn't too difficult; besides Tong Yang, Tang Li and a few others could manage it. The real challenge lay with Tenth World Tong Yang, First World Ye Huai, and Armand.","The power of these three was on a completely different level from the rest.","\"I wonder what's happening in the real world?\"","Tang Li said, \"The real world made preparations in advance, so we probably don't need to worry. Still, if this goes on long term, the real world might not be able to hold out.\"","\"It's not important,\" Tong Yang said firmly. \"The real world has the capability to handle it. We just need to survive and kill First World Tong Yang.\"","Tong Yang continued, \"First World Tong Yang and the others might catch up at any moment. Let's first contact Mi Qi and the real world.\"","After the twelve gates of the slums opened, the poor flooded into the commoner districts. Mi Qi and Bai Sining were mixed in among them. Once they entered a commoner district, they could receive satellite signals and be contacted.","\"Alright.\"","Additionally, the awakened androids, guided by Yang Miao, had joined Mi Qi and the others in the incursion into the commoner districts. While they couldn't fully contend with the United Government, they could hold them off for a while.","Tang Li and Tang Shuyan contacted Mi Qi and Mr. Du respectively.","Mi Qi and Bai Sining were hiding in a commoner district. Android armies dispatched by the United Government were trying to expel them. Fortunately, the slums covered a vast area and could cultivate considerable resources. Utilizing these resources for military purposes allowed them to temporarily resist the United Government. Coupled with the energy storms enveloping the affluent districts and the Mednard family causing trouble, both sides were deadlocked, delaying the United Government.","After Tang Shuyan finished his call with the real world, he returned to the group.","\"Nick's special particles are covering the sky above the city with spatial distortions. Bureau 749 has established something like a glass dome. Falling building debris is shattered by artillery fire upon hitting the dome.\"","\"The special particles simulate the night sky, so people in the real world have no idea what's happening.\"","Xu Junyue asked, \"Isn't the sound of artillery quite loud? Someone should notice, right?\"","\"The glass dome has a certain soundproofing effect. It took Bureau 749 years to develop this technology. The room used to imprison Yan Qing from the parallel worlds employs the same technique. Besides, this is in China. Even if people hear some explosions, they'd just think it's thunder.\"","\"In that case, we have even fewer concerns.\"","Tang Shuyan paused, looked at Tong Yang, and said, \"However, I heard Ye Huai's condition has deteriorated severely. After returning to the real world, he showed signs of sudden death. The medical team is performing emergency resuscitation on him...\"","His expression was grave, and he seemed hesitant to continue.","Tong Yang lowered his gaze, pursing his lips. \"And then?\"","Tang Shuyan said, \"Ye Huai's body was already at its limit long ago. The hope of him surviving is very slim.\"","A flicker passed through Tong Yang's eyes. He pressed his fingertips into his palm and murmured, \"I see.\"","\"And he had long refused injections of the premium genetic serum.\"","Tong Yang's throat felt somewhat dry. He spoke with a hint of self-mockery, \"It seems he's in a life-or-death moment, just like us.\"","Everyone sat in silence on the ground, unsure of what words to use to break it at this moment.","They had no time to dwell on Ye Huai's condition.","Just then, rustling sounds came from all around the building.","\"Be careful.\"","Everyone immediately became alert, rising to their feet and looking around.","Figures loomed faintly within a thick black fog. Shoulder to shoulder, they formed a dark, oppressive mass like a giant serpent, encircling them with their bulky forms.","\"Long time no see.\"","A young man walking at the front of the crowd gave them a harmless smile and said, \"Remember me?\"","A-World Chu Shiyu's eyes widened. \"Tao Bai? What are you doing here?\"","Seeing the young man's face clearly, Tong Yang frowned. It was indeed B-World Tao Bai, who had infiltrated their group at the Xili Mall. Like A-World Chu Shiyu, he was one of Wu Pingxue's subordinates.","However, after Wu Pingxue was expelled from the parallel worlds, only A-World Chu Shiyu and a few others remained by her side. B-World Tao Bai was not among them.","\"If I'm not here, where should I be?\" B-World Tao Bai said with an innocent look.","Then, someone walked out from behind B-World Tao Bai. She stared expressionlessly at Tong Yang and the others.","\"Wen Qin?\" Tong Yang frowned tightly. Why was she here?","\"How did you know we were here?\" A-World Chu Shiyu demanded. \"You traitor! If it weren't for you, Dr. Wu would never have been driven out!\"","A-World Chu Shiyu and Wu Pingxue had never mentioned the trigger for their expulsion from the parallel worlds. It seemed B-World Tao Bai was involved.","Wen Qin had originally been guarding the conference hall entrance with Tong Yang. Later, when Yang Miao went missing and was taken away, Wen Qin's whereabouts became unknown.","The situation was now very clear. Tong Yang's identity had been exposed.","\"Who would have thought,\" B-World Tao Bai sighed, \"that you've been hiding in the First World all along, even becoming a 'Forerunner,' a figure leading humanity forward.\"","The figures hidden in the black fog gradually became clearer. Their eyes were wide with anger, their faces expressionless as they stared ahead, weapons in hand. Their numbers were dense, pressing forward one after another, making it impossible to tell how many people were hidden in the fog.","\"I was still considering how to capture you. The center of the energy storm is so dangerous. I didn't expect you to just show up on your own, like rabbits waiting by a tree stump.\"","Countless people surrounded them in a tiny space, eyeing their lives with predatory intent.","Tong Yang was utterly perplexed. Wen Qin had countless opportunities to leak his identity to the parallel worlds before today. Why wait until now, after the energy storms appeared?","She was from the Armand family, fully aware of the deal between Tong Yang and First World Tong Yang. Why would she come out to sabotage it?","Tong Yang observed Wen Qin's expression. It was very stiff, quite similar to the people around her who were being controlled by the magnetic field energy.","Was Wen Qin being controlled? To train perfect warriors, the parallel worlds used methods to eliminate the influence of magnetic field energy on candidates for the \"Forerunner\" selection. She shouldn't be susceptible to magnetic field energy manipulation.","Why?","\"Wen Qin, why are you here?\" Tong Yang asked tentatively.","Wen Qin just looked at her, offering no response.","Tong Yang's heart sank. Could it be that the energy storm had also affected the parallel world?","\"No need for small talk, right? Once the time anchor is killed, everything will end. From what I know, the temporal dislocation will disappear tomorrow.\"","\"Enough!\" Xu Junyue suddenly cursed. \"I was already annoyed, and now you're rushing to your death.\"","\"If I can't beat those monsters, do you really think I can't handle you?\"","\"Really looking down on us, aren't they?\"","It was unclear how many people lurked in the darkness, but they weren't afraid. Instead, they found an outlet for their pent-up resentment.","\"Wait.\" Tang Li suddenly called for everyone to stop. She raised her phone and took a picture of them. \"I'll call Armand over.\"","Xu Junyue: \"???\"","\"Wait, you're calling him here to fight us alongside these people?\"","Tang Li said, \"We'll use him. There's no way he'd let us die at their hands. They'll be the snipe and the clam, and we'll be the fisherman who profits.\"","\"Whoosh—\"","Tang Li sent the message.","\"You're not going to stop her?\" Xu Junyue asked in surprise, looking at Tong Yang.","Tong Yang said, \"We shouldn't waste our energy. We might even find a chance to return to the First World.\"","Tong Yang reminded them, \"Wen Qin is strong. I'll handle her. The others... you deal with as you see fit.\"","\"Tang Shuyan, may I ask, do you feel like telling our fortunes today?\"","Tang Shuyan said, \"Not interested.\"","\"That's good.\"","After all, this guy only wanted to tell fortunes for those about to die.","B World Tao Bai sneered, \"It seems you only have eyes for Wen Qin.\"","\"Enough talk. If you can fight, don't just chatter.\"","\"Then...\"","\"I'm terribly sorry, it seems we've come at a bad time.\"","A voice suddenly came from behind Tong Yang.","Everyone turned around and saw several members of the \"Forerunners,\" led by Armand and First World Ye Huai.","\"Miss Ah Li can only die by my hand.\"","\"They are my prey. Are you trying to steal them?\"","Tong Yang and Tang Li exchanged a glance and immediately retreated to the side, leaving a blank area in the middle.","It would be best if the \"Forerunners\" fought B World Tao Bai. Moreover, with First World Tong Yang not among them, they could seize the chance to return to the First World and surround First World Tong Yang.","B World Tao Bai said, \"What are you trying to do? Don't forget the First World and the Main World have signed a pact. As long as the Shadow World's time anchor is killed, things will become much simpler.\"","\"Is that so.\" First World Ye Huai's smile was mocking. \"What's the use of a pact? Weren't you planning to annex the First World by controlling the child of the original android?\"","B World Tao Bai narrowed his eyes. \"I don't understand what you're saying.\"","\"Perhaps you're not high-ranking enough to know about such things,\" First World Ye Huai said.","Tong Yang and the others were secretly shocked. So First World Ye Huai and these \"Forerunners\" all knew the parallel world's goal, yet not a single one had warned the United Government.","These guys were just like First World Tong Yang, thriving on chaos.","Before they could continue their exchange, Wen Qin was the first to pounce towards Tong Yang.","\"I said, they are my prey!\"","A \"Forerunner\" blocked the path in front of Tong Yang and the others, intercepting Wen Qin's attack.","\"Since you refuse to see reason, don't blame me for not holding back! I'd like to see if the legendary 'Forerunners' can really take on a hundred enemies at once,\" B World Tao Bai scoffed.","\"Take on a hundred? You underestimate us.\"","In the blink of an eye, all the parallel world humans from within the black mist surrounded them.","All the \"Forerunners,\" including Armand and First World Ye Huai, were drawn into the fray.","Xu Junyue watched from behind, dumbfounded, and exclaimed, \"Are they insane?\"","Tang Shuyan said, \"I never thought everyone here was so noble. Well, we'll be taking our leave first.\"","\"Don't even think about it!\"","The Forerunners, while grappling with the parallel world humans, also launched attacks at Tong Yang and the others.","\"Miss Ah Li, you can't just leave me behind here.\"","First World Ye Huai said, \"If you can leave, feel free to try.\"","Of course, Tong Yang and the others wouldn't obediently stay. These guys were complete lunatics, fighting the parallel world humans while also entangling them. Add to that the parallel world humans attacking them as well, and no one could break free, creating a chaotic three-way melee.","Anyone who wasn't an ally was fair game. Xu Junyue even accidentally slapped A World Chu Shiyu in the face.","\"Oops! Sorry, my mistake,\" Xu Junyue said without a hint of sincerity.","A World Chu Shiyu covered her cheek and swore, \"You did that on purpose, you bitch!\"","Xu Junyue said, \"Believe me, this time it really wasn't.\"","\"Get lost!!!\"","At that moment, Tang Shuyan suddenly remembered something and said, \"Tong Yang, listen to me.\"","Tang Shuyan used his nunchaku to snap someone's neck and regrouped with Tong Yang, their shoulders pressed together.","\"What is it?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"Besides the matter with Ye Huai, Mr. Du also said that Wu Pingxue has already entered the First World. Your previous suggestion is viable. We can temporarily seal the passage between the two worlds using Parallel World Yan Qing. However, the energy storm is uncontrollable and will require some time.\"","\"If we can hold out until then and return to the First World, the other 'Forerunners' will be trapped in the parallel world.\"","Tong Yang's breath hitched. \"About how long?\"","\"Ten hours.\"","Ten hours was too long.","Yet given the current situation, they had no better option.","Aside from trapping the \"Forerunners\" here alone, the only alternative was to kill them and then go after First World Tong Yang.","But the latter was almost impossible, especially surrounded by parallel world humans.","Hold out for ten hours, return to the First World, seal the passage, and surround First World Tong Yang.","This was currently the method with the highest chance of success in Tong Yang's judgment.","\"I understand.\"!"]},{"number":128,"title":"Chapter 128","paragraphs":["\"Psychos!\"","\"How are they sticking to us like goddamn leeches!\"","\"Who wants to fight them anyway!\"","The group, covered in blood and panting, scrambled into the abandoned building, sealing the doors and windows shut, their bodies pressed tightly against the walls.","The parallel world humans posed no real threat, just a time-consuming nuisance. However, First World Ye Huai, Armand, and the others were a different story. While dealing with the parallel world humans, they relentlessly harassed our group, leading to a messy three-way brawl. It was a tough fight, and they'd only just managed a full retreat.","Tong Yang wiped the blood from his face. \"What time is it?\"","Someone answered, \"Just past midnight.\"","So much had happened, such a hard-fought battle, yet only three hours had passed since the energy cores of the two worlds fused at 9 PM on May 27th, 2027. There were still nearly eight hours to go until Wu Pingxue's promised temporary sealing of the inter-world channel.","They had to hold out in this parallel world for at least eight more hours.","\"Hah!\"","\"What do we do? Those guys are like hounds; they can sniff us out from a mile away.\"","Tong Yang said, \"We need to last until at least 7:30 AM. We can't engage them head-on, but we also can't just hide without being found, otherwise they might return to the First World early.\"","Tang Shuyan had already relayed Wu Pingxue's message to everyone.","Tang Li suggested, \"A war of attrition?\"","Tang Shuyan said, \"Attrition doesn't necessarily mean fighting. We advance when they retreat, retreat when they advance.\"","Xu Junyue rolled her eyes. \"You think they'll ever retreat? It's only us doing the retreating.\"","\"And we can't stray too far from the First World's energy storm zone.\"","They could use the spatial chaos within the energy storm area to easily return to the First World.","\"Holy crap!\" A-World Chu Shiyu, standing by the window, took a glance outside. \"They've caught up.\"","\"Move!\"","Regardless, engaging First World Ye Huai's group head-on offered no benefit for their mission. Their only choice was to avoid a direct confrontation.","\"Don't run away. Let's play a game together.\"","\"The Slayer isn't here. This is your best chance. Won't you seize it?\"","\"Stop running. You can't escape.\"","\"Are all you Third World people cowards?\"","\"If you've got the guts, step out. How about a one-on-one duel? Or we can even let you have two against one?\"","\"You all seem pretty useless to me. A bunch of trash?\"","The voices from behind sounded lazy, almost bored.","\"Idiots! Who'd fall for such an obvious taunt!\"","\"Instead of wasting your breath on sarcasm, why don't you try catching us first!\"","\"Such annoying flies, always sticking to us.\"","Cursing and retreating, Tong Yang's group deliberately led any parallel world humans they encountered towards First World Ye Huai's location.","With the anti-gravity wire devices, their mobility was incredibly high. While First World Ye Huai and the others were fast on their feet, they couldn't match the ability to scale walls and fly across rooftops. For the time being, they could only follow from a distance.","Being unable to catch up was one thing, but Xu Junyue and the others kept tossing out taunts every now and then. The \"Forerunners\" seemed particularly susceptible to this; even though they couldn't close the gap, they stubbornly kept tailing them.","Tong Yang fired an anti-gravity wire, grabbed Xu Junyue's arm, and used the anti-gravity to soar through the air, landing on the roof of the opposite building.","Xu Junyue let out an excited shout. \"The anti-gravity wire is such an awesome tool! They should really popularize this in our real world.\"","\"Keep it down.\" Tong Yang's ears were ringing from her noise.","The \"Forerunners\" trailed far behind. First World Ye Huai shot Armand a sideways glance. \"You seem to be enjoying this?\"","Armand feigned innocence. \"Not at all. I'm quite irritated right now.\"","\"Bullshit!\"","\"If it weren't for those anti-gravity wires, we'd have caught them ages ago!\"","\"Now look at us, following them around like fools.\"","Armand scoffed. \"Making excuses? Can't catch them, so you have no other ideas?\"","Someone else shrugged. \"Force them to fight us? Like capturing some Third World people?\"","\"Too troublesome. I don't want to fight Tong Yang. It'd be a drawn-out mess, and chances are we still wouldn't win.\"","First World Ye Huai said, \"Is that your excuse for slacking off?\"","\"Anyway, the Slayer doesn't intend for us to kill Tong Yang.\"","\"They're leading us around like we're on a leash. What's their goal?\"","Armand said, \"Buying time, probably.\"","First World Ye Huai said, \"Their target is the Slayer. They'll definitely try to trap us here and return to the First World.\"","\"Oh? Really? Can they do that? Trapping us here isn't exactly easy.\"","\"I'm kind of looking forward to it!\"","\"I wonder how they'll do it? Not like all of them combined stand a chance against the Slayer anyway.\"","The night passed with Tong Yang's group moving in stops and starts, barely resting, constantly circling the area.","First World Ye Huai's group followed at a leisurely pace behind. It was a strangely harmonious stalemate, with no major clashes, just the occasional exchange of insults. Neither side could gain the upper hand.","As the sky gradually lightened, everyone looked weary.","\"All night. How much longer are you going to keep walking? Isn't the time up yet?\" a Forerunner asked, exasperated.","\"All night. Would you die if you stopped chasing? Give everyone a breather, would you?\" Xu Junyue retorted, not backing down.","\"Maybe we should just talk this out,\" Armand suggested.","Tang Li asked, \"Talk about what?\"","\"Find a solution.\"","Tang Li said, \"We're going back to the First World. Will you follow?\"","\"Of course. Wherever Miss Ah Li goes, I follow.\"","\"Then there's nothing to discuss,\" Tang Li said.","Someone sighed. \"How about this: the others stay, and Tong Yang goes back to the First World for a one-on-one with the Slayer? The result will be quick, and we can all relax.\"","\"What nonsense are you spouting? Pitting a human against that monster? You think he can win?\"","\"The Slayer is powerful, but she has weaknesses. If you find them, it's not completely impossible to defeat her.\"","Xu Junyue's eyes lit up. \"What weaknesses?\"","The person rolled their eyes. \"You think I'd tell you?\"","\"Then your proposal is rejected.\"","Tang Shuyan whispered a reminder, \"Time's almost up.\"","Of course they couldn't let Tong Yang go back alone to duel First World Tong Yang. The odds of winning were practically zero.","Tong Yang said, \"Let's move. Find a chance to contact Wu Pingxue and return to the First World.\"","\"Right.\"","Without wasting more breath, Tong Yang's group used their anti-gravity wires to put distance between them again.","Tang Shuyan dialed Wu Pingxue's number, asking about the timing for their return.","Wu Pingxue's tone sounded unusually grave as she addressed everyone: \"Immediately.\"","Sensing something off in her voice, Tang Shuyan paused. \"Has something changed?\"","Wu Pingxue said, \"The United Government has recalled all androids sent to suppress the unrest in the civilian districts.\"","Tang Shuyan's brow furrowed deeply. \"Why? What are they planning?\"","Wu Pingxue let out a sigh and said, \"They plan to use the spatial rifts created by the energy storm to launch a full-scale invasion of the real world by the bionic humans. I miscalculated. Their numbers are far beyond imagination.\"","\"Can't we seal the passage from the First World to the real world?\"","Wu Pingxue replied, \"I'm afraid I'll disappoint you. I can only manage to seal it one way. It's possible to leave the First World from anywhere, but re-entry is now impossible.\"","Tang Shuyan's expression turned grim. \"What can we do to stop them?\"","\"Destroy the energy terminals that control the bionic humans, and find Yang Miao. She can command them to halt their actions,\" Wu Pingxue stated gravely. \"Chu Shiyu and the others have already located Yang Miao in the civilian district. Now, all that's left is for you to destroy the energy terminals.\"","\"Where are they located?\"","Wu Pingxue answered, \"Inside four top-tier bionic humans. They are currently carrying out this plan.\"","\"It's worth mentioning that the combat capabilities of these top-tier bionic humans are comparable to First World Tong Yang's.\"","Hearing this, everyone drew a sharp, collective breath.","A single First World Tong Yang was already incredibly difficult to deal with. How could there be four others just as powerful in the First World?","Wu Pingxue said, \"My apologies. The plan may very well fail.\"","The fact that the First World chose to deploy bionic humans to invade the real world under these circumstances indicated their numbers were vast. Coupled with the advanced weaponry from the First World and parallel worlds, the real world wouldn't hold out for long.","\"We can't let the bionic humans enter the real world,\" Tong Yang gritted her teeth. It was a case of \"misfortunes never come singly\"—they hadn't even dealt with the Tong Yang of the First World yet, and now another thorny problem had arisen.","Chu Shiyu from World A paled, muttering, \"Are they insane? Destroy top-tier bionic humans? How is that even possible?\"","A deathly silence fell over the group. If they couldn't handle First World Tong Yang, how were they supposed to deal with four others of similar strength? Such a daunting task seemed nearly impossible!","After a few seconds of silence, Tong Yang asked, \"If we make Yang Miao the magnetic field anchor, could she control the top-tier bionic humans?\"","\"She could,\" Wu Pingxue confirmed. \"But the real world wouldn't withstand the powerful impact. The world's barriers would become virtually useless. Moreover, she has half bionic human blood. Becoming a temporal anchor would fully activate that lineage. Once the magnetic field energy dissipates, she would lose her life, just like all the other bionic humans.\"","Tong Yang clenched her jaw. \"Then there's only one way. Before the bionic humans invade the real world, kill First World Tong Yang and have your people destroy the magnetic field energy.\"","Wu Pingxue paused for a moment before saying, \"They have already begun to move. Someone must go and stop them. Compared to First World Tong Yang, the bionic invasion of the real world is the more pressing threat. Even if you all band together to confront her, it would only result in more casualties at her hands. Tong Yang, you must act alone.\"","\"If you can kill her, all will be well. If you cannot, then all is lost.\"","\"How did it come to this...\" He Jingjing murmured.","Wu Pingxue's words hit everyone like a blow to the head, leaving them reeling and unprepared.","Wu Pingxue sighed. \"Tong Yang, if you fail, I will take the magnetic field energy development data and technology from the Second World back to the real world. Combined with the real world's own technology, we might be able to hold out for a few more decades.\"","The fact that the ever-strategic Wu Pingxue was making final preparations was proof enough of how monumental their task was.","\"The rest of you, rendezvous with Chu Shiyu and her team at the dueling grounds. What you have to do is no easier than Tong Yang's task, and you may even be more likely to lose your lives.\"","While Tong Yang would face First World Tong Yang, the others would have to confront all the bionic humans, including the top-tier ones.","Everyone's expressions were severe. \"We understand.\"","\"Before the mission begins, I want to remind you all. What you are about to do will most likely be in vain. If you choose to return to the real world, I will still bring the development data and technology to help you resist the invasion.\"","\"In other words, you are under no obligation to do this.\"","Tong Yang always adhered to one principle: never engage in endeavors where the value doesn't match the cost, and certainly never make pointless sacrifices.","Since the outcome would probably be the same whether they acted or not, she should abandon meaningless actions.","What kind of thing is worth doing when you know it's meaningless from the start?","But then, if they gave up just like that, what would all their experiences up to this point amount to?","\"Let's do it. We're going to die sooner or later anyway. At least this way, our deaths will sound a bit more honorable,\" Xu Junyue said.","\"Yeah. Do our utmost and leave the rest to fate.\"","\"After all, we were prepared to face death even before coming here.\"","\"Boss, let's do it!\" Xu Junyue turned to look at her. \"It's life or death either way.\"","Tong Yang's expression was calm. \"Then let's do it.\"","Tong Yang wasn't completely without a chance of winning. She knew what First World Tong Yang's weakness was.","But did she really have to use that method, to tarnish the memory of First World Tong Le's death in such a way?","Was there truly no other way?!"]},{"number":129,"title":"Chapter 129","paragraphs":["The First World remained a place of howling winds and flying sand.","Stepping onto this land, the gale nearly knocked them over. Fortunately, the anti-gravity fishline devices allowed them to steady themselves and stumble forward.","\"How's it going?\" Tong Yang asked.","Over the phone, Wu Pingxue's voice was heavy: \"The one-way passages to the other two worlds are sealed. We can begin the operation.\"","\"Good.\"","The time was approaching eight in the morning. It should have been sunrise, but the sky was shrouded in a blanket of gray mist.","\"The android forces are assembling, dispersed across four key locations in the affluent district. Everyone except Tong Yang will go in pairs to organize. The primary objective is to destroy the four top-tier androids and return to support Tong Yang. The secondary objective is to buy as much time as possible, to win breathing room for Tong Yang.\"","\"Understood.\"","\"Got it!\"","The tornadoes brewed by the energy storms were gone, replaced by an invisible resistance in the air, as if hindering their every step. Each movement was exceptionally difficult.","\"Take care.\"","\"You too!\"","Tong Yang clasped their hands, offering final farewells.","Wu Pingxue informed the others of the android forces' locations, instructing them to depart immediately.","Tong Yang stood in place, watching their retreating figures as wind-blown sand blurred her vision.","A moment later, Tong Yang turned and left, embarking alone on a mission that seemed nearly impossible.","Actually, while talking to Wu Pingxue, Tong Yang had wanted to ask one question.","Was the person who executed the top-secret mission, splitting the magnetic field energy into other timelines, 2036 Tong Le?","Once the temporal displacement between the 2014 and 2026 timelines vanished, Tong Yang's own timeline would form a closed loop. 2036 Tong Le would then exist alone in a separate timeline, exactly like the method used to destroy the magnetic field energy.","So, would the magnetic field energy enter the same timeline as 2036 Tong Le?","2036 Tong Le couldn't interfere with events in Tong Yang's timeline, so why did he come back to find her? According to him, he couldn't wait a moment longer, wanting to see Tong Yang sooner.","But if he lived in 2036, he could see her once the event of Tong Yang's death in 2024 was altered. Even with all the uncertainties in Tong Yang's timeline, for 2036 Tong Le, the change would be instantaneous. Why would he need to engage in time travel...","Suddenly!","A realization dawned on Tong Yang!","It's different! 2036 Tong Le's position is different from the other two world's time travelers!","The time traveler from the First World was from a defeated nation in the world war. Decades later, he found the magnetic field energy, returned to the past, and used it to change the outcome of the war. He could meddle in different timelines!","The parallel world time traveler, Wu Pingxue, after his homeland was invaded by the First World, used the magnetic field energy to return to the past, developed it, and ended the war with the First World. He could still interfere across different times and even different worlds!","Why can't 2036 Tong Le?","Why is he the only one who can't, even needing to borrow Tong Yang's hand? He knows what might happen in the future; wouldn't it be better for him to complete the task himself?","Even to prevent her death on May 28th, 2036 Tong Le could have chosen other methods.","Why? Why!","—Everything was preparation for the final secret operation.","He entered a solitary timeline, bringing the magnetic field energy into his own timeline before the temporal displacement between Tong Yang and the bystander group members vanished and the closed loop formed. This way, even if they existed in the same world, their timelines could never intersect or overlap.","Tong Yang's footsteps halted, staring blankly ahead.","But the magnetic field energy affects the human brain. The parallel world developed a portion of it and already caused certain effects. If the magnetic field energy cores of two worlds fused, and one person faced the full impact of that energy... what would 2036 Tong Le become?","If Tong Yang's speculation was correct...","\"You seem troubled.\"","Suddenly, a familiar voice sounded beside her.","Tong Yang's eyes felt dry. She stiffly turned her head to see a familiar face.","Parallel World Tong Yang leaned against a wall, smiling at her.","Tong Yang lowered her gaze and asked, \"What are you doing here?\"","Parallel World Tong Yang said, \"With such a big event happening in the First World, of course I came to watch the show. Besides, I told you during our first meeting that I was looking forward to seeing what changes you would make.\"","Tong Yang closed her eyes slightly. \"The passage from the parallel world to the First World should have been unilaterally sealed.\"","\"I came in last night,\" Parallel World Tong Yang replied.","\"Where is First World Tong Yang?\" Tong Yang asked.","\"I know where she is, but I see hesitation on your face. What's wrong? Isn't protecting the real world your unwavering duty?\" Parallel World Tong Yang said with a laugh.","Tong Yang wasn't sure if she was hesitating. \"Protecting the real world was never something I wanted to do.\"","She wasn't some selfless hero. Initially, she just wanted to survive and change her and Tong Le's lives.","\"Take me to her,\" Tong Yang said firmly.","Parallel World Tong Yang studied her expression, then after a moment said, \"Alright, but you have to tell me your reason for hesitating. I'm curious.\"","Together, they headed towards First World Tong Yang's location.","\"I'm not hesitating.\"","Tong Yang knew what she had to do. Things had evolved to this point; it was no longer just about her.","It was highly likely 2036 Tong Le would end up in a separate timeline, alone with the magnetic field energy.","Even so, Tong Yang wouldn't stop. Because she wasn't alone. Ye Huai, Chu Shiyu, Xu Junyue, Tang Li... the entire real world was standing with her. She couldn't stop by herself.","Tong Yang was very, very clear about this in her heart. So she would do her utmost to kill First World Tong Yang.","What she hesitated about was: Was there truly no one else who could do this besides 2036 Tong Le?","At this point, it seemed there was no need for further concealment. Tong Yang told Parallel World Tong Yang about the existence of 2036 Tong Le and all her speculations.","\"If you succeed in killing First World Tong Yang, 2036 Tong Le will enter a solitary timeline with the magnetic field energy, correct?\" Parallel World Tong Yang said.","\"Yes.\"","\"How do you feel about that?\" Parallel World Tong Yang asked.","Tong Yang said thoughtfully, \"What if we used the positional energy to send 2036 Tong Le back to the future, and if I died when the temporal displacement was no more than ten minutes, what would happen if I returned to ten minutes before that point?\"","Tong Yang found herself in a time-displaced loop. If the gap between the two timelines was already less than ten minutes, and she entered the loop to go back ten minutes, wouldn't that create a new time difference with the real world? She would be on a separate timeline, always a few minutes out of sync with reality. Couldn't she then carry the magnetic field energy into different timelines?","After hearing Tong Yang's words, Parallel World Tong Yang wore a complicated expression.","\"You're overthinking it. At the very least, after defeating First World Tong Yang, that's when you'll need to consider such things.\"","Tong Yang remained silent, pushing forward against the immense resistance.","\"Are you prepared?\" Parallel World Tong Yang asked.","Tong Yang was puzzled. \"Prepared for what?\"","\"Didn't I tell you about First World Tong Yang's weakness? It should be useful to you.\"","Tong Yang lowered her gaze. \"Do you know why she's afraid of rats?\"","\"Why?\"","\"Because after Tong Le died in the First World, she found his discarded body in a garbage dump, being gnawed on by rats.\"","Parallel World Tong Yang's expression stiffened slightly. \"Is that so?\"","\"I don't want to dishonor Tong Le's death that way.\"","\"You're so lucky. You have two Tong Les, even one who grew up,\" Parallel World Tong Yang sighed. \"I would also love to see what Tong Le looks like all grown up.\"","Tong Yang's eyes froze, suddenly thinking of something.","At the same time, Xu Junyue and the others arrived at the areas where the android troops were stationed.","Dark clouds pressed down on the sky. Looking down from a high vantage point, the dense masses of androids resembled ants pouring out of a nest, gathered together, awaiting orders from the top-tier android in a golden cloak standing at the front of the formation.","\"This is insane...\"","Xu Junyue murmured in disbelief upon seeing this scene.","For them to stop tens of thousands of androids was simply impossible.","Tang Li's expression was grave. \"Mi Qi has arrived with the armed forces from the slums. Combined with their firepower, we should be able to hold out temporarily.\"","Xu Junyue said, \"If the boss can't kill First World Tong Yang, everyone will die eventually. It's just a matter of time.\"","Tang Li nodded. \"Correct.\"","\"However, the most likely outcome is that we all die here along with Tong Yang.\"","The android army cast a vast shadow over the ground, so immense it seemed capable of devouring everything around it. It was unimaginable what tragedy would unfold if such a powerful android force entered the real world.","What lay before them was only death.","\"They're here.\"","First World Tong Yang was lounging lazily on a pile of rubble, looking up at the two of them.","\"Long time no see,\" she greeted Parallel World Tong Yang, then turned her gaze to Tong Yang. \"What a pity, our companions aren't here.\"","Tong Yang lowered her eyes. \"Indeed.\"","\"So, shall the game begin?\"","Tong Yang looked at her quietly, then suddenly asked, \"Aren't you curious about what Tong Le looks like grown up?\"","First World Tong Yang narrowed her eyes. \"Tong Le is dead.\"","Tong Yang continued as if speaking to herself, \"I met Tong Le from the year 2036. He used magnetic field energy to return to the present and orchestrated all of this.\"","The ultimate goal of 2036 Tong Le was to separate himself and the magnetic field energy onto other timelines. Everything he and Wu Pingxue did was to facilitate this purpose.","First World Tong Yang watched her, her face expressionless. \"What are you trying to say?\"","Tong Yang said, \"He's somewhere in the wealthy district right now. Don't you want to see him?\"","Tong Yang understood herself. Even from different worlds, different timelines, Tong Le was Tong Le. Any version of Tong Le was still Tong Le to her.","First World Tong Yang and Parallel World Tong Yang weren't as fortunate as her; Tong Le had not remained alive by their side.","If it weren't for the young Tong Le supporting her, Tong Yang would have become just like them. It was precisely because Tong Yang had something she cared about in her heart that she could stubbornly persist in doing what she believed was right, at least never becoming a truly cold and heartless person.","First World Tong Yang was silent for a moment. \"Where is he?\"","\"I don't know, but he must be at the place closest to the energy core.\"","First World Tong Yang looked at her, suddenly let out a laugh, and said, \"Your companions are shedding blood and sacrificing themselves to stop the android army. Are you sure you want to talk about this with me now?\"","Tong Yang felt she was being naive, but also wondered, since she herself could be this naive, might First World Tong Yang also be naive?","\"Go to the real world,\" Tong Yang said.","First World Tong Yang was taken aback. \"What did you say?\"","\"Since you feel nothing matters and just want me dead, you go be the sister to the Tong Le who is still alive. What 2036 Tong Le can do, I can probably do too.\"","Tong Yang could enter the loop because of the time difference; she couldn't loop like Parallel World Yan Qing.","Therefore, when the time difference between the two worlds fell below ten minutes, if she entered the loop and went back ten minutes, she would jump out of the time difference. She couldn't affect others' time, and naturally couldn't align with their timeline to complete the loop.","If the time difference was only nine minutes, her time would likely be one minute slower than everyone else's.","Because others only needed nine minutes to align, but she needed ten.","If this works...","2036 Tong Le had said that after the magnetic field energy disappeared, two timelines couldn't coexist in the real world. Even if they existed simultaneously in reality, they would never intersect, only catching faint traces of each other's presence at precisely the right moments.","Parallel World Tong Yang exclaimed in surprise, \"Are you serious?\"","Tong Yang said, \"Utterly serious.\"","As long as 2036 Tong Le could be sent back to 2036 without anyone noticing.","If Tong Yang became the temporal anchor point for the energy cores of the magnetic fields in both worlds, it should be possible.","\"Well?\" Tong Yang looked at First World Tong Yang, who remained silent on the collapsed wall.","First World Tong Yang's eyes were deep and dark. \"Aren't you afraid I'll kill him?\"","\"Anyone in the First World might harm him, but you? Absolutely impossible.\"","Tong Yang thought her idea was excellent. It could accomplish the plan without needing a life-or-death struggle with First World Tong Yang.","Since she would die one way or another, she might as well utilize her death to the utmost.","At that moment, a red beam of light pierced through the building, appearing before Tong Yang.","This was the sensor bracelet Tong Yang had given to Xu Junyue and the others.","It would only emit a red beam when their vital signs were critically bad.","Tong Yang's time was running out.","Jiao Yang recommends his other works:",":,",":,",":,","Hope you also like them"]},{"number":130,"title":"Chapter 130","paragraphs":["Dust and rubble swirled in the air, a desolate silence hanging heavy.","First World Tong Yang watched her silently, her expression inscrutable. Her deep gaze was like a bottomless black hole, making it impossible to grasp her emotions.","After nearly half a minute of standoff, First World Tong Yang spoke: \"Why go to such lengths?\"","Tong Yang lowered her eyes to the ground, pausing for a moment before saying, \"Because Tong Le is still alive.\"","Whether this was Tong Yang's true feelings or not, she knew it was the answer First World Tong Yang wanted to hear at this very moment.","The three shared the same face, had different personalities, yet their paths would ultimately converge.","\"Buzz—\"","\"Buzz—\"","Suddenly, a vibration sound came from First World Tong Yang.","Taking a phone from her jacket pocket, Tong Le had called as promised.","Tong Yang looked at the phone that had somehow appeared in her hand. She didn't ask how; it didn't matter anymore.","In the distance, the red rays from the sensor bracelets piercing through the buildings grew more numerous, indicating that the vital signs of everyone except Tong Yang had become critically poor.","Tong Yang had no other choice. Only by persuading First World Tong Yang, by making the magnetic field energy disappear as soon as possible, could everything end.","\"Shall we hear Tong Le's opinion?\" First World Tong Yang shook the phone slightly, speaking to her.","Tong Yang watched her quietly, unsure of her intention, and made no move to stop her.","First World Tong Yang answered the call and put it on speakerphone.","\"Let's congratulate student Tong Le! His project has won first prize in the National Primary and Secondary School Science and Technology Competition!\"","Thunderous applause followed.","\"Tong Le, you're amazing!\"","\"Congratulations!\"","Joyful voices erupted from the phone, causing all three to freeze momentarily.","\"Thank you, teacher.\"","\"Teacher, may I step out to call my sister?\"","\"Of course! Such important news must be shared with family immediately!\"","\"Tong Le really loves his sister!\"","\"Yeah, he talks about her every day!\"","\"Lele says his sister is a hundred, a thousand times more amazing than him. I really want to meet her.\"","\"I've seen her! Lele's sister is super cool!\"","Amidst his classmates' cheerful clamor, Tong Le walked out of the classroom.","Entering the quiet hallway, Tong Le called out, \"Sister, did you hear that?\"","First World Tong Yang softened her gaze, a gentle smile on her lips. \"You're incredible, winning first prize for your project.\"","Tong Le chuckled sheepishly, then said with regret, \"I wish you could have seen my project, sis.\"","First World Tong Yang asked, puzzled, \"Can't I see it?\"","Tong Le explained, \"I promised the teacher I'd donate it to the science museum for exhibition, so more kids can see it.\"","\"Is that so? You're truly remarkable.\"","\"Not as remarkable as you, sis! Sister, is it raining there? The wind sounds so loud,\" Tong Le said.","First World Tong Yang replied, \"It will rain soon.\"","\"Then you should hurry home. Don't get sick.\"","\"Mm.\"","Tong Yang listened silently to their conversation. First World Tong Yang's expression was unusually gentle, different from her usual self. This ordinary dialogue for Tong Yang was something distant and unattainable for both First World Tong Yang and Parallel World Tong Yang.","\"Lele, did your sister ever tell you about parallel worlds?\" First World Tong Yang shifted the topic abruptly.","Tong Le's voice grew tense. \"Sister, you did tell me. Are you in danger now?\"","First World Tong Yang asked, \"Do you know how many people exist in the world who look exactly like your sister?\"","Tong Le's voice softened. \"Sister, I know.\"","First World Tong Yang was silent for a beat, then asked, \"To you, they are...\"","Tong Le, always a clever child, ventured cautiously, \"Are you another version of my sister from another world?\"","Through the phone, hearing only an identical voice and tone, Tong Le had still recognized they were different.","First World Tong Yang nodded. \"Yes.\"","Tong Le hesitated, then asked, \"Is my sister... is she okay?\"","First World Tong Yang glanced up at her. \"Yes, she's right beside me.\"","Tong Le breathed a sigh of relief. \"Sister, to me, you and my sister are different people, but you are both 'Tong Le's' sister.\"","\"I don't know what parallel worlds are like. If there's a parallel world sister, there must be a parallel world me. No matter which world, sister and Tong Le are family.\"","\"Is that so,\" First World Tong Yang murmured. \"So, anyone who becomes your sister is acceptable?\"","Tong Le asked, \"Sister, do you want to be this Tong Le's sister?\"","First World Tong Yang smiled. \"Would that not be allowed?\"","Tong Le replied hesitantly, \"But wouldn't the Tong Le from the parallel world be sad?\"","\"He's dead,\" First World Tong Yang stated calmly.","\"I'm sorry...\" Tong Le mumbled.","\"It's fine. Answer me first. Would it be acceptable?\"","Tong Le thought for a few seconds, then said earnestly, \"Sister, if I died, and my sister became someone else's sister, even if it was another 'me' from a parallel world, I would be very sad.\"","First World Tong Yang was taken aback. \"Really? Is that how it is?\"","Tong Le continued, \"But I also don't want my sister to be sad. So... if it would make you happy, then Tong Le would be happy too.\"","First World Tong Yang gave a faint smile. \"Good child.\"","\"Answer one more question for me,\" First World Tong Yang said.","\"Sister, go ahead. I'll answer properly,\" Tong Le promised.","\"If your sister disappeared from this world, what would you do?\"","Tong Le was stunned, his voice turning panicked. \"No! Sister can't disappear! I can't be without my sister!\"","\"I... I only want my sister. I can give up everything else!\"","First World Tong Yang whispered, \"I see.\"","\"Sister...\"","\"Sister!\"","Tong Le suddenly raised his voice, as if searching for Tong Yang.","First World Tong Yang said unhurriedly, \"You are very much like Tong Le. Thank you for answering my questions. As a reward, I can grant you one wish.\"","\"Don't hurt my sister!\"","First World Tong Yang's expression remained placid as she nodded. \"Alright, I promise.\"","\"Sister, it doesn't matter if I die. You must survive. You are the person I love most, no matter which world...\"","Without listening further, First World Tong Yang ended the call and tossed the phone to Tong Yang.","\"Tong Yang, you were wise, and also fortunate. You protected Tong Le well, kept him alive,\" First World Tong Yang said.","Tong Yang lowered her eyelids. \"I was just luckier than you.\"","Even so, could luck simply sum up the difference between her and the other two Tong Yangs?","\"The lucky one isn't just you, but also Tong Le,\" Parallel World Tong Yang said.","The pain borne by the living far exceeded that of the dead.","This timeline had changed because of Tong Yang and 2036 Tong Le. Tong Le was the truly fortunate one. His luck stemmed from the version of himself in another timeline who had lost his sister.","Parallel World Tong Yang let out a sudden, dry laugh. \"But saying that doesn't seem right either. No one is truly fortunate.\"","Originally, they should have all had a peaceful life.","\"Who knows,\" said First World Tong Yang. \"I won't go back on my word. The game is over.\"","First World Tong Yang looked up at the sky and said, \"Take me to see him when he's grown up. After that, I won't interfere anymore.\"","Tong Yang secretly breathed a sigh of relief. As long as things developed according to her plan from here on out, she could separate the magnetic field energy and herself into different timelines before the others died. Then everything would truly be over!","Tong Yang called Wu Pingxue, briefly explained her idea, and then asked for the location of 2036 Tong Le.","After listening, Wu Pingxue fell into a brief silence. \"Your speculation is correct. The plan is feasible.\"","\"Then tell me where Tong Le is.\"","Wu Pingxue sighed. \"You two siblings should decide your own affairs. He's at the Joint Government base, underground level three.\"","\"I understand,\" Tong Yang's voice was heavy. \"Send the others back. The matter is resolved. Once the magnetic field energy disappears, it will all be over.\"","Wu Pingxue sighed. \"Although I'd like to do that, it's a great pity they are already inextricably involved. Only when the magnetic field energy disappears will they have a sliver of a chance to survive.\"","Tong Yang clenched her teeth. The red rays of light from different directions around her were already tinged with black, signaling that their lives were nearing their end. It was unknown how much longer they could hold on.","\"I understand.\"","Tong Yang hung up the phone and rushed to the decisive location. As long as she reached the Joint Government base before the rays turned completely black, everything would be fine.","Not daring to delay for a moment, Tong Yang rushed like mad, at the fastest speed she had ever mustered in her life, to the Joint Government base. This place was practically the only intact area left in the entire affluent district.","Fortunately, the Joint Government personnel had already entered the underground city. They didn't have much trouble entering the third underground level. Places requiring identity verification for passage posed no obstacle with First World Tong Yang accompanying them.","The icy walls of the third underground level reflected an eerie green glow, as if shimmering with watery light.","The three of them followed the light source forward, gradually seeing a pool of shimmering green water. Vague shadows flickered on the surface, and a golden energy core was enveloped within it.","A tall, slender young man sat with his back to them by the poolside. Perhaps hearing the sounds, the young man suddenly turned around, revealing a clean, fair face, his eyes smiling. \"Sis, you're here...\"","Suddenly, 2036 Tong Le's voice faltered as he looked at the three of them in surprise.","\"You look so alike,\" 2036 Tong Le exclaimed in amazement.","\"What do you think?\" said Parallel World Tong Yang.","\"Is that so,\" First World Tong Yang examined his face and suddenly smiled. \"You actually look so much like you did when you were little.\"","2036 Tong Le chuckled. \"Even your tone of voice is exactly the same.\"","Tong Yang looked at him, pressing her lips together tightly.","2036 Tong Le shook his phone and said to her, \"Sis, the time differential is about to end. The others are already on their way to Tiananmen Square.\"","Tong Yang didn't speak. She hadn't yet figured out how to make 2036 Tong Le willingly return to the year 2036.","\"Sis, you should return to the real world too. This will all be over soon,\" 2036 Tong Le said.","He didn't seem surprised that Tong Yang knew he was here, that he was the one to carry out the final task.","Tong Yang's throat felt dry. \"Tong Le, did you hear it from Wu Pingxue?\"","2036 Tong Le smiled. \"Yes, I heard it from Master.\"","Tong Yang took a deep breath and said, \"Lele, you've already done so much. It's enough, do you understand? You go back to 2036, and you'll see me right away...\"","\"I'm not going,\" 2036 Tong Le calmly interrupted her. \"Sis, I won't go back.\"","\"Tong Le...\"","\"No!\" 2036 Tong Le suddenly raised his voice. \"I've already lived through one twelve-year cycle, isn't that enough?\"","Tong Yang stared at him, stunned. 2036 Tong Le seemed somewhat angry, leaving her momentarily at a loss.","\"If no matter what I do, you are destined to die, why would I come back? Why would I do all this? Do you think I'm doing it to save the world?\" 2036 Tong Le had already learned Tong Yang's purpose from Wu Pingxue. His eyes were red as he looked at her, tears welling up.","Tong Yang was momentarily speechless. That old fool Wu Pingxue, so tight-lipped at other times, had to tell 2036 Tong Le everything now.","\"Do you know how I've held on until now? Do you think Tong Le is so stupid that he would believe the one returning was you?\"","\"You... don't cry. We can discuss this,\" Tong Yang took two steps forward.","2036 Tong Le choked back a sob. \"Sis, I've been waiting for this day. That person can only be me, not anyone else.\"","\"Sis, I won't die. I will always be with you, even if you can never see me.\"","Tong Yang clenched her jaw, walked up to him, raised her hand to wipe away his tears, her voice hoarse. \"You're so grown up now, don't cry.\"","2036 Tong Le hugged her, leaning down against her shoulder, and said, \"Sis, believe me, I won't die. I will never lie to you.\"","A wave of sorrow rose in Tong Yang's nose. She held him tightly with both arms. \"Tong Le...\"","Tong Yang didn't know how to persuade 2036 Tong Le, because since childhood she had never interfered with Tong Le's decisions. She respected any choice he made. She always believed that choices made by others were decisions made after careful consideration.","She didn't want others to casually interfere with her decisions, and likewise, she wouldn't casually interfere with others' decisions. After learning that once the time loop was completed, 2036 Tong Le would enter another timeline, she had clearly already accepted it.","It's just, if that person could be her, she would rather be the one existing on another timeline.","2036 Tong Le held her and whispered in her ear, \"Sis, time is running out. Go.\"","Tong Yang shuddered all over, raising her reddened eyes.","\"Sis, I will always love you. Even across an uncrossable span of time, I will always be by your side. I swear.\"","Tong Yang closed her eyes, tears tracing down her cheeks.","\"Sis, leave this place. Answer my call, until the very last second.\"","Tong Yang parted her lips, her voice raspy. \"Okay...\"","\"Go. Your friends might not have much time left.\"","Tong Yang pressed her lips into a tight line and gave his shoulder a firm pat. \"I'm leaving.\"","\"Okay.\"","Tong Yang took one last, deep look at him, then turned and left the third underground level.","Leaving the third level of the Joint Government base, they returned to the surface. There was no extra time for Tong Yang to hesitate.","First World Tong Yang did not leave with her. After the real world's self-destruct program was activated, it would only disappear upon the death of one party. Having been injected with the superior gene serum, as long as she died once before the magnetic field energy disappeared, the self-destruct program would deactivate, and her body could also recover.","Parallel World Tong Yang returned to the parallel world.","Tong Yang left the Joint Government base alone and discovered that the energy storm had vanished at some point. The mist had cleared, revealing the affluent district transformed into ruins.","After the magnetic field energy core fusion, a new temporal anchor point was established, so the energy storm disappeared.","\"Bzzz—\"","A vibrating sound rang out, and Tong Yang answered the phone.","\"Sis, is your friend okay?\"","Tong Yang stood on a road piled with rubble, staring at the dozen or so black rays that pierced through the entire affluent district, falling into dead silence.","Her throat was dry. She opened her mouth but no sound came out.","The black rays represented the death of those wearing sensor bracelets. It was too late.","\"They're dead,\" Tong Yang said hoarsely.","\"It's okay, sis,\" 2036 Tong Le said. \"Return to the real world. I can save them.\"","Tong Yang was stunned. \"What?\"","2036 Tong Le laughed. \"I've become the new temporal anchor point. But like you, it's only for a ten-minute loop, because we're both caught in the temporal displacement.\"","\"Ten minutes ago, the energy core had already fused. I will enter the 2036 timeline with it at that moment. If their time of death is within ten minutes, they can be revived. Ten minutes ago, the energy core vanished, and the androids would have lost their ability to act, so naturally they couldn't have killed them.\"","\"I can temporarily control the androids. Have the survivors bring their bodies back to the real world.\"","Tong Yang murmured, \"Okay...\"","Tong Yang did as he said, having the survivors bring the bodies of all those killed by the androids back to the real world.","Among them was surprisingly Yang Miao, who had attempted to control a top-tier android to issue a stop command, suffered a backlash, and died with blood flowing from all seven orifices.","Only Tong Yang remained completely unscathed in this storm.","She returned to the real world. 2036 Tong Le was saying inconsequential things in her ear, making her feel somewhat dazed.","\"Sis, all this time, you've worked hard.\"","After saying this, there was no more sound from the phone.","2036 Tong Le entered the loop. Due to the time difference being less than ten minutes, he couldn't affect anyone else's timeline.","However, ten minutes ago the magnetic field energy disappeared, the androids lost their ability to act, and couldn't have killed the others ten minutes ago. Therefore, ten minutes later, they would come back to life.","\"Tong Yang, where are you? Xu Junyue and the others are seriously injured and are already receiving treatment. What about you? How are you?\"","Even ten minutes ago, Xu Junyue and the others had sustained significant injuries.","Tong Yang stared blankly at the scene before her, murmuring, \"I'm fine. I'm at Tiananmen Square.\"","What a coincidence. She had returned directly from the First World to Tiananmen Square.","\"It's good you're okay. We'll send someone to pick you up.\"","\"Okay.\"","Immediately, Tong Yang hung up the phone.","Tong Yang looked around in a daze. Her phone buzzed again. Subconsciously picking it up, she saw it was a voice call from the \"Netizen Gossip 007\" group chat.","Answering the call, someone asked, \"Sis Tong, what time is it over there?\"","Tong Yang checked and said, \"10:07 AM.\"","\"We're only one minute apart!\"","\"I've already arrived!\"","\"Me too!\"","\"Sis Tong, are you here?\"","Tong Yang said, \"I'm here.\"","\"Where?\"","\"The main gate.\"","Tong Yang held the phone to her ear, her expression distant, listening to their excited discussion.","Time ticked by. Suddenly, the sound from the phone disappeared.","\"Tong Yang!\"","Instead, a voice came from not far away.","\"Sis Tong!\"","\"Finally meeting!\"","\"Sis Tong!\"","\"I've been looking forward to this for so long!\"","Tong Yang raised her eyes, looking at the people running towards her from all directions.","—The temporal displacement had disappeared.","She put down her phone. The interface popped up a message: [Netizen Gossip 007 group chat has been disbanded by the group owner]","\"Wow!\"","\"It's finally over!\"","Tong Yang whispered, \"Yes, it's all over now.\"","\"Wonderful!\"","\"The real world is safe!\"","\"Sis Tong, you're amazing!\"","\"It's almost noon! Let's go eat!\"","\"What about Lele? Bring Lele along!\"","\"Right!\"","\"Since we're all here, let's take a group photo. I brought a camera!\"","Tong Yang stood with them at Tiananmen Square and took a photo.","They found a print shop, developed the photo, and everyone got a copy.","Walking out of the print shop and passing by a street, suddenly someone called Tong Yang's name.","She looked up bewildered and saw Ye Huai, pale-faced, sitting in a wheelchair, staring motionlessly at her, his face full of concern.","\"Ye Huai... you're alive,\" Tong Yang said.","Tong Yang felt extremely weary. Ignoring the others around her, she walked up to Ye Huai.","\"I'm so tired,\" Tong Yang said softly.","Ye Huai pulled her close and said to the others, \"Sorry, can she rest for a bit first?\"","\"No problem, let her rest.\"","\"Sis Tong looks really pale. Go back and rest first!\"","\"See you later!\"","Tong Yang crouched down and looked up at him. \"You're okay now?\"","Ye Huai said, \"I woke up this morning.\"","\"You shouldn't have left the hospital directly.\"","\"It's fine, I know my limits.\"","Tong Yang buried her head, her cheek resting against his knee, looking at the photo in her hand.","Ten minutes had passed since the photo was taken.","Sunlight slanted onto them, their shadows reflected on the ground.","Tong Yang unexpectedly discovered that next to her shadow, there was an additional tall, slender shadow, lightly leaning against her shoulder, its head tilted as if smiling.","The corner of Tong Yang's mouth lifted. She murmured, \"So you didn't lie to me.\"","\"Bzzz—\"","\"Bzzz—\"","The phone vibrated. Tong Le was calling.","Time: May 28, 2027, 10:43."]}]);
